# game/script.rpy:948
translate Chinese after_load_2f24a960:

    # "Since you last played this save we have added the ability to set a last name/family name to use when characters formally address the main character."
    "自从您上次玩这个存档后，我们添加了一项功能，允许设置姓氏/家族名称，以便角色在正式场合称呼主角时使用。"

# game/script.rpy:950
translate Chinese after_load_700f3954:

    # "Please choose a last name to make sure nothing breaks."
    "请选择一个姓氏，以避免出现问题。"

# game/script.rpy:1036
translate Chinese start_423d8f63:

    # "This game contains explicit sexual visuals. If you prefer, you can choose to disable these images."
    "本游戏包含露骨的性爱画面。如果您觉得不适，可以选择禁用这些图像。"

# game/script.rpy:1038
translate Chinese start_124f53bf:

    # "Please note that this will only affect the visual content and not the text. As a result, there may be instances where the visuals do not align with the text description."
    "请注意，这只会影响视觉呈现，不会影响文字内容。因此，可能会出现画面与文字描述不符的情况。"

# game/script.rpy:1040
translate Chinese start_6515430b:

    # "But it'll keep you safe from prying eyes during gameplay. You will still unlock related images in the game's gallery even if you choose to disable this option."
    "但这能让您在游戏过程中避免被他人窥视。即使您选择禁用此选项，您仍然可以在游戏图鉴中解锁相关图片。"

# game/script.rpy:1051
translate Chinese start_341f4155:

    # "This game may contain visual and descriptive scenes that depict physical injuries."
    "本游戏可能包含视觉和文字场景，其中可能描绘身体损伤。"

# game/script.rpy:1053
translate Chinese start_4b32b0e4:

    # "These scenes are not intended to linger or glorify for shock value, they are simply meant to depict some of the realities of working on a ship during this time period and should be suitable for most players."
    "这些场景并非为了博人眼球而刻意渲染或夸大，仅仅是为了如实展现那个时期在船上工作的一些现实情况，相信大多数玩家都能接受。"

# game/script.rpy:1055
translate Chinese start_5963b7ce:

    # "However, if you prefer, you can choose to have these scenes toned down."
    "但是，如果您觉得不适，可以选择弱化这些场景。"

# game/script.rpy:1057
translate Chinese start_9aa934ec:

    # "While these scenes will still be included for narrative purposes, we will do our best to navigate around them. For instance, your character might look away or leave the room when these scenes occur."
    "虽然这些场景仍然会为了剧情连贯性而保留，但我们会尽量避免直接展示。例如，当这些场景发生时，您的角色可能会转移视线或离开房间。"

# game/script.rpy:1068
translate Chinese start_b5d71b1f:

    # "And lastly, you can hide/unhide this text box at any point by hitting {u}H{/u} if you're playing with Keyboard and Mouse, or {u}swipe down{/u} on touchscreen devices."
    "最后，如果您使用键盘和鼠标，可以按{u}H{/u}键随时隐藏/显示此文本框；如果您使用触摸屏设备，则可以{u}向下滑动{/u}。"

# game/script.rpy:1080
translate Chinese start_484b05e4:

    # "Today is the day—your final moments on dry land before beginning your life at sea."
    "就是今天了——在开启海上生涯之前，你在陆地上的最后片刻。"

# game/script.rpy:1082
translate Chinese start_d42eb731:

    # "It seems surreal; it's only been a week since you left the farmstead you grew up on, yet it almost feels as if a lifetime has slipped by."
    "这一切恍如隔世；离开从小长大的农庄才不过短短一周，感觉却像是已经过了大半辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:1084
translate Chinese start_17728d34:

    # "The uneventful journey along the rugged path from your humble village to the vibrant port city has ignited something within you. It seems like the past weeks have been the most thrilling days of your twenty year existence; and they're only the start of the adventure yet to come."
    "从偏僻闭塞的乡下村落沿着坎坷土路来到这座繁华港城，这一路波澜不惊的行程，却在你的心底点燃了某种火苗。在这活了二十年的岁月里，过去这几周简直是你经历过最教人兴奋的日子；而这，还仅仅是一场未知冒险的开端。"

# game/script.rpy:1086
translate Chinese start_3c830f05:

    # "At least, that's what you keep telling yourself."
    "至少，你一直在心里这般宽慰自己。"

# game/script.rpy:1088
translate Chinese start_463338eb:

    # "Beneath the tumultuous excitement at the surface, a lingering anxiety sits heavy in your stomach, keeping it tense. Nerves and fear intertwine, casting doubt on this sudden life change."
    "然而在表面难以自抑的兴奋底下，一抹挥之不去的焦虑却沉沉地堵在胃里，搅得肚腹发紧。忐忑与恐惧相互交织，让你对这突如其来的命运抉择不禁生出一丝动摇。"

# game/script.rpy:1090
translate Chinese start_20306cc0:

    # "Ship masts start to come into view, emerging above nearby rooftops as you approach. Their stark looming presence against the morning sky only serving to amplify your emotions, further unsettling your stomach as you turn the corner onto the bustling main road which leads straight to port."
    "随着你一步步靠近，高耸的船桅开始从附近屋顶上方显露出来。清晨天际线下那些巍峨耸立的桅影，只教你心潮愈发翻涌，胃里的翻江倒海更甚。你拐过街角，踏上了直通港口的大道，眼前顿时一片熙攘繁杂。"

# game/script.rpy:1092
translate Chinese start_115f351c:

    # "Maybe skipping breakfast today would have been a wise choice."
    "也许今天不吃早饭才是明智的选择。"

# game/script.rpy:1094
translate Chinese start_7c167e76:

    # "The coastal breeze kicks up, giving you the strongest hit of salty air yet. Another reminder of what you are so close to doing—a new life on the deck of a ship, surrounded by endless miles of ocean."
    "海风迎面卷来，带来了迄今为止最浓烈的一股咸腥气息。这再次提醒着你，你距离那个决定已经有多近——在航船的甲板上开启全新人生，被无边无际的汪洋大海彻底环绕。"

# game/script.rpy:1096
translate Chinese start_5a28d3c2:

    # "Are cats really made for life on the seas?"
    "猫当真生来就适合在海上讨生活吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1098
translate Chinese start_35e2ec77:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    "{cps=2}...{/cps}"

# game/script.rpy:1100
translate Chinese start_8afacf61:

    # "As you traverse the bustling thoroughfare leading to the docks, the familiar aroma of the nearby fisheries fills the air. The scent of fresh seafood intermingles with the salty tang of the sea—a pungent reminder of the lively nature of this quarter of the city."
    "走在通往码头的喧嚣大街上，空气中弥漫着附近渔场特有的气味。新鲜海产的鲜味与海水的咸味交织在一起，时刻提醒着你这里是全城最热闹的街区。"

# game/script.rpy:1102
translate Chinese start_6da817b4:

    # "The path is adorned with an array of shops and stalls; each proudly showcasing their own bountiful catches for the day. Their colorful displays of fresh seafood entice passersby, while diligent merchants busily prepare for the gathering crowds."
    "街道两旁排满了各色铺子和小摊，争先恐后地亮出各自当天捕获的丰饶渔获。五光十色的鲜活海货招揽着过往行人，勤快的摊贩们正忙前忙后，准备迎接蜂拥而至的人潮。"

# game/script.rpy:1104
translate Chinese start_a32a7e10:

    # "As the path nears its end, the smaller shops give way to grander structures that house shipwrights and shipping companies. These sturdy buildings stand as beacons of industry, eagerly accepting work from any ship that makes port."
    "越往街道深处走，低矮的小铺面便逐渐让位给了造船工坊和航运商行那高大坚固的建筑。这些结实厚重的屋宇宛若工业的灯塔，热切招揽着每一艘进港靠泊的船只业务。"

# game/script.rpy:1106
translate Chinese start_10201b0e:

    # "Of course, no port town is complete without its share of dockside taverns, and this bustling city is no exception. The closest tavern echoes with boisterous shouts and drunken songs, drawing in sailors and locals alike."
    "当然，任何港口城镇都少不了码头酒馆的身影，这座繁华的港城亦不例外。离得最近的那间酒馆里传出一阵阵粗门大嗓的喧哗与醉醺醺的酒歌，将往来水手和本地居民一并招引了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:1108
translate Chinese start_fa977a11:

    # "As you pause near the tavern, you finally get your first unobstructed glimpse of the ships. You have a direct view of awe-inspiring vessels that gracefully ride the gentle roll of the sea. Among them, one is about to become your new home."
    "你在酒馆附近驻足，终于第一次毫无遮拦地望见了港中泊着的船影。眼前那些巍峨恢弘的大船随着海水的舒缓起伏轻轻荡漾，景象教人肃然起敬。而其中一艘，即将成为你的新家。"

# game/script.rpy:1110
translate Chinese start_a6adc943:

    # "This is the very beginning of the grand adventure you have been dreaming of for years."
    "这便是你憧憬多年的伟大冒险，最初的开端。"

# game/script.rpy:1112
translate Chinese start_f274a3a0:

    # man1 "Out of the way!"
    man1 "滚开！"

# game/script.rpy:1114
translate Chinese start_a6c0b996:

    # "A slurred voice commands as a burly otter emerges from the tavern, shouldering his way through the crowd."
    "一声含糊不清的大喝传来，只见一只身材魁梧的水獭从酒馆里摇晃着挤了出来，硬是用膀子在人群里撞开一条道。"

# game/script.rpy:1116
translate Chinese start_4b9aa1c2:

    # "Lost in your thoughts, you find yourself rudely knocked to the ground by the shove. The sudden impact jolts you back to reality, quickly reminding you of the chaotic nature of port life."
    "你沉浸在思绪中，冷不丁被他粗暴地一把搡倒在地。突如其来的撞击猛然将你扯回现实，瞬间让你领教了码头生活的蛮横与混乱。"

# game/script.rpy:1118
translate Chinese start_2d9ba243:

    # "A groan escapes your lips as you climb back to your feet. The otter is already lost in the crowd, just another sailor with one too many pints in him too early in the day. It's a sight you know you will be growing accustomed to in your new life."
    "你龇牙咧嘴地呻吟着爬起身来。那只水獭早已没入了人潮，不过又是一个大清早就灌了太多杯黄汤的水手罢了。你知道，在往后的新生活里，这类光景怕是要见怪不怪了。"

# game/script.rpy:1124
translate Chinese start_78f97eaa:

    # "Any lingering frustration from the fresh bruise on your shoulder dissipates as you break through the dense crowd and reach the water's edge. Your eyes widen in awe as they fixate on the magnificent ship docked right before you."
    "肩头新添的淤青所带来的那一丝懊恼，在你挤出拥挤的人群、来到水泊边时顿时烟消云散。你惊叹地睁大了眼，目光死死定在正前方泊停的那艘气派大船上。"

# game/script.rpy:1126
translate Chinese start_123e8730:

    # "A fully rigged beauty adorned with three majestic masts that soar high above her deck. The meticulously carved and painted lettering across the stern proudly displays the name of the vessel, a name that signifies the place that is about to become your new home."
    "这真是一艘风姿绰约的三桅全帆装船，高耸的桅杆直插云霄。船尾雕刻精细、着色考究的字样骄傲地展示着这艘船的名字——一个即将成为你全新归宿的名字。"

# game/script.rpy:1128
translate Chinese start_a1b403ed:

    # "\"{i}Conway{/i}\""
    "“{i}Conway号{/i}”"

# game/script.rpy:1130
translate Chinese start_be8f7eba:

    # "A name that fills you with the same sense of passion and adventure that brought you all this way. A name you yearn to utter with pride in the days to come. You silently rehearse it within your thoughts, savoring each letter as it swirls and dances in your mind."
    "这个名字让你胸中再次涌起当初驱使你千里跋涉的豪情与向往。一个你在往后日子里渴望骄傲说出口的名字。你在心底默默咀嚼着它，细细体味着每一个音节在思绪里翻飞回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:1132
translate Chinese start_6577adbb:

    # "It has a nice ring to it!"
    "听起来真不赖！"

# game/script.rpy:1134
translate Chinese start_3bb7cbbc:

    # q "What're you doing there?!" with hpunch
    q "你杵在那儿干什么呢？！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:1136
translate Chinese start_68044c0d:

    # "Once again, you're startled from the hazy daydreams of your mind, instantly turning to the source of the bellowed voice."
    "你猛地又一次从恍惚的白日梦中被惊醒，立马循着那声暴喝望去。"

# game/script.rpy:1147
translate Chinese start_99aecb69:

    # "Before you stands a towering horse clad in a tight-fitting blue uniform, his hair tied back in a neat knot behind his head. He looms at least three heads above you, forcing you to tilt your head back to meet his piercing gaze."
    "只见一名身材魁梧的马站在你面前，身着一袭笔挺修身的蓝色制服，鬃毛在脑后扎成利落齐整的结。他足足比你高出三个头，迫使你不得不死命仰起脖子，才能对上他那道锐利如刀的目光。"

# game/script.rpy:1149
translate Chinese start_1997f041:

    # horse "You hear me?"
    horse "耳朵聋了吗？！"

# game/script.rpy:1151
translate Chinese start_12a4c225:

    # horse "We're on a tight schedule, and the last thing I need is some idiot gettin' crushed by a crate because he's gawkin' at the ships."
    horse "咱们时间紧得很，老子最不需要的就是哪个蠢货光顾着看船发呆，被吊箱砸个稀巴烂！"

# game/script.rpy:1153
translate Chinese start_f1c0e50f:

    # horse "So..."
    horse "所以……"

# game/script.rpy:1155
translate Chinese start_364cd120:

    # "The horse snorts heavily."
    "马重重地哼了一声，鼻息粗沉。"

# game/script.rpy:1157
translate Chinese start_12b8b6d1:

    # horse "Get out of the way!"
    horse "滚开！"

# game/script.rpy:1162
translate Chinese start_10986a5f:

    # "You're left feeling helpless as you stand there, unaware of the problem at hand. You finally grasp the situation when you instinctively look up and notice the crate suspended in mid-air, connected to a sturdy dock crane."
    "你手足无措地呆立在原地，压根不知道自己究竟犯了什么错。直到本能地抬头望去，你才赫然发现半空中悬着一只巨大的货箱，正挂在码头结实的起重吊臂之下。"

# game/script.rpy:1168
translate Chinese start_5568bcb2:

    # "A group of workers eagerly awaits the crate's arrival on the ship, while others work diligently to guide it from the ground, with you in the way."
    "船上一群工人正焦急地等着货箱放下，地面的工人则忙着拉绳引位——而你偏偏好死不死正挡在正下方。"

# game/script.rpy:1170
translate Chinese start_34041cc7:

    # "! ! !"
    "! ! !"

# game/script.rpy:1172
translate Chinese start_88d3b89a:

    # "You quickly scurry out of the way of danger, sheepishly watching as the crate is carefully lowered to the men on the ship."
    "你赶紧连滚带爬地逃出险境，满面羞惭地看着货箱被小心翼翼地平稳下放给船上的接应者。"

# game/script.rpy:1174
translate Chinese start_b5cb0c34:

    # "Great. Not even on the ship yet and you've already made a fool of yourself."
    "真有你的。还没踏上船半步呢，就已经把脸给丢尽了。"

# game/script.rpy:1176
translate Chinese start_6114bbfa:

    # man1 "Easy now. Slow. Slow it... A bit more!"
    man1 "都小心着点！慢点！再慢点！"

# game/script.rpy:1180
translate Chinese start_b7279098:

    # man1 "...And down. Now! Keep it slow and steady. Slow. Slooow. Damn it, I said slow! Are you deaf? She's not your wife. Treat her gently, you son of a bitch!"
    man1 "……往下放！就现在！手头都给老子稳着点、慢着点！慢！慢慢放！操，老子说了慢点！耳朵都聋了吗？货物又不是你媳妇，轻手轻脚伺候着点，你个王八犊子！"

# game/script.rpy:1184
translate Chinese start_94612ee2:

    # "Reluctantly, you approach the horse again, sure that he must be the one in charge with how he's barking orders."
    "你硬着头皮再次蹭到那马的面前，看他那副吆五喝六发号施令的架势，确信他定是管事的长官无疑。"

# game/script.rpy:1189
translate Chinese start_c94ed8f2:

    # pS "Sorry about that sir! I'm new. One of the new recruits signed up to join the Conway. Could you tell me where I should be?"
    pS "长官，刚才多有对不住！我是新来的，刚签字报名加入Conway号的新水手。不知该去哪儿报到？"

# game/script.rpy:1191
translate Chinese start_5d177212:

    # "The horse doesn't seem to have heard you. Or care. His attention is focused only on his work, keeping an eye on every barrel and crate coming from the nearby warehouse and heading for the ship."
    "那马好像压根没听见，或者说根本不在乎。他两眼只盯着手头的工作，密切注视着从仓库运来的每一个桶和箱子。"

# game/script.rpy:1193
translate Chinese start_0add45a9:

    # "Frustrated, you clear your throat and try again in a louder tone."
    "你有点恼火，清了清嗓子，又大声问了一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:1195
translate Chinese start_9523e541:

    # pS "Sir? I'm here to joi-"
    pS "先生？我是来加-"

# game/script.rpy:1199
translate Chinese start_d6a9fcb3:

    # horse "Yes. I heard you."
    horse "听见了。"

# game/script.rpy:1203
translate Chinese start_66ee68a3:

    # "He's quick to interrupt you, sparing only a momentary glance in your direction before his booming voice shouts at someone near the warehouse."
    "他飞快地打断了你，只瞥了你一眼，就冲着仓库那边的人吼道："

# game/script.rpy:1206
translate Chinese start_a1629a97:

    # horse "JEFFERY! WE'RE TWO SHORT! GET THOSE FIRST!"
    horse "JEFFERY！还差两个人手！先紧着把那俩补上！"

# game/script.rpy:1208
translate Chinese start_0af3f878:

    # man1 "Got it, sir!"
    man1 "明白，长官！"

# game/script.rpy:1212
translate Chinese start_f613ded3:

    # "The horse turns his attention back to you, narrowing his gaze with a deep scowl."
    "那马转过头，眯起眼睛，狠狠地瞪着你。"

# game/script.rpy:1216
translate Chinese start_18465cc7:

    # horse "You're one of the new ones? ... Great. How about you don't get in the way every chance you can."
    horse "你是新来的？……真他妈好极了。要不你尽量少给我添乱、少挡道，成吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1218
translate Chinese start_140f419c:

    # pS "I'm really sorry sir! I'll be more careful in the future."
    pS "真的很抱歉，先生！我以后会更加小心的。"

# game/script.rpy:1223
translate Chinese start_79d8ba8f:

    # "The horse snorts, clearly unconvinced. His steely gaze lingers long enough to make you squirm before he pulls out a leather-bound book and leafs through the pages."
    "马喷着响鼻，显然不相信。他锐利的目光盯着你，盯得你浑身不自在。他这才拿出一本皮面书，翻了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:1225
translate Chinese start_1f939b0a:

    # a "That's Officer to you from now on, got it? Officer Arthur Hudson. What's your name, recruit? I don't think I see 'Clueless Fool' in here."
    a "从今往后，叫我长官，听明白了吗？Arthur Hudson长官。你叫什么名字，新来的？我这名册上可没见着谁叫“没头脑的蠢货”。"

# game/script.rpy:1331
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_a5ee472d:

    # a "Well, shit. You weren't even joking."
    a "操，你小子还真没开玩笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1333
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_cea747b9:

    # a "[name] [family_name], arrived and accounted for. Get up there and wait at the fore, recruit. You'll be instructed after loading is done."
    a "[name] [family_name]，报到核对无误。到前甲板去候着，新来的。货装完自然会有人吩咐你。"

# game/script.rpy:1338
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_8c315922:

    # "Navigating around the busy crewmen, you cautiously tread upon the unsteady gangway, feeling it sway beneath your paws with each gentle roll of the sea."
    "你小心地绕开周围忙碌穿梭的水手，踏上摇晃不定的跳板，随着海浪的微微起伏，能感觉到脚爪下的木板正在晃颤。"
    # 译注：gangway在此指连接码头与船舷的跳板。

# game/script.rpy:1340
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_79ca15f2:

    # "You proceed cautiously, each step measured and deliberate, as if the slightest misstep could send you tumbling into the water. You can't help but feel the crew's eyes on you, perhaps amused by the new recruit's struggle to simply walk."
    "你小心翼翼地往前走，每一步都仔细掂量过，生怕一不小心就掉进海里。你感觉船员们的目光都集中在你身上，可能觉得这新来的家伙连路都走不稳，挺好笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:1347
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b2844dbb:

    # "Finally, your feet find solid ground as you step onto the deck, a wave of relief washing over you. It may not have been the smoothest start to your first day on the ship, but you reassure yourself that confidence will come with time. This is, after all, what you've always wanted."
    "终于，你双脚踏上了坚实的甲板，一阵轻松感涌上心头。虽然第一天上船的开局不太顺利，但你安慰自己说，自信总会随着时间慢慢培养起来的。毕竟，这就是你一直向往的生活。"

# game/script.rpy:1349
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_65f34fac:

    # "Regaining your footing on the stable deck, you stride purposefully towards the foremast, mindful of the instructions given to you. Best to avoid any further trouble that would come from sightseeing."
    "在平稳的甲板上重新找回重心后，你牢记方才的长官命令，径直朝前桅迈步走去。眼下最好还是少东张西望看稀奇，免得又惹出什么乱子。"
    # 译注：foremast指三桅帆船最前方的桅杆。

# game/script.rpy:1351
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_21e069a4:

    # "Focused on your tasks, you navigate the ship with purpose, eager to prove yourself in your new role. Surprisingly, you spot two others already waiting in the designated spot. It takes but a moment for you to put it together. More new recruits just like you."
    "你专注于自己的任务，在船上穿梭，渴望尽快证明自己的价值。令人意外的是，你发现已经有两个人在指定地点等候。你立刻意识到，他们和你一样，都是新来的。"

# game/script.rpy:1364
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_3a17fd03:

    # "The one in the back, a weathered wolf in his mid-thirties, bears the marks of time and hardships on his face. Lost in his thoughts, he flicks a coin with practiced ease, catching it repeatedly, absorbed in deep contemplation."
    "站在后头的是一只三十来岁、略显沧桑的灰狼，脸上刻满了岁月与艰辛的痕迹。他陷入自己的思绪中，手法娴熟地弹起一枚硬币又反复接住，显得心事重重。"

# game/script.rpy:1366
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b5dffec7:

    # "You can't help but wonder how he, at his age, became one of the ship's new recruits."
    "你忍不住好奇，他这把年纪怎么也成了新兵。"

# game/script.rpy:1368
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_b174982e:

    # "The other figure, a youthful lizard, appears much more suited for the role. From the looks of it, he couldn't be older than just about twenty, if even that."
    "另一位是年轻的蜥蜴，看起来倒是挺适合这份工作。看样子，他顶多也就二十岁，甚至可能更小。"

# game/script.rpy:1370
translate Chinese day1_postnameselection_f8c4ad07:

    # "From his spot leaned up against the mast, the lizard lets his inquisitive gaze focus on you, a faint smirk tugging at his lips."
    "蜥蜴斜靠在桅杆上，带着一丝意味深长的微笑，饶有兴致地打量着你。"

# game/script.rpy:1396
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_5d5dac8b:

    # p "Aye."
    p "嘿。"

# game/script.rpy:1398
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_7c490602:

    # wolf "Aye."
    wolf "嗯。"

# game/script.rpy:1400
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_3fbd2da0:

    # liz "Would you look at that. A cat! Not going to be at each other's throats immediately, are you?"
    liz "瞧瞧这是谁。居然是只猫！你们俩不会待会儿就掐起来吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1402
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_f36d6781:

    # p "Hadn't planned on it. You two new as well?"
    p "没打算那样。你们也是新来的？"

# game/script.rpy:1404
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_2d689573:

    # "The wolf simply nods. He doesn't seem to be the chatty type."
    "狼只是点了点头，看来他不太爱说话。"

# game/script.rpy:1411
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_9c4722b2:

    # j "New Landsman, yes. Julian. Sure it will be great working with you!"
    j "新招募的旱鸭子水手，对。我叫Julian。能跟你们一块儿干活肯定很有意思！"
    # 译注：Landsman是18世纪航海体制等级（无经验的新入行水手/旱鸭子水手）。

# game/script.rpy:1413
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_0c1ef4bd:

    # p "Pleasure's all mine. Can't wait to be scrubbing the whole ship with the two of you."
    p "幸会。我已经等不及跟你们俩一块儿把整条船从头刷到尾了。"

# game/script.rpy:1417
translate Chinese firstchoice_greet_77416f5f:

    # "Julian's smile curls up adorably across his reptilian muzzle. Seems he found your little icebreaker rather amusing."
    "Julian那爬行动物特有的吻部扬起一抹讨喜的笑意。看来他觉得你这句打破冷场的玩笑挺逗。"

# game/script.rpy:1433
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_77cecdd2:

    # "Without a word, you join the two in waiting, leaning your shoulder up against the mast next to the lizard."
    "你没说话，走到他们身边，靠着桅杆和蜥蜴并肩站着。"

# game/script.rpy:1440
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_c9b2af5e:

    # liz "Not going to say anything?"
    liz "不说两句吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1442
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_bd952281:

    # j "Figured you might have trouble with the wolf, being a cat and all, but didn't think you'd give me the cold shoulder. Name's Julian."
    j "我还以为你看到狼会不自在呢，毕竟你是只猫嘛，没想到你竟然直接给我脸色看。我叫Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:1444
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_1a476a3d:

    # "You fold your ears back sheepishly, offering a friendly smile to the lizard."
    "你有些不好意思地往后缩了缩耳朵，朝蜥蜴友善地笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1446
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_d00bb2f1:

    # p "Oh yes, sorry. I didn't mean any offense. I'm [name]. Nice to meet you Julian."
    p "哦，抱歉。我不是故意冒犯你的。我叫[name]，很高兴认识你，Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:1448
translate Chinese firstchoice_quiet_21bbc16a:

    # "Julian remains silent for a moment, a mischievous smirk gracing his lips as he studies you with an intense gaze. "
    "Julian沉默了片刻，脸上带着一丝顽皮的笑容，饶有兴致地打量着你。 "

# game/script.rpy:1456
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_abf132f7:

    # "Searching for a way to keep the conversation going, you subtly gesture toward the crew members who are busily loading the ship."
    "你想找个话题继续聊下去，便不着痕迹地指了指那些忙着往船上装货的船员们。"

# game/script.rpy:1458
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b3a144e5:

    # p "I can't believe how quickly they work. I think I'd be lost just trying to make it from here to the warehouse."
    p "真不敢相信他们干活这么快。我觉得我从这儿走到仓库都得迷路。"

# game/script.rpy:1460
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d4bb6956:

    # j "It's like a well-oiled machine. All the crew working together and knowing exactly what to do. No wonder they wanted us over here and out of the way."
    j "简直就像一台运转良好的机器。所有船员齐心协力，都知道自己该做什么。怪不得他们要把我们打发到这边来，免得碍事。"

# game/script.rpy:1462
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_43b282db:

    # j "I bet most of the crew are seasoned vets. Makes sense they work so smoothly."
    j "我敢说啊，这船上多半都是些老油条。怪不得干活这么利索。"

# game/script.rpy:1466
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7efd797f:

    # j "Did you hear? Some guy must have got in their way a bit ago. Could hear the screaming from up here!"
    j "听说了没？ 好像是有人不长眼，惹到他们了。我老远就听见那叫声了！"

# game/script.rpy:1468
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bb805eeb:

    # p "Oh.. uh. Yeah, I heard."
    p "哦……啊，听说了。"

# game/script.rpy:1470
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3607ee39:

    # "You're thankful not everyone saw the commotion you caused earlier; you quietly hope that Julian doesn't pry any further, allowing the incident to fade into oblivion."
    "你暗自庆幸没多少人看到你先前闹出的乱子；只盼着Julian别再刨根问底，好让那桩丢人现眼的事就此翻篇。"

# game/script.rpy:1474
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2eea007d:

    # p "It feels strange just sitting here while everyone works, though."
    p "不过，大伙儿都在忙活，就我搁这儿闲坐着，总觉得有点怪怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:1476
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_956d14bc:

    # j "It does, doesn't it?"
    j "可不是嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:1478
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4b12e0e0:

    # p "Feels like I'm just a passenger, I guess."
    p "感觉自己就是个搭船的，唉。"

# game/script.rpy:1480
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2baa462a:

    # "Your words nudge Julian towards a new topic."
    "你这话一说，Julian立马就转移了话题。"

# game/script.rpy:1482
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4db9bd0c:

    # j "Passenger, huh? You ever been on a ship before?"
    j "搭船的？你以前上过船吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1484
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d5871c2f:

    # p "Never. I've dreamed of it, but I was tied to my home until now. But I have to admit, I'm excited!"
    p "从来没有。我倒是做梦都想，可之前一直被家事绊着。不过说真的，我挺兴奋的！"

# game/script.rpy:1486
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ea040406:

    # "Julian seems surprised by the revelation. Guess it's not every day a new recruit has never even seen a ship before."
    "Julian听了这话，好像有点吃惊。估计很少有新来的，连船都没见过的。"

# game/script.rpy:1488
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f3f23683:

    # j "Really? Well, you're in for something then. It's not for everyone. Hope you get your sea legs quick."
    j "真的？那你接下来可有得受了。航海生活可不是人人都吃得消的。希望你能快点找到出海的脚感。"
    # 译注：get your sea legs为经典航海俚语，指适应甲板颠簸摇晃、不再晕船并能稳步站立行走的能力。

# game/script.rpy:1490
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4b8a153b:

    # p "Not your first time sailing?"
    p "你不是第一次出海吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1492
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_574b96e0:

    # j "Few trips here and there. Dad's in the navy, so I grew up with it all. Just never done anything this big."
    j "零星出过几趟海。我老爹在海军服役，所以我从小耳濡目染，多少懂点门道。只是从没出过这么大规模的远航。"

# game/script.rpy:1494
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b11a018c:

    # p "The navy? Not surprising you'd end up working on a ship as well."
    p "你爹是海军？难怪你最后也跑船上来了。"

# game/script.rpy:1496
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b42e31b5:

    # j "Not the first time I've heard that. Must be in my blood, huh?"
    j "这话我可没少听。看来我天生就是吃这碗饭的，啊？"

# game/script.rpy:1500
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ceffef06:

    # j "Better hope you don't get seasick immediately. I can't promise I won't laugh if I see you hurling off the edge of the ship."
    j "你可千万别一上来就晕船啊。要不然我看到你趴在船边上吐，可不保证不笑出声。"

# game/script.rpy:1502
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ba42c10c:

    # "Julian's jest comes with a mischievous glint in his eyes."
    "Julian说着玩笑话，眼睛里闪着坏笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1506
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_42cca550:

    # p "Thanks for being so supportive..."
    p "多谢您嘞，真是太照顾我了……"

# game/script.rpy:1509
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_22f5fe88:

    # wolf "I'll fetch you a bucket. That enough support?"
    wolf "我给你弄个桶来，够意思了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1517
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e71ac4f4:

    # "The wolf's deep voice interrupts the conversation from behind you, drawing your attention. You glance over your shoulder to see him still engrossed in his coin, its polished surface gleaming in the sunlight as he expertly flips it through the air."
    "身后传来灰狼那低沉浑厚的嗓音，打断了你们的对话，引得你转过身去。只见他依旧全神贯注地摆弄着手中的硬币，硬币磨得光亮的表面在阳光下熠熠生辉，随着他娴熟利落的指法在半空中翻转飞舞。"

# game/script.rpy:1519
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p "……"

# game/script.rpy:1521
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_de411af8:

    # p "Very kind of you."
    p "您真是太客气了。"

# game/script.rpy:1527
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2b4b05a9:

    # p "I think I'd like to assume I'll be fine. I don't need yet another thing to worry about."
    p "我还是先当自己没事吧。我可不想再多一件闹心的事儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:1529
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4ea2516a:

    # j "Time will tell, though I'm sure you'll be fine."
    j "走着瞧吧，不过我相信你肯定没问题的。"

# game/script.rpy:1537
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_593e1126:

    # j "...Hopefully."
    j "……但愿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1543
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_03904d97:

    # "Julian leans in, clapping a hand on your shoulder in a friendly gesture."
    "Julian凑上前来，友善地拍了拍你的肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:1548
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1d812308:

    # j "So if you've never been on a ship, what made you sign up? Let me take a wild guess. Running away from the farm life?"
    j "话说回来，既然你以前从没上过船，那是图个啥来签字当水手的？让我瞎猜猜——受够了乡下种地放牛的日子，跑出来逃避现实的？"

# game/script.rpy:1550
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c5525d76:

    # "Julian's long reptilian tail gracefully sweeps across the deck in slow, deliberate movements, waiting to see if his assumption was correct."
    "Julian那条长长的蜥蜴尾巴慢悠悠地扫过甲板，等着看自己是不是猜对了。"

# game/script.rpy:1552
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_81d3ef99:

    # "You can't help but frown. Was it really that common?"
    "你忍不住皱起了眉头。 这种事很常见吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1556
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2096f27a:

    # p "Lucky guess? I didn't think it happened that often. But yes, I wanted a chance to see the world. The tales from the sailors passing through my town were always so thrilling."
    p "瞎蒙的吧？ 我还以为没那么多人呢。 不过说真的，我就是想见见世面。 以前我们镇上总有水手路过，他们说的那些故事，可惊险刺激了。"

# game/script.rpy:1558
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_900459e6:

    # p "I guess I just needed to see something other than this town."
    p "我只是想看看外面的世界。"

# game/script.rpy:1560
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ed5b488c:

    # "Feeling self-conscious, you try to think of a way to put it into words."
    "你有点不好意思，想了想该怎么说。"

# game/script.rpy:1562
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0ee2dd91:

    # "The way the ocean has always seemed to offer an escape for you—how boxed in your village was, save for the endless expanse of sea..."
    "大海对你而言始终意味着一条出路——回想起来，你的村庄除了那片无垠的汪洋，是多么逼仄闭塞……"

# game/script.rpy:1564
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_11128422:

    # "Nothing seems like it will satisfy the two, and you decide to demur, ever so slightly."
    "似乎没什么能让他们都满意，你决定稍微婉拒一下。"

# game/script.rpy:1566
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fbd596e3:

    # p "Maybe that's childish of me."
    p "也许我很幼稚。"

# game/script.rpy:1568
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b9b9e423:

    # j "Wanting to \"get out and see the world,\" you mean?"
    j "你是说想要“走出去看看世界”？"

# game/script.rpy:1570
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_10b477f2:

    # p "I suppose."
    p "也许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1572
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_07c686af:

    # wolf "Yes. It is."
    wolf "没错。就是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:1576
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e83b2ba5:

    # j "Oh, ignore him."
    j "哦，别理他。"

# game/script.rpy:1578
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f5ca8fce:

    # "You try, although you nuance your explanation with a shrug, so that you don't seem too vulnerable."
    "你试着解释，耸耸肩，让自己的语气不显得那么脆弱。"

# game/script.rpy:1586
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6a71bbe2:

    # p "It was this or working on the farm. And..."
    p "要么这样，要么在农场工作。而且……"

# game/script.rpy:1588
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_748828a4:

    # "Somehow, considering that life for yourself makes the rest easier."
    "不知怎么的，一想到要过怎样的人生，其他的选择好像就没那么难了。"

# game/script.rpy:1590
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c1bcb652:

    # p "I'd hate myself if I didn't try it. I'm sure it's not all laughs and... the friendly company."
    p "要是不试试，我肯定会后悔的。当然，我也知道肯定不会只有欢声笑语和……和善的伙伴。"

# game/script.rpy:1597
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e0e24275:

    # "The wolf doesn't rise to the bait. Julian, however, smiles affably."
    "灰狼并未接招。不过，Julian倒是随和地笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:1599
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b75a6094:

    # j "As long as you know that before you start. You can always return, if you find out it's not for you."
    j "只要你在上船之前心里有数就行。要是干下来发现自己实在不适合这行，大不了随时回头。"

# game/script.rpy:1603
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bcb836bb:

    # p "Sure. It's still a leap into the unknown, that's all. Maybe I'm just worried it won't work out the way I hoped."
    p "是啊。毕竟是未知的冒险。可能我只是怕事与愿违吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1605
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7a89e0c8:

    # "That sounds childish, too, once you say it out loud. But you can't help casting one last, slightly wistful look at the harbor."
    "话一出口，你觉得自己听起来确实挺孩子气的。可你还是忍不住朝港湾投去了最后一眼，心头掠过一丝若有若无的留恋。"

# game/script.rpy:1607
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_a97bca64:

    # "All that security. Everything you've known. You'll be leaving it all behind, to spend..."
    "所有熟悉的安稳、过往已知的一切，如今你都要尽数抛在身后，去度过……"

# game/script.rpy:1609
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e66209f7:

    # "To spend God only knows how long—with sailors like these?"
    "天晓得要在海上漂泊多久——还要跟这样一群水手朝夕相处？"

# game/script.rpy:1611
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_54125c17:

    # p "It worked out for you, though, right? You don't seem to have any trouble."
    p "但你不是混得挺好的吗？ 看起来一点烦恼都没有。"

# game/script.rpy:1615
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d8c2f8b2:

    # "He gives you a quizzical look."
    "他用一种好奇的眼神看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:1617
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_085892b0:

    # j "Trouble?"
    j "麻烦？"

# game/script.rpy:1619
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3f3c7504:

    # p "Nerves? Things you're leaving behind? People who might miss you..."
    p "紧张？ 你要离开的东西？ 可能会想念你的人……"

# game/script.rpy:1623
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f1b7bbc5:

    # "He grabs the leather strap of the bag that, you realize, must contain all his belongings. Everything he has left in the world—just like you."
    "他攥住了包裹的皮背带，你意识到，那里面肯定装着他的全副家当。在这个世界上他仅存的一切——就像你一样。"

# game/script.rpy:1625
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_265469f6:

    # "But he twirls it idly in his hand, then shakes his head decisively."
    "但他漫不经心地用手转动着它，然后果断地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:1627
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_5989ea6a:

    # j "Oh.{w} No."
    j "哦。不。"

# game/script.rpy:1629
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8af92370:

    # p "Nobody?"
    p "一个都没有？"

# game/script.rpy:1631
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fa4a836a:

    # j "Well. Fine, yes."
    j "好吧，是...有吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1633
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e4fd1e41:

    # "Either he realizes that's not enough of an answer, or he suddenly decides he wants to tell you more."
    "要么他意识到这不足以回答，要么他突然决定想告诉你更多。"

# game/script.rpy:1635
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_70bd14de:

    # j "People will miss me. And I'll miss seeing the friends I grew up with. But my father has worked on ships all my life, so..."
    j "人们会想念我的。 我也会想念与我一起长大的朋友们。 但我父亲一辈子都在船上工作，所以……"

# game/script.rpy:1637
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2c4f6d83:

    # p "What do they say—salt water in your veins?"
    p "俗话怎么说的来着——血管里淌着海水？"
    # 译注：salt water in your veins为经典航海成语，指天生的水手血统/生来就属于海洋。

# game/script.rpy:1641
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_02801b7a:

    # j "Well, in that sense."
    j "嗯，某种程度上吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1645
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7414ea8e:

    # "He lets go of the bag and stands up, stretching his arms widely."
    "他松开行李，站起身，大大地伸了个懒腰。"

# game/script.rpy:1647
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4d1fce77:

    # j "It was only a matter of time before I'd follow in his footsteps, I guess."
    j "看来我迟早也会跟他一样，跑船为生。"

# game/script.rpy:1651
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_adcea35e:

    # wolf "Ah, yes, of course. The Admiralty is, no doubt, in this one's illustrious future."
    wolf "啊，那是自然。前途无量，没准还能进海军部呢。"

# game/script.rpy:1660
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3b40e24f:

    # j "Hey, who knows?"
    j "嘿，谁知道呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1662
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_025224c3:

    # "He seems to do a better job than you of not letting the wolf's personality get to him. Or maybe he takes it as a challenge, because his next question is directed at the canine as he makes his way over to him."
    "看来他比你更懂得如何不把这只灰狼的冷硬脾气放在心上。又或许，他反倒把这当成了一种挑战——因为当他踱步走向那只犬科兽人时，接下来的问题便是直冲着对方去的。"

# game/script.rpy:1668
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1daad1b6:

    # j "What about you, anyway? What's your story?"
    j "那你呢？你又是什么来头？"

# game/script.rpy:1670
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_49dde398:

    # "The wolf looks at him with an openly baleful expression."
    "那只狼恶狠狠地瞪了他一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:1672
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ff86a6f9:

    # wolf "My story?"
    wolf "我的来头？"

# game/script.rpy:1674
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fcceffc0:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "可不是嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:1680
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ce08d860:

    # "His thick tail follows the movements of each step he takes, like a dancer's ribbons, as he makes his way around the mast... And past the wolf."
    "他绕着桅杆走，粗壮的尾巴也跟着一摇一摆，像舞者的彩带一样...从那只狼旁边经过。"

# game/script.rpy:1685
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_9fcae6ce:

    # wolf "Money."
    wolf "为了钱。"

# game/script.rpy:1689
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e7859c9a:

    # j "Money? That's it?"
    j "为了钱？就这？"

# game/script.rpy:1691
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_13d2cc92:

    # wolf "That's it."
    wolf "就这样。"

# game/script.rpy:1693
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8efd3a6b:

    # p "You could have earned money here in town, you know?"
    p "你完全可以在镇里挣钱啊，你知道的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1697
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3acffd14:

    # wolf "And? I didn't, did I? Maybe I should've asked for a bonus. Being interrogated wasn't part of the description."
    wolf "所以呢？老子不乐意在镇上挣，不行么？早知如此该跟他们多要份津贴的。招募须知上可没写还要被你们盘问审讯。"

# game/script.rpy:1701
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c8a71010:

    # j "It's hardly an interrogation! I'm just curious."
    j "这算什么审讯！我就是好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:1705
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_49c4733f:

    # p "We're really not going to get you to tell us anything about you, are we?"
    p "看来我们是没法从你嘴里套出什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:1709
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fe924238:

    # "Rather than answering, he flips the coin into the air.{w} He catches it effortlessly, rolling it down between his fingers."
    "他不回答，只是把硬币抛向空中，{w} 轻松地接住，在指间转动。"

# game/script.rpy:1711
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_704f9bf9:

    # p "What about your name? Will you at least tell us that?"
    p "名字总能告诉我吧？你叫什么？"

# game/script.rpy:1713
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3207a923:

    # "He pauses, looking at you, poised to flip the coin into the air again."
    "他停顿了一下，看着你，又要抬手抛硬币。"

# game/script.rpy:1715
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_5a7891ae:

    # w "Wolf."
    w "Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:1719
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_01d21830:

    # j "You can't be serious. No way your name is just Wolf."
    j "不是吧，我不信。不可能有人直接叫Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:1721
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b5d39b60:

    # w "And yet, here we are."
    w "但事实就是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:1723
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ed8d9127:

    # w "My parents weren't the creative type,{w} how's that?"
    w "我爸妈没啥想象力，{w} 这样说你能理解吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1727
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d6a14645:

    # j "Mine aren't either, but... surely they didn't just call you \"Wolf.\""
    j "我爸妈也一样，但...他们总不能真的就叫你“Wolf”吧？"

# game/script.rpy:1731
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_618328de:

    # w "What was the point of asking me if you weren't going to listen to the answer in the first place?"
    w "如果你们根本不相信我的答案，干嘛还要问我？"

# game/script.rpy:1733
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0451bd21:

    # j "Wolf."
    j "Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:1735
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1334cd1c:

    # "He repeats it, clearly unconvinced."
    "他重复了一遍，语气里明显带着不信。"

# game/script.rpy:1737
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_86acd0ba:

    # w "They saw a wolf fall out, and it was the first thing that came to their mind. What more do you want?"
    w "当年接生时瞅见掉出来一头小狼崽子，他们脑子里蹦出的第一个词就是这玩意。你还想怎样？"
    # 译注：fall out是粗鲁俗语，形容分娩生下幼崽。Wolf用戏谑口吻解释为什么父母直接管他叫Wolf。

# game/script.rpy:1739
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_63e12b43:

    # "Silence descends, as you and Julian both try to decide whether he's being serious."
    "一片寂静，你和Julian都拿不准他是不是在说真的。"

# game/script.rpy:1741
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d7b63d2b:

    # "Finally, he flips the coin again. This time, though, he doesn't catch it. The coin glints and catches the light before it disappears in one of the folds of his white shirt."
    "结果，他又抛了一次硬币。不过这回，他没接住。硬币闪着光，在他白色衬衫的褶皱里消失不见。"

# game/script.rpy:1745
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_08c94947:

    # "Rather than acknowledge the missed toss, he simply fishes it from his shirt, then shakes his head scornfully."
    "他倒没提没接住的事儿，只是从衬衫里摸出硬币，不屑地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:1751
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_eec7b71b:

    # w "Whatever."
    w "随便你。"

# game/script.rpy:1753
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_63e9f822:

    # j "Apparently."
    j "大概是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:1762
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_40c07307:

    # "He leans the other way to get close to you, whispering so that the wolf—Wolf—can't hear him."
    "他朝另一侧倾过身，凑近你耳边低声说道，好让那只狼——呃...Wolf——听不见。"

# game/script.rpy:1764
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8a3236de:

    # j "Weird guy..."
    j "真是个怪人……"

# game/script.rpy:1772
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_381575ad:

    # "Before you can answer, or ask whether or not it was a safe bet that Wolf's hearing wasn't that good, Arthur makes his way forward to join you."
    "没等你回答，或者问他打赌Wolf的听力不好是不是稳赢，Arthur就走过来加入你们。"

# game/script.rpy:1774
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0c2e968d:

    # a "Hello, ladies!"
    a "怎么着，各位娇小姐！"
    # 译注：军营与水手长官习惯用“ladies”戏谑嘲弄初出茅庐的新手（娇滴滴的小姐）。

# game/script.rpy:1776
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_414d0202:

    # "The three of you get up, and you try to stand at something like military attention, greeting him properly."
    "你们三个赶紧站起来，你努力站得笔直，像个士兵一样，认真地向他问好。"

# game/script.rpy:1778
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0221ac57:

    # "Arthur takes a few seconds to quietly survey his new recruits."
    "Arthur花了几秒钟，默默地打量着他的新兵。"

# game/script.rpy:1780
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f9ceb7a6:

    # a "Well! Enough sitting around. We're almost ready. We'll be leaving port shortly."
    a "好啦！都别坐着了。咱们马上就要准备好了，很快就要离港了。"

# game/script.rpy:1791
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d8df2d80:

    # "You take one final look from the ship down to the harbor. Once more, the realization begins to sink in: this will be the last time you'll see this place for a long time."
    "你最后看了一眼船下的港口。你再次意识到：这会是你在很长一段时间里，最后一次看到这个地方了。"

# game/script.rpy:1793
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6629f1cb:

    # "Or you could bail now. Like Julian said—turn back, while you still have the chance...{p}No."
    "或者，你现在还可以临阵脱逃。正如Julian所说的那样——趁现在还有机会，打道回府……{p}不。"

# game/script.rpy:1795
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0d0a847e:

    # "You can't just go back. You chose this for a reason, and you're not going to back out now. This ship is your home."
    "你不能就这么回去。你选择这条路是有原因的，现在可不能打退堂鼓。这艘船就是你的家。"

# game/script.rpy:1797
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8b752382:

    # "These odd characters are your companions."
    "这些奇奇怪怪的人就是你的伙伴。"

# game/script.rpy:1807
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_76d2ad60:

    # "As you watch two sailors begin to close the heavy wooden cargo grate, Arthur speaks up again."
    "你看着两个水手开始合上厚重的木制货舱门，Arthur又开了口。"

# game/script.rpy:1809
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4bf11fe1:

    # a "You may be new, but I expect the same discipline and dedication from you as I would from any of the others."
    a "你们是新来的没错，但我对你们的期望和其他人一样，都要有纪律，肯奉献。"

# game/script.rpy:1811
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_14c3ecc2:

    # "The whole deck rattles as the door slams shut, with the finality you've always associated with a jail door closing." with hpunch
    "随着舱门“砰”的一声关上，整个甲板都震动起来，那声音就像监狱大门关上一样，让你觉得一切都尘埃落定了。" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:1813
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_100f6e47:

    # "Which side of the door are you on? You're not certain, but with a boyish smile you realize you certainly don't feel like a prisoner."
    "你现在到底在哪一边？你也不确定，但你带着一丝孩子气的微笑，意识到自己肯定不像个囚犯。"

# game/script.rpy:1815
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e78df59f:

    # "Even if some might argue that you are."
    "就算有人觉得你是，那又怎么样。"

# game/script.rpy:1817
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fb1f3967:

    # a "Is something funny, sailor?"
    a "什么事儿这么好笑，水手？"

# game/script.rpy:1819
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_04372ea5:

    # "You straighten up even further, to the limits of what you would've thought possible."
    "你把腰板挺得更直了，感觉都快超出极限了。"

# game/script.rpy:1821
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f5928b22:

    # p "No, sir."
    p "没有，长官。"

# game/script.rpy:1823
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e4fe052c:

    # "Sensing that this might not be sufficiently persuasive, you clear your throat."
    "感觉到这么说可能没什么说服力，你清了清嗓子。"

# game/script.rpy:1825
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_308b1b13:

    # p "I'm just... I'm happy to be here. Sir."
    p "我只是……我很高兴能来到这里。先生。"

# game/script.rpy:1827
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6f03ec83:

    # "He fixes you in a stern gaze, sizing you up."
    "他用严厉的目光盯着你，把你从头到脚打量了一番。"

# game/script.rpy:1829
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_15c322fb:

    # a "This isn't a day's sailing on your master's yacht, son. And that goes for you, too."
    a "这可不是在你家老爷的游艇上闲逛一天，小子。你也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:1831
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d870e62b:

    # "Arthur directs this at Julian, who remains impassive, even if you don't know why he might've been singled out."
    "Arthur是对着Julian说的，Julian还是面无表情，你也不知道他为什么会被单独点出来。"

# game/script.rpy:1833
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0c02cdee:

    # a "We may not be aboard a warship, but lives of others are going to depend on your diligent work. I expect you—all of you—to take it seriously."
    a "咱们脚下踩着的虽说不是军舰战船，但他人的身家性命全系在你们脚踏实地的干活上。我要求你们——所有人——都给我严肃对待。"

# game/script.rpy:1835
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2ff2d055:

    # a "All three of you will be under my command. Whatever I tell you to do, you'll do. Without question, without hesitation, and without doubt.{p}Is that clear?"
    a "你们三个都要听我的。我让你们做什么，你们就得做什么。不准质疑，不准犹豫，不准迟疑。{p}都明白了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1837
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b2c856c0:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:1839
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_a2c2407a:

    # "Julian and Wolf echo the same, alongside you."
    "Julian和Wolf也跟着应和，声音和你一样。"

# game/script.rpy:1841
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6065d579:

    # a "If not I, then whoever I delegate in my stead. I do not have time to nursemaid you. Is that clear?"
    a "如果不是我亲自指挥，也会由我指派的人来代替。我可没空像保姆一样照顾你们。明白了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1843
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_eff5237d:

    # "Again, a chorus of \"yes, sir\"—in unison, certainly more disciplined than you feel."
    "又是一阵异口同声的“明白，长官”——那整齐划一的阵势，听上去可远比你内心的底气要有板有眼得多。"

# game/script.rpy:1845
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_cc34e7d8:

    # a "The chain of command is your god, now. Whatever you were before, you'll be sailors, soon enough."
    a "从现在起，指挥命令就是你们的上帝。不管你们以前是干什么的，要不了多久，你们都得脱胎换骨变成真正的水手。"

# game/script.rpy:1847
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c2fbfdaa:

    # a "...With any luck."
    a "……如果运气好的话。"

# game/script.rpy:1849
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_82154223:

    # "The three of you remain motionless and stiff as Arthur looks you all up and down. If the horse feels optimistic, or disappointed—or nothing at all—you can't tell. His expression is impassive. Stern. Authoritative."
    "在Arthur从头到脚审视你们时，你们三个像木头桩子一样僵直地定在原地。至于这位马长官到底是觉得尚可造就，还是大失所望——抑或毫无感觉——你根本无从揣度。他的面容冷峻如铁、威严深沉，教人望而生畏。"

# game/script.rpy:1853
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_af2b8669:

    # "After a long spell, he decides he's had enough of his inspection and steps back."
    "过了好一会儿，他似乎终于结束了检阅，向后退了一步。"

# game/script.rpy:1857
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_05824698:

    # a "I'll find someone to teach you once we've left port."
    a "等我们出了港，我会找人来教你们。"

# game/script.rpy:1861
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_44e9b718:

    # a "Until then, grab your belongings and follow me."
    a "在此之前，都带上自己的东西，跟我走。"

# game/script.rpy:1863
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_066a76bd:

    # "When he nods to the bags sitting next to you, you hurry to grab yours—everything that remains of your previous life."
    "见他朝放在你们身旁的行囊颔首示意，你急忙抓起自己的那只包袱——那是你在过往人生中所残留的全部痕迹。"

# game/script.rpy:1867
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8c04989a:

    # "Arthur turns with a crisp, precise movement and heads toward the stern of the ship. He walks quickly, followed by Julian and Wolf."
    "Arthur干脆利落地转身，朝船尾走去。他脚步很快，Julian和Wolf紧随其后。"

# game/script.rpy:1887
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d44ff825:

    # "You hasten to catch up, falling in line with the others as sailors around you finish the last of the preparations."
    "你们连忙跟上，和其他水手排成一列。他们正在忙着做最后的准备工作。"

# game/script.rpy:1894
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1fddaa14:

    # "A sailor makes his way up the gangplank, just before it's pulled up after him. Carrying a leather-bound book and a few dozen letters in his hands, he approaches Arthur."
    "一个水手走上刚刚被收起的舷梯，手里拿着一本皮面书和几十封信，走向Arthur。"

# game/script.rpy:1896
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4927b8bb:

    # "The horse stops and returns the salute the sailor offers him."
    "Arthur停下脚步，向水手回了一个军礼。"

# game/script.rpy:1898
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3ebe7b4d:

    # a "At ease. Your report?"
    a "稍息。报告情况。"

# game/script.rpy:1900
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ff121d79:

    # sailschwartz "Everything and everyone is aboard, sir."
    sailschwartz "报告长官，所有人员和物资均已上船。"

# game/script.rpy:1902
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0836021d:

    # a "The surgeon?"
    a "医生呢？"

# game/script.rpy:1904
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2b9bcde8:

    # "He gives a short, sharp nod."
    "他短促地点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:1906
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0bf5327b:

    # sailschwartz "Yes, sir. Rajeeyah came aboard this morning. She said that she'd found what she needed to continue Mr. Blackborow's treatment."
    sailschwartz "是的，长官。Rajeeyah今天早上已经登船。她说她找到了能够继续治疗Blackborow先生的必需品。"

# game/script.rpy:1910
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_86ea528f:

    # a "Some good news, then. That should ease everyone's minds. Anything else?"
    a "这倒是个好消息，应该能让大家安心。还有其他事情吗？"

# game/script.rpy:1912
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_62585de9:

    # sailschwartz "Final messages from shore, sir. And the most recent soundings. They're still dredging the main channel, unfortunately."
    sailschwartz "长官，这是岸上送来的最后一批消息，还有最新的水深测量报告。不幸的是，他们还在疏浚主航道。"
    # 译注：dredging（疏浚），清理航道或港口水底淤泥砂石以加深航道水深的作业。参考：https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dredging

# game/script.rpy:1914
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_96d6e9a2:

    # a "I swear they'd be faster if they used their teeth. Very well. Take this to the quartermaster."
    a "我敢说他们要是用牙啃，速度都能更快点。好吧，把这些交给军需官。"

# game/script.rpy:1919
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7ceeea4b:

    # "With another salute, the sailor dashes aft, toward the raised quarterdeck at the ship's rear."
    "水手再次敬礼，然后快步走向船尾，那里是高出一截的后甲板。"

# game/script.rpy:1921
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8f4c1791:

    # "The four of you follow, although more slowly. Arthur's head is on a constant swivel, taking in the state of the ship around him."
    "你们四个也跟着走，不过速度慢多了。Arthur的头一直在转动，观察着船上的状况。"

# game/script.rpy:1927
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0f28ac0d:

    # "The sailor returns, without the books or the letters, scarcely out of breath despite dashing across the deck."
    "那个水手空着手回来了，虽然刚才跑过甲板，但几乎没怎么喘气。"

# game/script.rpy:1929
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ec5852bb:

    # sailschwartz "Sir. The kedge is fast. The quartermaster recommends we catch the tide, sir."
    sailschwartz "长官，已经用小艇锚固定好了。军需官建议我们抓住这次涨潮的机会，长官。"
    # 译注：kedge（小艇锚/导向锚）与 warping（绞锚移船），用小艇将小锚带到远处抛下，通过船上绞盘拉动缆绳移动帆船。参考：https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Warping_(sailing)

# game/script.rpy:1931
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1f96963d:

    # a "And catch it we shall. Have them hoist the flying jib, but keep it eased until I say so."
    a "好，那就抓住这次机会。让他们升起外飞头帆，但在我下令之前，先松着点。"
    # 译注：flying jib（外飞头帆/大三角帆），位于船首斜桅最前端的高处大三角帆，用于在顺风或微风中增加航速。参考：https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jib

# game/script.rpy:1935
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bcd595b4:

    # "When the sailor departs, Arthur straightens up further. His head is held high, and although you can see his chest fill with a deep breath, the loudness of his voice still takes you by surprise."
    "水手离开后，Arthur站得更加笔直。他高昂着头，胸膛深深地吸了一口气。即使有所准备，他洪亮的声音还是让你们吃了一惊。"

# game/script.rpy:1942
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_38e5e442:

    # a "All hands, stand by to weigh anchor!"
    a "全体注意，准备起锚！"

# game/script.rpy:1944
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_43d14c02:

    # "It is a clear, sharp bellow, and the crew snaps into action as if they are marionettes, under his direct control."
    "一声清晰而尖锐的怒吼，船员们就像被操控的提线木偶一样，立刻行动起来。"

# game/script.rpy:1946
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_22c00257:

    # a "Cast off all lines!"
    a "解开所有缆绳！"

# game/script.rpy:1950
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_01b7f974:

    # "Arthur checks his immediate surroundings, which includes the three of you."
    "Arthur环顾四周，包括你们三个。"

# game/script.rpy:1952
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3735bebb:

    # a "Stay clear of the ladders. We'll have men moving about. Beyond that, watch and learn."
    a "都给我离舷梯远点！会有人来回走动。除此之外，都给我看仔细了，好好学着点。"

# game/script.rpy:1954
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b2c856c0_1:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:1956
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ae111f75:

    # "Although Julian and Wolf seem to know what's going on, you have to pay close attention to discern one bit of activity from any other."
    "虽然Julian和Wolf好像知道该干什么，但你必须打起十二分精神，才能搞清楚他们到底在做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:1958
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c222498d:

    # "The crew are untying the ropes that have bound the Conway to her pier, you finally determine. Yet others wait raptly, their attention focused on Arthur."
    "你总算看明白了，船员们正在解开把Conway号固定在码头上的缆绳。还有些人正聚精会神地等着，眼睛都盯着Arthur。"

# game/script.rpy:1964
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_f2784108:

    # a "Haul in the kedge!"
    a "收起小艇锚！"

# game/script.rpy:1977
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_20da1e7c:

    # "His head turns, and you follow the horse's attention to where sailors have taken position around the capstan."
    "他转过头去，你的目光也顺着这位马长官的视线望去，只见水手们已经在起锚绞盘四周各就各位。"
    # 译注：capstan指依靠水手推木杠转动的起锚绞盘。

# game/script.rpy:1979
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_82336c6c:

    # "You notice no movement at first as it starts to turn; then, gradually, you perceive the shore receding from you as the ship's bow pulls away."
    "一开始，你没注意到绞盘有什么动静；但渐渐地，你感觉到船头正在驶离，海岸线也离你们越来越远。"

# game/script.rpy:1983
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3404c749:

    # a "Today, if you please!"
    a "动作麻利点，最好今天就能弄完！"

# game/script.rpy:1985
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_32ed9395:

    # "This seems to have been directed at a maned wolf, supervising the capstan. He gives Arthur a salute."
    "这声吆喝似乎是冲着正在监督绞盘作业的一只鬃狼喊的。那鬃狼随即朝Arthur行了个军礼。"

# game/script.rpy:1987
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fc4291ed:

    # mw "He said haul in! Put your backs into it! If you want to stay ashore so much, jump ship-"
    mw "他让你们收进来！都他妈的用点劲！想留在岸上是吧，那就跳船——"

# game/script.rpy:1989
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6ddb5c84:

    # "The crew are doing their best, although you can't tell if the man's exhortations are making a difference."
    "船员们都在尽力，不过你看不出来那家伙的训斥顶不顶用。"

# game/script.rpy:1991
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_59c7a023:

    # mw "-The rest of us have places to be. Oh, hell, I'll show you louts..."
    mw "——我们还有正事要办呢。哦，操，老子来给你们这些废物演示一下……"

# game/script.rpy:1993
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e776dd97:

    # "He joins them, his long legs straining for purchase on the deck."
    "他也加入了进去，两条大长腿在甲板上费力地寻找着力点。"

# game/script.rpy:1997
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_96e78550:

    # a "Good! Handsomely, now!"
    a "好！稳着点，匀速拉！"
    # 译注：Handsomely在18世纪帆船航海口令中专指“稳妥、匀速、小心稳步地（操作索具或起锚）”，切忌用力过猛拉断缆绳，并非字面“漂亮地”。

# game/script.rpy:1999
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1fef13dc:

    # "You wonder if you're about to be enlisted to help, yourself, but Arthur seems satisfied with the change in progress."
    "你寻思着是不是也要让你去帮忙，不过Arthur似乎对现在的进度还挺满意。"

# game/script.rpy:2001
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_818aae0b:

    # "The dock is noticeably further away now, as the ship's crew pulls it into the harbor by the anchor chain."
    "码头已经明显远了很多，船员们正通过锚链把船往港口里拉。"

# game/script.rpy:2003
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3c73ed60:

    # "Arthur's eyes flick from the capstan to the shore, narrowing at the direction of the rising smoke."
    "Arthur的目光从绞盘移向岸边，望向冉冉升起的炊烟方向，微微眯起了双眼。"

# game/script.rpy:2005
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bba34e23:

    # a "Sheet in the jib!"
    a "拉紧前三角帆！"

# game/script.rpy:2007
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_16e22931:

    # "He pauses, his ear flicking at the sound of a shout from further aft. You can't make it out, but the horse seems to have had no difficulty. He raises his voice again."
    "他停下动作，耳朵微微抖动，听到了从船后方传来的喊声。你没听清喊的是什么，但这位马长官显然听得一清二楚。他再次拔高了嗓门。"

# game/script.rpy:2012
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_134ab1d9:

    # a "All hands, man the halyards! Now, damnit—brace the yards and hoist the stays'ls! Samuel, stand by!"
    a "全体集合，升降索就位！都给我动作快点，操——转动帆桁，升起支索帆！Samuel，做好准备！"
    # 译注：man the halyards（升降索就位）；brace the yards（转动帆桁迎风角度）；hoist the stays'ls（升起支索帆），18世纪标准起帆航海口令。

# game/script.rpy:2014
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_97460d6a:

    # mw "Aye, sir!"
    mw "遵命，长官！"

# game/script.rpy:2016
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_cf0455b1:

    # a "Leave the yards be! Get on the bloody stays'ls, damn you!"
    a "别管那些帆桁了！都他妈的去弄支索帆，混账东西！"

# game/script.rpy:2019
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0ad61d6f:

    # a "{cps=5000}Leave the yards be! Get on the bloody stays'ls, damn you!{/cps}" nointeract
    a "{cps=5000}滚开！去拉该死的支索帆，听见没有！{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:2025
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_3400b200:

    # "Something seems to have agitated Arthur, although you can't tell what. But it looks like most of the crew are just pulling ropes.{p}Surely, you can do that?"
    "Arthur好像有点生气了，虽然你也不知道是因为什么。不过看起来大部分船员只是在拉绳子。{p}这活儿你总能干吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2027
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1b100a96:

    # p "How can we help, sir?"
    p "长官，我们能帮什么忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2029
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bab9326a:

    # "He shoots you a sharp look."
    "他狠狠地瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:2031
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_075f8076:

    # a "You can stay out of the bloody way. Clear of the damned ladders—what did I say?"
    a "你们只要别他妈的在这儿碍手碍脚就行！给我离那些该死的舱梯远点——老子刚才怎么说的？！"

# game/script.rpy:2033
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_aaa561b1:

    # "Julian gives your arm a gentle tug, to draw you away from the horse's sight—and his ire."
    "Julian轻轻拽了拽你的胳膊，把你拉离这位马长官的视线——也免得触了他的霉头。"

# game/script.rpy:2037
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1d3fecd5:

    # "Despite the outburst he's focused again immediately. The sails begin to lift, catching the wind until the ropes snap taut."
    "虽然刚才发了火，但他立刻又专注起来。船帆开始升起，迎风鼓动，直到绳索绷得笔直。"

# game/script.rpy:2039
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_26b95952:

    # a "Mind the downhaul on the mizen stays'l!"
    a "留神后桅支索帆的下曳索！"
    # 译注：downhaul（下曳索），用于迅速拉下或收拢三角帆与支索帆的专用索具。参考：https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Downhaul
    # 译注：mizen (mizzen) stays'l专指“后桅支索帆”；downhaul指拉下帆面的下曳索。

# game/script.rpy:2041
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_104bd539:

    # "The ship is moving perceptibly faster now. Arthur's eyes are still narrowed, his attention turned on something you can't yet perceive. But, as if receiving some sign, he raises his voice again."
    "现在船速明显加快了。Arthur仍然眯着眼睛，注意力集中在你尚未察觉的地方。但他似乎收到了某种指示，再次提高了嗓门。"

# game/script.rpy:2043
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e00990c8:

    # a "Samuel: haul away!"
    a "Samuel，起绞！用力拉！"
    # 译注：haul away是起锚绞盘操作时的核心号令，命令水手推杠绞盘拉起锚链。

# game/script.rpy:2045
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_71fec747:

    # "The maned wolf and his crew on the capstan work with renewed effort. It seems, at least, to be easier."
    "起锚绞盘旁的鬃狼和他的水手们再度加了把劲。至少看上去，绞盘转得比刚才要顺当了些。"

# game/script.rpy:2047
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bf63086e:

    # "They're no longer pulling the ship, you realize: The Conway is moving under her own power. Samuel just needs to raise the anchor as you pass over it."
    "你这才省悟过来，他们已经不再是纯靠人力拖船前行了：Conway号正借助自身风力航行。Samuel只需等船身驶过锚位正上方，将锚彻底收起即可。"

# game/script.rpy:2051
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8ec71ae7:

    # a "Keep the stays'ls sheeted in! That's good, lads."
    a "把支索帆的缭绳拉紧！干得漂亮，伙计们。"

# game/script.rpy:2053
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1812709c:

    # "The order is loud, but sounds perceptibly less urgent. He relaxes, and takes a deep breath that you can see in the movement of his massive chest."
    "命令依旧洪亮，但听起来明显没那么急迫了。他放松下来，深吸一口气，胸膛剧烈起伏。"

# game/script.rpy:2066
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_cba08017:

    # "He watches for another minute or so, then turns to the three of you."
    "他观察了一会儿，然后转向你们三人。"

# game/script.rpy:2068
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_703fd602:

    # a "While I appreciate your... enthusiasm..."
    a "我很欣赏你们的这份...热情……"

# game/script.rpy:2070
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_76afd139:

    # "He trails off, glaring fiercely at you, in particular."
    "他话音一顿，狠狠地瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:2074
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_840b081f:

    # a "I'd prefer you learn the ropes before I start you hauling on them."
    a "我更希望你们在动手去拽那些绳子前，先他妈把规矩和门道摸清楚。"
    # 译注：learn the ropes为源自帆船航海的双关熟语，既指字面“认清并学会操纵船上复杂的各种缆绳”，又指比喻“摸清门道、通晓行规”。

# game/script.rpy:2076
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b2c856c0_2:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:2080
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b4fb4fdf:

    # a "Report to Samuel. He'll be able to whip you into something like shape.{p}I hope."
    a "去找Samuel报到。他会好好操练你们的。{p} 但愿如此。"

# game/script.rpy:2082
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_b2c856c0_3:

    # p "Yes, sir."
    p "是的，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:2093
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_06cb9a2d:

    # "Samuel, the maned wolf, seems to have finished whatever he was working on. You take one step towards him, only for Arthur to cut you off."
    "鬃狼Samuel好像已经干完了手头的活。你刚想朝他走一步，就被Arthur打断了。"

# game/script.rpy:2095
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e0485388:

    # a "Take care of your bags first. Both of you. You're... posts 36 and 37, if I remember."
    a "先把你们的行囊归置好。你们俩都要去。如果我没记错的话，你们的号位是……36号和37号吊床位。"

# game/script.rpy:2099
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0aa463f5:

    # "He points to you and Julian in turn."
    "他依次指了指你和Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:2101
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_5d900710:

    # a "Stow your gear. Then go see Samuel."
    a "把行囊铺盖归置收好。然后去找Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:2103
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_828f8215:

    # "You wait, sensing it's expected of you. Or, at least, that if you left at once he'd just yell at you again."
    "你没动，觉得应该等他发话。或者说，至少你现在走开，他肯定又要朝你嚷嚷。"

# game/script.rpy:2105
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4992235c:

    # a "You're dismissed. Be quick about it."
    a "解散。都麻利点。"

# game/script.rpy:2111
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4db22149:

    # "There is a bit of an edge in Arthur's voice, although you can't tell the reason. The crew respond, nonetheless, moving around the ship's rigging as nimbly as a spider in her web."
    "Arthur的语气有点冲，但你摸不着头脑。船员们倒是不敢怠慢，像蜘蛛在网上一样，灵巧地在船上的索具间穿梭。"

# game/script.rpy:2115
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8bbdddc1:

    # "As you watch, the sails lift, catching the wind until the ropes snap taut. The ship is moving perceptibly faster now. Arthur's eyes are still narrowed, his attention focused on something you can't yet perceive."
    "你看到船帆扬起，迎风鼓动，绳索根根绷紧。船速明显加快。Arthur依旧眯着眼睛，注意力集中在你尚未察觉的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:2117
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_cc52b8c9:

    # a "Mind the downhaul on the mizen stays'l—Samuel, haul away!"
    a "留神后桅支索帆的下曳索——Samuel，开绞！用力拉！"
    # 译注：mizen stays'l（后桅支索帆）；downhaul（下曳索）；haul away（开绞拉拽）。

# game/script.rpy:2119
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_71fec747_1:

    # "The maned wolf and his crew on the capstan work with renewed effort. It seems, at least, to be easier."
    "起锚绞盘旁的鬃狼和他的水手们再度加了把劲。至少看上去，绞盘转得比刚才要顺当了些。"

# game/script.rpy:2123
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_bf63086e_1:

    # "They're no longer pulling the ship, you realize: The Conway is moving under her own power. Samuel just needs to raise the anchor as you pass over it."
    "你这才省悟过来，他们已经不再是纯靠人力拖船前行了：Conway号正借助自身风力航行。Samuel只需等船身驶过锚位正上方，将锚彻底收起即可。"

# game/script.rpy:2125
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_ef85c08c:

    # a "Good."
    a "很好。"

# game/script.rpy:2127
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2795c1e5:

    # "Arthur relaxes, and takes a deep breath that you can see in the movement of his massive chest. He lifts his voice again."
    "Arthur放松下来，深吸一口气，胸膛剧烈起伏。他又提高了嗓门："

# game/script.rpy:2129
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_47ad9044:

    # a "Keep the stays'ls sheeted in."
    a "把支索帆的缭绳拉紧！"

# game/script.rpy:2142
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_cba08017_1:

    # "He watches for another minute or so, then turns to the three of you."
    "他驻足注视了约莫一分钟，随后转过身，看向你们三人。"

# game/script.rpy:2144
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_fba1fc46:

    # a "Well, you apparently can keep out of trouble. Let's see if you can be useful, too. You're at posts... 36, and 37, I believe."
    a "看来你们几个还算识相没惹麻烦。再让我瞧瞧你们能不能派上点用场。你们在……36号和37号位，我没记错的话。"

# game/script.rpy:2146
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_0aa463f5_1:

    # "He points to you and Julian in turn."
    "他依次抬手指向了你和Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:2148
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_a02a5d67:

    # a "Stow your gear and report to Samuel. Be quick about it."
    a "收好各自的行囊，去向Samuel报到。手脚都给我麻利点！"

# game/script.rpy:2172
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1fb36b70:

    # "Wolf, it would seem, has already put away his belongings. You follow Julian, who seems to know where he's going."
    "Wolf看来早就把自己的随身家当收拾停当了。你跟在Julian身后，他走起路来轻车熟路，仿佛很清楚该往哪儿去。"

# game/script.rpy:2174
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_569d0157:

    # p "Do you understand what happened? How you move the ship, I mean."
    p "刚才到底是怎么回事，你全弄明白了？我是说，船究竟是怎么动起来的？"

# game/script.rpy:2178
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1051ffd2:

    # j "The orders? Of course. It's not too difficult."
    j "刚才那些口令？当然啦。其实没多难。"

# game/script.rpy:2180
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_c93e2721:

    # "You have a hard time believing this, to be honest."
    "说实在的，你很难相信他真的全都懂。"

# game/script.rpy:2182
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d3d08fbc:

    # p "Really? All the ropes and the... anchors and everything? You understand how it works?"
    p "真的假的？那么多绳索、还有……锚什么的，你真搞明白它是怎么运作的了？"

# game/script.rpy:2186
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d00746e0:

    # j "Well... not all of it. Just think about it logically. It comes down to wanting wind in the sails, right?"
    j "呃……倒也不是全懂。不过按常理琢磨琢磨，说到底不就是想让风把帆吹鼓嘛，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2188
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_a369d2b2:

    # p "I guess?"
    p "大概是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2190
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_a1d10fca:

    # j "And to point the sails into the wind, you pull on the different ropes. If it's important, they'll teach us."
    j "想让帆面兜住风，就得拉各种不同的绳子。真要紧的门道，回头长官他们自会教咱们的。"

# game/script.rpy:2192
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_7600a17d:

    # p "With that... winch the maned wolf was running?"
    p "靠刚才那只鬃狼操作的那个……大绞盘拉？"

# game/script.rpy:2196
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_8e892929:

    # j "The capstan?"
    j "你说起锚绞盘？"

# game/script.rpy:2198
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_13e5c01e:

    # "He looks around at the posts, searching for where they're identified."
    "他四下打量着那些立柱，寻找上面标示的编号。"

# game/script.rpy:2202
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_6251cb9d:

    # j "Here we go. Just put your bag here."
    j "找着了。就把你的行囊放这儿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2206
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_af126572:

    # "You do as he says, although you have to take Julian's own knowledge of the Conway on faith."
    "你照他说的放下包裹，尽管你其实只能全凭瞎蒙，指望Julian是真了解Conway号上的门道。"

# game/script.rpy:2208
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_37314b59:

    # p "\"Capstan.\" Yes."
    p "对，“起锚绞盘”，就是那个。"

# game/script.rpy:2210
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1dd4185e:

    # j "No."
    j "那倒不是。"

# game/script.rpy:2212
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_93be50a0:

    # p "No?"
    p "不是？"

# game/script.rpy:2216
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_d16756ad:

    # "He gives you one of those airy, boyish smiles, as if it was the least meaningful thing in the world."
    "他冲你露出了那副轻佻顽皮的少年笑容，仿佛这根本微不足道一样。"

# game/script.rpy:2218
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2251bce5:

    # j "The capstan is for the anchor. If the wind's not favorable, they set an anchor in the harbor mud and pull the ship into deep water that way. Simple."
    j "起锚绞盘是用来绞锚的。要是风向不对，他们就把小艇锚沉到港湾泥底里，借着绞索硬生生把船拽进深水区。就这么简单。"
    # 译注：提锚绞移法（kedging）是18世纪帆船在港湾或浅滩缺风时的经典操船手法。

# game/script.rpy:2220
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_20ba7377:

    # p "If you say so."
    p "你说是那就是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2224
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_1e1fa6c7:

    # "He keeps making this pronouncement. You have the sense that, beneath his lackadaisical exterior, Julian is more complex than he lets on."
    "他总是一副胸有成竹的断言口吻。你隐约感觉得出，在他那副玩世不恭的漫不经心背后，Julian其实比他展现出来的要深藏不露得多。"

# game/script.rpy:2226
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_2095160f:

    # "More world-wise, despite himself.{p}...More than you, at least, for now. You file \"capstan\" away in your mind for later."
    "尽管他看似随性，却意外地颇通世故。{p}……至少就目前而言，见识比你要多得多。你暗自把“起锚绞盘”这个词记在了心里，以备后用。"

# game/script.rpy:2228
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_4a6081da:

    # p "Is that all we need to do here?"
    p "咱们在这儿就算完事了？"

# game/script.rpy:2230
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_e5a5dd08:

    # j "Yep. So let's get back on deck before Wolf has a chance to turn that other dog against us."
    j "没错。赶紧回甲板上去吧，免得Wolf趁机把那只大鬃狼拉到他的阵营来对付咱们。"

# game/script.rpy:2232
translate Chinese firstchoice_done_84a9c1e4:

    # j "Shall we?"
    j "走着？"

# game/script.rpy:2265
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_fa15f2d4:

    # "The two of you join Wolf, who seems to have been engaged in a brief conversation with the maned wolf."
    "你们俩回到甲板与Wolf会合，他刚才似乎正同那名鬃狼简短地搭着话。"

# game/script.rpy:2267
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_00e4a4cc:

    # p "Ah... Samuel? We were told to report to you."
    p "那个……Samuel？长官让我们来找你报到。"

# game/script.rpy:2269
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ae3c42a7:

    # "The maned wolf is leaning against the railing, the capstan now abandoned. He looks remarkably carefree, with his arm hooked around one of the ship's cables, and his foot propped against one of the cleats."
    "那只鬃狼正倚靠在栏杆边，这会儿起锚绞盘旁已经空了下来。他看起来一副悠然自得的样子，一只手臂松垮地搭在船缆上，一只脚踏在系缆桩上歇着。"

# game/script.rpy:2271
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_888ca081:

    # s "So I been told. Nothing like a bit of excitement to start the voyage, eh?"
    s "听说了。刚一出航就来了这么一出小刺激，挺带劲的，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2273
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_82a5bb1c:

    # p "{i}Was{/i} that exciting?"
    p "{i}那{/i}也算刺激？"

# game/script.rpy:2277
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_b0272082:

    # j "He was expecting a pirate attack, I'm sure. Ready to take command if the captain was struck down."
    j "他刚才肯定以为要遇上海盗袭击了，时刻准备着一旦船长倒下就立马接管指挥权呢。"

# game/script.rpy:2279
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_e1f8a304:

    # p "No, I just-"
    p "没有，我只是——"

# game/script.rpy:2281
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_686bcb4f:

    # j "He's very helpful."
    j "他这人可热心肠了。"

# game/script.rpy:2283
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ee61e6ab:

    # s "Ah. Bucking for promotion already?"
    s "哈。这就急着巴结长官想往上爬了？"
    # 译注：bucking for promotion为军队/航海俚语，指急于表现争取升迁。

# game/script.rpy:2285
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_7a0d041d:

    # p "I wasn't certain what was happening, earlier. I made the mistake of asking Arthur if I could help."
    p "我刚才搞不清状况。犯蠢跑去问Arthur需不需要帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:2289
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_de7fc918:

    # "The maned wolf grins. He looks young—not much older than yourself, really. His grin, too, is youthful."
    "那只鬃狼咧嘴笑了。他看起来年纪不大——说真的，并不比你年长多少。那抹笑容也透着一股年轻人的朝气。"

# game/script.rpy:2291
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d4e09588:

    # "But he's clearly an experienced member of the Conway's crew—someone Arthur could rely on, despite the wicked easiness of the smile he's turned on you."
    "但他显然是Conway号上的老船员了——是深得Arthur器重的人，尽管他此刻冲你露出的笑容里带着一丝狡黠而随性的戏谑。"

# game/script.rpy:2293
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2558f17d:

    # s "If the sailing master needs ya help, he'll ask ya for it. Especially when ya' new. And dead weight."
    s "航海长要是真需要你们帮忙，他自会使唤。特别是你们这些刚上船的新丁，纯属累赘。"
    # 译注：sailing master指航海长官/领航员；dead weight指新手拖油瓶。

# game/script.rpy:2295
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_75597283:

    # p "I'd rather not be."
    p "我可不想当拖油瓶。"

# game/script.rpy:2299
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4f9b5c06:

    # "You are, admittedly, slightly concerned about making the wrong impression—although Samuel seems fairly friendly.{w} More than Arthur, at least."
    "说实在的，你心里确实有点担心留下坏印象——好在Samuel看起来挺随和的。{w}至少比Arthur要好相处多了。"

# game/script.rpy:2301
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9c156eb4:

    # p "Was something happening earlier?"
    p "刚才是有什么突发意外吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2303
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_faedbda1:

    # s "Ordinary somethings, yes. Nothing that adventurous. A faster tide than we expected. And less wind. It'll pick up when we're outta the lee of the harbor."
    s "都是些稀松平常的事儿，没什么大不了的。无非是潮水比预想的急了点，风头又弱了点。等咱们出了港湾的背风区，风势自然就上来了。"
    # 译注：lee of the harbor指港口防风背风面。

# game/script.rpy:2307
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_93c35690:

    # j "He was expecting a pirate attack, I'm sure."
    j "我看啊，他八成是在防备海盗突袭呢。"

# game/script.rpy:2309
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2c815f3b:

    # p "No, I just didn't know what was happening. I thought I should ask Arthur, maybe."
    p "不是，我就是不清楚状况。想着或许应该去问问Arthur。"

# game/script.rpy:2311
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_50b97f3e:

    # s "Mr. Hudson. \"Sir.\""
    s "是Hudson先生。“长官”。"
    # 译注：在传统帆船礼节中，普通水手对军官长官不能直呼其名，须称Mr. Hudson或Sir。

# game/script.rpy:2313
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_e6ebf546:

    # p "If that's his name..."
    p "如果他真叫这名儿的话……"

# game/script.rpy:2315
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9b7e7c0e:

    # s "Oh. I figured you were new, but I didn't realize you were that new..."
    s "呵。我料到你是新来的，可没想到你生疏成这副模样……"

# game/script.rpy:2319
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_de7fc918_1:

    # "The maned wolf grins. He looks young—not much older than yourself, really. His grin, too, is youthful."
    "那只鬃狼咧嘴笑了。他看起来年纪不大——说真的，并不比你年长多少。那抹笑容也透着一股年轻人的朝气。"

# game/script.rpy:2321
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d4e09588_1:

    # "But he's clearly an experienced member of the Conway's crew—someone Arthur could rely on, despite the wicked easiness of the smile he's turned on you."
    "但他显然是Conway号上的老船员了——是深得Arthur器重的人，尽管他此刻冲你露出的笑容里带着一丝狡黠而随性的戏谑。"

# game/script.rpy:2323
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_5369e160:

    # s "He chewed ya out, then?"
    s "这么说，他狠狠训了你一顿？"

# game/script.rpy:2325
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_51654c41:

    # "If you were more charitable in describing it, you could think of Arthur as a stern father-type. Samuel doesn't seem like that."
    "要是往宽厚了说，你尽可以把Arthur看作一位严厉的父亲形象。但眼前的Samuel可完全不是那一套路数。"

# game/script.rpy:2327
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_6e7e821e:

    # "But that just means you're even more conscious of your desire to make a good impression on him."
    "正因如此，你反而更加渴望能在他面前留下个好印象。"

# game/script.rpy:2329
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1c1f292b:

    # p "I kept quiet. He seemed busy."
    p "我没吭声。他当时看着挺忙的。"

# game/script.rpy:2333
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_bacbeb45:

    # s "He was. But it's nothing that adventurous, anyway. A faster tide than the sailing master expected, that's all."
    s "他确实忙。不过也算不上什么稀罕事儿。无非就是潮水比航海长预想的急了点，仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:2335
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_705d41f2:

    # "He looks up at the masts, where most of the sails are still neatly rolled up. \"Furled\"—you know that much."
    "他抬眼望向桅杆，上面的大部分风帆依然整齐地卷裹着。“卷帆”——至少这点航海常识你还是知道的。"
    # 译注：furled在航海中指将帆卷拢系缚在帆桁上。

# game/script.rpy:2337
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_0dbdde2b:

    # s "And less wind. It'll pick up when we're outta the lee of the harbor."
    s "风也小了点。等驶出了港口的背风面，风势自然就上来了。"

# game/script.rpy:2339
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_78a60a7b:

    # p "That happens often?"
    p "这种事经常碰上吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2343
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_3fe0b811:

    # s "The wind not doing what's expected of 'er? All the time. But Hudson knows how to handle something like that. You'll figure it out, too."
    s "风不照着人想的意思刮？那是家常便饭。不过Hudson长官精通怎么应付这道坎。用不了多久，你也能摸出门道来的。"

# game/script.rpy:2347
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_5e8b9f0c:

    # s "In time."
    s "早晚的事儿。"

# game/script.rpy:2349
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1f48b3a7:

    # p "But we shouldn't be ready for pirates, then..."
    p "这么说，咱们不用随时防备海盗了……"

# game/script.rpy:2353
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1db000f8:

    # s "No. Our foes here are far more crafty and tenacious. It's all but impossible to fend off their siege..."
    s "用不着。咱们在这儿的敌人可比海盗狡猾顽固得多。想挡住他们的围攻，简直难如登天……"

# game/script.rpy:2355
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_a1a74e0b:

    # "He stretches out one of those long legs of his, nudging it against the deck."
    "他伸出那条长腿，用脚尖在甲板上蹭了蹭。"

# game/script.rpy:2357
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ad41ece3:

    # s "A constant battle, where no mere cutlass or cannon can aid you. It will be, 'course, your most important task."
    s "这是一场无休无止的苦战，普通的短剑火炮根本派不上半点用场。当然喽，这也是你往后最要紧的一项差事。"
    # 译注：cutlass为水手配戴的水手弯刀。

# game/script.rpy:2359
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9cad8843:

    # p "...Scrubbing the deck."
    p "……刷甲板。"

# game/script.rpy:2363
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8854f345:

    # s "You learn quick!"
    s "脑子转得挺快嘛！"

# game/script.rpy:2365
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_09e06f2c:

    # "His grin is sardonic, although you imagine that, with his friends, it's not that rare."
    "他脸上的笑容带着几分讥诮，不过你能想象得出，他在熟人堆里大概向来就是这副调调。"

# game/script.rpy:2367
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_6cfabea3:

    # s "Realistically, yes. That's what you'll be spending your time doing."
    s "实话实说，正是这活儿。往后大半光阴你都得泡在里头。"

# game/script.rpy:2371
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_cb941511:

    # s "Welcome to life at sea."
    s "欢迎来到海上生活。"

# game/script.rpy:2373
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_59df9b72:

    # s "Though it's not just the deck, sheets needs to be tarred, masts slushed.{p} It's almost funny how little a ship actually wants to be at sea."
    s "不仅得擦甲板，绳索得刷焦油防腐，桅杆还得抹熟油润滑。{p}仔细想想真有点滑稽，这大船打心眼里压根就不想呆在海里。"
    # 译注：tarred指涂煤焦油防海水腐蚀；masts slushed指用熟猪油涂抹上桅以使帆桁滑动顺畅。

# game/script.rpy:2375
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9b6d1ac2:

    # s "Almost. Perhaps more fun if we weren't on the receiving end of the joke."
    s "滑稽是滑稽。但要不是咱们自己当了笑柄里挨整的那个，没准还会觉得更有乐子。"

# game/script.rpy:2379
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f675f4bb:

    # s "Now, one of ya is a Julian Preble, I'm told."
    s "话说回来，听说你们里头有个叫Julian Preble的？"

# game/script.rpy:2381
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9412e7a4:

    # "Julian nods, straightening briefly to attention. Samuel points to you next."
    "Julian点了点头，立正挺直了身板。Samuel紧接着指了指你。"

# game/script.rpy:2383
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_94b547d5:

    # s "And you? What's your name?"
    s "那你呢？叫什么名字？"

# game/script.rpy:2385
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_36cc1bec:

    # p "[name] [family_name]."
    p "[name] [family_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:2387
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_0a610e64:

    # s "Well. I'll try to remember that, I guess. We'll find uses for new hands like you, 'course."
    s "成吧。我尽量记着点。像你们这种生瓜蛋子，船上少不了使唤你们的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:2408
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_6b579e50:

    # "You look at the deck, and then your eyes wander from the Conway's bowsprit back to her stern, where you can see Arthur in conversation with one of other officers."
    "你低头看了看脚下的甲板，目光从Conway号高挑的船首斜桅一路游移回船尾——那儿能看到Arthur正同另一位军官交谈。"
    # 译注：bowsprit指船首斜桅。

# game/script.rpy:2410
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_fac5c9fb:

    # "How much work would it even take to clean this whole thing, on your knees?"
    "真要成天跪在木板上把这么大条船全擦干净，得费上多大的力气？"

# game/script.rpy:2412
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_353cf564:

    # s "Oh, ya'll be plenty busy, don't worry."
    s "嘿，有得你们忙活的，放宽心吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2423
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ecf53ef3:

    # "It's as if he's guessed what you were thinking."
    "那神情就好像他已经把你的心思猜了个八九不离十。"

# game/script.rpy:2427
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4f5c4d7a:

    # s "If ya' smart, you'll have some alcohol to trade before someone hands you the bucket. But maybe that's just me."
    s "要是个放聪明的，趁着别人把水桶硬塞进你手里前，最好先攒点烈酒去跟老水手换换差事。不过这兴许只是我的个人心得。"
    # 译注：alcohol to trade指用配给的朗姆酒/格罗格酒换取轻松差事，为18世纪水手潜规则。

# game/script.rpy:2429
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_05d396f8:

    # "And you do have the sense that, young as he is, Samuel counts as being an old salt. The scar on his cheek, and some markings tattooed around his left wrist, complete the picture."
    "而且你明显感觉得出，Samuel尽管面相年轻，却实打实是个老江湖。脸颊上那道刀疤，加上左手腕刺的一圈刺青，活脱脱勾勒出一名老水手的气派。"

# game/script.rpy:2433
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_0e14702e:

    # s "Ya' learn that, too."
    s "往后这些窍门，你也早晚会摸透的。"

# game/script.rpy:2435
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1db07efa:

    # "You nod and look around the deck of the ship, already trying to estimate just how long it would take to clean this thing on your knees."
    "你点了点头，又环视了一圈甲板，暗自盘算着真要是双膝跪地把这整片木板洗刷出来究竟得耗上多少时辰。"

# game/script.rpy:2437
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8d0e6330:

    # j "I already know."
    j "我早就把门道摸得门儿清了。"

# game/script.rpy:2439
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_88ec4b37:

    # "The others turn to look at Julian, when he speaks up. The lizard smiles."
    "Julian一开口，其他人全都齐刷刷扭头看向他。那只年轻的蜥蜴狡黠一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:2441
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1c92c49f:

    # j "Who I can make work for me. I already know that. Ain't it so, Wolf?"
    j "谁能被我拉来替我干活，我心里可有数得很。是不是啊，Wolf？"

# game/script.rpy:2443
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1a73f485:

    # w "You better watch your tongue."
    w "你最好管好你的舌头。"

# game/script.rpy:2447
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2f388b3f:

    # j "Oh, that's right. The big bad wolf."
    j "哎哟，对对对。大恶狼要吃人喽。"

# game/script.rpy:2449
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8bcbd577:

    # "He keeps that cheeky smile of his on full display."
    "他脸上肆无忌惮地挂着那抹没皮没脸的嬉皮笑脸。"

# game/script.rpy:2451
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_5828a8e5:

    # j "I'm just saying, that's all. We're fast friends, him and I."
    j "我不过随口说说罢了。我和他那可是铁打的拜把子交情。"

# game/script.rpy:2453
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_29fea082:

    # "Julian really does have no idea when to stop with the wolf. Samuel doesn't seem especially convinced by this explanation, either."
    "Julian在对付这只灰狼时，向来不知道什么时候该见好就收。Samuel听了这番说辞，脸上也瞧不出半分信服的神色。"

# game/script.rpy:2455
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_273b6fea:

    # "It wouldn't surprise you if the two end up brawling by the end of the journey.{p}For the moment, Wolf keeps his cool..."
    "要是这两人在航程结束前没忍住大打出手，你是一点都不会感到意外的。{p}不过眼下，Wolf总算还能沉得住气……"

# game/script.rpy:2457
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_0e5ea682:

    # "...But not to the extent that he keeps himself from glaring daggers at Julian."
    "……但也仅仅止步于没动手，他眼里射出的凶光简直恨不得把Julian当场生吞活剥。"

# game/script.rpy:2461
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_bd397fd2:

    # w "You really are a nuisance, kid."
    w "你这小崽子，真他妈招人烦。"

# game/script.rpy:2467
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1c735978:

    # j "We're-"
    j "咱们这叫——"

# game/script.rpy:2469
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_067550c7:

    # "The maned wolf clears his throat. His lanky body does not project the same authority as Arthur, but he does manage to sound like a voice of wisdom."
    "那只鬃狼清了清喉咙。他那精瘦修长的体格虽然透不出Arthur那种威压十足的官威，但拿捏起老成管事的口吻来却也自有一股威信。"

# game/script.rpy:2471
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_93a87c1f:

    # s "You two can continue this courtship on your own time."
    s "你们俩要打情骂俏，留着私底下自己找工夫去。"

# game/script.rpy:2473
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_7010a53a:

    # w "We are not \"courting.\""
    w "谁他妈跟他“打情骂俏”了！"

# game/script.rpy:2477
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_829c05a2:

    # s "Fine. You can have the drunken brawl ya' angling for on your own time, too. I'd recommend ya wait until after we get to harbor."
    s "成啊。那你们眼馋的那场醉鬼群架，也一样留着私底下去打。不过我好心劝你们一句，最好憋到船进港靠了岸再说。"

# game/script.rpy:2482
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f958dc92:

    # j "That long?"
    j "还得憋那么久？"

# game/script.rpy:2486
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_78c7732b:

    # s "In a harbor bar, you might not be identified. Maybe you be really lucky, and we'll sail before anybody wants damages covered."
    s "在港口的烂酒馆里打烂了桌椅，没人能认出你们是谁。运气要是够好，没等店家找上门来索赔，咱们的船早就扬帆出海了。"

# game/script.rpy:2488
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f82cae54:

    # "His smile has hardened. You wonder where he got that scar, after all."
    "他说到这儿，脸上的笑容微微敛住。你暗自揣摩，他脸上那道疤痕八成就是这么落下的。"

# game/script.rpy:2492
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_39eabc02:

    # s "But keep it off the ship, all the same. Unless you just like being whipped, in which case..."
    s "但只要在船上，就全给我老实消停点。除非你们当真皮痒，就偏爱挨水手长的鞭子抽，要是那样的话……"
    # 译注：whipped指水手违规受九尾鞭笞（flogging）。

# game/script.rpy:2494
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8d91138d:

    # s "Don't let me stop ya from getting in the way of your good time."
    s "那我也懒得拦着，免得扫了你们皮肉受苦的雅兴。"

# game/script.rpy:2498
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_dd3d7bfc:

    # j "I'm just trying to have a bit of fun, is all. We're going to have to be friends. It's a small ship."
    j "我不过就是想逗个乐子嘛，真是的。在这巴掌大的一条船上，咱们迟早都得处成朋友。"

# game/script.rpy:2503
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_586ab155:

    # w "A long way for you to swim back to shore, you mean."
    w "你小子是想说，离岸这么远，够你一路游回去的，对吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2505
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_c436798a:

    # "The snarl in his voice was not particularly subtle, but it mostly vanishes when he turns towards Samuel."
    "他喉咙里的低嗥带着毫不掩饰的威胁意味，但当他转头看向Samuel时，那股狠劲便收敛得无影无踪了。"

# game/script.rpy:2509
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_fc943d63:

    # w "He's not worth it.{w} I know that. Don't worry."
    w "犯不上跟这号货色一般见识。{w}我心里有数，用不着你操心。"

# game/script.rpy:2511
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d78a4fda:

    # s "Good. Apparently, Arthur expects me to make sailors out of you. I'd really prefer not to look like I can't keep you from each other's throats for a full watch."
    s "很好。Arthur看样子是指望我把你们调教成合格水手。我可不想让人看笑话，显得我连当一班哨的功夫都没法拦着你们互相掐架。"

# game/script.rpy:2515
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_bb86494c:

    # "He nods his long muzzle towards you."
    "他抬起狭长的口鼻，冲着你的方向偏了偏头。"

# game/script.rpy:2517
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ecd00e78:

    # s "What about ya? You have any smoldering passions you need to keep cool?"
    s "那你呢？心窝里有没有什么憋得难受的邪火需要泼瓢冷水降降温？"

# game/script.rpy:2519
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_a889c29d:

    # p "Uh. No, sir."
    p "呃……没有，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:2523
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_e2cd416e:

    # "The maned wolf snorts."
    "那只鬃狼嗤笑了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:2525
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1594dec3:

    # s "Don't call me that. I'll throw you overboard for grievous insults. Now, if you three need to be kept busy, I can certainly find ways to occupy you... you idle..."
    s "少这么叫我。再敢用这种恶心人的称呼，我就把你们扔下海喂鱼去。要是你们仨闲得发慌，我管保能给你们找点事做……你们这群游手好闲的……"

# game/script.rpy:2531
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_6a4f83bb:

    # "He trails off, as a noise coming from the stern catches his attention."
    "他的话头戛然而止，因为船尾方向传来的一阵响动冷不防勾住了他的注意。"

# game/script.rpy:2544
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4f6ab40b:

    # "You follow his gaze to see someone leaning over the wooden railing. He's clutching at a rope tightly, to keep from going over."
    "你顺着他的视线望去，只见有个人正死死趴在木栏杆上。他双手死命攥着一根船缆，生怕整个人栽进海里。"

# game/script.rpy:2546
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4878823b:

    # "He recovers, though, straightening up to emerge from behind the railing. You have a brief glimpse of large, rounded ears before he disappears again."
    "不过他很快缓了过来，挣扎着直起身子，从栏杆后探出头来。你隐约瞥见了一对又大又圆的耳朵，随后他便又缩了回去。"

# game/script.rpy:2548
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_60086ce7:

    # "Samuel laughs once more, this time in a knowing chuckle."
    "Samuel再次笑了起来，这回发出的是一阵心照不宣的会心轻笑。"

# game/script.rpy:2550
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_93165834:

    # s "Well. Looks like someone's having an even worse start to our trip than you, Wolf."
    s "嘿。看来咱们船上还有位仁兄，这一路开局比你还狼狈呢，Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:2552
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4e3fe9ed:

    # w "Oh?"
    w "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:2554
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d04608b6:

    # "He follows the direction of Samuel's gaze, and you all watch the hapless man throw his body forward again, his fingers holding the rope in a death-grip.{p} This time, there's the unmistakeable sound of retching."
    "他循着Samuel指引的方向看去，你们几人眼睁睁看着那个倒霉蛋猛地再度弓下身子，十指如同铁箍般死死抠住缆绳。{p}这一回，空气中传来了再清晰不过的干呕翻胃声。"

# game/script.rpy:2567
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_479c0448:

    # w "Oh. Well. I don't know about that.{w} I might take that if it meant we could lose some more unnecessary weight."
    w "呵。那倒也难说。{w}要是吐一吐能帮咱们船上甩掉点多余的无用累赘，我倒宁愿他也多吐吐。"

# game/script.rpy:2571
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_41e4b63b:

    # "Julian clasps a hand against his breast in feigned shock."
    "Julian装出一副大惊失色的模样，一把捂住了自己的胸口。"

# game/script.rpy:2573
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1e2a9071:

    # j "You wound me, Wolf. We've been getting on so well..."
    j "你这话可太伤人了，Wolf。咱们刚才不是处得挺融洽的嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:2575
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_b2e98ba6:

    # w "If you don't shut up, I promise I'll do it for you."
    w "你小子要是再不把嘴闭上，老子保证亲手帮你把嘴缝起来。"

# game/script.rpy:2577
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_3fc79519:

    # "It's still not entirely clear to you how much of Wolf's attitude is theatric."
    "你依旧没能彻底摸透，Wolf这副凶神恶煞的架势里究竟有几分只是在虚张声势。"

# game/script.rpy:2579
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_e7dfbd16:

    # "What you do know is that he, and Julian, seem quite comfortable on the Conway, at least from a physical point of view."
    "但至少有一点你心里清楚：无论他和Julian，在这条Conway号上起码身体底子还算吃得消，站得足够安稳。"

# game/script.rpy:2581
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_634d0be6:

    # "Neither of them have Samuel's relaxed stance, but Wolf hasn't even put out a hand to steady himself as the ship begins to rock through the more substantial waves of open ocean."
    "虽说他们两个谁也没能摆出Samuel那样四平八稳的悠闲站姿，但随着船只驶入外海迎上越发汹涌的浪涛颠簸起伏，Wolf甚至连扶一下栏杆稳住身子的动作都不曾有过。"

# game/script.rpy:2587
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_0c519941:

    # p "Should we... try to help him?"
    p "咱们要不要……过去帮帮他？"

# game/script.rpy:2592
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d2490578:

    # s "He got big teeth. Don't worry."
    s "他牙口硬实着呢，少瞎操心。"

# game/script.rpy:2594
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_4d49a893:

    # p "No. Him."
    p "不是他。我是说那位。"

# game/script.rpy:2596
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d38c4a18:

    # "You point to the unfortunate soul who is now leaning heavily against the railing for support. Having feared you might be susceptible yourself, it's hard not to feel a little sorry for him."
    "你抬手指向了那个可怜的人影，他此刻整个人几乎虚脱地挂在栏杆上借力支撑。由于起航前你一直担心自己也会晕船遭罪，此刻实在很难不对他的窘境生出一丝同情。"

# game/script.rpy:2598
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_efa2c5ee:

    # p "Is there anything we can... I don't know—can we help?"
    p "有没有什么法子……我是说，咱们能帮上什么忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:2603
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9f490845:

    # s "Not really. Can't do much. Sometimes ya just get caught by it. The ocean's not for everyone, that's for sure."
    s "帮不上，谁也奈何不了晕船。碰上这档子事只能硬扛。这茫茫大海本就不是人人都受得了的，这话一点不假。"

# game/script.rpy:2605
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_fb5fcf06:

    # "He shrugs, and turns away."
    "他耸了耸肩膀，漫不经心地转过身去。"

# game/script.rpy:2607
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_aeca6bd0:

    # s "Don't think he's anyone I know. Must be a passenger of some kind. It'll pass, though."
    s "瞅着不像船里的熟面孔，八成是哪位随船乘客。不过放心吧，遭两阵子罪也就熬过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:2609
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f2720977:

    # s "He'll have more room for dinner. Think of it that way."
    s "胃里倒腾干净了，晚饭正好能多塞两口。往好处想想嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:2613
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_b8e9ea71:

    # "Samuel, you realize, must have seen more than his share of seasickness. Eager young men—like you, no doubt—discovering too late that they're part of the maned wolf's \"not for everyone.\""
    "你心里清楚，Samuel见过的晕船场面八成比他吃过的盐还多。那些心怀壮志的年轻小伙——毫无疑问就像你一样——往往直到船开出港才追悔莫及地发现，自己恰恰就属于这只鬃狼口中那些“不是谁都受得了”的倒霉鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:2615
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_c2c4b614:

    # p "I... suppose."
    p "也……也是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2619
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2e537f20:

    # w "What's it to you, anyway? You want to go be helpful again?"
    w "关你什么事？你小子又想屁颠屁颠跑去充好人了？"

# game/script.rpy:2621
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_48e4af9a:

    # p "Just... I'm just feeling sorry for him. That's all."
    p "我就是……就是觉得他挺可怜的。仅此而已。"

# game/script.rpy:2626
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_c07c0d8e:

    # s "Well, nobody's stopping you from keeping him company."
    s "成啊，你要是想过去陪他说说话，也没人拦着你。"

# game/script.rpy:2628
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_3d461445:

    # p "We're supposed to be working for you, aren't we? I was told chain of command was very important."
    p "我们不是得听从你的差遣吗？之前有人告诫过我，说船上的规矩尊卑重于一切。"

# game/script.rpy:2632
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_6acdc17f:

    # s "Don't worry. I can release you to go administer rites, or whatever it is ya think would help."
    s "放宽心。我有权批准你去给他做临终祈祷，或者随便折腾你觉得管用的什么偏方。"

# game/script.rpy:2634
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f704ff9a:

    # s "The rest of us are about to have other things to do, anyway."
    s "反正咱们大伙儿待会儿也有别的事要张罗。"

# game/script.rpy:2636
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_88eb524a:

    # j "Dinner, right?"
    j "开饭了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2640
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d2902000:

    # "He points towards the horizon."
    "他抬手指了指天际线。"

# game/script.rpy:2642
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ad959388:

    # j "The sun's getting fairly low."
    j "太阳都快落到海平线下了。"

# game/script.rpy:2646
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_66b1bc0b:

    # w "What does it matter?"
    w "那又怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:2648
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_21451ced:

    # p "I... I don't know. I just felt sorry for him."
    p "我……我也不晓得。只是觉得他挺遭罪的。"

# game/script.rpy:2652
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_41143c8b:

    # s "Well. Go keep him company, then. The rest of us have other things to do."
    s "成吧。那你就去陪陪他。我们其他人手头还有活计。"

# game/script.rpy:2654
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_62116388:

    # j "You have work for us? We looked to be already trimmed."
    j "还有活儿分派给咱们？我看帆装不是都已经调顺就位了吗。"
    # 译注：trimmed在航海中指调整帆桁与帆脚索使帆面顺风受力。

# game/script.rpy:2656
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_512d10f6:

    # p "\"Trimmed\"?"
    p "“调顺就位”？"

# game/script.rpy:2660
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_261ba3f6:

    # w "What did I say earlier? Admiral's daughter, this one."
    w "老子之前说什么来着？这小子打娘胎里就是个海军上将家娇生惯养的千金。"
    # 译注：Admiral's daughter是英国老水手嘲讽不懂装懂或娇气新手的俚语。

# game/script.rpy:2662
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_c05bdd7a:

    # "Julian sighs, too dramatically. Samuel ignores the both of them."
    "Julian夸张之极地长叹了一声。Samuel对他们两人的唇枪舌剑置若罔闻。"

# game/script.rpy:2664
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_e6fbb892:

    # s "The ship's sails are properly set for the wind we have. We're close-hauled 'til we can turn southwards."
    s "船帆已经照着眼下的风向完全挂稳了。在能折向南航之前，咱们都得顶着风抢风航行。"
    # 译注：close-hauled指顶风/抢风航行（帆面尽可能贴紧迎风面）。

# game/script.rpy:2666
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_1c22c1b9:

    # "You don't know what \"close-hauled\" means, either. You open your mouth to ask, but Samuel shakes his head."
    "你同样不明白“抢风航行”究竟代表什么意思。你刚张开嘴打算请教，Samuel却冲你摇了摇头示意别问。"

# game/script.rpy:2668
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9b1b1df9:

    # s "The important thing is: I don't have work for ya. Not now. But they'll ring the bell for dinner, soon enough."
    s "最要紧的是：我现在手头没派给你们的苦差。眼下没有。不过用不了多久，船钟就该敲响开饭了。"

# game/script.rpy:2670
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ecaf908d:

    # j "Oh! It must be about time, I suppose? The sun's rather low."
    j "哟！那估摸着到点了？太阳都沉得那么低了。"

# game/script.rpy:2672
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_bfab4d76:

    # s "Indeed. So we should all get ready for it. Consider yourselves dismissed."
    s "可不是嘛。大伙儿都赶紧拾掇拾掇准备吃饭。准你们就地解散。"

# game/script.rpy:2674
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_610f59e3:

    # "Wolf turns quietly away the moment he hears that you've been released, leaving the three of you behind."
    "一听到解散的指令，Wolf立马一言不发地扭头离去，把你们三人撂在原地。"

# game/script.rpy:2680
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9604b974:

    # "You're still not certain what to make of him. Why go through all the trouble of working at sea if you're just going to be miserable?"
    "你依旧有些拿不准该如何看待他。要是出海纯粹为了成天板着脸受罪，何苦费这么大周折跑来船上讨生活呢？"

# game/script.rpy:2682
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8b161e1a:

    # "At least the seasick passenger must have a destination in mind."
    "至少那位吐得七荤八素的晕船乘客，心底里好歹还装着个奔赴的目的地。"

# game/script.rpy:2684
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_536436d9:

    # "Julian, watching Wolf step down the ladder into the bowels of the ship, seems to be thinking the same thing."
    "Julian目送着Wolf踩着舱梯没入幽深的船舱内部，眉宇间似乎也在琢磨着同一档子事。"

# game/script.rpy:2691
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_3fb75d82:

    # j "Someone's hungry."
    j "瞧瞧，有人肚皮饿得咕咕叫了。"

# game/script.rpy:2695
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_8c394524:

    # s "Or someone hates your guts, though I can't imagine why."
    s "要不就是有人打心眼里烦透了你，虽说我实在想不出他烦你的由头。"

# game/script.rpy:2697
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_871db740:

    # j "\"Why\" is because he needs to lighten up a bit."
    j "“由头”无非就是他那人太紧绷了，成天不知道放松放松。"

# game/script.rpy:2699
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_a3377081:

    # s "Maybe."
    s "兴许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2701
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9edac298:

    # "The maned wolf flexes his long fingers, then balls them into a fist and socks Julian on the shoulder before he can dodge it."
    "那名鬃狼活动了一下修长有力的指骨，随即猛地攥成拳头，趁着Julian还没来得及缩脖子闪避，结结实实一拳捶在了他的肩膀上。"

# game/script.rpy:2712
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ffa3e875:

    # j "Ow! Stop that. What was that for?"
    j "嗷！快住手！好端端打我干什么？"

# game/script.rpy:2718
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_13ea0f7c:

    # s "Curiosity?"
    s "手痒好奇呗？"

# game/script.rpy:2722
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_cfd3d918:

    # s "Oh, that {i}did{/i} feel good."
    s "哟呵，这拳头捶上去手感还{i}真{/i}不赖。"

# game/script.rpy:2724
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_d95cb988:

    # "Julian rubs at the sore spot on his shoulder, glaring at Samuel. Some of that seems to be genuine—the maned wolf must've hit harder than you thought."
    "Julian揉着肩膀上发酸的痛处，气鼓鼓地瞪着Samuel。那眼神里似乎有几分是动了真气——看来那只鬃狼刚才那一拳的分量远比你想象的要沉得多。"

# game/script.rpy:2726
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_9e5c5bd8:

    # j "You're saying I'm wrong? He doesn't need to lighten up?"
    j "你这是觉得我说错了？难道他就不该稍微放松放松？"

# game/script.rpy:2730
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_7c2a1452:

    # s "I'm saying I've known ya for long enough to think you can definitely be a bit annoying, like."
    s "我是说，就凭咱们认识的这段工夫，我都足够确信你小子嘴碎起来确实相当招人烦。"

# game/script.rpy:2735
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_ca8ac8c9:

    # j "You've known me for 15 minutes!"
    j "咱俩总共才认识一刻钟！"

# game/script.rpy:2737
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_303feea5:

    # s "Like I said..."
    s "就如我刚才说的……"

# game/script.rpy:2739
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_a4c8bddc:

    # j "Oh, not you, too.{p}Hey."
    j "哎，怎么连你也这样。{p}喂。"

# game/script.rpy:2743
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_f383af7b:

    # "With that prompting, Julian looks to you for approval."
    "有了这声催促，Julian眼巴巴地转过脸来望着你，指望你能表个态支持他。"

# game/script.rpy:2761
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_432d0dc3:

    # "Strange as Wolf is, he must have his reasons for the caginess."
    "尽管Wolf这人行事古怪，但他的防备与警惕想必也事出有因。"

# game/script.rpy:2763
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_9d827ce9:

    # "Even if he doesn't, you can hardly blame him for not wanting to deal with Julian."
    "退一步讲，就算他毫无道理，你也实在没法苛责他不愿跟Julian多费唇舌。"

# game/script.rpy:2765
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_4cd24767:

    # "The lizard acts like you're off on some boarding-school camping trip, not a proper sailing vessel.{w} At least, what you imagine a camping trip would be like. Something a lot less serious than working aboard the Conway."
    "这只小蜥蜴的一举一动，简直就像是在参加全托贵族寄宿学校组织的郊游野营，根本不是在正规出海航行。{w}至少，也符合你脑海中对郊游野营的全部想象——跟在Conway号甲板上卖命干活比起来，简直轻松得如同儿戏。"

# game/script.rpy:2767
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_d5b6b6dc:

    # p "You do come on a bit strong."
    p "你确实有点……太自来熟得过头了。"

# game/script.rpy:2769
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_bee03836:

    # j "Strong, huh?"
    j "过头？哈？"

# game/script.rpy:2771
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_0dbfa9b6:

    # s "He's being diplomatic."
    s "人家这是在顾及你的脸面，说得客气委婉呢。"

# game/script.rpy:2773
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_856657fe:

    # j "Diplomatic?"
    j "客气委婉？"

# game/script.rpy:2775
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_fc27c55e:

    # s "As in, the diplomatic way of saying \"annoying little shit.\" In the local dialect..."
    s "意思就是，换成本地街坊土话，人家是在客客气气地骂你是个“讨厌的小浑球”……"

# game/script.rpy:2777
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_8e7b67e8:

    # "Julian looks at you, as if expecting further explanation. But if he doesn't understand why his antics would rub anyone the wrong way, you doubt you can explain it to him."
    "Julian定定地看着你，仿佛还眼巴巴等着你给出进一步的解释。但如果他连自己轻浮胡闹的毛病为何会招人厌烦都想不通，你恐怕也很难同他讲得明白。"

# game/script.rpy:2781
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_8cd6e672:

    # "Finally he gives up, shoulders slumping in defeat."
    "最终他终于死了心，垂头丧气地耷拉下双肩认栽。"

# game/script.rpy:2783
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_89e21f0f:

    # j "Fine, fine..."
    j "行了行了，算我说不过你们……"

# game/script.rpy:2785
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_2a10a2f0:

    # "He sighs, and shakes his head."
    "他重重地叹了一口气，无奈地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:2789
translate Chinese smallchoice_abit_24f85c61:

    # j "But he {i}does{/i} need to stop being such a grump."
    j "但他成天板着张臭脸，也{i}确实{/i}该收敛收敛了。"

# game/script.rpy:2795
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_6343fb54:

    # "Even if Julian's a bit overenthusiastic, he probably doesn't deserve all of Wolf's ire."
    "就算Julian确实有些热情过火，但他罪不至死，Wolf那一肚子邪火倒也未必全该撒在他头上。"

# game/script.rpy:2797
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_48d605a3:

    # p "I mean... he could lighten up a bit."
    p "我的意思是……他也用不着成天这么紧绷嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:2801
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_ac00bb37:

    # j "Exactly!"
    j "就是说啊！"

# game/script.rpy:2805
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_45f39f92:

    # p "Especially if he's going to throw someone overboard when we're so close to the harbor.{w} You wouldn't have to swim for more than an hour or two."
    p "特别是咱们离港口还这么近呢，他要是真把人扔下海，{w}游回去顶多也就一两个钟头的事儿。"

# game/script.rpy:2807
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_4b4dad85:

    # j "Are you on my side or not, [name]?"
    j "[name]，你到底是站哪头的啊？"

# game/script.rpy:2809
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_46c5225a:

    # "But, the way he briefly sticks out his tongue, Julian clearly understands that you're just teasing him. The fact that you didn't punch him probably helps."
    "不过看他偷偷吐了吐舌头，Julian心里显然清楚你只是在拿他打趣。你没真一拳砸上去，大概也起了点安抚作用。"

# game/script.rpy:2815
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_83940c1d:

    # j "{i}Anyway{/i}. Wolf should have better ways to deal with his anger."
    j "{i}不管怎么说{/i}，Wolf也该学学怎么消消自己的火气。"

# game/script.rpy:2817
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_3cf63604:

    # p "I won't argue with that, no matter what. It seems to me as if having a little fun shouldn't be the end of the world."
    p "这话我不反对。依我看，稍微找点乐子也不至于天塌下来。"

# game/script.rpy:2819
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_c5323bb0:

    # j "Right! We got the whole solemn-duty speech from Arthur already. Don't worry."
    j "就是！Arthur刚才已经给咱们好一通严肃训话了。别担心。"

# game/script.rpy:2821
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_abe0da74:

    # "The maned wolf doesn't look particularly impressed."
    "那只鬃狼脸上瞧不出多少以为然的神情。"

# game/script.rpy:2823
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_49634d94:

    # s "Mm-hm."
    s "嗯哼。"

# game/script.rpy:2825
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_460454b8:

    # p "Wolf will be fine, I'm sure. That's all."
    p "我相信Wolf总会习惯的，就这意思。"

# game/script.rpy:2827
translate Chinese firstchoice_lightenup_4a1671ae:

    # j "He can't be a grump all day, every day. We're on the same ship. Working together. Learning from each other, all that... you know, that good stuff."
    j "他总不能成天到晚都丧着张脸吧。咱们都在同一条船上，要搭伙干活，还要互相照应……反正就是那些门道嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:2836
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a3733003:

    # s "Be that as it may, good behavior goes both ways. We're gonna be stuck here for a while. You don't have to like each other, but you do have to tolerate each other."
    s "话虽如此，规规矩矩也是相互的。咱们可得在这船上挤好一阵子。你们用不着掏心掏肺，但起码得互相担待着点。"

# game/script.rpy:2840
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_40326679:

    # j "I'm trying!"
    j "我已经在努力担待了！"

# game/script.rpy:2844
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f1803c26:

    # s "Don't make me punch ya again."
    s "少跟我皮，别逼我再赏你一拳。"

# game/script.rpy:2846
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7f6214f5:

    # "Julian huffs dramatically."
    "Julian夸张地倒抽了口气。"

# game/script.rpy:2850
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_51a72c53:

    # s "Everybody's got their own past. Their own little... quirks and things they don't want to talk about."
    s "谁心底里还没点过往呢。各自都有点小脾气……或者不想翻出来的陈年旧事。"

# game/script.rpy:2852
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ab7da46d:

    # s "Things that can't just be left ashore, much as we'd all prefer it."
    s "那些玩意儿可不是想留在岸上就能抛下的，哪怕咱们巴不得全给甩干净。"

# game/script.rpy:2854
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a3a4bd64:

    # s "And you don't want to start off by getting one everyone's bad side."
    s "刚一开船，你们总不想把全船上下得罪个遍吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2856
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f8036b45:

    # j "I'm not trying to \"antagonize\" people."
    j "我又不是故意跟人“过不去”。"

# game/script.rpy:2858
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_963fbfe5:

    # "Something about the way he responds gives you the impression it's probably a speech the young man has heard once or twice before."
    "从他回应的这副腔调里，你隐隐觉得这套大道理这年轻小子八成早就听别人唠叨过不止一两回了。"

# game/script.rpy:2860
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_aee4bdc2:

    # s "Well, in that case, at least try'n make ya ribbing funny. Just some advice."
    s "成吧，既然这样，往后拿人寻开心好歹也说点好笑的俏皮话。老哥我好心提点你一句。"

# game/script.rpy:2864
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5c70fe0f:

    # j "Oh, of course. There's so many people here I can take pointers from on {i}that{/i} one."
    j "哈，那是自然。这船上能在这档子事上指点我几招的高人可真是一抓一大把呢。"

# game/script.rpy:2866
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9c2091c8:

    # "He shakes his head, but keeps a reasonably brave face."
    "他摇了摇头，脸上依旧强撑着一副死鸭子嘴硬的满不在乎。"

# game/script.rpy:2868
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d6e3e9ee:

    # j "All right, all right. I won't \"antagonize\" him. Or you. And you won't punch me again, right?"
    j "行行行，我认了。我不去跟他“过不去”就是了。也不跟你较劲。那你可不能再冷不防给我一拳了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2872
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d85f4269:

    # s "Good lad. Stay on Wolf's good side."
    s "这才乖，好小子。记着千万别惹Wolf动怒。"

# game/script.rpy:2876
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_2841f8fc:

    # j "{i}...Right?{/i}"
    j "{i}……你答应了没啊？{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:2878
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_574bdd71:

    # s "Let's go down and wait for dinner. You're hungry, right?"
    s "走吧，下到底舱去等开饭。肚子早就饿扁了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:2880
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_4f424144:

    # "Julian looks at Samuel suspiciously for a few more seconds before giving up."
    "Julian满腹狐疑地盯着Samuel看了好几秒，这才无可奈何地放弃了追问。"

# game/script.rpy:2885
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_50dce8f9:

    # j "Yes. Practically starving, now that you mention it."
    j "可不是嘛。你这一提，我真觉得前胸都要贴后背了。"

# game/script.rpy:2887
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_cd6e519e:

    # "He looks in the direction of the ship's bell, like he could will it to ring sooner."
    "他眼巴巴地望着挂在甲板前方的船钟，那副热切的眼神恨不得用意念催它赶紧敲响。"

# game/script.rpy:2889
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_79049577:

    # s "And you haven't even done any work yet."
    s "瞧你这点出息，手头连半点像样活计都还没干呢就喊饿。"

# game/script.rpy:2893
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7d76ea1c:

    # "He gives Julian another punch, although this one is much lighter, and to the other shoulder."
    "他又照着Julian捶了一记，不过这一拳力道轻巧得多，换到了另一侧肩膀上。"

# game/script.rpy:2895
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_73492f53:

    # s "Ah, I'm kidding. You should be excited. Just once, while we're close to port. We'll run out of fresh ingredients quickly, but for now..."
    s "哈，逗你玩的。你们这帮新来的确实该高兴高兴。趁着刚出港离岸近，这可是仅有一次能饱口福的好机会。船上的新鲜生鲜食材很快就会耗光，不过眼下嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:2899
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_150de7d2:

    # j "Oh, I know. \"Enjoy it while you can.\""
    j "哎，我知道。“今朝有酒今朝醉，能享受时且享受”。"

# game/script.rpy:2901
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_42b2f3c6:

    # "He keeps staring at the bell, though."
    "尽管嘴上这么贫，他的目光却始终直勾勾地盯着那口报时铜钟。"

# game/script.rpy:2903
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7367e467:

    # j "I plan on it. Who knows when the next good meal will come?"
    j "我反正是一口都不打算落下。鬼晓得下一顿热乎可口的大餐得等到何年何月去？"

# game/script.rpy:2909
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a7dacfda:

    # s "Exactly. Bandile is one splendid cook, at least. That man could make salt pork a royal feast, if he had to. And he'll come close, even for us, when it comes to that."
    s "一点没错。好在咱们船上的Bandile可是一位手艺绝顶的大厨。那汉子要真被逼急了，哪怕是粗盐腌猪肉都能给炖出宫廷御宴的滋味来。就算轮到伺候咱们这群粗鄙水手，手艺也差不到哪儿去。"
    # 译注：Bandile为船上厨子（Cook）；salt pork为18世纪水手必备桶装盐腌猪肉。

# game/script.rpy:2911
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ae4886b1:

    # j "I can't wait. I'm sure we'll be eating hardtack soon enough..."
    j "我都迫不及待了。用不了几天，咱们准得天天啃硬邦邦的水手干饼……"
    # 译注：hardtack指航海硬饼干/干粮块，坚硬如石、易生象鼻虫。

# game/script.rpy:2915
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_65ed5847:

    # s "Well. Bandile could almost make that edible, too."
    s "这倒也是。不过就算是水手硬饼干，Bandile差不多也能调理得勉强能下咽。"

# game/script.rpy:2917
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_08f97af1:

    # "He pauses, and then shrugs."
    "他说到这儿微微一顿，随即耸了耸肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:2919
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5e487a50:

    # s "Almost."
    s "……也就勉强吧。"

# game/script.rpy:2925
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_cba4be07:

    # j "Do you know what he's planning? I saw someone from the ship bustling about the shops near the docks..."
    j "你晓得他今晚打算做啥好吃的吗？下午我在码头铺子附近瞅见咱们船上有人在那儿东奔西跑大肆采买来着……"

# game/script.rpy:2927
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_85ab9f70:

    # s "Probably Bandile, then, yes. I heard rumors that it would be salmon. Something of a specialty for him."
    s "那八成就是Bandile没跑了。我听到风声说今晚做的是鲑鱼。那可是他的看家绝活之一。"

# game/script.rpy:2929
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ffc9f95e:

    # j "Oh, that sounds good. I'll never turn down fresh fish..."
    j "哇，听着就馋人。新鲜好鱼我可从来不嫌多……"

# game/script.rpy:2933
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ae26e193:

    # "It sounds good to you, too. Even growing up in a harbor town, the best fish was too expensive for a family like yours."
    "这话听得你也不由得食指大动。即便是在港口小镇土生土长，像你家那样的清贫境况，最肥美上乘的鲜鱼也是压根吃不起的稀罕物。"

# game/script.rpy:2935
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ab992a49:

    # "From Samuel's hungry expression, Bandile has to be preparing something more exciting than some overboiled stew that barely does more than smell of fish."
    "单看Samuel那副两眼放光的嘴馋模样，Bandile今晚张罗的硬菜绝不可能只是某种寡淡寡味、纯粹只有股鱼腥气的烂炖清汤。"

# game/script.rpy:2937
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f252b3c9:

    # p "It does sound good. I can't wait to see what our cook can manage..."
    p "听着确实叫人嘴馋。真想亲眼见识见识咱们的大厨究竟能露些什么好身手……"

# game/script.rpy:2939
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8c9021f4:

    # "You'd figured it would be a while before that smell would be appetizing again. In any event, as far as appetite is concerned, you're still thinking about the seasick man."
    "你原本以为自己大概得过上一阵子才能重新把那股海腥气当成开胃的香味。不过无论怎么说，眼下比起填饱肚子，你脑海里依然惦记着那个吐得快虚脱的晕船家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:2943
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_cf8dd92b:

    # p "But I, ah... I want to check on that passenger. Make sure he's not suffering too badly..."
    p "不过我……那个，我想先去瞧瞧那位乘客。看看他是不是遭罪遭得太厉害……"

# game/script.rpy:2945
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e9acaa53:

    # s "Sure, sure. Suit yourself.{w} Careful by the railings, though. I don't fancy a swim."
    s "去吧去吧，随你的便。{w}不过靠着船舷栏杆时可给我留神脚底下。老子可没闲心跳进海里捞你上来游水。"

# game/script.rpy:2949
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ed01f97c:

    # "And his physique doesn't exactly lend itself to the ocean, you suppose, which must be why he ends that in a wry grin."
    "你心想，以他那副身材骨架在海里估计也扑腾不出什么水花，难怪他最后露出了那副无可奈何的苦笑。"

# game/script.rpy:2951
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_82113570:

    # p "I will be.{w} I'll be down in a moment. Leave some for me, will you?"
    p "我会小心的。{w}我稍后就下来。给我留一口吃的，行不？"

# game/script.rpy:2958
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3bc4f1c1:

    # j "No promises. It'll be your fault for being late, anyhow."
    j "这我可不敢打保票。谁叫你自己来迟了，横竖怪不到别人头上。"

# game/script.rpy:2960
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6088f673:

    # "Despite the ribbing, you're pretty sure Julian and Samuel will ensure you don't go hungry."
    "虽说免不了被他们打趣几句，但你确信Julian和Samuel绝不会真让你饿着肚子。"

# game/script.rpy:2968
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_cc62c7b2:

    # "You watch them make their way across the deck, following Wolf's footsteps and disappearing down into the ship's hull."
    "你目送着他们穿过甲板，跟随着Wolf先前的脚步，一同没入通往底舱的幽暗舱口。"

# game/script.rpy:2977
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_96b90193:

    # "You ascend the \"ladder,\" as Arthur called it, although it's more of a narrow staircase. Nearly as steep as a ladder, though, and you can't imagine trying to manage it on a rocking deck."
    "你踩着Arthur口中所谓的“舷梯”向上攀爬，虽说这构造实际上更像是一截狭窄的木台阶。不过它几乎同直梯一样陡峭逼人，真不敢想象在颠簸剧烈的甲板上该怎么平稳上下。"
    # 译注：ladder在船上指连接各层甲板的陡峭木梯/伴梯（companion ladder）。

# game/script.rpy:2985
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f7490fa6:

    # "The sound of your claws clacking—whatever \"sea legs\" are, you don't have them yet—announces your presence to the passenger."
    "你的肉爪指甲在木梯上踩出哒哒的细碎轻响——不管所谓的“海腿脚感”究竟是什么名堂，反正你现在还根本没找着门道——这一响动让那名乘客察觉到了你的靠近。"

# game/script.rpy:2987
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_17b16f73:

    # "He turns to face you, and on closer inspection you can see that he's an African Wild Dog.{w} You've not met many of those before, but the look of his fur is unmistakeable. So, too, are his round ears."
    "他转过头来面向你，凑近细看你才认出他原来是一只非洲野犬。{w}你以前极少遇到过这类兽人，但他那身斑斓花俏的毛色绝不可能认错，还有他那对招风的大圆耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:2989
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b67e306f:

    # "And a black muzzle that stands out against his pale fur, with teeth that would be more imposing were they not tightly clenched."
    "还有那在浅色皮毛衬托下格外显眼的黝黑口鼻；要是他此刻没有痛苦地死死咬紧牙关，那一嘴利齿本来该显得相当威严唬人。"

# game/script.rpy:2993
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f0783df2:

    # pd "Ah?{p}Oh. Company?"
    pd "啊？{p}哦。有人来了？"

# game/script.rpy:2995
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0546bb20:

    # p "Perhaps?"
    p "算我一个？"

# game/script.rpy:2997
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c777e3e2:

    # "He seems to be over the worst of it, although he flinches with the more severe waves."
    "他看上去最凶险的那阵恶心已经熬过去了，不过每当船身遇上稍显剧烈的波浪颠簸时，他依旧会条件反射般畏缩紧绷。"

# game/script.rpy:3005
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f828f3ae:

    # "Still, his voice sounds more sure of itself as you near the final step of the ladder."
    "即便如此，当你迈上舷梯的最后一级台阶时，他的嗓音听上去总算恢复了几分沉稳底气。"

# game/script.rpy:3007
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d3b9981f:

    # pd "Careful!"
    pd "当心脚下！"

# game/script.rpy:3009
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b92b7de2:

    # "You freeze, and have to put out a hand to catch the railing."
    "你吓得浑身一僵，不得不慌忙伸手一把抓住旁边的栏杆稳住身形。"

# game/script.rpy:3011
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5e5bb835:

    # pd "Oh—apologies for the outburst! Please do not miss your step. But I think you are about to step on my glasses."
    pd "哎呀——抱歉我刚才大呼小叫！千万别踩空了。但我看你刚才那一脚，眼瞅着就要踩到我的眼镜上了。"

# game/script.rpy:3015
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0e48e2e8:

    # "You glance down to discover your paw scant centimeters from said glasses. An ornate pair, at that."
    "你低头一瞅，这才发现自己的脚爪距离那副眼镜仅仅只有几厘米之遥。而且打眼一瞧，那还是一副做工极其考究精巧的金丝眼镜。"

# game/script.rpy:3017
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_75084a80:

    # "You find better footing, and carefully bend down to retrieve them, holding the glasses by the bridge in the middle."
    "你重新在甲板上找准平稳的落脚点，小心翼翼地俯下身将它拾了起来，两指稳稳捏住正中间的鼻梁架。"

# game/script.rpy:3019
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f1a192a3:

    # p "So I was. I'll hold them, in that case. It's probably safer that way?"
    p "还真是险些踩着。既然这样，我先替您拿着吧。搁我手里兴许还安全点？"

# game/script.rpy:3023
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b8df66d5:

    # pd "Thank you..."
    pd "多谢您了……"

# game/script.rpy:3025
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ec9585ca:

    # "And you wouldn't have wanted to damage them. The frames are thin, but made of gold. They look expensive. Aristocratic, even."
    "你自然也不愿失手弄坏它。镜框极细，通体由纯金精工打造。瞧着就身价不菲，甚至透出一股公侯贵胄的典雅气派。"

# game/script.rpy:3027
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_683d7c00:

    # "Now that you have a chance to examine him up close, the man himself has a similar sort of bearing."
    "如今有了近距离端详的机会，眼前这人通身上下也散发着极其相衬的儒雅风度。"

# game/script.rpy:3029
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_396b6ba1:

    # "His black suit is fancier than anything else you've seen aboard ship, even from the officers. It would've been out of place ashore, too. Even the men who dressed in their Sunday finest for services don't dress like this."
    "他身上那件剪裁得体的纯黑礼服，比你在船上见过的任何行头都要考究得多，就连那些当官的军官也比不上。哪怕搁在陆地上，这身打扮也显得格格不入。即便是在礼拜天盛装去教堂祈祷的乡绅显贵，也极少有人能穿出这等矜贵派头。"

# game/script.rpy:3031
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_bf4bdab7:

    # "His demeanor, though, is hardly so imposing. He stays quiet, and you feel compelled to break the silence."
    "不过，他的神态举止却全然谈不上盛气凌人。他始终安安静静地伫立着，反倒让你不由自主地觉得该由自己来主动打破沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:3033
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7239dbe2:

    # p "I saw you up here and wanted to know if everything was... well, if there was something the matter."
    p "我方才在下头看到您趴在这儿，就想过来问问……看您是不是哪里不大舒服？"

# game/script.rpy:3037
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8e57421a:

    # pd "Oh! Are you the surgeon?{w} You are not the surgeon, are you?"
    pd "哦！您莫非是船医先生？{w}不对……您不是船医，对吧？"
    # 译注：surgeon在帆船时代指专职船医准尉。

# game/script.rpy:3039
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_bf014313:

    # "He asks, peering at you without the benefit of his glasses."
    "他脱口问道，没了眼镜的辅佐，只能眯起双眼费劲地打量着你。"

# game/script.rpy:3041
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_084d37ee:

    # p "I'm not. I don't know who the surgeon is, now that you mention it. I came aboard earlier today. It just looked like you were having a bit of a rough time."
    p "我不是。经您这么一提，我其实还压根不知道船医是哪位呢。我是今天才刚上船的新水手。刚才只是看着您似乎遭罪遭得厉害。"

# game/script.rpy:3043
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ac83c4dc:

    # pd "Well... that was very kind of you to take note, in that case."
    pd "哎……那您特意留心在下的处境，这份善心当真叫人感激不尽。"

# game/script.rpy:3045
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5546c04c:

    # "He's still holding the rope tightly, and his ears remain slightly drawn. The whole of his body, indeed, seems to have wilted."
    "他依然死死拉住身旁的粗缆绳，双耳微微向后耷拉着。可以说，他整副身架都仿佛被海风抽空了力气一般无精打采。"

# game/script.rpy:3047
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_679431c5:

    # p "You do still look a bit under the weather. Do you need help?"
    p "您看起来脸色还是不大对劲。需要帮忙吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3051
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_833333de:

    # pd "No... no, no. I will be fine, I am sure.{w} It's just seasickness, that is all. I am afraid I am not used to this."
    pd "没……没，不妨事，我肯定能缓过来的。{w}只是晕船罢了，仅此而已。说来惭愧，我实在是不习惯这海上颠簸。"

# game/script.rpy:3053
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_19db122e:

    # p "Well... it can happen to anyone. I wouldn't think anything of it."
    p "哎……这事儿谁碰上都不稀奇。换做是我，我也不会往心里去。"

# game/script.rpy:3057
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d04291a4:

    # pd "Really? Because..."
    pd "当真吗？可眼下……"

# game/script.rpy:3059
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_caad760e:

    # "He shudders, and shuts his eyes tightly for a moment, taking deep breaths through his nose before he manages to calm himself down."
    "他猛地打了个寒战，紧紧闭上双眼，鼻翼翕动着深吸了几大口气，这才勉强压制住体内的翻江倒海。"

# game/script.rpy:3061
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_526048e8:

    # pd "Because there is certainly some evidence to the contrary, to anyone observing this tableau keenly. Or absence of evidence, if you would rather formulate it that way."
    pd "因为任何敏锐打量这一幕光景的人，分明都能找出相反的确凿铁证。或者说是‘并非人人如此的反例证伪’，如果您偏爱用这般论调表述的话。"

# game/script.rpy:3063
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script.rpy:3065
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a55f5271:

    # pd "I am the only one on this ship hanging over the railing while some..."
    pd "整条船上，唯独只有我一个人像滩烂泥似的挂在栏杆上，还得劳烦某位……"

# game/script.rpy:3067
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f20e4a02:

    # "He grimaces, although it seems he's able to recover faster this time."
    "他痛苦地咧了咧嘴，不过看起来这回恶心平复得比方才要快了一些。"

# game/script.rpy:3069
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6de5996b:

    # pd "...nice young man holds their glasses."
    pd "……热心肠的年轻小伙，替他捧着眼镜。"

# game/script.rpy:3073
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_668ce7c9:

    # "After a moment, he tries to smile, and succeeds...{w} mostly."
    "过了片刻，他努力挤出一丝微笑，而且总算……{w}大致算是笑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:3075
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_bb08d937:

    # pd "I do appreciate the thought, though."
    pd "不过，您这份心意，在下确实感激不尽。"

# game/script.rpy:3079
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c8ac484d:

    # "The two of you lapse back into silence while the African Wild Dog steadies himself again."
    "你们两人重新陷入了沉默，那只非洲野犬则在海风中极力稳住脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:3081
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ecdda13b:

    # "You find yourself grateful that you're able to enjoy this. For the moment, everything is fairly calm. There is the distant sound of the crew conversing, and the creak of the ship's timbers and rigging..."
    "你暗自庆幸自己尚能从容领略眼前这番景致。此时此刻，周遭的一切显得格外恬静。远处隐约飘来其他船员的谈笑声，间或夹杂着船身巨木与缆绳索具在风中挤压发出的嘎吱轻吟……"

# game/script.rpy:3083
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_34ffb417:

    # "The rhythmic splash of waves against the hull as Conway truly gets underway towards her destination..."
    "波浪有节奏地拍打着船侧木板，伴随着Conway号真正扬帆起航，稳稳破浪驶向远方的目的地……"

# game/script.rpy:3085
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7d4bb0ba:

    # "You know it can't last, of course. For now, you're promised a good meal, everyone is still reasonably clean, spirits are good, and tempers are at a low boil, Wolf excepted."
    "当然，你心里清楚这种宁静绝不可能长久。眼下至少还能指望上一顿可口的晚餐，大伙儿身上还算齐整干净，精气神十足，除了Wolf以外，甲板上的脾气心性也都维持在一团和气的温吞状态。"

# game/script.rpy:3087
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8d5539d7:

    # "But for now, you enjoy it. You only wish your companion could do the same."
    "但至少在眼下，你尽情享受着这片刻悠闲。你只盼着身旁这位同伴也能同你一样消受得起这番美景。"

# game/script.rpy:3089
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d57a93ce:

    # p "You're a passenger, right?"
    p "您是船上的乘客，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3091
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_06ee88c9:

    # p "One of the other sailors said he'd never seen you before."
    p "底舱有别的老水手说，以前从来没在这船上见过您。"

# game/script.rpy:3095
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_2c332233:

    # pd "I am, yes. I suppose I do not much look the part of a sailor, either, do I? It was not required for me to travel incognito, and, well... I am fond of these clothes, I admit."
    pd "确实如此，我是乘客。我想我这副模样横看竖看也扮不出半点水手的做派，不是吗？此番出行倒没要求我隐姓埋名，而且，哎……我承认，我打心眼里还是舍不得脱下这身行头。"

# game/script.rpy:3097
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b311e20e:

    # p "Where does-"
    p "您打算去——"

# game/script.rpy:3101
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_531b010f:

    # "Before you can ask him where he's headed, the painted dog abruptly leans over the railing and throws up again."
    "还没等你问出他这趟要去向何方，那只非洲野犬猛然一躬身扑到栏杆上，哇的一声再度呕吐起来。"

# game/script.rpy:3103
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e9070a7c:

    # "You think about trying to offer some assistance—even if only a reassuring pat on the arm—before deciding to err on the side of discretion, and look the other way."
    "你原本想伸手帮衬他一把——哪怕只是安抚地拍拍他的臂膀——但思前想后还是觉得谨慎避嫌为妙，知趣地将视线转开望向了别处。"

# game/script.rpy:3107
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9c7ffcbd:

    # pd "More fond of the clothes than the conveyance. I have already become something of a reluctant passenger, to tell you the truth."
    pd "比起脚下这件漂洋过海的交通工具，我显然更偏爱身上这件衣服。说句掏心窝子的话，我如今都有些后悔当这个随船乘客了。"

# game/script.rpy:3109
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0ae81683:

    # p "I see."
    p "我懂了。"

# game/script.rpy:3111
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_2eb0231b:

    # "It is truly an idyllic scene at which you find yourself gazing. The sky above has taken on the orange tint of brilliant sunset."
    "映入你眼帘的，委实是一幅如诗如画的绝美田园图景。头顶上方那片苍穹，已被绚丽夺目的落日余晖浸染成了一片浓郁璀璨的金橙色。"

# game/script.rpy:3113
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d25367d7:

    # "Some additional sails have been set, and rustle with the minutest changes in wind. But, until you gain truly open waters, most of them remain furled."
    "船上又多支起了几面帆页，随着微风细小的流转发出细碎的窸窣摩挲声。不过，在真正驶入毫无遮拦的辽阔公海之前，绝大部分风帆依然整齐地卷束在帆桁上。"

# game/script.rpy:3115
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_20118801:

    # "The masts and rigging cut sharp black slices through the beckoning glare of sunset. A few gulls have followed the ship out this far; they wheel, nimble, dancing silhouettes above the horizon."
    "巍峨的桅杆与密如蛛网的索具在落日余晖的金芒中切割出道道利落分明的漆黑剪影。几只海鸥尾随大船一路盘旋至此；它们在天际线上空展翅翱翔，划出矫健曼妙的灵动身姿。"

# game/script.rpy:3117
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_84fb0541:

    # "And, next to you, the unfortunate wild dog heaves again."
    "而在你身侧，那位倒霉的野犬先生再次忍不住干呕起来。"

# game/script.rpy:3119
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_65553064:

    # "And again..."
    "一口接着一口……"

# game/script.rpy:3121
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9dcbc15f:

    # "Fortunately, by this point, he seems to have emptied himself completely."
    "所幸吐到这步田地，他肚腹里的积存似乎总算是彻底倾倒干净了。"

# game/script.rpy:3125
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_24033829:

    # "He straightens up, and tugs his neatly tailored jacket back into place."
    "他慢慢挺直了腰杆，伸手将那件剪裁精细的礼服短外套重新抻平归位。"

# game/script.rpy:3127
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_50f6afc0:

    # pd "Dear lord. I am quite sure by this point nothing is even left. What I would not give for my body to simply..."
    pd "我的老天爷。我敢打包票吐到现在连半点苦胆水都没剩下了。要我付出什么代价我都甘愿，只要这副肉身能干干脆脆……"

# game/script.rpy:3129
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5cff2b5d:

    # "The painted dog pauses, as if considering whether he needs to be sick again."
    "那只非洲野犬话说到一半突然僵住，仿佛还在暗自掂量腹中是不是还有恶心要翻上来。"

# game/script.rpy:3131
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b3a526ca:

    # pd "No, I think that is better. What I would not give, I was saying, for my body to simply leave me alone."
    pd "不，看来总算是好转些了。我刚才想说的是，只要能让我这副不争气的身板消停消停别再折磨我，要我拿什么换我都情愿。"

# game/script.rpy:3138
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_92c80007:

    # p "Try looking at the horizon. That should help."
    p "试试远眺海平线。应该能好受些。"

# game/script.rpy:3142
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6f79a61f:

    # pd "Does it? Why would it ever do a thing like that?"
    pd "管用吗？光凭远眺凭什么能治得了反胃？"

# game/script.rpy:3144
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_db93608b:

    # p "I'm not sure. I'm not a philosopher, or a doctor, or... or whatever you'd need to be."
    p "这我也说不上来。我又不是哲学家，也不是医生，更不是……懂那些深奥学问的大师。"

# game/script.rpy:3146
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a9b64431:

    # "It seems like he could use some solid counsel, though; you figure it's not worth telling him that it's just a story you heard from some of the old hands in port."
    "不过他眼下看起来确实急需一剂定心丸；你琢磨着，倒也没必要戳破这其实不过是你从码头老水手口中听来的一则土方传闻。"

# game/script.rpy:3148
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c69ddcae:

    # p "I think it helps to remind you that it's just you that's moving, not the whole world."
    p "我想这大概能帮你提个醒：晃动的只是你自己，而不是整个天地都在天旋地转。"

# game/script.rpy:3150
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_80c6324f:

    # p "You have something to focus on, instead of just the constant... you know. The up and down, up and-"
    p "这样一来，你的目光好歹能找个固定的东西聚焦，省得脑子里成天只剩下永无休止的……您懂的。那股子忽上忽下、忽左忽——"

# game/script.rpy:3154
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f5f0f006:

    # "The dog holds up a hand to stop you."
    "那只野犬赶忙抬起一只手示意你快打住。"

# game/script.rpy:3156
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_34f300c3:

    # pd "I understand your meaning. I suppose... well, I suppose it can hardly make it any worse, can it?"
    pd "我领会您的意思了。依我看……哎，依我看横竖情况也不可能比现在更糟了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3158
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5225e3d2:

    # "He makes a game attempt at following your advice, putting his hands on the railing and staring landwards. The shore is still visible, black and formless, like the ragged edge of torn paper separating sea and twilight."
    "他拿出迎难而上的勇气尝试遵照你的提议照办，双手稳稳扶住木栏杆，目光笔直地投向陆地所在的方向。海岸线依然隐约可见，黑魆魆的模糊一片，好似一条被粗糙撕裂的纸边，横亘在茫茫大海与向晚暮色之间。"

# game/script.rpy:3160
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_591bdd32:

    # pd "What a ghastly thing, really."
    pd "真是件教人毛骨悚然的事物，委实可怕。"

# game/script.rpy:3162
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c4c3e648:

    # p "What is?"
    p "什么可怕？"

# game/script.rpy:3164
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_549d41ff:

    # pd "All this water. Leaving the land behind. I suppose you would not understand."
    pd "这漫无边际的海水。将脚踏实地的陆地彻底抛诸脑后。我想，像你们这般行当，大抵是体会不到这种恐惧的。"

# game/script.rpy:3166
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_faaf776b:

    # "He laughs. The sound is quiet and rueful."
    "他苦笑了一声，笑声里透着说不出的轻微与落寞。"

# game/script.rpy:3168
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d9f1d777:

    # pd "A sailor such as yourself must find it rather curious, indeed."
    pd "像您这样天生的弄潮儿水手，瞧着我这副德行，心里定然觉得相当稀奇好笑吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3170
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c907a407:

    # p "No. No, not at all. It's my first time, actually."
    p "不，不，根本没有的事。实不相瞒，我也是头一回出远海。"

# game/script.rpy:3174
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_02917128:

    # p "It sounds awful, sir. I... I was worried I might experience it, myself."
    p "光是看着就觉得难受极了，先生。我……出港前我自己也一直提心吊胆，生怕自己也会遭这份大罪。"

# game/script.rpy:3176
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_27d852f1:

    # pd "Count your blessings, on that one."
    pd "在这件事上，您可真该好好感谢上苍庇佑了。"

# game/script.rpy:3178
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7c59c0a2:

    # p "I'm sure it's just not my time yet. The only thing I know is that they say it'll pass. You get used to it."
    p "我估摸着大概只是我的报应还没到时候。我唯一晓得的，就是大家都说熬过这阵子就会好转，慢慢就能习惯的。"

# game/script.rpy:3180
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_df571f6e:

    # pd "Comforting platitudes for the ailing, I imagine..."
    pd "无非是拿来哄骗病患的宽心套话罢了，我想……"

# game/script.rpy:3184
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0d92380f:

    # "He tries to smile and does, you think, seem to be recovering."
    "他尝试着展颜微笑，而且在你看来，他的气色确实正在一点点恢复好转。"

# game/script.rpy:3186
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_76922ebd:

    # pd "I read in a book once that you should stare at a fixed point. It is something about the equilibrium of our... well, some humor or another, would it not be?"
    pd "我从前在典籍里读到过，说晕眩时应当凝视某一处固定不动之物。此举关乎人体某种……怎么说来着，四体液的调和平衡，不是么？"
    # 译注：humor指欧洲18世纪主流医学古希腊“四体液说”（血液、粘液、黄胆汁、黑胆汁），此处借体液失调与现代幽默感双关。

# game/script.rpy:3188
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ece1d4cf:

    # p "I'm afraid I don't know."
    p "这深奥医理我恐怕就一窍不通了。"

# game/script.rpy:3190
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5b395b30:

    # pd "Nor do I. And, truth be told, this has left me rather short of humor altogether. The real problem, I find..."
    pd "我同样是一知半解。而且说句公道话，这番折腾下来，我不仅体内体液失调，连脑子里的幽默兴致也给吐得荡然无存了。在我看来，真正的症结所在……"

# game/script.rpy:3192
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9a60e330:

    # "He takes a deep breath, fixes his hands on the railing, and stares at the horizon. Right at its edge, you can still see the shoreline."
    "他深吸了一口气，十指稳稳把住栏杆，目不转睛地凝望着天边。就在那天际的最边缘处，你依旧能隐约辨出那一抹故土的海岸线。"

# game/script.rpy:3194
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3141e96d:

    # pd "...Is that it means you need to look at all this water. Countless, ghastly leagues of it."
    pd "……症结在于，这意味着你不得不直面这漫天遍地的茫茫海水。一眼望不到头、足足绵延几百里格的森森凶涛。"
    # 译注：league（里格，18世纪航海里程单位，约3海里/5.5公里）。

# game/script.rpy:3196
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_49f8809f:

    # p "\"Ghastly\"? That sounds a bit... dramatic."
    p "“毛骨悚然”？这词儿听着是不是……稍微夸张了点？"

# game/script.rpy:3200
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9a1d309d:

    # pd "It makes one uneasy, at least. It is strange to be leaving it behind. We were meant for the land, I think."
    pd "至少叫人心神不宁。把陆地彻底抛在脑后，总归透着一股说不出的古怪。依我看，咱们生来就是属于陆地的生灵。"

# game/script.rpy:3202
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5b787c13:

    # pd "I was, anyway. Perhaps I am talking nonsense, in my current state."
    pd "反正我自己是这么坚信的。兴许就我眼下这副虚脱光景，尽在胡言乱语了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3204
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c2a6ddae:

    # p "You're not."
    p "您没有胡说。"

# game/script.rpy:3211
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6ac6665d:

    # "You, too, stare at the horizon. It's difficult to make out any details. The hills and rolling terrain of your birthplace are no more tangible and real than the markings on a map."
    "你也同样凝视着天际线。隔着这么远的距离，实在很难辨清任何景物的细枝末节。你出生地那一座座起伏连绵的丘陵土岗，此刻看起来并不比羊皮纸地图上的几道墨痕更具实感。"

# game/script.rpy:3213
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9a99e359:

    # "A black ribbon, dividing sea and sky. It's hard to believe you called it home."
    "宛如一条黑色的丝带，在天地间生生将沧海与苍穹劈成两半。真难相信，你曾把那片逼仄的土地唤作自己的故乡家园。"

# game/script.rpy:3215
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_160aee26:

    # p "I know what you mean. It's the oddest feeling, watching everything you've ever known vanishing into the distance."
    p "我懂您的意思。眼睁睁看着自己以往熟悉的一切渐渐消逝在天际远方，那种滋味确实古怪极了。"

# game/script.rpy:3219
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_fd2d0b45:

    # pd "You are from here?"
    pd "您是本地土生土长的人？"

# game/script.rpy:3221
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3d69b9aa:

    # p "I am. From..."
    p "是的。打小就住在……"

# game/script.rpy:3223
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a3065ff0:

    # "You try to point, but you've never seen your home from this angle. Is that the old church tower? Are those the peaks you used to climb with your friends? At this distance, it's all blending together."
    "你试着抬手指向岸上，但你这辈子还从未从海面这等角度回望过自己的家门。远处那点灰影是老教堂的尖塔吗？那些黑斑是你曾同伙伴们一并攀爬的山峦吗？拉开这般遥远的距离，万物早在一片浑茫中化作了不可分辨的虚景。"

# game/script.rpy:3225
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a5843556:

    # "And you still have the painted dog's glasses, for that matter."
    "况且说实在的，你手里这会儿可还替那只非洲野犬捧着金丝眼镜呢。"

# game/script.rpy:3227
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9e13ec26:

    # p "I don't know. I was, though. I was from there."
    p "我也认不太清了。但我确实是从那儿走出来的。我的根在那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3234
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_46ecf0e5:

    # pd "Ah. What brought you aboard? You are a passenger, too?"
    pd "原来如此。那究竟是什么缘由把您引上了这条大船？您莫非也是随船的乘客？"

# game/script.rpy:3236
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8e5be0a0:

    # "He eyes you curiously. But, unlike Arthur or Wolf or Samuel, you don't feel the same kind of judgment."
    "他好奇地打量着你。然而与Arthur、Wolf或是Samuel大不相同，你从他身上感受不到半点居高临下或是横加审视的审度味道。"

# game/script.rpy:3238
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_78a5b8cb:

    # "It is a more congenial sort of inquisitiveness. Perhaps he's happy to have something else to think about."
    "那是一种更为温和、更富教养的探求心。或许，他心里也正巴不得能找些别的话题来转移对腹中难受的注意力。"

# game/script.rpy:3240
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_bd03560e:

    # p "No, I'm part of the crew. I just joined today. They call me a landsman, which I suppose is a sort of rank."
    p "不，我是船上的水手，今天才刚入伙报到。他们管我叫“旱鸭子新手水手”，我琢磨着这大概也算是个职级名堂吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3242
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3c19f31d:

    # "You shrug, self-deprecating. The newness of the experience is something the two of you share, after all."
    "你自嘲地耸了耸肩膀。说到底，初次涉足大洋的新奇与生疏，正是你们两人当下共同的心境体验。"

# game/script.rpy:3244
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7db8f693:

    # p "Or it's just the polite form of what they'll call me when I can't desert."
    p "又或者，这不过是他们见我如今上了船想开小差当逃兵也插翅难飞时，嘴上冠冕堂皇给的客气称谓罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:3248
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8bbe12fc:

    # pd "It must be exciting. I hope it is, at least, to be giving up your home like this..."
    pd "那一定叫人热血沸腾吧。至少我真心希望如此——能够这般义无反顾地告别故里……"

# game/script.rpy:3250
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7698a743:

    # p "It is. It still is, I mean. It doesn't quite seem real. I've always dreamt of seeing my hometown disappear, and now..."
    p "确实很让人兴奋。我是说，直到这会儿我心里依然激动难平。只是一切依然恍如梦境。我从前无数次幻想过有朝一日能亲眼看着故乡消失在地平线下，而如今……"

# game/script.rpy:3252
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3a501522:

    # pd "The call of the unknown? An adventuresome spirit?"
    pd "这便是源自未知世界的无形感召么？属于年轻人的冒险家气魄？"

# game/script.rpy:3254
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_873cea41:

    # p "Maybe, yes. I wanted to see something new. Something I'd never find on the homestead. I'm not sure just what, yet, but..."
    p "也许是吧，大概就是这么回事。我只是渴望见识些前所未见的新天地。那些在田间地头的农庄庄稼地里穷尽一生也绝不可能碰上的事物。具体究竟想寻觅什么，我自己眼下也还说不准，但是……"

# game/script.rpy:3258
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ba1b0f67:

    # pd "You will find it, I'm sure."
    pd "您一定能寻得所求的，我对此确信不疑。"

# game/script.rpy:3260
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0d19d36f:

    # p "It doesn't sound naive?"
    p "听起来不会显得太孩子气、太不切实际了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3262
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5419693e:

    # pd "Not at all! There is always a point when a young man like yourself must want to spread his wings. Or hers, perhaps?"
    pd "绝无此事！人生旅途中总会有那么一个关头，像您这样的青年才俊无论如何都会渴望展翅高飞。抑或是……巾帼英雄展翅翱翔，兴许如此？"

# game/script.rpy:3264
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_51ca9f56:

    # "He catches himself, and turns back to the horizon to calm himself while he ponders that before giving a decisive nod."
    "他意识到自己有些言辞过繁，连忙重新将视线投向海平线平复心绪，深思熟虑片刻后，方才郑重其事地用力颔首。"

# game/script.rpy:3266
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a2b14e9e:

    # pd "Yes. Certainly. I think it must be a universal instinct. I am sure everyone feels that call in the core of their very being."
    pd "不错，千真万确。我想这定然是深植于万物生灵骨血之中的普世天性。我坚信每个人在灵魂最深处，都能清晰聆听到这股呼唤的共鸣。"

# game/script.rpy:3268
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_dbbda5c9:

    # pd "I just wish it involved more carriages and fewer boats."
    pd "我只是打心眼里期盼，这份浪漫的感召要是能多劳驾几架四轮马车、少劳烦这等颠簸大船就再美妙不过了。"

# game/script.rpy:3270
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_236bd0f9:

    # p "For me, there was only so far I could hope to go on land."
    p "可对我而言，陆地上的路，再怎么走也有到头的一天。"

# game/script.rpy:3274
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_38bb85bc:

    # pd "Oh? What is it you are leaving behind? Your nest, as it were."
    pd "哦？这么说来，您如今舍弃在身后的究竟是怎样一番光景呢？您从前安身立命的……温暖巢穴，姑且这么称呼吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3276
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_76e031b1:

    # p "My family has a small homestead. In a good year, there are as many mouths to feed as there are plots to feed them with. In a bad year..."
    p "我家守着一座小小的农庄宅地。要是碰上丰年，收成勉强够糊住一大家子张嘴吃饭的嘴巴。可要是赶上灾年……"

# game/script.rpy:3280
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_92645c83:

    # pd "Ah. I see."
    pd "唉。我明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:3282
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_eea4ac65:

    # "But, no, it isn't quite that simple, is it? Not so pragmatic."
    "但是，事情显然并不止如此简单，不是吗？绝非纯粹出于这般务实的谋生算计。"

# game/script.rpy:3284
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_fb4efdba:

    # p "Don't get me wrong. We get by—got by. We got by. We could sustain ourselves. But I don't think farm life was for me, not forever."
    p "您可别误会。日子总归还是过得下去的——哪怕穷，也是撑过来了的。我们自给自足不成问题。可我觉得，农庄里面朝黄土背朝天的日子绝不适合我，起码绝不可能捆住我一辈子。"

# game/script.rpy:3286
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_fb799f3c:

    # pd "That is understandable as well. Spend your whole life in one place, and the temptation to see other worlds would be terribly difficult to ignore."
    pd "这也完全合情合理。倘若终其一生困顿于方寸之地，那份想要见识大千世界的诱惑，无论如何也是极其教人难以割舍的。"

# game/script.rpy:3288
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1b07e8ab:

    # pd "Not to say that the roving impulse is felt by all of us equally. There must be separate fashions for separate kinds... the spheres of our various interests and talents—am I rambling?"
    pd "倒不是说这种浪迹天涯的冲动在每个人心头都激起同等的分量。不同的族类天性自当有各自的活法……我们各有所长、才情志向所属的领地也各不相同——抱歉，我是不是扯得太远了？"

# game/script.rpy:3292
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b1458955:

    # p "I... I don't know?{w} A little."
    p "我……我也不太确定？{w}稍微有一点点深奥吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3296
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8d74c5c4:

    # pd "My spirits are lifting. That is what has happened. I do think looking towards the horizon helped, after all. Maybe it is time I saw it for what it truly is."
    pd "在下这是精神头渐渐缓过来了，正是如此。看来眺望天际线当真大有裨益。兴许此时此刻，我总算能够看清它本来的真容了。"

# game/script.rpy:3298
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7f1a7407:

    # "That seems to be a rather philosophical statement, but the painted dog is clearly a man of some intellect.{w} You try to meet him on the same ground."
    "这话听上去颇具哲学思辨意味，但眼前这只非洲野犬显然是位满腹经纶、颇有学识的学者。{w}你试着尽力跟上他的谈吐节奏。"

# game/script.rpy:3300
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_038a04f9:

    # p "Um. A nest?"
    p "呃……您是指刚才说的那个‘巢穴’？"

# game/script.rpy:3302
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_117c7d37:

    # pd "No, no. I mean: could I have my glasses back, if you would be so kind?"
    pd "不，不。我的意思是：能否劳驾行个好，把我的眼镜还给我？"

# game/script.rpy:3304
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f0cf1714:

    # pd "I can hardly see you, let alone our destination or our origin..."
    pd "眼下我连您的相貌都快看不真切了，更枉论看清咱们的归宿与来路了……"

# game/script.rpy:3306
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3fd8c260:

    # "He holds out his hand—you're not sure he'd even need the other to support himself, now, let alone both—and you carefully set the glasses in the painted dog's palm."
    "他递出一只手来——你甚至不确定他眼下是否还需要用另一只手扶着栏杆借力，更别提双手死抓不放了——你小心翼翼地将眼镜稳稳放回了这只非洲野犬的掌心里。"

# game/script.rpy:3308
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1ced7360:

    # "He places them smartly on the bridge of his muzzle, and then adjusts them precisely until he's satisfied with the fit."
    "他娴熟敏捷地将镜架卡回自己的鼻梁上，随即精细地微调了几下，直到镜片彻底贴合端正。"

# game/script.rpy:3312
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ee57a9a5:

    # pd "Much better. Thank you!"
    pd "清楚多了。多谢您！"

# game/script.rpy:3314
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_d63e6628:

    # p "Of course. Is the water any less troubling?"
    p "举手之劳罢了。眼下看那些海水，感觉有没有少遭点罪？"

# game/script.rpy:3318
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_91f63b41:

    # pd "Objectively, no. But I shall manage."
    pd "从客观上讲，并没有好到哪儿去。但我自会咬牙顶住的。"

# game/script.rpy:3320
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9635f295:

    # p "So... why the Conway, then? If you're not a sailor, and you don't like traveling..."
    p "话说回来……您为什么非要登上Conway号呢？既然您既不是水手，又这般吃不消长途跋涉……"

# game/script.rpy:3322
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ee091661:

    # pd "Traveling is lovely. In the right circumstances, of course. It is a change of scenery for myself, as you might have imagined."
    pd "游历四方自然是一桩美事。当然，前提得是在体面适宜的境况下。想必您也能猜想得到，这趟远行于我而言，原本只是一场换个环境采风的契机。"

# game/script.rpy:3324
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e9e361a3:

    # "He gestures at himself and, with the glasses, the genteel air is well and truly cemented."
    "他抬手指了指自己的装束，如今有了金丝眼镜的衬托，那一身温文尔雅的书卷贵气更是展露无遗。"

# game/script.rpy:3326
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1b70a24f:

    # pd "Coming aboard with no mess kit or fishing tackle or... whatever sort of accoutrements I would be expected to have, as a proper tar."
    pd "我上船时甚至连一件像样的水手餐具、钓鱼排钩都没置办，更别提……那些一个正经老水手按规矩该随身携带的琐碎家当了。"

# game/script.rpy:3328
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_183658e4:

    # "It is, despite his scholarly bearing, a number of words and phrases you also don't recognize."
    "尽管他满口都是学者名流的文绉腔调，但他话里吐出来的许多生僻字眼与词汇，同样是你见所未见的门道。"

# game/script.rpy:3330
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0464c1c0:

    # "Perhaps Julian can help, later. For now, you focus on the painted dog."
    "兴许回头可以找Julian请教请教。不过眼下，你的心神全放在了身旁这位非洲野犬身上。"

# game/script.rpy:3332
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c09ab340:

    # p "But you wanted the change of scenery?"
    p "但您是打心眼里想换个新环境看看？"

# game/script.rpy:3336
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_4ff25183:

    # pd "Is that not the rub? I am being brought over by my patron, who desires that I work on her estate in the south."
    pd "这不正是左右为难的症结所在么？我是受我的资助人慷慨聘请前往南方的，她盛情相邀，期盼我去她在南方的私人庄园里主持差事。"

# game/script.rpy:3338
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_845e17b1:

    # p "Paid to travel the world? That sounds like quite a lovely offer. I guess you're not sleeping with the sailors, either."
    p "有人出资供您周游世界？听上去可真是一桩美差。我猜，您肯定也不用跟我们那些普通水手挤在下头打通铺吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3340
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_3eb1ce20:

    # pd "I am not, no. The accommodations are quite reasonable, all things considered. But the voyage is, to be honest, mostly done from necessity."
    pd "确实不用。总的来说，船上为我安排的下榻舱房还算体面得体。但实不相瞒，这趟漫长航行，多半也是情势所逼下的无奈之选。"

# game/script.rpy:3342
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_fd638cb5:

    # pd "Even if I were one of those professorial types, installed like a statue in a library, not everything can be done that way."
    pd "即便我原本是那种成天像尊石雕般深居于古旧藏书楼里的学究宿儒，世间也有诸多学问绝非单凭闭门造车所能成就。"

# game/script.rpy:3346
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_944c306d:

    # p "Such as?"
    p "比方说？"

# game/script.rpy:3350
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_35b0a46b:

    # pd "Ah! I am: \"to turn my energies and industries, in full, on the diversity of flora in that region, thereby to assemble a compendium of such notes and such conclusions as may lead to profitable ends.\""
    pd "啊！委派于在下的重托乃是：‘竭尽全力倾注心血与精干才识，悉心搜研该地域之奇花异草，进而编纂详实纲要与论断，以期开拓富庶之利途’。"

# game/script.rpy:3352
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_454ad277:

    # p "That sounds... important? Right?"
    p "听起来……干系相当重大，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3356
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_189b2dd1:

    # "He smiles, his mood improving by the minute."
    "他展颜一笑，心境显然正肉眼可见地逐分逐秒好转起来。"

# game/script.rpy:3358
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_117722c8:

    # pd "I shall gather plants, to see if any of them might be useful to my patron in her business. She is bringing me down there to allow me to do my work."
    pd "我此去负责采撷各类植株样本，探明其中是否有物产能助益我那位资助人拓展其商贸大业。她此番特意携我南下，便是为了能让我专心致志施展学识。"

# game/script.rpy:3360
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_dbabed49:

    # pd "As I said, I cannot do it in a library. Many of them have not been documented at all! At least, not in languages any of us speak. I will be the first."
    pd "正如我方才所言，这等学问在故纸堆的藏书楼里断然无法成就。彼方许多奇草异卉甚至从未见诸于任何典籍图录！至少在咱们所熟识的诸般语言之中从未有过记载。而我，便将是开先河的第一人。"

# game/script.rpy:3362
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_28127f27:

    # p "It... it sounds like you do have a wonderful opportunity, then. Being paid for everything... living in a fancy estate..."
    p "那……那听上去您当真是遇上了天大的机缘造化。沿途一切开销全有人包揽……还能住进奢华气派的庄园豪宅……"

# game/script.rpy:3364
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_06e0875b:

    # p "Traveling without needing to get your fur soaked in tallow and grease..."
    p "出行远游还用不着成天把皮毛给浸泡在难闻的兽油焦油堆里……"
    # 译注：tallow and grease指水手整备索具/抹桅杆用的动物熟脂与黄油。

# game/script.rpy:3368
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_80811899:

    # "His smile becomes a little gentler."
    "他唇边的笑意微微变得更加柔和宽厚。"

# game/script.rpy:3370
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_217141ba:

    # pd "True. I could not care less about the money, but... the discoveries, that is a different matter."
    pd "此话不假。金银俸禄于我如浮云，我丝毫不以为意；但那份未知的发现与开创……那可就全然不同了。"

# game/script.rpy:3372
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_2a9d69fc:

    # pd "I may have prefered to stay home, truth be told, but when else would I be able to see the other side of the world like this?"
    pd "实不相瞒，若非如此，我本心或许更情愿深居简出留守故土。可若非借由此等机缘，我又何年何月才能有幸亲眼见证这大洋彼岸的辽阔天地呢？"

# game/script.rpy:3374
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f3bca45a:

    # p "Never?"
    p "若不靠这机会，便再无可能了么？"

# game/script.rpy:3376
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0c93cbdb:

    # pd "Not the way you might, obviously. Paying for the voyage myself—no matter what accommodation—would be out of the question. I am quite sure of that."
    pd "显然不可能像您这样洒脱从容。若是单凭我自己掏腰包支付远洋船资——且不论是何等简陋的客舱——那也是万万无法负担的天文数字。这一点我心里再清楚不过了。"

# game/script.rpy:3378
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e271c639:

    # pd "And I am not cut out to be a sailor. Even once I learn to keep my food down and my eyes looking elsewhere. I could not do it."
    pd "更何况，在下天生就绝非当水手的料。哪怕等我往后学会了不再翻胃呕吐、懂得了如何闭口不乱张望，我也断然干不来你们这行当。"

# game/script.rpy:3380
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_965abe7a:

    # p "Why? What makes you say that?"
    p "为什么？您怎么会这么断定？"

# game/script.rpy:3384
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e108f689:

    # pd "Why could I not be a sailor? It's just not... me, I suppose, for lack of any better or more useful way of putting it. It is for some people."
    pd "我为何干不了水手？大抵是因为这全然不符我的本性吧，若是找不出更精当贴切的辞藻来形容的话。这碗饭向来只适合特定的人选去吃。"

# game/script.rpy:3386
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_f0546eff:

    # "As if he might have overstepped, he clears his throat, and gestures to you."
    "仿佛意识到自己这番论调或许有冒犯僭越之嫌，他清了清喉咙，郑重地朝你欠了欠身。"

# game/script.rpy:3390
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e75fadeb:

    # pd "Nothing against you, of course. Far from it! I mean to say that it is...{w} I am not made for it, that is the problem. It is too dangerous. Too physical. I..."
    pd "当然，在下绝无贬损冒犯阁下之意。断然绝无此意！我只是想表白……{w}我这副筋骨天生就不是经受此等风浪的料，症结便在于此。水手生涯太凶险、也太耗费蛮力。我……"

# game/script.rpy:3392
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_0274bfd7:

    # "He trails off, and lets his hand fall."
    "他的话头渐渐低落了下去，悬在空中的手也随之垂落回身侧。"

# game/script.rpy:3394
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1c395569:

    # pd "I am simply not adventurous in that fashion."
    pd "我打心底里骨子里就不是那等敢作敢当的硬派冒险者。"

# game/script.rpy:3396
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_4ec2d265:

    # p "Sure you are, though. You're sailing around the world right now. You said so yourself.{w} That sounds plenty adventurous to me."
    p "您当然是啊。您现在不就正迎着风浪环游世界吗？这话刚才可是您亲口说的。{w}在我听来，这可算得上是不折不扣的大冒险了。"

# game/script.rpy:3400
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_fbb2299a:

    # pd "Sailing around a very particular world, my friend. A very particular one indeed: here, I have a little cabin all my own. There, I shall have the estate, and perhaps even an assistant to help with my work."
    pd "航行环游一个极其特殊的‘世界’罢了，我的朋友。一个格外特立独行的世界：在这儿，我享有专属自立的幽静小舱房；到了彼方，我将入驻气派庄园，甚至还能分得一名助手协助推行手头的研究。"

# game/script.rpy:3402
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_bb7010b7:

    # pd "I feel the world around which I am sailing is... only incidentally the one shared by the good ship Conway."
    pd "我总觉得，我所遨游环行的那个世界……不过是碰巧与这艘结实的Conway号商船有所重叠罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:3406
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_df19ecd2:

    # p "I suppose. But it doesn't look that comfortable for you."
    p "这倒也是。不过瞧您刚才那副架势，这趟重叠之旅恐怕也全然谈不上有多惬意享受吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3408
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_31b9daa7:

    # pd "An artifact of my softness, though, is it not? Even once that is past, no matter what, I will not be the one climbing up these... are these the ropes they climb?"
    pd "这正是我天生娇生惯养留下的烙印，不是么？哪怕眼下这阵风浪熬过去了，无论如何，往后我也绝不可能亲自攀上这些高处去……等等，水手们攀爬的就是这些绳索么？"

# game/script.rpy:3410
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_02531811:

    # p "I think they're the ropes they pull on to set the sails."
    p "我想眼前这些大概是用来拉扯升帆的操帆缆索。"

# game/script.rpy:3412
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e36f4bee:

    # "Nobody is aloft right now, but you recall the ones you saw other sailors scrambling up, and point them out."
    "眼下桅杆上虽说空无一人，但你脑海里还清晰记着起航时目睹其他老水手猿猱般飞步攀爬的那些绳梯，便抬手指向了它们。"
    # 译注：ratlines/shrouds指侧支索绳梯（梯状攀爬绳网）。

# game/script.rpy:3416
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_5ae1bbaf:

    # p "Those are the ones they'll be climbing."
    p "那边那些绳梯网，才是他们该爬的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:3418
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_13b73c1e:

    # "He looks at you, expectantly, with his brow raised."
    "他挑起眉毛，满含探询与意味深长的目光定定注视着你。"

# game/script.rpy:3420
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6f0ceac6:

    # p "{i}We'll{/i}.{w} Those are the ones {i}we'll{/i} be climbing."
    p "是{i}我们{/i}。{w}那才是{i}我们{/i}该爬的绳网。"

# game/script.rpy:3424
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b4e6eb69:

    # pd "Right so. And when there is a storm, my duties will be to keep my glasses about me and my food in my stomach. Yours will be to keep the ship sound and all aboard her safe."
    pd "正是这般道理。待到暴风狂澜席卷而至之时，我的职责无非是护好鼻梁上的眼镜、稳住肚子里的吃食；而您的重任，则是保卫全船安然无恙、护卫阖船性命周全。"

# game/script.rpy:3426
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_49d50faf:

    # "He regards you with what, despite his station, seems almost like genuine respect."
    "他凝神端详着你，尽管彼此身份门第悬殊，那目光中流露出的敬意却显得无比诚挚而真切。"

# game/script.rpy:3428
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_8ddbf4f3:

    # pd "But that's what I am cut out for. I prefer it that way."
    pd "但这正是我各自所长。我倒宁可这般各司其职。"

# game/script.rpy:3435
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ac011075:

    # "Before you can answer, the ship's bell chimes. In case you didn't understand the meaning, a sailor's voice raises above it.{p}Dinner is ready."
    "未等你出言应答，船钟清脆的鸣声骤然激荡开来。生怕新来的听不懂这钟鸣的含意，一名老水手高亢粗粝的大嗓门立时盖过了钟声余韵——{p}底舱开饭了。"

# game/script.rpy:3437
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_a6c45323:

    # p "How are you feeling? Well enough to eat?"
    p "您现在感觉如何？肚子里能咽得下晚饭了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3441
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_9630e8d8:

    # pd "I suppose so, yes."
    pd "我估摸着大概可以了，能吃下一点。"

# game/script.rpy:3443
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e3109406:

    # p "Ah, that's a relief! The cook is quite good, I'm told. Something to look forward to."
    p "啊，那可太让人松口气了！听船员们说咱们的大厨手艺相当了得，很值得好好期待一番呢。"

# game/script.rpy:3445
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e2522b63:

    # pd "Well. I will not be dining with the crew, unfortunately, but I hope to find out, nonetheless."
    pd "哎。可惜在下身为乘客无法同水手大伙儿同席共餐，不过无论如何，我总能从旁人口中打听到饭菜高下的。"

# game/script.rpy:3447
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_413633a2:

    # pd "Perhaps... perhaps we will meet again, do you suppose? Thank you for the company—I would certainly not mind sharing it again."
    pd "也许……你说，我们在这漫长航程里之后还会再见面的，对吧？多谢你刚才一直陪着我——若是还能与你这般叙谈，在下自是求之不得。"

# game/script.rpy:3449
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_951aec48:

    # p "Well, then I... yes, I hope so. Enjoy your dinner, ah..."
    p "那真好，我……嗯，我也期盼着再相会。祝您晚餐用得舒心，那个……"

# game/script.rpy:3453
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_4d0e0e33:

    # "He cants his head, peering at you curiously, before it strikes him."
    "他偏过头来，满带好奇地注视着你吞吞吐吐的模样，这才恍然大悟。"

# game/script.rpy:3455
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ccf0942e:

    # n "Oh! Goodness, a thousand apologies. I am Nomax. It is a pleasure meeting you."
    n "哎呀！老天在上，真是万分抱歉。在下名唤Nomax。万分荣幸能与您结识相识。"

# game/script.rpy:3460
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c5fdaa22:

    # "He holds out his hand for you to shake and, while yours is clean enough to feel the gesture permissible, you take him up on the offer."
    "他伸出手来示意与你相握；虽然你手上的粗糙风霜尚算干净得体、不至于在贵客面前失礼，你还是爽快地接过了他的善意。"

# game/script.rpy:3462
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c88b0fd5:

    # p "It's nice to meet you, Nomax. I'm [name]."
    p "很高兴认识您，Nomax先生。我叫[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:3464
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_388152c6:

    # n "[name], yes, I see. A pleasure meeting you, as well."
    n "[name]，好的，我记在心上了。同样很荣幸能结识于您。"

# game/script.rpy:3469
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_02064f15:

    # "With a polite bow, he makes his way unsteadily down the ladder to the main deck. He is careful, putting one foot in front of the other, but at least he no longer seems like he needs to spend every moment bent over the railing."
    "行过一记温雅的脱帽躬身礼后，他脚步虽仍有些踉跄虚浮，却稳扎稳打地沿着梯级走回主甲板。他走得极其小心翼翼，一步一顿，但至少他看上去已经用不着每分每秒都把整个人瘫挂在冰冷的船舷上了。"

# game/script.rpy:3474
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_cdd4d767:

    # "Like most of those you've met, he seems like an interesting fellow, if a bit of a character. You find yourself liking him, despite his slight awkwardness."
    "就像你今天结识的大多数人一样，这位学者看来也是个颇有故事、性格鲜明的趣人。你发现自己打心底里挺中意他，尽管他初见时略显窘迫笨拙。"

# game/script.rpy:3476
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b5216743:

    # "There's not much space aboard the Conway, so you expect to see more of the painted dog."
    "好在整艘Conway号统共也就这么大点天地，你料定往后抬头不见低头见，少不了还要与这只非洲野犬打交道。"

# game/script.rpy:3480
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1d005a79:

    # "And if it's not looked upon favorably, for the crew and passengers to mingle, well..."
    "至于水手与船客私下往来是不是会招致船上长官的白眼责难，哼，那又怎样……"

# game/script.rpy:3482
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_ecc1b601:

    # "Well, surely Nomax would be the first to tell you that you should make your own destiny, in that regard. You smile to yourself, and decide that will have to be the case. And it's time for you to get going, yourself. Dinner beckons."
    "反正要是换作Nomax，定会第一个站出来劝你万事当遵从自己的心愿与主见。你嘴角噙着笑意，暗下决心往后便这般坦然处之。你也该动身了，底舱热气腾腾的晚饭正在召唤你呢。"

# game/script.rpy:3484
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1ebe4646:

    # "You think you can already feel yourself becoming steadier on your feet. Not as graceful as the maned wolf, Samuel, but then you've only been aboard a few hours."
    "你隐约觉得自己的脚底板似乎已经开始踩出点稳当劲儿了。虽说还远及不上那名鬃狼Samuel举手投足间的从容优雅，但别忘了，你满打满算登船也才不过短短几个钟头罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:3500
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_e5fe2efb:

    # "You are not, for instance, accustomed to how quickly the open air topside gives way to the oppressive darkness of the ship's interior."
    "举例而言，你眼下显然还没完全习惯，甲板上辽阔通透的海风日光，竟然能在转瞬间就被船舱内部令人窒息的幽暗与逼仄所全盘取代。"

# game/script.rpy:3502
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_7d7c26f2:

    # "There hardly any openings to the outside world, save for the hatches that are also the only source of fresh air. Fortunately, for the moment, the dominant smell is that of fresh cooking. It's thick in the air, and you already know it will be delicious."
    "舱壁上几乎没有任何通向外界的采光孔，唯一能勉强透入新鲜空气的便是那几具方方正正的甲板出入口舱盖。万幸的是，此刻这密闭空间里充盈着的全是刚出锅的浓郁饭菜香气。那股香味浓稠得化不开，单凭吸上一口你便敢断定味道绝对差不了。"

# game/script.rpy:3504
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_188a76a4:

    # "Of course, first you have to find where it is. The last of the day's light flickers through scanty windows, sending faint beams through rising steam and motes of dust."
    "当然，当务之急你得先摸清楚排队打饭的方位。暮色残留的最后一缕微光穿过逼仄狭小的采光舷窗，在蒸腾升起的饭菜热气与浮动的尘糜中投射下几道微茫暗淡的光柱。"

# game/script.rpy:3506
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_96e332e0:

    # "Beneath it are the shifting, dim forms of your fellow crew. The end of the room marks the door to the officers' quarters; you can see Arthur in conversation with some feline, a cheetah you haven't seen before."
    "光柱下方，是你那些水手同伴们晃动模糊的昏暗身影。舱室尽头是一道通往军官起居舱的木门；你透过缝隙能瞥见Arthur正在同某位猫科兽人低声攀谈，那是一只你此前从未谋面的猎豹。"

# game/script.rpy:3522
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_c0ff3d88:

    # "It's not your world, anyway. You belong here, in the milieu of the other working men on the Conway."
    "不过无论如何，那不是属于你的阶层世界。你真正的归宿在这里，在Conway号底舱这帮卖苦力干粗活的水手弟兄中间。"

# game/script.rpy:3534
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_1f035f36:

    # "Later, the commons area is where the crew will set up their hammocks, if you understand correctly. For now, wooden crates have been set up as tables."
    "等夜深了，这处公共通舱便是水手们拉起吊床歇息的地方，如果你的记忆没出错的话。而眼下，笨重的储物木箱被临时码成了一排排排餐桌。"
    # 译注：帆船生活空间：白天公共食堂（mess deck），入夜挂吊床铺位（hammocks）。

# game/script.rpy:3539
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6d5d0230:

    # "Sailors are already occupying them: sitting, eating; playing cards. Savoring the respite from the shifts to follow."
    "水手们早已将木箱围坐得水泄不通：有的狼吞虎咽，有的痛快进食，有的正围聚着赌牌。人人都在抓紧享受这接踵而至的值夜轮班前难得的片刻喘息。"

# game/script.rpy:3541
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_76f1676b:

    # "On one side, tucked away in a corner by himself, Wolf has found a relatively quiet spot—though you sense it's difficult, indeed, to truly be alone with your thoughts on a ship of this size."
    "在通舱的一侧，Wolf独自缩在阴暗的角落里，挑了个相对清静的位子——不过你也感觉得出，在这么大点的一艘船上，真想彻底避开纷扰独处静思，属实难上加难。"

# game/script.rpy:3556
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_02612125:

    # "Elsewhere, Samuel and Julian have found a place for themselves, apparently without having come to further blows. A few other sailors are sitting with them."
    "而在另一侧，Samuel和Julian也已经给自己占好了一席之地，看样子两人方才并没有真的挥拳打破头。几名其他船员正与他们并肩围坐在一处。"

# game/script.rpy:3558
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_b8fcca11:

    # "You duck under a heavy beam, congratulating yourself for not discovering the sturdy wooden brace with your forehead."
    "你机灵地一低头猫腰钻过一根粗壮的甲板承重横梁，暗自庆幸自己的脑门这回没结结实实撞在那道坚硬如铁的木枋上。"

# game/script.rpy:3560
translate Chinese day_1_dinner_2_6a3b591e:

    # "And now, sailor that you are, comes the most important choice of your first day: with whom do you end it? Who do you want to seek out for dinner?"
    "而如今，身为这船上一名货真价实的水手，你即将迎来登船第一天最要紧的一个重大抉择：今夜你要与谁共度终局？你想找谁搭伙共进这第一顿晚餐？"

# game/script.rpy:3603
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e479e4c1:

    # "First, though, you need to grab your share of today's dinner. The ship's cook has prepared salmon, just like Samuel said."
    "不过，首先你得去领自己那份今天的晚饭。船上的大厨做了鲑鱼，正如Samuel说的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:3605
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_837f47c2:

    # "A rather generous slice of it, at that."
    "而且分量给得相当大方，好大一块。"

# game/script.rpy:3607
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c72acc39:

    # "It looks absolutely mouthwatering. The cook, Bandile, has even made sure to garnish it for every crew member so that it really looks the part."
    "看着真让人直咽口水。大厨Bandile甚至还给每位船员的盘子里都点缀了配菜，摆盘有模有样。"

# game/script.rpy:3609
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_154e5982:

    # p "Thank you so much, Bandile."
    p "太感谢你了，Bandile。"

# game/script.rpy:3613
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_258d8ab3:

    # "The hare looks up from his work, as if surprised to be greeted that way."
    "这只野兔从忙活中抬起头，似乎挺惊讶有人会这么客气地向他打招呼。"

# game/script.rpy:3619
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_833753a5:

    # b "Have we met? You look new here."
    b "我们见过吗？你看上去面生得很。"

# game/script.rpy:3621
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b58ff0ab:

    # p "I just reported aboard today, that's right. My name's [name] [family_name]."
    p "我今天刚上船报到，没错。我叫[name] [family_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:3625
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0fc992e4:

    # b "And you know mine, already, eh? I hope the rumors haven't been too bad..."
    b "这么快就知道我的名字了，嗯？但愿外头传的关于我的闲话没太难听……"

# game/script.rpy:3627
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1e20c719:

    # p "No! No! Far from it.{w} Samuel's been talking up your cooking, and I couldn't wait."
    p "不！绝没有！差得远呢。{w}Samuel一直在夸你的手艺，我都快等不及尝尝了。"

# game/script.rpy:3629
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_19c73bdb:

    # "His friendly smile widens into a good-natured grin."
    "他友善的笑容咧得更开了，笑得一脸和气。"

# game/script.rpy:3633
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_51dd7e48:

    # b "Oh? Has he now? Well, I think you've just ensured Samuel will have a little extra care put into his next meal."
    b "哦？他真这么夸了？哈哈，冲你这句话，Samuel下一顿饭我可得多关照关照他了。"

# game/script.rpy:3635
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6389d9d0:

    # b "He must be up on deck again?"
    b "他准是又跑到甲板上去了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3637
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2b08989f:

    # p "No, he's just over there, actually."
    p "没呢，其实他就在那边。"

# game/script.rpy:3641
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2b8cf9a3:

    # "You nod over your shoulder, in the direction of Samuel and Julian's table."
    "你朝肩后歪头示意，指向Samuel和Julian那一桌。"

# game/script.rpy:3643
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d145dc86:

    # b "Hm, he already had his supper earlier..."
    b "嗯，他刚才已经吃过晚饭了……"

# game/script.rpy:3645
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_643f722f:

    # p "Planning to bring along a reward?"
    p "打算给他带份犒劳过去？"

# game/script.rpy:3647
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_361e44ef:

    # b "I shouldn't... but...{w} On second though, maybe I can smuggle him something."
    b "按规矩可不行……不过……{w}转念一想，说不定我能偷偷给他塞点好吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:3651
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8c91a7a6:

    # b "Talking me up like that has to be rewarded, doesn't it?{w} I'll prepare something."
    b "把我吹得那么好，总得赏他点甜头不是？{w}我这就去备一份。"

# game/script.rpy:3657
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_333f5fe5:

    # "He begins doing just that, setting about the task with obvious skill. As far as you're concerned, he could just as easily have been at one of those fancy restaurants you've always heard about in the city."
    "他当即动起手来，动作娴熟利落。在你看来，这等身手就算去城里那些常听人念叨的高档餐馆当主厨也绰绰有余。"

# game/script.rpy:3661
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0762fbc6:

    # b "So, you're one of the new pups? Already making friends, I see."
    b "这么说，你就是新来的雏儿之一了？瞧你这架势，已经交上朋友了嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:3663
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bcc6e9ce:

    # p "Well... trying to make a good first impression. It's exciting! My first time away from town, and all..."
    p "这个嘛……也就是想留个好印象。这实在太让人兴奋了！毕竟我长这么大还是头一回离家出远门……"

# game/script.rpy:3665
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_46026067:

    # b "Ah, wonderful. The enthusiasm never hurts, I'll tell you that much. The work isn't easy, and..."
    b "哈，挺好。有股冲劲绝不是坏事，这我敢跟你打包票。海上的活计可没那么轻松，而且……"

# game/script.rpy:3671
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_96659fcb:

    # "He pauses, dropping his voice to a playful stage whisper."
    "他顿了顿，故意压低嗓门，像是在演戏般故作神秘地窃窃私语。"

# game/script.rpy:3673
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d5440d02:

    # b "I'll let you in on a secret. The food won't always be quite this... fancy."
    b "我悄悄透露你一个秘密吧。往后的伙食可不一定总有这么……体面。"

# game/script.rpy:3679
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7eb4db13:

    # p "They told me that, too. Kind of like a... a last hurrah, on leaving port."
    p "大伙也跟我这么说过。说这就像是……出港前的最后一次告别欢聚。"

# game/script.rpy:3683
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_de367a5e:

    # b "Indeed! It helps keep everyone's spirits up. On your third week of salt pork, that can be a bit of a challenge..."
    b "可不是嘛！这能帮大伙提振士气。等到了连啃三周咸腌猪肉的时候，想打起精神可就没那么容易了……"

# game/script.rpy:3685
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_79397695:

    # "He grins, though. Every bit of him radiates an exuberant cheeriness that you imagine must be infectious."
    "不过他还是咧嘴笑了。他浑身上下都透着一股热气腾腾的快活劲儿，任谁都会被他感染。"

# game/script.rpy:3687
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6c9b7891:

    # b "But we always manage! And for now, we have fresh fish."
    b "但咱们总能挺过来的！而且眼下，咱们好歹还有鲜鱼吃呢。"

# game/script.rpy:3689
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7a2da4d8:

    # p "Salmon, right?"
    p "是鲑鱼，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3693
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a13e2429:

    # "Bandile nods crisply."
    "Bandile干脆利落地一点头。"

# game/script.rpy:3695
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_264cfd39:

    # b "Hand-picked by yours truly just this morning. One of the advantages of being in port. Seeing new things, taking in the fleshpots, that's pleasant enough."
    b "今天一早本人亲自挑的。这可是靠港的好处之一。见见世面，逛逛风月欢场，倒也挺快活。"
    # 译注：fleshpots指港口酒馆、勾栏青楼等销金享乐之地，为老海员地道用语。

# game/script.rpy:3697
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d1d24657:

    # b "But a market! Fresh food and spices... and the trust of the purser to spend his coin, of course."
    b "但去集市才是正事！新鲜吃食和香料……当然，还得有事务长信得过我，肯把银钱交由我支配。"
    # 译注：purser为帆船军需/事务长，负责全船开销与采买银钱。

# game/script.rpy:3703
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_76a5da9d:

    # b "This is from, um... Um... right down the street from the harbor."
    b "这鱼是从……呃……从出海港顺着街一直往下走的那家买的。"

# game/script.rpy:3707
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5a7dd5fe:

    # "He pauses and rubs at his temple, struggling to remember the details. You can't help noticing that he keeps the fingers he's been using away from his fur. It's a subtle touch."
    "他停下动作揉了揉太阳穴，费劲地回想着细节。你注意到他特意避开刚才抓过食材的手指，没去碰自己的毛发。这细节颇显讲究。"

# game/script.rpy:3709
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_63ec7dac:

    # b "Bright yellow house. Lovely old lady runs it. Her sons have a fishing boat... and she apparently has an appetite for hare ears, given how much she chewed mine off."
    b "一栋刷成明黄色的房子。是个和蔼的老太太开的。她几个儿子有条渔船……而且她大概顶喜欢兔耳朵，拉着我絮絮叨叨，简直快把我的耳朵都念出茧子来了。"
    # 译注：chew someone's ear off是英语熟语，意为拉着某人喋喋不休、唠叨没完。

# game/script.rpy:3711
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_41a5e7c8:

    # b "I could swear that her plan was to never let me leave again."
    b "我敢发誓，她那架势简直就是不想放我出店门了。"

# game/script.rpy:3713
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_30f568f1:

    # "He briefly stops to rub his temples and looks over at you as if to interject into his own sentence."
    "他稍稍停下揉了揉太阳穴，转头看向你，好像冷不丁想打断自己刚才的话头。"

# game/script.rpy:3715
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6b3548d3:

    # b "Lovely stories, mind you."
    b "不过话说回来，她讲的故事倒蛮有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:3717
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fa947e14:

    # p "Oh! From Gundred's store? Yes, she's a-"
    p "哦！是Gundred家的铺子？没错，她人可——"

# game/script.rpy:3719
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e9a7076b:

    # "You don't get out the word \"treasure\" before the hare cuts you off excitedly."
    "你还没来得及说出“大好人”三个字，就被这只野兔兴奋地打断了话头。"

# game/script.rpy:3723
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0b54c65c:

    # b "GUNDRED! Right!" with vpunch
    b "Gundred！没错！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:3727
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_00bfddd7:

    # "His excitement is definitely contagious, you decide."
    "你确信，他的这股兴奋劲儿当真是会传染人的。"

# game/script.rpy:3729
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3b30b3e5:

    # p "Yes. She's a treasure. It's her son and grandson, actually. I've known them for years."
    p "是啊。她老人家是个大好人。出海打渔的其实是她儿子和孙子。我认得他们好多年了。"

# game/script.rpy:3731
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d253e63a:

    # p "I remember when I was a kid, years ago, my mother and I would go there occasionally. She'd always make sure to give me a bite of smoked eel."
    p "我记得好些年前我还是个小不点的时候，我母亲偶尔会带我去那儿。老太太每次都准会塞给我一口熏鳗尝鲜。"

# game/script.rpy:3733
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_025225db:

    # "You smile with the memory, and Bandile seems to appreciate it as well."
    "你伴着回忆露出了微笑，Bandile看起来也颇感温馨。"

# game/script.rpy:3735
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c27a4c47:

    # p "We could never afford to buy it. She just always pushed a little something into my paws."
    p "我们那会儿根本买不起那玩意儿。她每次就是由着性子，总往我爪子里塞点零嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:3737
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_137679f2:

    # b "She seems very kind. I'm not surprised. Of course, I can't help noticing that I didn't get any morsels for free..."
    b "她老人家确实善心。我一点也不觉得意外。当然啦，我可由不得在琢磨，怎么我自己刚才可连一丁点免费零嘴都没蹭着呢……"

# game/script.rpy:3739
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_844afc3e:

    # p "Oh! Well, I-"
    p "啊！呃，我——"

# game/script.rpy:3743
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1a0a9d69:

    # b "Kidding, kidding."
    b "逗你玩呢，开玩笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:3745
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_790e6b94:

    # "You're pretty sure he's teasing you, given his personality. But he hasn't gotten back to preparing dinner, either."
    "就冲他这脾性，你很肯定他是在逗你寻开心。不过他手头也确实还没急着回头去盛饭。"

# game/script.rpy:3747
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_259190e4:

    # b "It's fine if you set the bar too high for how cute one has to be to earn a bit of eel."
    b "没关系，要是想讨口鳗鱼吃还得达到你这种长相的可爱门槛，那我甘拜下风。"

# game/script.rpy:3751
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1e408385:

    # "You stammer a little. In response. Bandile crosses his arms in front of his chest, playing the part of a grumpy child."
    "你结结巴巴地应着。Bandile见状双臂抱胸，故意扮出一副闹别扭的小孩模样。"

# game/script.rpy:3753
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6ee01608:

    # p "I'm sure that's not—I mean—no, I'm sure—I'm sure you're cute enough."
    p "我相信绝不是因为那个——我是说——不，我敢说——你肯定也够惹人喜欢的啦。"

# game/script.rpy:3757
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0b9c5fdf:

    # "He laughs, abruptly. It's a bright, warm giggle, the grumpy affectation broken immediately as he resumes work."
    "他噗嗤一声笑出声来。笑声欢快又温暖，刚才赌气的装腔作势顿时烟消云散，重新埋头忙活起来。"

# game/script.rpy:3759
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b9625c5d:

    # b "Oh, I see!"
    b "哈哈，我明白啦！"

# game/script.rpy:3761
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3db426f8:

    # "None of this is what you expected to be doing on your first day!"
    "第一天上船的境况，跟你事先预想的半点都不一样！"

# game/script.rpy:3763
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_22af124a:

    # "Not that you mind it, either."
    "不过，你倒也一点都不反感。"

# game/script.rpy:3767
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "那个……"

# game/script.rpy:3771
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0efbebfe:

    # b "Mmhm. Fish, though. Yes?"
    b "嗯哼。不过说回正题，你的鱼，准备好了？"

# game/script.rpy:3779
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3e39e69f:

    # "Changing the subject, he grabs one of the plates. The sizzling in the skillet intensifies briefly as he pushes a fork into a piece of salmon, setting it on the plate with a flourish."
    "他岔开话题，抓起一只餐盘。随着他拿叉子叉起一块鲑鱼，铁平底锅里的滋滋油响陡然变大，紧接着他潇洒利落地把鱼肉盛放在盘中。"

# game/script.rpy:3781
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a2a6feb4:

    # "Next, he adds a few stalks of asparagus, and then pours a cream-colored sauce over it, thick enough that it only begins to run when the salmon warms it up."
    "接着，他添上几根芦笋，又淋上一勺乳白色的酱汁；那酱汁格外浓稠，唯有被鲑鱼的热气一烘，才慢慢地在盘中淌开。"

# game/script.rpy:3783
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_be8abf3d:

    # p "Fish, yes. What's the sauce?"
    p "有鱼吃，太棒了。浇的是什么酱汁？"

# game/script.rpy:3785
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_674f4be2:

    # b "Lemon and dill. Nothing fancy, but it's a favorite of the crew when we leave port. Something of a tradition."
    b "柠檬莳萝酱。谈不上名贵，但每次离港出航，船员们最爱吃的就是这口。算得上是咱们船上的老规矩了。"
    # 译注：lemon and dill是欧洲海员经典的柠檬莳萝鱼酱配方。

# game/script.rpy:3789
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c6532417:

    # b "I'm sure you'll love it."
    b "我敢打包票你一定会爱上它的。"

# game/script.rpy:3791
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_83fcddf8:

    # "He smiles as he adds a decorative slice of lemon on top of the fish, rounding it all off with a sprinkling of fresh herbs and a generously sized piece of bread."
    "他笑着在鱼肉上搁了一片点缀的柠檬，最后又撒了一把新鲜香草，附带了一大块分量十足的面包。"

# game/script.rpy:3793
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fb7555d0:

    # p "I'm sure I will, too. It looks absolutely wonderful."
    p "我也肯定自己会喜欢的。光是瞧着就棒极了。"

# game/script.rpy:3799
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fbe5ab29:

    # "It's not much of an exaggeration, even. You take the plate when he hands it over to you, unable to keep from licking your lips with anticipation."
    "这话可真一点都不夸张。你从他手里接过餐盘，馋得忍不住舔了舔嘴唇，满心期待。"

# game/script.rpy:3806
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_21c4a1a8:

    # "He prepares a second plate. The slice of salmon is much smaller, and it's missing the asparagus, but extra food is extra food."
    "他接着准备了第二盘。这盘的鲑鱼小得多，也没配芦笋，不过有额外加餐总归是天大的好事。"

# game/script.rpy:3810
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cafe12e1:

    # b "Won't always be like this, as I said! But for now, you dine like kings. Or, at least..."
    b "往后可不会天天都这样，正如我刚才说的！不过眼下嘛，你们好歹能吃得跟国王一样体面。或者，退一步讲……"

# game/script.rpy:3816
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c7e06728:

    # "He leans closer, giving you a conspiratorial wink as he hands the plate to you. You doubt Samuel is going to complain."
    "他凑近了些，递盘子给你时还促狭地冲你眨了眨眼。料想Samuel绝不会挑剔半句。"

# game/script.rpy:3818
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_90636f94:

    # b "Like servants who have the king's favor-"
    b "至少跟深得王爷恩宠的跟班随从吃得一样好——"

# game/script.rpy:3824
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1c794c27:

    # "There's a sudden discontented growl from behind you, and you suddenly realize you're not the only person in line."
    "你身后冷不防传来一阵不满的低吼，你这才猛然回过神来，排队等饭的可不止你一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:3828
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3eced360:

    # sail "Did Gundred or whatever teach you anything about fish, Bandile, or just how to yammer on like a fishwife?"
    sail "那姓Gundred的老婆子到底教没教过你正经做鱼啊，Bandile？还是光教了你怎么跟个卖鱼婆娘一样嘚吧嘚唠叨个没完？"

# game/script.rpy:3835
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0b4428d0:

    # "You realize that, of course, you're hardly the only person waiting for their food."
    "你这才意识到，自己显然不是唯一一个眼巴巴等着打饭的人。"

# game/script.rpy:3837
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4ded669e:

    # p "Oh. Sorry, I'm new. Just getting caught up in all the excitement."
    p "呃，对不住，我是新来的。头一回上船有点兴奋过头了。"

# game/script.rpy:3839
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_84889963:

    # sail "Not being worked hard enough, you mean, if you've time for gossip."
    sail "我看是派给你的苦活还不够重！要是还有闲工夫在这儿扯闲篇，力气多得没处使是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3843
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a722fa12:

    # b "Your food will be just as carefully prepared and just as fresh."
    b "你那份也一样烹得讲究，一样新鲜滚烫，少不了你的。"

# game/script.rpy:3845
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cf9269e8:

    # "He does seem to be chiding the sailor for his brusqueness, even as he reassures him."
    "他虽然嘴上在安抚那水手，但听得出来也是在敲打对方别那么横冲直撞。"

# game/script.rpy:3849
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_afe49e8f:

    # b "And I should get to preparing it before a brawl breaks out, I suppose. It was very nice meeting you, [name]."
    b "趁着大伙还没真动起手来，我可得赶紧装盘了。很高兴认识你，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:3851
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b3a8f850:

    # p "Right, of course, don't let me keep you. It was nice meeting you, too."
    p "好，当然，我不耽误你忙了。我也很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:3853
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_914c4433:

    # b "Are you going over to them?"
    b "你是要到他们那一桌去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3855
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_92a5dc09:

    # p "I'm afraid not right now, I'll be sitting with someone else."
    p "眼下恐怕不过去，我要去跟另一个人坐一块儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3857
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2df6ad70:

    # b "I see, I'll bring it over myself in a moment then."
    b "成，那我待会儿抽空自己给他送过去。"

# game/script.rpy:3859
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_96c26d97:

    # "With a plate in hand, you have to be careful not to spill sauce everywhere as the ship rocks beneath you. But you nod your thanks to the hare as best as you can."
    "你手里端着餐盘，脚下的船体起伏摇晃，你不得不格外小心免得把酱汁溅得到处都是。但你还是尽可能向野兔大厨点头致意。"

# game/script.rpy:3861
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_69dd5c1a:

    # "As you head off, he turns his attention to the curt man behind you."
    "你迈步离开时，他已转头去应付你身后那个语气生硬的家伙了。"

# game/script.rpy:3863
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2a002b30:

    # "Despite it all, you can tell his upbeat demeanor isn't simply reserved for newcomers. It seems to have won the hungry sailor over, too."
    "看得出来，他这股热情洋溢的随和劲头并非只冲着新面孔。就连刚才那个饥肠辘辘的粗暴水手，似乎也被他三两句哄得没了脾气。"

# game/script.rpy:3868
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_de903139:

    # "It occurs to you that if complimenting Bandile's food gets you an extra plate of it, getting on the cook's bad side might be a questionable decision."
    "你心里暗想，既然夸赞Bandile的手艺能额外蹭上一盘好菜，那要是把大厨给得罪了，日子恐怕可就真不好过了。"

# game/script.rpy:3872
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e64d0286:

    # p "Starting a bit early, aren't you?"
    p "你起得未免也太早了点吧？"

# game/script.rpy:3874
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b4d5d532:

    # "He scowls at you."
    "他没好气地瞪了你一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:3876
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3538f5a5:

    # sail "Starting early is what we're going to be doing tomorrow. And every day after it. Some of us would like to eat and get some time in our racks before that happens."
    sail "赶早可是咱们明天一早的规矩，打明儿起天天都得这样！我们有些人就想赶紧扒拉两口饭，好抓紧时间回铺位躺会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3878
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d5d9a4b2:

    # sail "Who are you, anyway?"
    sail "话说回来，你又是哪根葱？"

# game/script.rpy:3880
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1883522c:

    # p "[name] [family_name]. I came aboard today."
    p "我叫[name] [family_name]。今天刚登船报到。"

# game/script.rpy:3882
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_07001fd6:

    # sail "Well, if you don't want to go back to shore-"
    sail "行吧，要是你不想卷铺盖被扔回岸上去——"

# game/script.rpy:3884
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_edb23a71:

    # b "Oh, calm down. Save it for when we're breaking into the hardtack."
    b "行了行了，消停点。把这股火气留到咱们开啃硬饼干的时候再撒吧。"

# game/script.rpy:3886
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c576c428:

    # "For the briefest of moments, the hare seems stern, even paternal. Then he turns back to you, smiling."
    "那一瞬间，野兔大厨的神情显得极具威严，甚至像个严厉的老长辈。紧接着他又转过身，朝你露出了笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:3888
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bae5d703:

    # b "It was nice meeting you, [name]."
    b "很高兴跟你聊上，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:3890
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7be4e092:

    # b "Oh! Are you going over to them?"
    b "哦对！你是要过去他们那一桌吗？"

# game/script.rpy:3892
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d6ae60b4:

    # p "I'm afraid not right now, going to be sitting with someone else."
    p "眼下恐怕不过去了，我要去跟别人坐一块儿。"

# game/script.rpy:3894
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2df6ad70_1:

    # b "I see, I'll bring it over myself in a moment then."
    b "成，那我待会儿抽空自己给他送过去。"

# game/script.rpy:3901
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_03021252:

    # "You scan the ship's interior for Wolf, who's still sitting quietly by himself in a corner of the common area."
    "你在船舱里搜寻着Wolf的身影，只见他依旧独自一人，静静坐在公共区域最幽暗的角落里。"

# game/script.rpy:3910
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_edfeb4db:

    # "He's polishing his plate clean with a piece of bread, making sure not a single drop of sauce goes to waste."
    "他正拿面包把盘底抹得干干净净，一滴酱汁也没糟蹋。"

# game/script.rpy:3912
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_218faf9e:

    # "He's thorough, the kind of meticulousness that can only come from discipline or a prior relationship with hunger, both intimate and long-term."
    "他吃得那叫一个彻底，这种异乎寻常的细致劲头，唯有源于极为严苛的行伍纪律，抑或是过去那段同饥饿耳鬓厮磨、如影随形的漫长岁月。"

# game/script.rpy:3914
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0f8597fd:

    # "Devour what you can now, it might have taught him, for we might meet again one day. Or maybe you're reading too much into it."
    "或许是饥饿曾教导过他：只要眼下有吃的就得尽数下肚，谁晓得咱们哪天又会狭路相逢。又或者，只是你自己想得太多了。"

# game/script.rpy:3916
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b18e075c:

    # "Whatever the reason, at this moment, the wolf sure does look hungry."
    "不论缘由为何，此情此景之下，这头灰狼瞧着确实是饿坏了。"

# game/script.rpy:3918
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fe57f80d:

    # "You realize he made his den in the darkest corner of the area."
    "你留意到，他特意把自己的落脚处选在了这片区域最深沉背光的角落。"

# game/script.rpy:3925
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_563eaa41:

    # "You walk up to him and join him in the corner."
    "你迈步朝他走去，来到角落在他身旁落座。"

# game/script.rpy:3936
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5ddf803b:

    # w "There's a whole lot of empty space around us, if you hadn't noticed."
    w "周围空位多得是，要是我没看走眼的话。"

# game/script.rpy:3944
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4ef26f70:

    # w "{cps=5000}There's a whole lot of empty space around us, if you hadn't noticed.{/cps}" nointeract
    w "{cps=5000}你没发现吗，咱们周围空荡荡的。{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:3957
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_57ba7c43:

    # "The canine nods, almost reluctantly. He might not be fully on board with your presence, but he seems to understand having a desire for peace."
    "这只犬族点了点头，神情显得颇为勉强。他虽未必多乐意你的凑近，但对于水手想图个清静的念头，倒也并非不能理解。"

# game/script.rpy:3961
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b9ae3bf6:

    # w "If I wanted company, I'd have sat somewhere else."
    w "要是我乐意找人搭伴，我早就坐别处去了。"

# game/script.rpy:3965
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_62269568:

    # p "I just thought it would do you good. To brighten things up a little."
    p "我就是觉得有人陪着对你没坏处。好歹给这儿添点亮堂气嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:3970
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b027873a:

    # w "I can't decide who's worse, you or that lizard.{w} But someone's starting to pull ahead."
    w "你跟那只蜥蜴到底哪个更讨人嫌，我还真说不上来。{w}不过嘛，眼下倒有某个人正迎头赶上呢。"

# game/script.rpy:3972
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_077f4b7b:

    # "The lupine bites into the fresh bread. A fleeing drop of cream escapes through his teeth, making its way past his lips and down his chin, before being caught by his tongue."
    "这头灰狼咬了一大口新鲜面包。一滴漏网的乳白色酱汁从他齿缝间溢出，滑过嘴角淌往下巴，随即被他的舌尖敏捷地卷了回去。"

# game/script.rpy:3976
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_20bb2664:

    # "All traces of its passage are then wiped off by the back of his hand."
    "紧接着，他随手用手背将嘴边的痕迹抹得一干二净。"

# game/script.rpy:3983
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_077f4b7b_1:

    # "The lupine bites into the fresh bread. A fleeing drop of cream escapes through his teeth, making its way past his lips and down his chin, before being caught by his tongue."
    "这头灰狼咬了一大口新鲜面包。一滴漏网的乳白色酱汁从他齿缝间溢出，滑过嘴角淌往下巴，随即被他的舌尖敏捷地卷了回去。"

# game/script.rpy:3985
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_20bb2664_1:

    # "All traces of its passage are then wiped off by the back of his hand."
    "紧接着，他随手用手背将嘴边的痕迹抹得一干二净。"

# game/script.rpy:3994
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7bd4ed7d:

    # "That's the last straw for your stomach, whose loud protestations are luckily covered by the creaking of wood and the noise of the crew."
    "这对你的胃口来说简直是最后通牒，你的肚皮终于抗议般地擂起了大鼓；所幸这阵咕噜声被船板木料的吱嘎声和船员们的喧哗掩盖了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:3996
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d1aa270f:

    # "You formally acknowledge the complaint and pry off a piece of salmon from your plate; it's time to feast."
    "你正式顺从了肚子的抗议，从盘中挑起一块鲑鱼；是时候大快朵颐了。"

# game/script.rpy:3998
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_888471ce:

    # "Heavens! Or... Neptune? You don't know what deity sailors usually refer to while on their voyages, but what you do know is that this salmon is {i}divine{/i}."
    "天老爷啊！或者……该叫海神涅普顿？你不知道水手们出海航行通常都求告哪位神仙，但你确确实实知道，这鲑鱼的味道简直如同{i}神馔{/i}。"
    # 译注：Neptune在航海背景下指罗马海神涅普顿（Neptune）。

# game/script.rpy:4000
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f6e15d48:

    # "It's rich, slightly smoky, cooked to perfection and melting on the tongue at the first sign of contact."
    "肉质丰腴肥美，带着一抹若隐若现的烟熏香气，火候拿捏得妙到毫巅，刚一触碰到舌面便化作满口鲜美。"

# game/script.rpy:4002
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_983d49c2:

    # "There's some fat to it, contributing to an almost buttery texture that floods your mouth with an explosion of taste."
    "鱼肉间夹着恰到好处的油脂，带来了宛如凝脂奶油般的丝滑质感，在口腔中引爆了一场无可挑剔的味觉盛宴。"

# game/script.rpy:4004
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7c08fd2a:

    # "Whatever God or Goddess it is that sailors pray to, you thank them for this boon."
    "不论水手们出海时祭拜的究竟是哪位神灵，你在心底都由衷感激他们赐下的这份厚赏。"

# game/script.rpy:4006
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_24e0af0a:

    # "And the sauce! Creamy, a hint of tanginess—lemon! And herbs you attempt to recognize, but by this point, you're too enraptured to think."
    "还有那酱汁！浓郁顺滑，带着一丝恰到好处的果酸——是柠檬！另外还掺着你试图辨认的香草，但到了这会儿，你整个人已被这美味陶醉得无暇深思了。"

# game/script.rpy:4008
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c11e1804:

    # "Your first bite is quickly followed by another, then another, and your meal is in full swing."
    "第一口刚下肚，紧接着便是第二口、第三口……这顿饭彻底渐入佳境。"

# game/script.rpy:4011
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4e38c79a:

    # "Wolf doesn't seem to mind your appreciation of Bandile's cooking skills. He's okay with you being there, as long as your mouth is occupied with food rather than chatter."
    "Wolf倒是不大介意你对Bandile厨艺的赞不绝口。只要你的嘴巴忙着嚼饭而不是叭叭扯闲话，他并不在乎你在旁边待着。"

# game/script.rpy:4013
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0ff410d1:

    # "You keep quiet and keep eating."
    "你老老实实闭上嘴，继续埋头大吃。"

# game/script.rpy:4015
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5735d725:

    # "He does the same."
    "他也一样。"

# game/script.rpy:4017
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4c14e3b1:

    # "There's no awkwardness in the silence hanging between you. It's the calm after the storm so to speak, a welcome respite from all the hustle and emotions of the departure."
    "悬在你们之间的沉默并不令人感到尴尬。说起来，这倒像是暴风雨过后的平静，正好让疲惫的身心从起航时的喧嚣忙乱与跌宕情绪中喘上一口气。"

# game/script.rpy:4019
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_44882d85:

    # "As time passes, even the commotion caused by the rowdiest members of the crew begins to feel distant."
    "随着时间流逝，就连那帮最能闹腾的水手折腾出的喧嚣动静，听着也逐渐显得遥远了。"

# game/script.rpy:4021
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bf8473fd:

    # "You decide to relax with some people-watching."
    "你决定放慢节奏，借着观察四周的人群放松片刻。"

# game/script.rpy:4023
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3d742bee:

    # "There's a noticeably varied representation of people on board, socializing in the low orange light; perhaps unsurprisingly, considering the globetrotting nature of this ship."
    "在昏黄的橙色灯火下扎堆说笑的船员形形色色，种族迥异；不过考虑到这艘船常年四海通商、周游全球的营生，倒也并不让人感到意外。"

# game/script.rpy:4025
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_839d6347:

    # "There's foxes, an otter, uncommon but not unusual. You spot a tiger and an Armadillo, a couple of birds, and canines and other felines that barely register in their mundanity."
    "人群里有狐狸、有水獭，虽不常见但也算不得稀奇。你还瞥见了一头猛虎和一只犰狳，几只飞禽，以及多得数不过来、寻常得让你甚至懒得细看的犬类与各色猫族。"

# game/script.rpy:4027
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e0158538:

    # "You realize you skipped over the more common species—for your hometown, at least—without a second thought."
    "你猛然发觉，自己想都没想便径直略过了那些更为常见的种族——至少在你的家乡是再寻常不过的样貌。"

# game/script.rpy:4029
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_dfb5e9b0:

    # "You wonder at what point of the journey they will all stop registering as noticeable, as you absentmindedly take a bite out of your bread."
    "你心不在焉地咬了一口面包，暗自琢磨着究竟要在海上航行多久，所有这些形形色色的面孔才会不再显得新鲜扎眼。"

# game/script.rpy:4031
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_adedc007:

    # "The bread is still warm, just as fresh as if it came right out of the oven. A wonderfully crunchy outside hides a fluffy, soft center that's simply begging to be dipped in the sauce."
    "面包依旧热乎，松软新鲜得宛如刚从炉膛里出炉一般。金黄酥脆的外皮之下包裹着蓬松柔软的麦芯，简直在无声地催促着你把它浸进浓稠的酱汁里。"

# game/script.rpy:4033
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8d5c6001:

    # "And so you do. Oh Bandile, you God among us mere mortals! Maybe he's the one you should have been praying to all along."
    "于是你顺理成章地蘸了下去。哦，Bandile啊，你简直就是降临在我们这群凡夫俗子当中的真神！或许出海以来，你真正该顶礼膜拜的本就是这位大厨才对。"

# game/script.rpy:4035
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4d03cca6:

    # "It's not even a particularly complex dish. Just some salmon, some sauce, some fresh bread. But everything is paired and balanced to perfection."
    "这道菜肴本身其实算不上有多繁复深奥。无非是些鲑鱼肉、少许酱汁、几片新烤面包。可每一种滋味的搭配与调和，都已臻于化境。"

# game/script.rpy:4037
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_eee3306d:

    # "You catch your tail swaying a little too excitedly and rein it back in before it starts sweeping the wooden floor."
    "你猛然发觉自己的尾巴正兴奋得轻轻甩个不停，赶忙把它收紧按住，免得它得意忘形地扫到了木甲板上。"

# game/script.rpy:4039
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_269a3ed2:

    # "You try to find the right words to share your excitement with your quiet companion. This meal is worthy of the highest praise your mouth can muster."
    "你搜肠刮肚地想要找寻最恰当的字眼，好与身旁这位沉默寡言的同伴分享你的惊喜。这顿佳肴值得你用舌头所能搜寻到的最高赞誉去奉承。"

# game/script.rpy:4046
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_23ad448c:

    # p "Oh man, this is really good. This is... This is really, really good. Like, really good."
    p "老天爷，这味道真不是盖的。这……这简直好得出奇，真的太绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:4048
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_13adb1d5:

    # "Wolf's ear twitches ever so slightly as you break the silence."
    "随着你冷不丁打破沉默，Wolf的耳朵极细微地动了动。"

# game/script.rpy:4052
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_de7e2112:

    # "His head turns by only a degree or two before focusing back on his plate, which he empties of the last piece of salmon."
    "他的脑袋仅仅微微侧转了一两寸，随即视线便又落回了自己的盘中，将最后那一小块鲑鱼吞入腹中。"

# game/script.rpy:4054
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1f060c36:

    # "You look at the state of your own plate; it's still half full. You're taking your time savoring every single bite, while the wolf consumed his meal quickly and efficiently."
    "你低头瞅了瞅自己盘里的光景；还剩下足足大半盘呢。你正细嚼慢咽地品味着每一口美味，而这头灰狼却早已麻利高效地把盘中物扫荡一空。"

# game/script.rpy:4056
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6a1cb321:

    # "Your tail stops wanting to sway."
    "你的尾巴终于安分下来，不再想来回摆动了。"

# game/script.rpy:4058
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cdfc3e87:

    # "After a second or two, Wolf nods and swallows down the last of his food."
    "过了一两秒，Wolf这才微微点头，咽下嘴里的最后一口饭菜。"

# game/script.rpy:4063
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b33a460b:

    # w "It is really good."
    w "确实好吃。"

# game/script.rpy:4065
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_461c94aa:

    # "You can't quite make out his face in the dark corner, but your ears tell you he's smiling. You believe them."
    "角落里光线晦暗，你不大能瞧清他的面容，但你的耳朵却敏锐地捕捉到了他嗓音里带出的笑意。你相信自己那对猫耳朵的直觉。"

# game/script.rpy:4067
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bfb337c5:

    # "Bandile, you may or may not be a God, but you indeed managed to accomplish a feat worthy of Greek legends."
    "Bandile啊，你究竟是不是神明暂且不论，但这手厨艺委实已办成了足以媲美古希腊神话史诗的壮举。"

# game/script.rpy:4077
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_37f0de5d:

    # p "Oh man, this is really good. This is... This is really, really good."
    p "天老爷，这味道真绝了。这……这真是好得不能再好了。"

# game/script.rpy:4079
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_13adb1d5_1:

    # "Wolf's ear twitches ever so slightly as you break the silence."
    "随着你冷不丁打破沉默，Wolf的耳朵极细微地动了动。"

# game/script.rpy:4083
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_de7e2112_1:

    # "His head turns by only a degree or two before focusing back on his plate, which he empties of the last piece of salmon."
    "他的脑袋仅仅微微侧转了一两寸，随即视线便又落回了自己的盘中，将最后那一小块鲑鱼吞入腹中。"

# game/script.rpy:4090
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b6b36b78:

    # "You look at the state of your own plate; it's still half full. You're taking your time savoring every single bite, while the wolf consumed his meal fastly and efficiently."
    "你低头瞅了瞅自己盘里的光景；还剩下足足大半盘呢。你正细嚼慢咽地品味着每一口美味，而这头灰狼却早已麻利高效地把盘中物扫荡一空。"

# game/script.rpy:4092
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6a1cb321_1:

    # "Your tail stops wanting to sway."
    "你的尾巴终于安分下来，不再想来回摆动了。"

# game/script.rpy:4099
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4c86ed8c:

    # "After a second or two, Wolf swallows down the last of his food."
    "过了一两秒，Wolf咽下了最后一口食物。"

# game/script.rpy:4101
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6f1c8b1d:

    # w "Do you ever quit yapping?"
    w "你嘴里就没个消停的时候吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4103
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d8b70fbd:

    # p "We talked a little, earlier. Seems like a nice guy."
    p "我方才跟他聊了几句。人看着挺随和热心的。"

# game/script.rpy:4105
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fca1dde6:

    # w "Talked to whom?"
    w "跟谁聊了？"

# game/script.rpy:4107
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5c9f4317:

    # "You focus on swallowing the bite you took, afraid you might choke once you start speaking to Wolf."
    "你专心咽下嘴里的这一口，生怕一开口跟Wolf说话就把自己给呛着。"

# game/script.rpy:4109
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_83fa84e2:

    # p "Bandile. The cook, he makes the meals."
    p "Bandile啊。就是那个大厨，管做饭的那位。"

# game/script.rpy:4114
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c205c531:

    # p "Long ears. 'Bit bouncy, very friendly."
    p "长耳朵那位。走起路来一蹦一跳的，人特别和气。"

# game/script.rpy:4116
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_18cb86b0:

    # w "I know what a cook is."
    w "我认得什么叫厨师。"

# game/script.rpy:4118
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c00e29aa:

    # "He waves your over-explanation off with a snort."
    "他鼻腔里哼出一声，摆摆手打断了你多此一举的解释。"

# game/script.rpy:4124
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6df8a2cd:

    # w "A piece of advice."
    w "送你句忠告。"

# game/script.rpy:4126
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ea1f1c19:

    # w "Make friends with whoever is handling your meals."
    w "不管在谁手底下讨饭吃，跟管伙食的那位搞好关系准没错。"

# game/script.rpy:4133
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_60812df1:

    # "You slice one of the asparagus in half and pick it up with your fingers, dangling over your muzzle."
    "你切开半根芦笋，用指尖捏起来，悬在自己嘴筒子上方晃悠。"

# game/script.rpy:4135
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0074c5f1:

    # "You drop it in, while waiting for Wolf to continue. It is also really, really good."
    "你把它扔进嘴里，一边嚼着一边等Wolf接着往下说。这芦笋的味道也同样绝顶鲜嫩。"

# game/script.rpy:4137
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    "……"

# game/script.rpy:4144
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_85e047a4:

    # p "...That's it?"
    p "……这就没了？"

# game/script.rpy:4146
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f1da597a:

    # "Wolf nods."
    "Wolf笃定地一点头。"

# game/script.rpy:4148
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ac70e94f:

    # p "It feels a little... laconic."
    p "这话听着未免……太言简意赅了点。"

# game/script.rpy:4152
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4b108cd4:

    # w "Fancy word. I don't care much for that."
    w "文绉绉的拽词儿。我从来不吃这一套。"

# game/script.rpy:4156
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_72c908cf:

    # w "You need to eat. Someone handles your food. You better be in their good graces. Simple as that."
    w "你张嘴要吃饭。有人掌勺管饭。你最好老老实实博得他的欢心。就这么浅显的道理。"

# game/script.rpy:4158
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_69437252:

    # w "The only alternative is the grace of God. But I'm not the prayin' type."
    w "除此以外，唯一的指望也就是上帝的恩典了。可惜老子向来不是吃斋念佛、逢庙烧香的主。"

# game/script.rpy:4160
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f2d20a47:

    # p "Probably for the best. You wouldn't make for a great preacher."
    p "那恐怕倒也是万幸。你身上横看竖看可都不像个能当传教士的料。"

# game/script.rpy:4165
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e1d3844a:

    # "Wolf snorts under his breath. It sounds kind of like a chuckle."
    "Wolf鼻翼微动，沉沉哼了一声。听着倒颇有几分低沉轻笑的意味。"

# game/script.rpy:4167
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_89f2ca97:

    # w "Could do without that."
    w "少来这一套。"

# game/script.rpy:4172
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8f9c329c:

    # p "I was wondering, though... Why did you join this crew?"
    p "不过我一直挺纳闷的……你当初怎么会想到上这艘船当水手的？"

# game/script.rpy:4176
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a933fc68:

    # p "I was wondering... Why did you join this crew?"
    p "我心里一直好奇……你究竟为了什么才上这艘船入伙的？"

# game/script.rpy:4181
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7d0a33f9:

    # "Wolf's eyes lock into yours, betraying a kind of emotion you can't fully read."
    "Wolf的双眼陡然锁住了你的视线，眼眸深处流露出一抹你难以全然参透的情绪。"

# game/script.rpy:4183
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2cfa8857:

    # w "Why're you asking? {w}It's just work. Money's money."
    w "你打听这个干什么？{w}无非是份糊口的营生罢了。银子就是银子，谁给都一样。"

# game/script.rpy:4185
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_25aa59a5:

    # "He pauses, glancing over his shoulder, the glimmer of the lamps on the nearby tables reflecting in his pupils. Then his focus turns back to you."
    "他稍作停顿，侧头朝肩后瞥了一眼，邻桌油灯的幽微火苗在他的瞳仁中摇曳闪烁。随后他的目光重新移回你的脸上。"

# game/script.rpy:4189
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d39245f8:

    # w "We're not all here for thrills and adventures, kid."
    w "咱们可不是人人出海都为了寻刺激、图冒险的，小鬼。"

# game/script.rpy:4193
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d06b9945:

    # w "This ship gets me my wage and a place to sleep. Got a problem with that?"
    w "这艘船能给我按月结工钱，还能给我一张睡觉的铺位。你对这个有意见？"

# game/script.rpy:4195
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_372beefe:

    # "You shrug in response."
    "你耸了耸肩，没有作声。"

# game/script.rpy:4199
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_dbcee82d:

    # p "It... just feels odd, that's all. There are far easier jobs around. You can't risk shipwrecking by working at a tavern..."
    p "我……只是觉得有点怪，仅此而已。世上多得是轻松省力的差使。在岸上酒馆里跑堂，总不至于冒触礁沉船的掉脑袋风险吧……"

# game/script.rpy:4208
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_60141f31:

    # "The sound of a mug crashing against the wooden floor cuts your reply short."
    "“啪嚓”一声陶杯摔在木甲板上粉碎的脆响，猛地打断了你的话音。"

# game/script.rpy:4210
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bb508021:

    # "Cheering and laughter fill the empty silence between the two of you, as the rest of the crew makes sure whoever dropped it won't forget about it until the next morning."
    "起哄的喝彩与哄堂大笑瞬间填满了你们二人之间的沉默，其他水手正七嘴八舌地起哄，准保叫那个失手摔了杯子的倒霉蛋明早之前抬不起头来。"

# game/script.rpy:4217
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0c5585c8:

    # "You turn your attention back to your puzzling crew mate."
    "你将视线转回到眼前这位令人捉摸不透的同伴身上。"

# game/script.rpy:4219
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c120bc04:

    # "Wolf, his head low, is balancing his coin against the floor, occasionally giving it a spin with his thumb."
    "Wolf低垂着脑袋，正拿一枚硬币立在甲板上摆弄着平衡，时不时拿大拇指拨弄一下，让它在原地滴溜溜转上几圈。"

# game/script.rpy:4223
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_550d5616:

    # w "You ever thought I might just like ships?"
    w "你就没想过，老子或许纯粹就是喜欢帆船？"

# game/script.rpy:4225
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e641a211:

    # "He leans back, resting his head against the wooden pillar."
    "他向后一靠，把脑袋随性地枕在支撑舱顶的木柱上。"

# game/script.rpy:4227
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cc40488f:

    # "The thick fluff around his neck fans out in the dim light, leaving his jaw fully exposed."
    "脖颈周围那一圈浓密蓬松的厚实鬃毛在幽暗的光线下舒展开来，露出了他坚毅粗犷的下颌线条。"

# game/script.rpy:4239
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_559cbdea:

    # w "Or perhaps that I'd have to kill you if you found out?"
    w "又或者说……要是真被你摸清了底细，老子就非得杀你灭口不可？"

# game/script.rpy:4243
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8d9761cb:

    # "There's a smirk across his lips. Whether it's a display of derision, sarcasm, or showing you a glimpse of his fangs as a threat, you can't tell."
    "他的嘴角掠过一丝似笑非笑的弧度。究竟是嘲弄、讥讽，还是故意露出半截犬齿向你示威恐吓，你一时辨别不清。"

# game/script.rpy:4245
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e026da49:

    # p "You wouldn't. Not while we're on the ship."
    p "你才不会呢。起码在船上航行的时候绝不会动手的。"

# game/script.rpy:4249
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e13d7955:

    # w "Why so confident? {w}All I need is a little push and a sad story about a greenhorn who couldn't keep his footing."
    w "哪儿来的底气？{w}老子只要顺手轻轻一推，再编个哪个不长眼的新雏儿失足落水的凄惨说辞，任谁也挑不出刺来。"

# game/script.rpy:4251
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8f874eb7:

    # w "Moonless nights on the ocean are dark. The deck is always slippery. I'm just saying..."
    w "大洋上没有月亮的黑夜伸手不见五指。甲板上又成天滑腻得要命。我无非是随便这么一说……"

# game/script.rpy:4255
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c3890a61:

    # "The smirk disappears from his lips."
    "他嘴角那抹似笑非笑的弧度瞬间敛去，神色重归冷漠。"

# game/script.rpy:4257
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9d45ab7d:

    # w "A ship's a dangerous place."
    w "一条船上可从来不是什么安乐窝，险恶得很。"

# game/script.rpy:4259
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5c04efa4:

    # "You swallow, even though you haven't taken another bite since he started talking."
    "你喉咙发紧地咽了咽唾沫，尽管自从他开口说话起，你就吓得连一口东西都没敢再吃。"

# game/script.rpy:4261
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e875bd6f:

    # p "... I won't pry, then."
    p "……那我往后不瞎打听就是了。"

# game/script.rpy:4265
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0b46db05:

    # "The smirk returns on his face, widening into a grin."
    "那抹促狭的笑意重新浮现在他脸上，转而咧成了一副痛快的笑模样。"

# game/script.rpy:4267
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c86ca20f:

    # w "Good. You're finally starting to get it."
    w "这就对了。你总算是摸出点门道来了。"

# game/script.rpy:4269
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_06580685:

    # "Silence falls between the two of you, the uproarious laughter and cheering of the crew a distant background noise."
    "二人之间再度陷入了一片沉默，远处的喧嚣起哄与纵情欢笑声不断袭来，像潮水般拍打着这处孤立背光的小角落。"

# game/script.rpy:4276
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_22c7455e:

    # "You tackle another piece of the salmon, trying not to think about his implications too much."
    "你接着去对付另一块鲑鱼，努力克制着自己别往他方才那些弦外之音里深琢磨。"

# game/script.rpy:4278
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_98e58cf6:

    # "You realize you've eaten the last of your bread, too preoccupied with its taste to balance it out with the fish."
    "你这才发觉自己竟不知不觉把最后一口面包全吃光了，刚才光顾着陶醉于麦香，忘了拿它配着鱼肉一起下咽。"

# game/script.rpy:4280
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e1fef98a:

    # "You mop the sauce up with the salmon, trying not to waste any."
    "你只得直接拿鲑鱼肉去抹盘底的酱汁，生怕平白浪费了半点美味。"

# game/script.rpy:4282
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1ac2f6c2:

    # "You focus on the last piece of your meal, slowly trying to recapture the magic of those first few bites."
    "你全神贯注地对付着盘里的最后一口吃食，极力想要找回最初刚下口时那股惊艳四座的神奇滋味。"

# game/script.rpy:4289
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b6ada9ef:

    # "You hear a coin spinning against the floor nearby. Seems like Wolf considers the matter closed as well."
    "你听到附近又传来了硬币在木板地上旋转的脆响。看来在Wolf眼里，刚才那场谈话同样已然揭过告一段落了。"

# game/script.rpy:4295
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e16dc59d:

    # "The salmon is still as good as it was ten minutes earlier, though noticeably colder. You're fine with that—to your tongue, it's still astoundingly tasty."
    "这鲑鱼比起十分钟前依然毫不逊色，虽说明显凉了些。但你丝毫不介意——在你的舌尖尝来，它依旧美味得令人惊叹。"

# game/script.rpy:4297
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ba003d98:

    # s "{alpha=0.3}...{/alpha}"
    s "{alpha=0.3}……{/alpha}"

# game/script.rpy:4299
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2c61cde4:

    # "You wonder if Bandile would be able to teach you some of his cooking—the basics, at least."
    "你心里暗自思忖，不知道Bandile能不能乐意教你两手烹饪手艺——至少教教最基本的下厨功夫。"

# game/script.rpy:4301
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a401b830:

    # "Not that you'd need it, while on the ship, but it might prove useful one day, or just fun..."
    "虽说长年漂泊在船上未见得真用得上，但保不齐哪天就能派上大用场，或者哪怕仅仅当作图个乐子也挺好……"

# game/script.rpy:4303
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e47a817c:

    # s "Hoy!"
    s "喂，那边的！"

# game/script.rpy:4312
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_19c2004f:

    # "You finally notice the shadow looming over the nook you're in—a familiar set of ears, jutting out from a red bandanna, are inquisitively pointed at you."
    "你终于留意到投在你们这处角落上的高大阴影——一条熟悉的红色头巾下立着一对长耳朵，正满怀探询意味地朝你这头探来。"

# game/script.rpy:4314
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0a2bcb9c:

    # "Samuel."
    "是Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:4318
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2d6fc43d:

    # s "Hey there, newbie! If that's how alert you going to be while on watch, we're going to have a problem!"
    s "嘿，新来的！要是你在甲板上轮值瞭望时也这么后知后觉，那咱们全船人可就大难临头了！"

# game/script.rpy:4320
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_353359d3:

    # "You crane your neck back to look up at the maned wolf."
    "你向后仰起脖子，抬头打量着这只高大的鬃狼。"

# game/script.rpy:4322
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_55f7aa8e:

    # "Silhouetted against the lamps of the common area, you can barely make out his features from your dark corner."
    "借着公共主舱洒过来的油灯逆光，你窝在这处幽暗的角落里，勉强只能看清他身形的大致轮廓。"

# game/script.rpy:4324
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6ef04928:

    # p "Oh-! Oh, I was just..."
    p "啊——！哦，我刚才只是在走神……"

# game/script.rpy:4326
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f04c4f73:

    # s "You two found quite the cozy spot. And here I thought Julian was the one and only for you, Wolf."
    s "你们俩倒还真会挑地儿，找了个挺舒坦的暖和窝嘛。害我还一直琢磨着Julian才是你在船上的唯一老相好呢，Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:4330
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_294e0e95:

    # "The sound of the spinning coin stops abruptly."
    "木板地上飞速旋转的硬币声冷不丁戛然而止。"

# game/script.rpy:4332
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_53b7a427:

    # s "Sure you folks don't want to join us, then?"
    s "真打算死赖在这儿，不挪窝过去跟咱们大伙凑个热闹？"

# game/script.rpy:4341
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_73bd5c68:

    # "Wolf, looking up at the maned wolf, still shows no signs of being interested in socializing. He returns to his coin, flipping it between his fingers."
    "Wolf抬起眼皮打量了这只鬃狼一眼，脸上依旧看不出半分想要掺和社交的兴致。他重新收回视线，在指掌间翻动着那枚硬币。"

# game/script.rpy:4343
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cabbf878:

    # w "I'm fine where I am."
    w "我坐这儿舒坦得很。"

# game/script.rpy:4352
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_31427969:

    # "Samuel turns back towards you, his head tilted. You shrug in response."
    "Samuel转头望向你，歪了歪脑袋。你只得无奈地耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:4354
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e92137eb:

    # p "This place works. It's nice and quiet."
    p "这地方挺好的。安安静静，正合心意。"

# game/script.rpy:4356
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1966de9f:

    # p "I felt I needed some peace. It's been an... eventful day. I still have to get used to it all."
    p "我觉得自己确实需要清静一会儿。今天过得……实在太跌宕起伏了。我脑子到现在还没全缓过劲来呢。"

# game/script.rpy:4360
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c5ef5da9:

    # "Samuel shows you a warm smile, his previous amusement just a hint in the back of his eyes."
    "Samuel冲你露出了温和的笑意，方才打趣戏谑的锋芒只在眼底化作了一抹微末的暖意。"

# game/script.rpy:4362
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_718a333e:

    # s "I get it. I've been there, y'know. Hard to believe, but I wasn't born on the high seas."
    s "我懂。我也是从你这个岁数熬过来的，明白不？说出来你兴许不信，老子当年可不是打从娘胎里一生下来就在大洋上漂着的。"

# game/script.rpy:4364
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ff9a1ebc:

    # s "Things can be tough when ya' just starting out. New job, whole new way of living, whole lotta terms and rules to learn from scratch. Can't blame people for wanting a break."
    s "凡事刚起头的那阵子，任谁都难熬。一份新差使，一种彻底变样的活法，还有一大堆黑话切口和规矩条例得从头学起。想找个消停地界透口气，半点不丢人。"

# game/script.rpy:4366
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8c8078b6:

    # "The maned wolf's speech feels genuine, if practiced. He's showing you a side of himself that you feel has been shown to many a new sailor, over the years."
    "这只鬃狼的话语虽然听着熟稔得近乎像背书，但内里的真诚却是实打实的。你感觉得到，这些年来，他必定也曾对无数初登甲板的新水手吐露过这番心腹之言。"

# game/script.rpy:4370
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c45107b6:

    # s "And a whole new group o' people to deal with. Being stuck on a ship with a bunch o' strangers—hah!"
    s "更别提还得跟这么一大家子素不相识的人打交道了。成日成夜跟一帮陌生汉子困在这条木头船上——哈！"

# game/script.rpy:4372
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_28bb4220:

    # s "It takes a while to start thinking of the crew as family.{w} Some sailors never manage to."
    s "想把这帮糙汉子当成同一口锅里吃饭的一家人，总得熬上一阵子工夫。{w}有些水手干了一辈子，临到老也没学会这门本事。"

# game/script.rpy:4374
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0678e356:

    # s "But ya still holed up in this thing with 'em."
    s "可你横竖还是得跟这帮人挤在这么个木头壳子里。"

# game/script.rpy:4376
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a742f6b5:

    # s "{i}Us.{/i}"
    s "跟{i}咱们{/i}一道。"

# game/script.rpy:4378
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_77d83053:

    # s "Just have to make sure to try get along with the rest. Small annoyances can erupt into something quite vicious if you're cooped up for weeks if not months on end."
    s "所以务必得设法跟身边的弟兄们处好关系。要是成周累月地闷在船舱里，一点芝麻绿豆大的小龃龉，都能跟野火似地窜成要命的大祸端。"

# game/script.rpy:4380
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cf99ea8a:

    # p "Thankfully it's nothing like that.{w} Just a bit exhausted."
    p "谢天谢地，我倒还不至于那样。{w}只是感觉身上稍微有点吃不消、犯乏罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:4382
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_61127d04:

    # w "That lizard's getting pretty close."
    w "那只蜥蜴凑得未免也太近了点。"

# game/script.rpy:4384
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3f2eab1d:

    # "Samuel crosses his arms over his chest, seemingly disappointed. You realize his speech might not have been directed exclusively at you."
    "Samuel双手抱在胸前，神色间流露出一丝无奈的失望。你这才恍然发觉，他刚才这番意味深长的长篇大论，未必只是单纯说给你一个人听的。"

# game/script.rpy:4386
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2ecb5e8b:

    # "Wolf ignores him, focusing his attention back to the coin flipping between his fingers."
    "Wolf压根没搭理他，重新把全副心神放回了在指尖上下翻飞的硬币上。"

# game/script.rpy:4390
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cacd076e:

    # s "I'm sure he'll get the hint eventually."
    s "我相信他迟早有一天能听出好歹来的。"

# game/script.rpy:4392
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f71a318f:

    # s "Or at least someone will..."
    s "退一步讲，总该有旁人能听出好歹来的……"

# game/script.rpy:4396
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9dcc1b14:

    # s "Anyway, I'm not here to steal any more of your free time. I came to let you know that we've got the morning watch tomorrow."
    s "行了，我也不多占你们清闲的工夫了。我专门过来，就是来知会你们一声：明早咱们俩值晨更。"
    # 译注：morning watch航海术语晨更（早上4点至8点）。

# game/script.rpy:4398
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_37e1eace:

    # p "Morning watch?"
    p "晨更？"

# game/script.rpy:4400
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9288f1f4:

    # s "Yes. Pretty simple, as far as duties go. If you're already used to waking up before dawn, that is."
    s "没错。就差事本身而言挺轻省的。当然前提是你平时早就习惯了天不亮就爬起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4402
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e2778528:

    # s "I can't order you to make it an early night, but I also don't want your first assignment to start with an official reprimand. Or worse."
    s "我不能硬下死命令非叫你早早上床，但我可绝不想看到你登船头一回轮值就吃上长官的训斥甚至关禁闭。那可就糟透了。"

# game/script.rpy:4404
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5e909c41:

    # p "Got it."
    p "明白了。"

# game/script.rpy:4406
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_82d161b9:

    # w "I'll keep it in mind."
    w "我心里有数。"

# game/script.rpy:4408
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e62e587b:

    # s "That's what I hoped to hear. I'll leave you two to your quiet time, then!"
    s "要的就是你们这句话！那我就不打扰你们二位图清静了！"

# game/script.rpy:4410
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1a4fd5d7:

    # "The maned wolf leaves with a quick wave of the hand, hopping his way back to the table he shared with Julian and a few others you don't know."
    "这只鬃狼利落地一挥爪子，迈开大步一颠一晃地折返回去，回到他和Julian以及几个你素未谋面的水手合坐的那张长桌前。"

# game/script.rpy:4415
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0d8bacc0:

    # "A few laughs and spirited chatter welcome his arrival. They seem to be having a much more lively evening than you, over there, but you don't mind."
    "一阵哄堂大笑与热烈的划拳喧哗声迎接了他的归座。瞧着那头，他们今夜过得显然要比你这边喧闹快活得多，不过你倒也并不介怀。"

# game/script.rpy:4422
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_854fdfd2:

    # p "Morning watch. That's probably the quietest it gets on the ship. Sounds like a good deal, doesn't it?"
    p "值晨更啊。那大概是一条船上一天当中最安生的时候了吧。听着倒挺划算的，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4426
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_52bee8d4:

    # w "Good enough for me."
    w "正合我意。"

# game/script.rpy:4430
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ab1814c9:

    # "The wolf flicks his coin in the air expertly, but his hand isn't as deft at catching it."
    "这头灰狼手腕极熟练地将那枚硬币弹向半空，然而接币时爪法却似乎没那么敏捷了。"

# game/script.rpy:4434
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_954ea7c5:

    # "His eyes widen as it slips through his fingers, free from his grasp at last."
    "随着硬币从他张开的指缝间滑脱，终于摆脱了他的掌心掌控，他的双眼不由得微微睁大了几分。"

# game/script.rpy:4436
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cdfd2f05:

    # "The coin bounces off the wooden floor with a series of tinkling sounds, starts rolling towards you, and comes to a final stop against one of your paw pads."
    "硬币伴着一连串清脆的叮当轻响在木板甲板上跳跃翻滚，一路朝着你的方向滚来，最终冷不丁抵在你的一只肉垫边停了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:4440
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3998c92b:

    # "It's a glimmer on the floor of the dark corner, catching light from the lamps lighting up the rest of the common area."
    "在幽暗的角落木地板上，它泛着一抹清亮的光泽，反射着公共区域主舱灯火洒过来的余晖。"

# game/script.rpy:4447
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3362f471:

    # "It's also too far away for Wolf to get it without getting up, so you reach for it."
    "那硬币滚出的距离，对于Wolf来说若不起身根本够不着，于是你主动俯身替他去拾捡。"

# game/script.rpy:4451
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f8408c31:

    # "Your fingers immediately notice something is off."
    "你的指尖刚一触碰到那枚硬币，立刻便觉察出有些古怪。"

# game/script.rpy:4453
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a7861ab3:

    # "You hold the coin close to your face. It's hard to make out details in the dim light of your nook, but it doesn't feel like any coin you've ever touched."
    "你将硬币举到眼前端详。在昏暗逼仄的角落光线下很难分辨出细部纹样，但这触感跟你以往摸过的任何一枚钱币都迥然不同。"

# game/script.rpy:4455
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ec9b9097:

    # p "What is this?"
    p "这是什么钱？"

# game/script.rpy:4462
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8553584c:

    # "You look at Wolf, who's been staring at you the entire time, waiting for you to return it."
    "你抬头看向Wolf，只见他从刚才起就一直在直勾勾地盯着你，正等着你把东西交还给他。"

# game/script.rpy:4464
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_dbdeddc1:

    # w "It's a coin? What's wrong with it?"
    w "不就是枚钱币吗？能有什么不对劲的？"

# game/script.rpy:4468
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_148d65fc:

    # "There's a small hole near the edge of the coin—a later addition, as it's punched right through what looks like a letter."
    "硬币边缘附近钻着一个小孔——显然是后来加打上去的，因为那个孔洞不偏不倚正好凿穿了一个看似字母的铭文。"

# game/script.rpy:4470
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6bf03ca1:

    # "The coin is also very elaborate, sporting unfamiliar and hard to make out engravings."
    "而且这枚硬币做工极其考究繁复，上面刻着你全然不认得、且在昏暗中很难辨识的陌生铭文与图案。"

# game/script.rpy:4472
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_de06121c:

    # p "I've never seen anything like it. It's not from anywhere in the region, is it?"
    p "我从来没见过这种钱币。这绝不是咱们这片海域或者岸上的通货吧？"

# game/script.rpy:4474
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6beb8a43:

    # w "No, it's not. It's a gift."
    w "不是。是别人送的信物。"

# game/script.rpy:4476
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1abb68f5:

    # p "Oh, like a memento? Something to remind you of your friends while you're away?"
    p "哦，算是留念的定情信物或者纪念品？好让你在远渡重洋漂泊时能念及家乡的老朋友？"

# game/script.rpy:4481
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fe87096b:

    # "Wolf shakes his head, then pushes himself up and leans towards you. His hand reaches for the coin, but you move it away from his reach."
    "Wolf摇了摇头，随即撑起身子朝你凑近了些。他的大爪径直伸向硬币，但你手腕一偏，巧妙地避开了他的抓取范围。"

# game/script.rpy:4483
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e10f7e1c:

    # p "I just want a better look. I'll give it back in a second, I promise."
    p "我就想借着光多瞧一眼嘛。我保证马上就还给你，说到做到。"

# game/script.rpy:4488
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_63d7b61a:

    # "The canine huffs audibly but takes no other action. He sits back down, closer to you."
    "这只犬族喉咙里发出一记清晰可辨的不耐烦低嗤，但倒也未再强抢。他重新坐了下来，离你比刚才更近了些。"

# game/script.rpy:4492
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_732c73ff:

    # w "It's from a friend. We haven't seen each other in a while."
    w "是一位老相识送的。我们已经有些年头没见过了。"

# game/script.rpy:4494
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d22b6fbd:

    # w "And we won't meet any time soon. There's your story."
    w "而且有生之年短时间内大概也见不上了。你想听的故事，就这么多了。"

# game/script.rpy:4496
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1d69fe28:

    # p "I'm sorry to hear.{w} Sometimes people go on separate paths in life. That's just how it is."
    p "听到这个真叫人难过。{w}人生在世，大家总有各奔前程、分道扬镳的时候。世事往往就是这般无奈。"

# game/script.rpy:4500
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bccb624c:

    # w "Yeah."
    w "谁说不是呢。"

# game/script.rpy:4502
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2f65a246:

    # "You wait for a few seconds, but your companion offers no further thoughts. You turn your attention back to the coin."
    "你屏息静候了几秒，可身旁的同伴却再未吐露半字感慨。你只得将全副心神重新转回手中的那枚硬币上。"

# game/script.rpy:4506
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6f1dcd5a:

    # "Slowly, you start to piece shapes together through the darkness."
    "借着穿透阴暗的微弱火光，你开始一点一点在脑海中拼凑起那上面雕琢的图样轮廓。"

# game/script.rpy:4508
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3c3a55a7:

    # "One side of the coin is adorned with someone's head—you don't recognize him, nor his hairstyle or outfit. But he looks {i}very{/i} royal."
    "硬币的一面铸着一个人的肖像头颅——你认不出他是谁，也没见过那种发型和衣着。但他看起来{i}格外{/i}像个君王。"

# game/script.rpy:4510
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_20c45797:

    # "The other side features writing, surrounding an elaborate crest—one that carries three... flowers? {i}Fleurs de Lis{/i}, was that the name?"
    "另一面则环绕着一圈铭文，簇拥着一面繁复精美的徽章——上面刻着三朵……花朵？是叫{i}金百合花饰{/i}来着吗？"

# game/script.rpy:4512
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_42ea45ce:

    # p "It's from France, right?"
    p "这是法国的钱币，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:4514
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_88b53041:

    # w "Correct."
    w "算你猜对了。"

# game/script.rpy:4516
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a4273d9e:

    # p "So is he French? That friend of yours."
    p "这么说，你那位朋友是法国人？"

# game/script.rpy:4518
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_55d6d471:

    # p "Wait, is it a friend? Or is it... {w}A lady waiting for you at some port on the continent?"
    p "等等，当真是朋友吗？还是说……{w}是有哪位法兰西姑娘在欧陆的哪个港口等着你回去呢？"

# game/script.rpy:4523
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_685c58b1:

    # "Wolf groans. He doesn't acknowledge your questions, nor your joke. He just holds out his paw so you can put an end to them."
    "Wolf无奈地低哼了一声。他既没搭理你的探问，也没理会你的取笑，只是直挺挺地伸出一只粗糙的狼爪，好让你赶紧打住这个荒唐的话头。"

# game/script.rpy:4525
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_89aa7f1f:

    # w "Are we done here?{w} Thought you a lot nicer back when you were quiet."
    w "闹够了没有？{w}我先前还当你在旁边闭嘴不言的时候有多招人待见呢。"

# game/script.rpy:4527
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_97658e25:

    # "You give in, placing the coin in the middle of his palm."
    "你只得服软作罢，将那枚硬币端端正正放在了他的掌心正中。"

# game/script.rpy:4531
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b4b6b143:

    # "The coin quickly vanishes into the pocket of his breeches."
    "硬币随即一闪，敏捷地没入了他那条水手马裤的暗袋之中。"

# game/script.rpy:4533
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_396004df:

    # p "I guess we are...{w} For now, at least."
    p "看来咱们是说到头了……{w}至少眼下算谈崩了。"

# game/script.rpy:4538
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a6bf2905:

    # p "Is it a problem? I mean, I just want to get to know you. You heard Samuel, we should be trying to get along."
    p "我这么做真有那么招你烦吗？我是说，我不过是想多了解你一点。你方才也听到Samuel说的了，同舟共济，大家总得试着好好相处嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:4540
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9b70726b:

    # w "It's not a problem."
    w "谈不上犯不犯烦。"

# game/script.rpy:4542
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e00f2ad7:

    # p "Well, then-"
    p "那既然如此——"

# game/script.rpy:4544
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0897efde:

    # w "Look... {w}Listen, kid. This is just a job. That's all there is to it."
    w "瞧着……{w}听好了，小子。这无非就是份糊口的苦差使。从头到尾就这么一回事。"

# game/script.rpy:4546
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4a6c1fa5:

    # w "I'm here to get up, do my work, get paid, go to bed. I'm not here to make friends."
    w "老子到这船上来，就是天亮爬起来，出力干活，按期领薪，然后倒头大睡。我可不是来跟人过家家交什么朋友的。"

# game/script.rpy:4548
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3ebc8894:

    # p "But we're still going to be spending months together. The way you think about it sounds miserable."
    p "可咱们接下来还得同一条船共度好几个月的光阴呢。要是整天抱着这副念头过日子，那未免也活得太凄凉了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:4550
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3a8e22b0:

    # p "But I can't force you to do anything you don't want to do. If you're just here for the job, then just do the job."
    p "不过我也没法强扭你的性子。要是你真纯粹只把这当成一份差事，那就当成差事干好了。"

# game/script.rpy:4555
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_eb872cca:

    # "Wolf takes a few seconds in silence, just looking at you. He then leans forward, closer than you two have been so far, then stops."
    "Wolf沉默地端详了你好几秒钟，只是定定地凝视着你。随后他身子前倾，凑得比你们今晚以来的任何时刻都近，随即却又蓦然停住了动作。"

# game/script.rpy:4557
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_992fcb47:

    # "But that's all he does. He stares at you... thinking? Holding back? Fighting some instinct?"
    "可他也仅仅止步于此。他就这么直勾勾地瞪着你……是在权衡沉思？在竭力克制？还是在同自己内心深处的某种兽性本能苦苦抗衡？"

# game/script.rpy:4562
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_481989dd:

    # "Then he slowly pushes himself up off the floor and turns away, taking his empty plate with him."
    "随后，他双手撑着木甲板缓缓直起身来，转过身去，顺手端走了自己那个早已干干净净的空餐盘。"

# game/script.rpy:4564
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bf3e1d94:

    # w "See you for the morning watch."
    w "明早晨更值班时见。"

# game/script.rpy:4569
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8fad2d31:

    # "You sit there and watch him head off and hand his empty plate to the cook."
    "你坐在原地，默默目送着他迈开步子走开，把手里的空盘子交还给了大厨。"

# game/script.rpy:4571
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d347de63:

    # p "Strictly work, then..."
    p "说来说去，终究还是只有公事公办啊……"

# game/script.rpy:4575
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c7b2619c:

    # p "Right, the plate."
    p "对了，还得还盘子。"

# game/script.rpy:4580
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3ccd97b1:

    # "You take care of the last few nibbles of salmon, which by now has entirely gone cold."
    "你把最后剩下的几小口鲑鱼解决干净，这会儿鱼肉早已彻底凉透了。"

# game/script.rpy:4582
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fce55589:

    # "It's still good, but it doesn't fill you with the same warmth it did at the start of the meal. And it's not hard to understand why."
    "味道依然不错，但已无法再带给你刚开动时那股由内而外的融融暖意了。至于缘由，倒也并不难揣摩。"

# game/script.rpy:4584
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_b9b17a0e:

    # "You can feel your energy fading away with each bite. Or maybe it's the adrenaline dissipating, now that Wolf is out of the picture."
    "你只觉得身上的精气神正随着每一口的吞咽而渐渐涣散。又或者，是既然Wolf已经从眼前离开，先前紧绷神经分泌的肾上腺素也随之消退了。"

# game/script.rpy:4586
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d0c31f5f:

    # "All the events of the day catch up with you at once, and with a yawn, you realize you're having a hard time staying awake. It's time to figure out where to sleep."
    "一整天的繁重劳顿与波折瞬间齐刷刷找上门来，你忍不住打了个大大的哈欠，发觉自己甚至连眼皮都快抬不起来了。该赶紧打听清楚今晚究竟睡在何处了。"

# game/script.rpy:4604
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_265b632f:

    # "The rest of the night is short and hazy."
    "今夜剩下的时光变得既短暂又恍惚。"

# game/script.rpy:4606
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_15ef49a5:

    # "You bring your plate back to Bandile, unable to gush about it with the amount of excitement his cooking deserves."
    "你把餐盘交还给了Bandile，却困得实在打不起精神，未能如他的高超手艺所配得的那样连连夸赞一番。"

# game/script.rpy:4608
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1624ee5a:

    # "You walk into Julian—literally—and mumble an apology. You won't be able to remember what he says in reply, but it must have been funny. For him, at least."
    "你走着走着撞了个正着——结结实实地撞在了Julian身上，嘴里含糊不清地嘟囔着道了个歉。你后来压根记不得他当时到底回了句什么，但那话准保挺逗乐的——至少对他来说肯定是。"

# game/script.rpy:4610
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a1cb7597:

    # "You finally manage to find Samuel, who's sitting at a completely different table with completely different people."
    "你最终好不容易在人堆里找到了Samuel，只见他早已换到了一张完全不同的长桌前，正同另一帮全然面生的人谈笑风生。"

# game/script.rpy:4612
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_294e7a4e:

    # "His social energy seems infinite, you realize with barely a hint of jealousy. You won't remember how this conversation goes either."
    "他的交际活力简直浩瀚无边，令你在暗自钦佩之余由不得泛起一丝微末的羡慕。至于这番谈话具体聊了些什么，你同样是一点也记不清了。"

# game/script.rpy:4620
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_14b6843f:

    # "But you find yourself taking off your shirt in front of a hammock that you're reasonably sure is yours to sleep in. You must have done something right."
    "但不知不觉间，你已然站在了一张悬挂的吊床跟前脱下了自己的衬衫——根据推断，这八成就是派给你歇息的铺位了。看来你先前的表现好歹没出差错。"

# game/script.rpy:4622
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_99a4f996:

    # "The hammock does a good job catching the gentle sway of the ship as it glides over the calm waters."
    "随着商船在宁静平缓的波涛中平稳滑行，摇曳的吊床恰到好处地化解了船身的轻柔晃荡。"

# game/script.rpy:4624
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a124a9b0:

    # "Finally you can say that you achieved what you were gunning for.{p}To finally have a ship to call your home.{p}To be able to call yourself a sailor."
    "你终于可以昂首挺胸地说，自己终于得偿所愿了。{p}终于有了一艘可以唤作“家”的大船。{p}终于能够堂堂正正自称是一名水手了。"

# game/script.rpy:4626
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3386a593:

    # "Shortly after sleep greets you with a warm embrace."
    "不多时，温暖安详的沉睡便将你温柔地拥入了怀中。"

# game/script.rpy:4631
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cea18c97:

    # "A growl appears to resonate throughout his body."
    "一声低沉浑厚的闷吼仿佛从他的胸腔骨髓深处共鸣般震荡开来。"

# game/script.rpy:4633
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_74f6252b:

    # p "Really funny."
    p "真挺逗乐的。"

# game/script.rpy:4635
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_54720069:

    # w "Funny how?"
    w "怎么个逗乐法？"

# game/script.rpy:4637
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a808b97c:

    # "There's an intensity in Wolf's eyes that you haven't seen before. They pierce straight through you, making you feel naked. Vulnerable."
    "Wolf的眼眸中翻涌起一股你此前从未见过的骇人煞气。那两道目光森然刺穿了你，令你只觉浑身赤裸无遮，脆弱不堪。"

# game/script.rpy:4639
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3e90e540:

    # w "You think I'm funny? That I'm just the ship's jester for you?"
    w "你觉得老子很可笑？觉得老子就是特意在这船上给你这毛头小子逗闷子解闷的弄臣戏子？"

# game/script.rpy:4641
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2869d3a8:

    # w "There to dance whenever you feel like it?"
    w "怎么，只要你小子动了兴致，我就得随叫随到给你蹦跶跳舞是吧？"

# game/script.rpy:4643
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5616cdc7:

    # p "N-No, I... I just..."
    p "不……不是的，我……我刚才只是……"

# game/script.rpy:4645
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_48766c31:

    # w "Do me a favor and {i}shut your mouth{/i}."
    w "行行好，给老子把你的{i}臭嘴闭上{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:4647
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_478b317b:

    # "He doesn't need to raise his voice. He's the kind of person who can freeze a room with a whisper, if he's aggravated enough."
    "他甚至根本不需要扯开嗓门咆哮。他属于那种只要怒气积攒到了顶点，单凭一句耳语低吼便能让整间屋子瞬间冻结成冰的可怕人物。"

# game/script.rpy:4649
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_39ccd738:

    # "You realize pushing him to that point might not have been a smart idea."
    "你这才猛然意识到，把这等煞星逼到发作的关头，委实称不上什么明智的举动。"

# game/script.rpy:4651
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5251e28d:

    # w "Now get out of my sight."
    w "现在，立刻从老子眼前消失。"

# game/script.rpy:4653
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9d37766b:

    # "You feel his words in the fur at the back of your neck. There's no implied threat in them, and there doesn't need to be."
    "他的字句仿佛化作了实质的冰冷寒意，扎得你后颈上的绒毛根根倒竖。话语里虽未带半字要杀人的威胁，但也委实根本用不着了。"

# game/script.rpy:4660
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c0315166:

    # "You collect your meal and leave him sitting there, in his dark corner, alone."
    "你赶忙收拾起自己的饭食餐盘，将他一个人孤零零地留在他那幽暗背光的角落里。"

# game/script.rpy:4666
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_2f44f8f9:

    # "Which is probably for the best."
    "平心而论，眼下这局面或许反倒是不幸中的万幸。"

# game/script.rpy:4673
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_a8f64dac:

    # "You wander around aimlessly, trying to shake off the thoughts of the prior conversation. It's hard, but not impossible."
    "你漫无目的地在过道里游荡着，拼命想要将刚才那场令人窒息的对话从脑海中驱逐出去。这不容易，但好歹并非全无指望。"

# game/script.rpy:4675
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_65564454:

    # "Your heart starts to beat slower, though not yet as slowly as you'd like it to."
    "你狂乱的心跳终于开始渐渐放缓，尽管距离你期盼的平稳状态依然差得老远。"

# game/script.rpy:4677
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0aaa8ebe:

    # j "{alpha=0.3}Hey!{/alpha}"
    j "{alpha=0.3}喂！{/alpha}"

# game/script.rpy:4679
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fc39123d:

    # "You wonder if you can salvage your relationship with Wolf. Not that there was much of one to begin with, to be frank."
    "你心里不住地嘀咕，不知道自己往后还能不能弥补同Wolf之间糟糕透顶的关系。坦白说，你们俩原本打一开始也没什么交情可言。"

# game/script.rpy:4681
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_dea57362:

    # "But as far as getting off on the right foot, this wasn't it. This was more like a rotting left peg leg."
    "但若是要论及如何给同行留下良好第一印象的话，今晚这表现简直糟透了。这哪叫顺当起步啊，简直就像是拄着一条朽烂断折的木头假腿踉跄开局。"
    # 译注：get off on the right foot（开局良好）反语幽默，用水手烂木假腿（rotting peg leg）比喻极具航海特色。

# game/script.rpy:4683
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d81253e9:

    # j "{alpha=0.6}Hey!{w} [name]!{/alpha}"
    j "{alpha=0.6}喂！{w}[name]！{/alpha}"

# game/script.rpy:4685
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_fd1faa2f:

    # "He didn't look {i}too{/i} mad, at least."
    "不过话说回来，他刚才瞧着至少没有{i}怒发冲冠{/i}到不可收拾的份上。"

# game/script.rpy:4687
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_25e1e8d6:

    # "You think?"
    "你当真这么以为？"

# game/script.rpy:4689
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_93285fed:

    # "You swallow, trying not to let the tension back up your throat. He didn't need to. He made his feelings about you pretty clear."
    "你吞了吞唾沫，竭力把倒抽上喉咙的紧张凉气重新咽回肚里。他根本无需大发雷霆。刚才那番举止，已足够把他对你的真实态度表露得一清二楚了。"

# game/script.rpy:4691
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8c35e460:

    # j "{alpha=0.3}God damn it. Did he go deaf or something...{/alpha}"
    j "{alpha=0.3}真他娘的见了鬼了。这小子莫非是耳朵给震聋了还是怎么着……{/alpha}"

# game/script.rpy:4693
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_31e6bfad:

    # "Your ears perk up as you snap out of your daze. Someone's been calling for you for a while now."
    "你猛然从恍惚中惊醒，两只猫耳随之机警地支棱起来。原来不知何时起，早就有人在远处扯着嗓子呼唤你半天了。"

# game/script.rpy:4709
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3679e600:

    # "You look towards the direction of the sound. Julian and Samuel are looking back at you, the former waving his arm in a vain attempt to catch your attention."
    "你循声望去。只见Julian和Samuel正双双朝你这边张望，前者正拼命狂甩着胳膊，徒劳地试图引起你的注意。"

# game/script.rpy:4713
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bd200a54:

    # s "There ya go. He figured it out now."
    s "瞧瞧，这不终于回过神来了嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:4726
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f2586c26:

    # "You wave back and head for their table, trying to shove your conversation with Wolf back to a corner of your mind."
    "你挥手回应了一下，端着盘子朝他们的长桌走去，竭力想把刚才同Wolf的那番沉重对话抛到脑后。"

# game/script.rpy:4728
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_be552e80:

    # "You're surprised to realize they aren't alone, though it may be Wolf's wish for isolation having an effect on you."
    "令你颇感意外的是，他们身旁竟然还坐着旁人；或许是因为先前受了Wolf那股孤僻阴郁的性子传染，你本能以为大家都是单独成伙的。"

# game/script.rpy:4730
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_af25dc34:

    # "Two other people are sitting with them, a lynx and a peregrine falcon."
    "与他们同桌落座的还有另外两位船员，分别是一只猞猁和一只游隼。"

# game/script.rpy:4734
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4bb30a11:

    # s "Hey, newbie! What's got ya wandering around? Lost the map on your way to the cook?"
    s "嘿，新雏儿！你搁那儿瞎转悠什么呢？难不成端着盘子连找大厨的路都给走丢了？"

# game/script.rpy:4750
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bb1e41a7:

    # "You shrug and sit at their table, leaving your plate alongside theirs."
    "你耸了耸肩，在他们的桌旁拉了把椅子坐下，把手里的餐盘搁在了一旁。"

# game/script.rpy:4756
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ff16691b:

    # p "I, well... I don't know. Just thinking, I guess."
    p "我……唉，也没什么。就是刚才在琢磨点事情罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:4758
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0918b452:

    # p "I tried talking to Wolf, but... It didn't go well, let's put it that way."
    p "我刚才试着找Wolf搭话聊了聊，不过……怎么说呢，聊得委实不大顺畅。"

# game/script.rpy:4762
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3a419b06:

    # j "Hah! If you wanted some harsh words and growling you could have just asked me. It would have spared you the trouble."
    j "哈！要是你早说自己上赶着想听难听刺耳的粗话和低吼，找我不就结了！白白省得你大老远跑去他那儿碰一鼻子灰！"

# game/script.rpy:4766
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7d3568ae:

    # j "He's an odd fellow, not much more to it. Not worth worrying about, there's one in every ship."
    j "他那人就是个古怪的孤僻胚子，没啥好深究的。用不着搁在心上，哪条跑海的大船上没一两个这种怪胎？"

# game/script.rpy:4768
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c3100d21:

    # s "Just leave him be, if he's not feeling like chatting. You'll have more chances in the future."
    s "他要是一时半会儿不想搭腔，由着他自便就是了。往后在这汪洋大海上，你多的是机会跟他混熟。"

# game/script.rpy:4770
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ab3d4455:

    # p "I guess..."
    p "但愿如此吧……"

# game/script.rpy:4772
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c20ad968:

    # p "Uh, sorry, that was rude of me. Hi, I'm [name]."
    p "呃，抱歉，光顾着说话失礼了。你们好，我叫[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:4779
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f3878271:

    # "Samuel stretches his long legs under the table with a pleased smirk. It's time for introductions."
    "Samuel嘴角挂着满意的笑意，在桌底下大大咧咧地舒展起他那双显眼的大长腿。是时候引见新朋友了。"

# game/script.rpy:4781
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_60d71d9b:

    # s "That's Konrad next to me and Torres there—probably hiding behind Julian from your view. And, to ya most shocked surprise, they're also members of the crew."
    s "挨着我坐的是Konrad，那边那个是Torres——刚才八成正好被Julian挡住了你的视线。而且，准保叫你大吃一惊的是，他们二位也全都是咱们船上的弟兄。"

# game/script.rpy:4783
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5fadbb15:

    # p "Ah, it's a pleasure."
    p "啊，幸会幸会，很荣幸认识二位。"

# game/script.rpy:4796
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f92c7472:

    # "Julian leans back to open the view on him. The falcon is leaning against one of the ship's timbers, he looks quite relaxed, despite the vessel's constant shifting and rolling."
    "Julian适时向后一靠，替你腾出了看清对方的视野。只见那只游隼正姿态闲适地依偎在船舱的主龙骨梁柱上，尽管整艘船身都在一刻不停地随浪晃荡倾侧，他瞧着却分外松弛自如。"

# game/script.rpy:4798
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_11feb4de:

    # t "So, another part of the new blood, ay? Torres, the pleasure is mine."
    t "这么说，你就是新充实进来的新鲜血液之一喽，嗯？在下Torres，幸会幸会。"

# game/script.rpy:4800
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cb6a7ef6:

    # "Torres is polite and affable. Warm, smiling, well groomed—perhaps exceedingly so? The bright blue feathers in his hat feel a tad too much for a sailor."
    "Torres举止温文有礼，谈吐随和。态度热情、笑容可掬、浑身上下打理得一丝不苟——甚至未免精致得有些过头了？帽子上插着的那撮亮蓝色羽毛，作为一名风吹日晒的水手来说，实在显得有些过于招摇了。"

# game/script.rpy:4802
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_96f0cb29:

    # "You did notice a penchant for self-expression on the ship, but the feathers don't match with the rings, tattoos and earrings the crew usually sports."
    "你此前确实留意到船上的水手们都挺热衷于展现个性，可他帽子上这簇体面的羽毛，比起大伙身上常见的黄铜鼻环、粗犷刺青和耳钉耳环来，格调未免有些太不搭调了。"

# game/script.rpy:4804
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_beb5c7da:

    # "His clothing also seems on the fancier side. He shakes your hand with a smile and a hint of an accent you can't quite place."
    "他的衣着打扮同样颇为讲究体面。他含笑同你握了握手，言谈间带着一抹你一时辨不出究竟源自哪方的异国口音。"

# game/script.rpy:4806
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_0bc14575:

    # "He falls just short of exoticism, but you don't feel an excess of vanity coming off of him."
    "他身上隐隐透着一股异邦风情，但言行举止间却又丝毫瞧不出半分自命不凡的虚荣招摇。"

# game/script.rpy:4808
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_324c8c5d:

    # "Noticing your eyes lingering on the falcon's attire, Samuel snaps a finger at him."
    "瞧见你的目光一直在游隼水手那身扎眼的行头上打转，Samuel打了个脆响的响指，朝他努了努嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:4820
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3c6398aa:

    # s "Don't think you need to measure up to this level o' elegance. Torres here's an exception."
    s "可别以为自个儿也非得学着装扮得这般风流体面。Torres这小子在咱们船上纯属蝎子拉屎独一份。"

# game/script.rpy:4822
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bc763f89:

    # s "Unless ya hoping for a love story whenever we make port, shirt and breeches do fine."
    s "除非你小子也盼着每逢进港靠岸都能招惹上一桩风流罗曼史，否则平日里老老实实穿好粗布衬衫和短马裤就足够应付了。"

# game/script.rpy:4824
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_48361b25:

    # t "Hah! And what do you know about wooing ladies, Samuel? Never seen one talking to you in all the years I've been on the Conway!"
    t "哈！就凭你也配在人家跟前传授讨姑娘欢心的门道，Samuel？我在Conway号上当差这么些年，可打没见过哪个正经姑娘乐意多搭理你半句！"

# game/script.rpy:4826
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6820a152:

    # s "That's because they all run away when they smell you coming, Torres! Stop dousing yourself in cologne and take a bath for once!"
    s "那是因为每次一打老远闻着你身上那股呛人的骚气，人家姑娘早吓得掉头跑光了，Torres！有空少拿古龙香水往自个儿羽毛上死浇，痛痛快快洗个正经澡比什么都强！"

# game/script.rpy:4834
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_f2361edd:

    # "The table erupts into laughter, Konrad slapping a hand against his knee."
    "长桌旁顿时爆发出雷鸣般的哄笑，Konrad更是乐得一巴掌重重拍在自己的膝盖上。"

# game/script.rpy:4836
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e6a373b2:

    # "You join in after noticing Torres howling with the group; it wasn't a sincere insult, just two old friends verbally punching each other like only true friends do."
    "见Torres也跟着大伙仰头扯开嗓门大笑，你也忍不住跟着笑出声来；这并非动真格的当众羞辱，无非是两个交情莫逆的生死弟兄之间唯有铁哥们儿才使得出来的当面揭短罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:4841
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_d8c27e63:

    # k "Hah! Ooh, he gutted ya, hah, like a fish, Torres!"
    k "哈！哎哟喂，他这一嗓子简直跟把一条鱼开膛破肚似的把你给剖了个透亮，Torres！"

# game/script.rpy:4849
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_5ddad4b2:

    # "The lynx uses the opportunity to lean across the table and extend his paw. You meet it, and immediately feel his firm grip, almost to the point of discomfort."
    "这只猞猁借机隔着长桌探出身来，朝你伸出了一只毛茸茸的大爪。你伸手相迎，随即立刻感受到他掌心传来的一股结实得近乎令人指骨发疼的惊人握力。"

# game/script.rpy:4851
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_94c0c66e:

    # "It's the grip of a sailor who's more familiar with ropes and wooden planks than people, and you are thankful once he decides to release your hand."
    "这等手劲唯有经年累月同缆绳滑轮与厚重木板死磕的老练工匠才磨练得出来；等他终于肯松开手时，你由不得暗暗松了一大口气。"

# game/script.rpy:4856
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_defecb35:

    # "You're not surprised when he introduces himself as the shipwright. He brushes along his beard, playing expertly with the three braids he's split it in."
    "当他自我介绍说是船上的船匠时，你丝毫没有感到意外。他随手捋了捋下巴上的浓密胡须，指尖极老练地捻弄着被编成三股发辫的胡梢。"
    # 译注：shipwright船匠，负责全船木工与维护；三股胡子辫是经典老水手发饰。

# game/script.rpy:4860
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4ca50a8d:

    # "He asks if you've already thought about your first tattoo, and laughs at your stammering in response."
    "他大着嗓门问你有没有琢磨好入行后的第一个水手刺青，见你结结巴巴答不上来，便忍不住开怀大笑起来。"

# game/script.rpy:4862
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_05a5a8fe:

    # "He's roughly in his forties, but his manners seem to project a mindset far beyond his age. And in the eyes of the others at the table, a high level of respect."
    "他年纪约莫四十出头，但言谈气度间却透露出一股远迈其实际岁数的深沉老到。而在同桌其他弟兄的眼中，他显然享有极高的威望与敬重。"

# game/script.rpy:4864
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ddb96072:

    # "For now, he seems happy to have you on board."
    "至少眼下看来，他似乎打心眼里乐见你加入这条船入伙。"

# game/script.rpy:4868
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8b837712:

    # k "'S my pleasure. Samuel told us about ya earlier."
    k "很荣幸结识。Samuel刚才在前头就已经跟我们提起过你了。"

# game/script.rpy:4870
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c61719d4:

    # "He speaks like a fisherman, you notice, but wisdom and experience sanded all roughness off his manners."
    "你留意到，他谈吐间带着几分老渔民的质朴，但漫长岁月积淀下的阅历与智慧，早已将他举手投足间的粗砺边角打磨得圆融温和。"

# game/script.rpy:4872
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_182fa754:

    # "His voice is as calm as the gentle strokes he reserves for his tripartite beard. His directness only adds to the warmth."
    "他的嗓音平缓沉着，恰如他信手抚弄那三股胡子辫时的笃定从容。而那份毫无城府的直率，更平添了几分令人如沐春风的温暖。"

# game/script.rpy:4874
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e7bb3015:

    # p "Only the good things, I hope?"
    p "但愿背地里夸的都是好话？"

# game/script.rpy:4878
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e7263544:

    # "The lynx nods."
    "这只猞猁笃定地点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:4882
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_9d7e0eb4:

    # k "Wait! There are bad things to tell about you?!"
    k "等会儿！难不成你小子身上还真有什么见不得人的坏账能让人念叨？！"

# game/script.rpy:4888
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_43b5e462:

    # k "Just pulling your tail, lad."
    k "扯你尾巴逗你玩呢，小伙子。"
    # 译注：pull your tail为兽人文化俚语，相当于“逗你玩呢/拿你开涮”。

# game/script.rpy:4890
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_6d37e9d4:

    # k "Not a single word about asking questions ya should already know the answer to."
    k "他可连半个字都没提你成天追着长官打听那些早就该自个儿心知肚明的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:4892
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_ef8a19b1:

    # k "Nothing about hitting your head because ya weren't paying attention either."
    k "更没提过你走路光顾着东张西望、连脑袋磕在木桁上都没注意这档子糗事。"

# game/script.rpy:4894
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_db201dca:

    # k "And not a whisper about how yer big heart won't let a passenger go uncomforted, even in the middle of your first day."
    k "至于你小子那副菩萨似的热心肠，即便头一天上船累死累活，也硬是要好言安抚那位素昧平生的贵客乘客，他更是一句风凉话都没往外吐露过。"

# game/script.rpy:4896
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_32c0a8c8:

    # p "So... {w}He lied, is what I'm hearing?"
    p "这么说……{w}我听着怎么像是他在酒桌上把我的底全给抖搂光了？"

# game/script.rpy:4902
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_16a38e84:

    # "The tufts on the tips of his ears wobble as he laughs heartily. His voice is deep but not cavernous, though you can't recall ever thinking of a laugh as 'reverberating' before now."
    "他开怀放声大笑时，两只耳尖上的标志性黑色簇毛也跟着剧烈抖动起来。他的嗓音低沉雄浑却绝不显得空洞，但直到此时此刻，你才真真切切体会到何为所谓的“笑声如洪钟回荡”。"

# game/script.rpy:4908
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1d92ebaf:

    # k "Hah! All slander, of course."
    k "哈！全是这厮胡说八道的鬼话，那还用问！"

# game/script.rpy:4912
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_c8b80401:

    # s "Well, isn't this a happy crew! Glad to see we're all getting along, and apologies for having to ruin the atmosphere."
    s "好嘛，瞧瞧咱们这帮快活的弟兄！见着大家伙相处得这般融洽我心里自然舒坦，不过很对不住，我不得不扫大伙的兴来泼一盆冷水了。"

# game/script.rpy:4914
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_88dbfb38:

    # s "I must let ya know it's the morning watch for us tomorrow. Which means it's a good idea to cut this party a little shorter than you might be used to."
    s "我得提前把话搁在这儿：明儿一早是咱们这拨人值晨更。这意味着今晚这场拼酒胡闹，最好比你们平日里撒欢时早早就收场散席。"

# game/script.rpy:4916
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_e824c529:

    # s "I'd prefer not to pick up your slack because ya haven't had any rest."
    s "老子可绝不想明早因为哪个人昨晚没睡够发虚犯困，不得不替你们去擦屁股扛苦活。"

# game/script.rpy:4920
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_cd67d866:

    # s "Granted, I can't order you to bed, but I also don't want your sailing career to start off with an official reprimand."
    s "自然，我没权力硬拿鞭子赶你们进吊床闭眼，但我可绝不愿看到哪位弟兄的航海生涯，是在长官的一记军纪处分和臭骂声中狼狈开局的。"

# game/script.rpy:4924
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_db743b5b:

    # p "Message received. I'll finish up my plate quickly first, if you don't mind."
    p "令行禁止，完全明白。不介意的话，我先把盘里剩下的两口吃完。"

# game/script.rpy:4926
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_8a4333bd:

    # p "I'm feeling rather tired anyway."
    p "反正我身上也确实乏得不行了。"

# game/script.rpy:4928
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_da463072:

    # s "Well, that sure sounds acceptable. I'll see you all tomorrow then, gentlemen. Just before dawn."
    s "成，这话听着还像个懂事的。那咱们明早见了，爷们儿们。就在破晓黎明前头。"

# game/script.rpy:4948
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_51b6ab1e:

    # "You don't remember exactly how the rest of your conversation with the group goes, but you leave with the impression that they've taken a liking to you."
    "长桌上后续的闲谈你已然记不大真切了，但你离席告辞时却清晰地意识到，这帮老海员们显然已打心眼里接纳并喜欢上了你。"

# game/script.rpy:4950
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_74ce00bd:

    # "You quickly find yourself taking off your shirt in front of a hammock—your new bed for the next... You don't even know how long."
    "没过多大会儿工夫，你便发觉自己已站在了一张吊床前脱掉了衬衫——这便是你在接下来的……天晓得要在海上漂泊多久的岁月里的新床铺了。"

# game/script.rpy:4952
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1f1b7f40:

    # "You climb in, thinking back to the events of the evening—back to Torres, Konrad, Julian, Samuel."
    "你手脚麻利地爬了上去，脑海中不断回放着今晚经历的种种人事——回想着Torres、Konrad、Julian，还有Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:4954
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_1abca40d:

    # "Back to Wolf..."
    "还有那个令人难忘的Wolf……"

# game/script.rpy:4956
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_7739f2f6:

    # "The hammock does a good job catching the gentle sway of the ship as it glides over the calm waters, but your brain is all but calm."
    "随着商船在波澜不惊的静水上轻柔滑行，摇曳的吊床极好地消解了船身的颠簸，可你的脑海里却掀起了滔天巨浪，半点也平静不下来。"

# game/script.rpy:4958
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_92bb287a:

    # "You call upon the gentle embrace of sleep, which is resisted by past conversations bouncing all over inside your head."
    "你拼命祈求安详沉酣的睡意降临，可先前交谈时的一句句言犹在耳的话语却在你的脑壳深处四处横冲直撞，顽固地抗拒着睡眠。"

# game/script.rpy:4960
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_3dc44be7:

    # "While you can't shake the canine from your mind you at least try to take comfort in finally reaching what you were gunning for for so long.{p}To finally have a ship to call your home.{p}To be able to call yourself a sailor."
    "尽管那头灰狼的身影始终在脑海里挥之不去，但你至少还能在心底暗暗自慰，庆幸自己终于实现了苦苦追寻已久的宿愿。{p}终于有了一艘可以唤作“家”的大船。{p}终于能够堂堂正正自称是一名水手了。"

# game/script.rpy:4962
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_bb3d7b93:

    # "A sailor that already messed up..."
    "可哪怕成了水手，也是个头一天就把差事搞砸了的冒失鬼……"

# game/script.rpy:4964
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_144c7cd8:

    # "What an exemplary first day on the job."
    "头一天上差便这般光景，可真是个绝妙的“典范”。"

# game/script.rpy:4966
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_4a544ad6:

    # "You toss and turn until sleep finally takes pity on you."
    "你在吊床上翻来覆去烙着烧饼，直到睡神终于发了慈悲，将你沉沉拽入了梦乡。"

# game/script.rpy:4968
translate Chinese firstdinner_Wolf_35e2ec77:

    # "{cps=2}. . .{/cps}"
    "{cps=2}……{/cps}"

# game/script.rpy:4995
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e479e4c1:

    # "First, though, you need to grab your share of today's dinner. The ship's cook has prepared salmon, just like Samuel said."
    "不过，首先你得去领自己那份今天的晚饭。船上的大厨做了鲑鱼，正如Samuel说的那样。"

# game/script.rpy:4997
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_837f47c2:

    # "A rather generous slice of it, at that."
    "而且分量给得相当大方，好大一块。"

# game/script.rpy:4999
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c72acc39:

    # "It looks absolutely mouthwatering. The cook, Bandile, has even made sure to garnish it for every crew member so that it really looks the part."
    "看着真让人直咽口水。大厨Bandile甚至还给每位船员的盘子里都点缀了配菜，摆盘有模有样。"

# game/script.rpy:5001
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_154e5982:

    # p "Thank you so much, Bandile."
    p "太感谢你了，Bandile。"

# game/script.rpy:5005
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_258d8ab3:

    # "The hare looks up from his work, as if surprised to be greeted that way."
    "这只野兔从忙活中抬起头，似乎挺惊讶有人会这么客气地向他打招呼。"

# game/script.rpy:5011
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_833753a5:

    # b "Have we met? You look new here."
    b "我们见过吗？你看上去面生得很。"

# game/script.rpy:5013
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b58ff0ab:

    # p "I just reported aboard today, that's right. My name's [name] [family_name]."
    p "我今天刚上船报到，没错。我叫[name]·[family_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:5017
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0fc992e4:

    # b "And you know mine, already, eh? I hope the rumors haven't been too bad..."
    b "你这就知道我的名字了？希望外头传的不是什么坏话才好……"

# game/script.rpy:5019
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1e20c719:

    # p "No! No! Far from it.{w} Samuel's been talking up your cooking, and I couldn't wait."
    p "不！没有的事！差得远呢。{w}Samuel一直在夸你的手艺，我都快等不及尝尝了。"

# game/script.rpy:5021
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_19c73bdb:

    # "His friendly smile widens into a good-natured grin."
    "他友善的微笑随之舒展开来，化作一抹随和的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:5025
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_51dd7e48:

    # b "Oh? Has he now? Well, I think you've just ensured Samuel will have a little extra care put into his next meal."
    b "哦？他真这么说了？得，冲你这句话，下次给Samuel盛饭我可得给他开个小灶、多照顾照顾。"

# game/script.rpy:5027
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6389d9d0:

    # b "He must be up on deck again?"
    b "他又跑到甲板上去了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5029
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f2c985f2:

    # p "No, he's just over there, actually. I was planning on sitting down with him in a second."
    p "没呢，其实他就在那边。我正打算领了饭过去跟他一起坐。"

# game/script.rpy:5033
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2b8cf9a3:

    # "You nod over your shoulder, in the direction of Samuel and Julian's table."
    "你偏过头，朝身后Samuel和Julian坐的那张桌子扬了扬下巴。"

# game/script.rpy:5035
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_82de9963:

    # p "I can take something for him, if you'd like?"
    p "如果您想的话，我可以顺便帮他捎一份过去？"

# game/script.rpy:5037
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_09a05d85:

    # "He shakes his head in response."
    "他摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:5039
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_42c5649f:

    # b "He already had his supper earlier, but thank you."
    b "他刚才已经吃过晚饭了，不过还是谢谢你的好意。"

# game/script.rpy:5041
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8d4a77e0:

    # b "Oh...hm... On second though, maybe I can smuggle him something."
    b "哦……唔……话又说回来，也许我可以偷偷给他塞点好吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:5045
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_324db461:

    # b "Talking me up like that has to be rewarded, doesn't it?{w} I'll prepare something on a second plate."
    b "他把我说得那么神，总得给点赏赐不是？{w}我拿个新盘子给他弄点零嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:5051
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_09349dc5:

    # "He begins doing just that, setting about the task with obvious skill. As far as you're concerned, he could just as easily have been at one of those fancy restaurants you've always heard about."
    "他说干就干，动作熟练利落。在你看来，这架势就算去你常听说的那些体面大餐馆当大厨也绰绰有余。"

# game/script.rpy:5055
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0762fbc6:

    # b "So, you're one of the new pups? Already making friends, I see."
    b "这么说，你就是刚招上船的小崽子之一了？看来已经交上朋友了嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:5057
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_bcc6e9ce:

    # p "Well... trying to make a good first impression. It's exciting! My first time away from town, and all..."
    p "嗯……总得努力给大家留个好印象嘛。真让人兴奋！这还是我头一回出远门离家呢……"

# game/script.rpy:5059
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_46026067:

    # b "Ah, wonderful. The enthusiasm never hurts, I'll tell you that much. The work isn't easy, and..."
    b "啊，挺好。有股冲劲绝不是坏事，这我敢打包票。船上的活计可不容易，而且……"

# game/script.rpy:5065
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_96659fcb:

    # "He pauses, dropping his voice to a playful stage whisper."
    "他话头一顿，压低嗓门，神神秘秘地小声咬起耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:5067
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d5440d02:

    # b "I'll let you in on a secret. The food won't always be quite this... fancy."
    b "悄悄告诉你个底细：往后的伙食可不见得一直有这么……讲究。"

# game/script.rpy:5073
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7eb4db13:

    # p "They told me that, too. Kind of like a... a last hurrah, on leaving port."
    p "他们也这么跟我说过。就当是……起航时最后尽兴的一顿大餐吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5077
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_de367a5e:

    # b "Indeed! It helps keep everyone's spirits up. On your third week of salt pork, that can be a bit of a challenge..."
    b "没错！起码能提振提振大伙的士气。等到了连啃三周咸腌猪肉的时候，想提振士气可就费劲喽……"

# game/script.rpy:5079
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_79397695:

    # "He grins, though. Every bit of him radiates an exuberant cheeriness that you imagine must be infectious."
    "但他还是咧嘴笑了起来。他整个人都洋溢着一股饱满的活力与开朗，让人不由自主地被他感染。"

# game/script.rpy:5081
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6c9b7891:

    # b "But we always manage! And for now, we have fresh fish."
    b "不过咱们总有法子熬过去！再说眼下嘛，至少还有新鲜的鱼肉吃。"

# game/script.rpy:5083
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7a2da4d8:

    # p "Salmon, right?"
    p "是鲑鱼，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5087
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a13e2429:

    # "Bandile nods crisply."
    "Bandile干脆利落地一点头。"

# game/script.rpy:5089
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_264cfd39:

    # b "Hand-picked by yours truly just this morning. One of the advantages of being in port. Seeing new things, taking in the fleshpots, that's pleasant enough."
    b "今儿一大早我亲自挑的。这也是靠港停泊的好处之一。见见世面，去港口红灯区的声色欢场找找乐子，确实挺惬意的。"

# game/script.rpy:5091
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d1d24657:

    # b "But a market! Fresh food and spices... and the trust of the purser to spend his coin, of course."
    b "不过集市才是大头！新鲜食材和香料……当然，还得承蒙事务长信得过，肯把钱交给我采办。"

# game/script.rpy:5097
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_76a5da9d:

    # b "This is from, um... Um... right down the street from the harbor."
    b "这鱼是从……唔……顺着港口那条街直走过去那家买的。"

# game/script.rpy:5101
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5a7dd5fe:

    # "He pauses and rubs at his temple, struggling to remember the details. You can't help noticing that he keeps the fingers he's been using away from his fur. It's a subtle touch."
    "他停下动作揉了揉太阳穴，使劲回想着细节。你忍不住注意到，他切菜用过的手指始终小心避开自己的皮毛。真是个讲究细致的人。"

# game/script.rpy:5103
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_63ec7dac:

    # b "Bright yellow house. Lovely old lady runs it. Her sons have a fishing boat... and she apparently has an appetite for hare ears, given how much she chewed mine off."
    b "一栋刷得鲜黄的房子。打理店铺的是个慈祥的老太太。她几个儿子有条渔船……而且她显然很中意野兔耳朵，拉着我唠叨个没完，耳朵都快被她磨出茧子了。"
    # 译注：chew someone's ear off是英语熟语，意为拉着某人喋喋不休、唠叨没完。

# game/script.rpy:5105
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_41a5e7c8:

    # b "I could swear that her plan was to never let me leave again."
    b "我敢发誓，她那架势简直就是不想让我迈出店门半步。"

# game/script.rpy:5107
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_30f568f1:

    # "He briefly stops to rub his temples and looks over at you as if to interject into his own sentence."
    "他停下来揉了揉太阳穴，转头看向你，好像忍不住要在自己的话里插上一句。"

# game/script.rpy:5109
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6b3548d3:

    # b "Lovely stories, mind you."
    b "不过说句公道话，故事倒是挺动听的。"

# game/script.rpy:5111
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fa947e14:

    # p "Oh! From Gundred's store? Yes, she's a-"
    p "哦！是Gundred开的那家店？对，她可是个——"

# game/script.rpy:5113
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e9a7076b:

    # "You don't get out the word \"treasure\" before the hare cuts you off excitedly."
    "还没等你说出“大好人”这个词，野兔便兴奋地打断了你。"

# game/script.rpy:5117
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0b54c65c:

    # b "GUNDRED! Right!" with vpunch
    b "Gundred！没错！" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:5121
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_00bfddd7:

    # "His excitement is definitely contagious, you decide."
    "你心想，他的这股兴奋劲儿还真是极具感染力。"

# game/script.rpy:5123
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3b30b3e5:

    # p "Yes. She's a treasure. It's her son and grandson, actually. I've known them for years."
    p "对。她真是个难得的大好人。其实是她儿子和孙子在打理，我认识他们好多年了。"

# game/script.rpy:5125
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d253e63a:

    # p "I remember when I was a kid, years ago, my mother and I would go there occasionally. She'd always make sure to give me a bite of smoked eel."
    p "我记得好些年前我还是个孩子的时候，我和母亲偶尔会去那儿。她每次都一定要塞给我一小块熏鳗鱼尝尝。"

# game/script.rpy:5127
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_025225db:

    # "You smile with the memory, and Bandile seems to appreciate it as well."
    "泛起的记忆让你嘴角带笑，Bandile似乎也很喜欢听这些。"

# game/script.rpy:5129
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c27a4c47:

    # p "We could never afford to buy it. She just always pushed a little something into my paws."
    p "那会儿我们可买不起这金贵东西。她却总是硬往我爪心里塞上一点。"

# game/script.rpy:5131
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_137679f2:

    # b "She seems very kind. I'm not surprised. Of course, I can't help noticing that I didn't get any morsels for free..."
    b "听起来是个大善人。倒是不意外。当然了，我可没法不注意到自己压根没拿到半点免费的零嘴……"

# game/script.rpy:5133
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_844afc3e:

    # p "Oh! Well, I-"
    p "哦！这个，我——"

# game/script.rpy:5137
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1a0a9d69:

    # b "Kidding, kidding."
    b "逗你玩的，逗你玩的。"

# game/script.rpy:5139
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_790e6b94:

    # "You're pretty sure he's teasing you, given his personality. But he hasn't gotten back to preparing dinner, either."
    "就冲他的脾气，你料定他是在拿你打趣。不过他也确实还没转头回去继续备饭。"

# game/script.rpy:5141
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_259190e4:

    # b "It's fine if you set the bar too high for how cute one has to be to earn a bit of eel."
    b "行吧，你要是把能换口鳗鱼吃的“可爱门槛”定得高不可攀，我也认了。"

# game/script.rpy:5145
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1e408385:

    # "You stammer a little. In response. Bandile crosses his arms in front of his chest, playing the part of a grumpy child."
    "你一时语塞，结结巴巴不知该如何应答。Bandile则双臂环抱在胸前，故意扮出一副闹别扭耍脾气的小孩模样。"

# game/script.rpy:5147
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6ee01608:

    # p "I'm sure that's not—I mean—no, I'm sure—I'm sure you're cute enough."
    p "肯定不是那样的——我是说——不，我敢肯定——您肯定够可爱的了。"

# game/script.rpy:5151
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0b9c5fdf:

    # "He laughs, abruptly. It's a bright, warm giggle, the grumpy affectation broken immediately as he resumes work."
    "他突然噗嗤一声笑了出来。那笑声清脆又温暖，方才装模作样的生闷气瞬间烟消云散，他又转过身去麻利地干活了。"

# game/script.rpy:5153
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b9625c5d:

    # b "Oh, I see!"
    b "哦，我懂了！"

# game/script.rpy:5155
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3db426f8:

    # "None of this is what you expected to be doing on your first day!"
    "出海头一天会遇上这番光景，可完全出乎你的意料！"

# game/script.rpy:5157
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_22af124a:

    # "Not that you mind it, either."
    "不过，你倒也一点都不讨厌这种感觉。"

# game/script.rpy:5161
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_12cd3a24:

    # p "Well..."
    p "那个……"

# game/script.rpy:5165
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0efbebfe:

    # b "Mmhm. Fish, though. Yes?"
    b "嗯哼。不过说正经的，开饭拿鱼，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5173
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3e39e69f:

    # "Changing the subject, he grabs one of the plates. The sizzling in the skillet intensifies briefly as he pushes a fork into a piece of salmon, setting it on the plate with a flourish."
    "他岔开话题，顺手抓起一个盘子。平底锅里的滋滋油煎声骤然一响，只见他用叉子稳稳叉起一块鲑鱼，潇洒漂亮地滑入盘中。"

# game/script.rpy:5175
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a2a6feb4:

    # "Next, he adds a few stalks of asparagus, and then pours a cream-colored sauce over it, thick enough that it only begins to run when the salmon warms it up."
    "接着，他往盘里添了几根芦笋，又浇上一勺乳白色的浓酱。那酱汁浓稠得很，直到被热腾腾的鲑鱼一烘，才缓缓流淌开来。"

# game/script.rpy:5177
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_be8abf3d:

    # p "Fish, yes. What's the sauce?"
    p "有鱼吃，太棒了。浇的是什么酱汁？"

# game/script.rpy:5179
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_674f4be2:

    # b "Lemon and dill. Nothing fancy, but it's a favorite of the crew when we leave port. Something of a tradition."
    b "柠檬莳萝酱。谈不上名贵，但每次离港出航，船员们最爱吃的就是这口。算得上是咱们船上的老规矩了。"

# game/script.rpy:5183
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c6532417:

    # b "I'm sure you'll love it."
    b "我敢打包票你一定会爱上它的。"

# game/script.rpy:5185
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_83fcddf8:

    # "He smiles as he adds a decorative slice of lemon on top of the fish, rounding it all off with a sprinkling of fresh herbs and a generously sized piece of bread."
    "他笑着在鱼肉上搁了一片点缀的柠檬，最后又撒了一把新鲜香草，附带了一大块分量十足的面包。"

# game/script.rpy:5187
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fb7555d0:

    # p "I'm sure I will, too. It looks absolutely wonderful."
    p "我也肯定自己会喜欢的。光是瞧着就棒极了。"

# game/script.rpy:5193
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fbe5ab29:

    # "It's not much of an exaggeration, even. You take the plate when he hands it over to you, unable to keep from licking your lips with anticipation."
    "这话可真一点都不夸张。你从他手里接过餐盘，馋得忍不住舔了舔嘴唇，满心期待。"

# game/script.rpy:5200
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_21c4a1a8:

    # "He prepares a second plate. The slice of salmon is much smaller, and it's missing the asparagus, but extra food is extra food."
    "他接着准备了第二盘。这盘的鲑鱼小得多，也没配芦笋，不过有额外加餐总归是天大的好事。"

# game/script.rpy:5204
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_cafe12e1:

    # b "Won't always be like this, as I said! But for now, you dine like kings. Or, at least..."
    b "往后可不总能有这待遇，就跟我刚才说的一样！但眼下嘛，你们能像国王一样享用美餐。或者，至少……"

# game/script.rpy:5210
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c7e06728:

    # "He leans closer, giving you a conspiratorial wink as he hands the plate to you. You doubt Samuel is going to complain."
    "他凑近了些，把盘子递给你时冲你狡黠地眨了眨眼。料想Samuel是绝不会挑剔半句的。"

# game/script.rpy:5212
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_90636f94:

    # b "Like servants who have the king's favor-"
    b "就像深得国王宠幸的贴身仆人一样——"

# game/script.rpy:5218
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1c794c27:

    # "There's a sudden discontented growl from behind you, and you suddenly realize you're not the only person in line."
    "你身后突然传来一声不满的低吼，你猛然意识到，排队领饭的可远不止你一个人。"

# game/script.rpy:5222
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3eced360:

    # sail "Did Gundred or whatever teach you anything about fish, Bandile, or just how to yammer on like a fishwife?"
    sail "那个叫Gundred的老太婆到底教过你半点烧鱼的本事没有啊，Bandile？还是光教你像个卖鱼婆一样扯着嗓门瞎唠叨？"
    # 译注：fishwife卖鱼婆，常用于形容嗓门大、嘴碎唠叨的市井妇人。

# game/script.rpy:5229
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0b4428d0:

    # "You realize that, of course, you're hardly the only person waiting for their food."
    "你这才恍然，排队等饭的人显然不止你一个。"

# game/script.rpy:5231
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4ded669e:

    # p "Oh. Sorry, I'm new. Just getting caught up in all the excitement."
    p "呃，对不住，我是新来的。头一回上船，一高兴就聊过头了。"

# game/script.rpy:5233
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_84889963:

    # sail "Not being worked hard enough, you mean, if you've time for gossip."
    sail "我看是派给你的活计还不够重，你小子才有闲工夫在这儿嚼舌根吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5237
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a722fa12:

    # b "Your food will be just as carefully prepared and just as fresh."
    b "你的那份同样会精心烹制，也同样新鲜热乎。"

# game/script.rpy:5239
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_cf9269e8:

    # "He does seem to be chiding the sailor for his brusqueness, even as he reassures him."
    "他在安抚那名水手的同时，显然也含蓄地责备了对方的粗暴无礼。"

# game/script.rpy:5243
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_afe49e8f:

    # b "And I should get to preparing it before a brawl breaks out, I suppose. It was very nice meeting you, [name]."
    b "依我看，我也该麻利点准备下一份了，免得待会儿真打起来。很高兴认识你，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:5245
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b3a8f850:

    # p "Right, of course, don't let me keep you. It was nice meeting you, too."
    p "好的，当然，您快忙吧。我也很高兴认识您。"

# game/script.rpy:5247
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_58296dba:

    # "With two plates, you have to be careful not to spill sauce everywhere as the ship rocks beneath you. But you nod your thanks to the hare as best as you can."
    "两手各端着一个餐盘，你必须打起十二分精神，免得船身摇晃时把酱汁洒得满地都是。不过你还是尽力朝野兔大厨感激地点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:5249
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2451ddca:

    # b "And give Samuel my regards!"
    b "替我向Samuel带个好！"

# game/script.rpy:5251
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_69dd5c1a:

    # "As you head off, he turns his attention to the curt man behind you."
    "你转身离开时，他已经转过头去应付你身后那个说话生硬粗暴的男人了。"

# game/script.rpy:5253
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2a002b30:

    # "Despite it all, you can tell his upbeat demeanor isn't simply reserved for newcomers. It seems to have won the hungry sailor over, too."
    "即便面对挑衅，你也能看出他那股乐天开朗的劲头绝不是只对新人的伪装。看来就连那个饥肠辘辘的粗暴水手也被他给抚平了脾气。"

# game/script.rpy:5258
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_de903139:

    # "It occurs to you that if complimenting Bandile's food gets you an extra plate of it, getting on the cook's bad side might be a questionable decision."
    "你心里暗想，既然多夸两句Bandile的手艺就能多讨上一份热饭，那要是跟这位大厨把关系搞僵，可就真成了脑子进水的昏招了。"

# game/script.rpy:5262
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e64d0286:

    # p "Starting a bit early, aren't you?"
    p "你这也找茬找得太早了点吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5264
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b4d5d532:

    # "He scowls at you."
    "他朝你怒目而视。"

# game/script.rpy:5266
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3538f5a5:

    # sail "Starting early is what we're going to be doing tomorrow. And every day after it. Some of us would like to eat and get some time in our racks before that happens."
    sail "明天咱们天不亮就得开工，往后天天都这样。咱们有些人只想快点吃完饭，抓紧时间钻进吊床里多睡上一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:5268
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d5d9a4b2:

    # sail "Who are you, anyway?"
    sail "再说了，你小子又是哪根葱？"

# game/script.rpy:5270
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1883522c:

    # p "[name] [family_name]. I came aboard today."
    p "[name]·[family_name]。我今天刚登船报到。"

# game/script.rpy:5272
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_07001fd6:

    # sail "Well, if you don't want to go back to shore-"
    sail "哼，你小子要是还想平平安安回到岸上——"

# game/script.rpy:5274
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_edb23a71:

    # b "Oh, calm down. Save it for when we're breaking into the hardtack."
    b "行了，少吵吵两句吧。把这股骂街的力气留到啃干硬饼干的时候再使。"

# game/script.rpy:5276
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c576c428:

    # "For the briefest of moments, the hare seems stern, even paternal. Then he turns back to you, smiling."
    "有那么一瞬间，野兔的神情显得格外威严，甚至透着长辈般的严厉。但紧接着他又转过头来，朝你露出温暖的微笑。"

# game/script.rpy:5278
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_72c31d13:

    # b "It was nice meeting you, [name]. Give Samuel my regards, please. And enjoy dinner, the both of you."
    b "很高兴认识你，[name]。千万代我向Samuel带个好。祝你们俩用餐愉快。"

# game/script.rpy:5280
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0be4d8c0:

    # p "Thank you! I will."
    p "多谢你！我一定带到。"

# game/script.rpy:5295
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_865e591c:

    # "Balancing as carefully as you can against the rocking of the ship, trying not to spill anything, you head off."
    "你竭力稳住身形，对抗着船身的摇晃起伏，小心翼翼不把饭菜洒出来，迈步朝桌子走去。"

# game/script.rpy:5297
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_91bc637c:

    # "Behind you, you can hear the conversation continuing."
    "在你身后，你还能听到他们俩的交谈声在继续。"

# game/script.rpy:5301
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9736d5bd:

    # "It seems to have won the hungry sailor over, too; he's not even grumbling by the time they fade out of earshot with the buzz of other conversations around you."
    "看来饥肠辘辘的水手也被大厨给抚平了性子；等到他们的声音被周围此起彼伏的嘈杂谈笑声淹没时，那人已经连一句嘟囔抱怨都听不见了。"

# game/script.rpy:5315
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ab58da5d:

    # "With the meals in hand, you make your way over to the small table where Samuel and Julian are sitting."
    "你端着两份晚餐，穿过舱内过道，径直来到Samuel和Julian围坐的小桌前。"

# game/script.rpy:5329
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c63d5e7f:

    # "They've been joined by two other sailors you don't recognize. A falcon and a lynx, by the looks of them."
    "他们身边又多了两位你素未谋面的水手。从模样上看，是一只游隼和一只猞猁。"

# game/script.rpy:5331
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_37aa9c2a:

    # s "Two, eh? Someone learned to start flirting with Bandile early."
    s "哟呵，两盘？看来有人刚上船就摸透了门道，懂得怎么讨好Bandile了。"

# game/script.rpy:5333
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4a6ad6bd:

    # p "We're to be married when we reach harbor.{w} He says I have the hands of a surgeon."
    p "等船靠了下一个港口，我们俩就正式成婚。{w}他说我有双当外科大夫的巧手。"

# game/script.rpy:5339
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b1cd50f9:

    # "The maned wolf regards you skeptically."
    "鬃狼一脸狐疑地上下打量着你。"

# game/script.rpy:5341
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c6c0fa35:

    # "Chatting with Bandile has put you in a teasing mood. You let your serious expression drop only dragging Samuel along for a few seconds."
    "刚才和Bandile的畅聊让你心情大好，也跟着有了开玩笑的兴致。你故意板着一本正经的严肃面孔，逗了Samuel好几秒才破功。"

# game/script.rpy:5343
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3e0bb4e4:

    # p "It's for you, actually. Your gushing review of his fine establishment earned you a bit extra. Here."
    p "其实是专门给你的。你在外头对他大加赞赏的好评，替你换来了这份额外的加餐。拿着吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5348
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c945bf69:

    # "You hand the plate over to him before you need to maneuver your way towards a seat."
    "你把盘子递给他，随后便得设法给自己找个落座的空位。"

# game/script.rpy:5350
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ab0b7835:

    # "He can hardly contain his excitement at getting another turn at the salmon."
    "一想到能再多吃上一轮香气扑鼻的鲑鱼，他简直难掩脸上的雀跃与兴奋。"

# game/script.rpy:5354
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_da02f1f0:

    # s "Well, now! Maybe it's not off to such a bad start, then, is it. Ya see what I mean."
    s "哈，瞧瞧！这么看来，今天这开局倒也不算太糟糕嘛，是吧？你看，我就说吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5374
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_97f35833:

    # "You motion to Julian."
    "你转头朝Julian示意了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:5378
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1ef49d88:

    # p "Could you scoot over a bit?"
    p "能稍微往旁边挪一挪吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5384
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_de3502c5:

    # "He nods at you, and moves to make room for you to join him."
    "他朝你点了点头，挪动身子给你腾出挤进去坐下的空当。"

# game/script.rpy:5386
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_bcbad7d3:

    # "The wooden box he's sitting on is hardly the most comfortable seat, and the wood is rather coarse, but there aren't exactly many alternatives."
    "他坐着的那只木箱可绝谈不上舒适，木料也粗糙得很，不过在这舱底下倒也实在找不出更好的替代品了。"

# game/script.rpy:5401
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1eebe937:

    # "The whole table is a bit of a makeshift affair, you note: just a plank, balanced atop a barrel with nothing to fix it in place. You have to be careful not to put too much weight on it."
    "你留意到，整张桌子简直就是凑合出来的应急货：不过是一块木板横架在木桶上，没有任何固定措施。你得万分小心，绝不能把太多重量压在上面。"

# game/script.rpy:5405
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fdf1c6c8:

    # "There's something rather odd about seeing the plate Bandile prepared resting on such a rough surface. Odd or no, though, you're looking forward to digging in."
    "看着Bandile精心盛装的讲究菜肴搁在这么一张粗陋不堪的木板上，反差之大让人觉得颇为滑稽。不过不管别不别扭，你都迫不及待想大快朵颐了。"

# game/script.rpy:5417
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_51a1a558:

    # "Just as you start, the maned wolf clears his throat, drawing your attention back to him."
    "正当你抓起叉子准备开动时，那只鬃狼清了清嗓子，把你的注意力再次拉了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:5421
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5f0d71bb:

    # s "Hey."
    s "喂。"

# game/script.rpy:5423
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_64b18b06:

    # "He's sitting on a barrel and, tall as he is on it, you have to make an effort to look up at him."
    "他大马金刀地坐在一只立着的木桶上，身架本就高挑瘦长，坐在上面更是居高临下，你得使劲仰起脖子才能对上他的目光。"

# game/script.rpy:5425
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_061e5381:

    # p "Yes?"
    p "怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5427
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_413eb50a:

    # s "I think there's been a mistake."
    s "我觉得事情好像搞错了。"

# game/script.rpy:5429
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_dc4de43a:

    # p "What? A mistake about what?"
    p "什么？搞错什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5433
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_eeada5c2:

    # "He nods his head towards your plate, indicating it with his muzzle and a toothy grin."
    "他朝你的盘子努了努嘴，咧开一口尖牙，露出不怀好意的坏笑。"

# game/script.rpy:5435
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_551356e9:

    # s "That plate. You must have mine. Hand it over, then..."
    s "那盘饭。你准是拿错成我的了。麻溜点，交出来吧……"

# game/script.rpy:5437
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_50a28f36:

    # "He's not the only one with teeth. You give him a scowl you figure Wolf would be proud of."
    "长着利齿的又不止他一个。你恶狠狠地瞪了他一眼，心想这眼神要是让Wolf瞧见，保准也会夸你有出息。"

# game/script.rpy:5439
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4001c0de:

    # p "Don't you even think about it. You've been talking it up all day, and I will have you know..."
    p "你想都别想。你自己念叨一整天了，我可得把话说在前头……"

# game/script.rpy:5441
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a8248eb5:

    # p "Come any closer and this is ending in a brawl."
    p "你要是敢再靠过来一步，咱们可就得当场干上一架了。"

# game/script.rpy:5445
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6e6945ae:

    # s "On your first day?"
    s "出海头一天就想跟人动手？"

# game/script.rpy:5447
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a9d6e8aa:

    # "You narrow your eyes at him, and try to look the part of a grizzled old salt."
    "你冲他眯起双眼，竭力摆出一副饱经风霜的粗犷老水手派头。"

# game/script.rpy:5449
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2c8b1246:

    # p "Just try me."
    p "不信你就试试看。"

# game/script.rpy:5455
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1abd66f9:

    # "It looks like Samuel seems to have found a less-crowded solution, and while you have his attention, you indicate the barrel he's sitting on."
    "看得出来Samuel似乎找到了个没那么拥挤的折中办法，你趁着吸引了他的注意，朝他坐着的那只木桶扬了扬下巴。"

# game/script.rpy:5459
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0f95a63b:

    # p "Do you mind if I come over there?"
    p "介意我坐到你那儿去吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5466
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2c7570d2:

    # "He looks at you, and then down at the barrel, and then back up to you. Finally, with a shrug, he scoots to the side."
    "他低头看了看你，又瞅了瞅自己屁股底下的木桶，最后又抬头看向你。终于，他耸了耸肩，往旁边挪了挪身子。"

# game/script.rpy:5470
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5e3cfb31:

    # s "Ya' welcome to try, anyhow."
    s "反正你要是不嫌挤，随你的便。"

# game/script.rpy:5485
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5e18438e:

    # "There's enough room to fit—barely. The rest of the group is sitting at a rather makeshift \"table,\" just a plank propped on top of another, smaller barrel."
    "地方勉强够坐——仅仅是勉强挤得下。同行的其他几个人正围坐在一张相当简陋的“餐桌”旁，那不过是架在另一个稍小的木桶上的一块木板。"

# game/script.rpy:5487
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f67c7b20:

    # "You notice how the others have to avoid putting any weight on it, lest they topple the whole affair."
    "你注意到其他人都有意避开把重量压在木板上，生怕一下子把整张桌子给掀翻了。"

# game/script.rpy:5489
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3e99a105:

    # "Of course, sitting on a barrel that the lanky Samuel finds comfortable, you're too high up to make use of the table anyway."
    "当然了，坐在这只高木桶上虽然让瘦高的Samuel觉得挺舒服，但对你来说却坐得太高了，反正本来也够不着那张桌子。"

# game/script.rpy:5493
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_122543e4:

    # "Just as you're about to take your first bite, Samuel interrupts you by elbowing you in the side." with hpunch
    "你刚想吃第一口，Samuel就用胳膊肘撞了你一下，打断了你。" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:5497
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_152d5fb2:

    # "You manage to avoid spilling any of the salmon, thankfully."
    "谢天谢地，你总算稳稳当当坐下了，一点鲑鱼肉都没给洒出来。"

# game/script.rpy:5499
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ae88fce7:

    # p "Hey! What was that for?"
    p "嘿！你刚才那是想干嘛？"

# game/script.rpy:5501
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_413eb50a_1:

    # s "I think there's been a mistake."
    s "我觉得事情好像搞错了。"

# game/script.rpy:5503
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_dc4de43a_1:

    # p "What? A mistake about what?"
    p "什么？搞错什么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5507
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_eeada5c2_1:

    # "He nods his head towards your plate, indicating it with his muzzle and a toothy grin."
    "他朝你的盘子努了努嘴，咧开吻部露出一口尖牙，坏笑得格外灿烂。"

# game/script.rpy:5509
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_76b233c0:

    # s "That plate. I think you have mine. We can swap."
    s "那盘饭。我琢磨着你手里拿的那盘原本是我的。咱们俩换换。"

# game/script.rpy:5511
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_50a28f36_1:

    # "He's not the only one with teeth. You give him a scowl you figure Wolf would be proud of."
    "长着利齿的又不止他一个。你恶狠狠地瞪了他一眼，心想这眼神要是让Wolf瞧见，保准也会夸你有出息。"

# game/script.rpy:5513
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8f1096e7:

    # p "Don't you even think about it. You've been talking it up all day, and I'm not about to let you keep me from it."
    p "你想都别想。你念叨了一整天了，我可绝不会让你从我嘴边把它抢走。"

# game/script.rpy:5517
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e7399e28:

    # "The maned wolf looks you up and down."
    "瘦长的鬃狼把你从头到脚打量了一番。"

# game/script.rpy:5519
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a8f63a39:

    # s "No?"
    s "真不换？"

# game/script.rpy:5521
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c4f5675c:

    # "You narrow your eyes right at him."
    "你直勾勾地眯起眼瞪着他。"

# game/script.rpy:5523
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2c8b1246_1:

    # p "Just try me."
    p "不信你就试试看。"

# game/script.rpy:5532
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fee7aa20:

    # "A laugh goes through the group at your hard-fought defense of the salmon. Samuel grins and relents."
    "见你为了保卫自己的鲑鱼这般拼死抵抗，整桌水手都被逗得哄堂大笑。Samuel也咧嘴笑了笑，终于罢手作罢。"

# game/script.rpy:5534
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1ca777d6:

    # s "Well, it was worth a shot."
    s "得，好歹值得试上一试嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:5536
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5077e118:

    # lynx "That's the other new boy, Sam?"
    lynx "这就是另一个新来的小毛头吗，Sam？"

# game/script.rpy:5544
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c7849ff6:

    # s "That he is. Clambered aboard from the port this morning. He's, ah{cps=2}...{/cps} Oh. Bloody hell. He's-"
    s "可不是他嘛。今儿早上才刚从码头爬上船。他叫，呃{cps=2}……{/cps}见鬼，他叫——"

# game/script.rpy:5546
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_19e3a3b3:

    # p "[name]."
    p "[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:5551
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3218653f:

    # "He gives a snap of his fingers, then points to you, as if the thought had occurred to him at the same time."
    "他打了个响指，随即指着你，就好像这个念头刚好也同时撞进了他的脑袋瓜里一样。"

# game/script.rpy:5555
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b57ac50a:

    # s "Yes! That's it. [name]...{w} [family_name], was it?{w} Knew it was something like that."
    s "对！就是这个！[name]……{w}[family_name]，对吧？{w}我就知道是这个名字来着。"

# game/script.rpy:5557
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_58f41445:

    # p "I remembered yours. I brought you food and everything."
    p "我可是一下子就记住了你的名字，连晚饭都原原本本给你带过来了。"

# game/script.rpy:5559
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_df79329b:

    # "He takes the ribbing in stride."
    "他倒是一点都不恼，坦然接下了这顿调侃。"

# game/script.rpy:5563
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_71894a7e:

    # s "And I appreciate that. Don't think nothin' by it, {i}[name]{/i}."
    s "这份心意我领了。可千万别往心里去啊，{i}[name]{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:5565
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_11c4b504:

    # "When he repeats it, he adds a bit of emphasis, as if he might've forgotten again already."
    "他在重复你的名字时特意加重了语气，就好像如果不再使劲念上一遍，转头就又该忘光了似的。"

# game/script.rpy:5569
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2863722c:

    # s "Always takes me at least twice to remember a name."
    s "我这脑子，记个新名字总得听上两遍才管用。"

# game/script.rpy:5571
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f131ad8c:

    # t "That's what happens when you get smacked across the noggin a few times, huh?"
    t "脑袋瓜上挨了几记狠的，可不就落下这毛病了嘛，嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:5576
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_67f92ca6:

    # s "Exactly."
    s "一点都没错。"

# game/script.rpy:5581
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_995b562f:

    # "He gestures at the new speaker, who has been observing the conversation with his hands clasped behind his head."
    "他朝刚才开口说话的新同伴比划了一下，那人一直双手枕在脑后，饶有兴致地旁观着这边的动静。"

# game/script.rpy:5583
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1ed7b4cc:

    # s "Pretty boy over there is Torres—see, and I remembered that one straightaway, didn't I?"
    s "那边那位俏哥儿叫Torres——瞧，这个名字我可是当场就记住了，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5597
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f92c7472:

    # "Julian leans back to open the view on him. The falcon is leaning against one of the ship's timbers, he looks quite relaxed, despite the vessel's constant shifting and rolling."
    "Julian往后仰了仰身子，好让你把视线落在他的身上。只见那只游隼斜倚在船舱的立柱上，尽管整艘船都在持续起伏晃荡，他看上去却格外悠然自得。"

# game/script.rpy:5619
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b2a3858a:

    # "Leaning against one of the ship's timbers, he looks quite relaxed, despite the vessel's constant shifting and rolling."
    "斜倚在船身厚重的立柱旁，尽管整艘船都在不断摇晃起伏，他看上去却格外轻松自如。"

# game/script.rpy:5621
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d98a7fa1:

    # t "So you did."
    t "可不是嘛，难为你记性大发了。"

# game/script.rpy:5635
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_be7e63c6:

    # "Next, the maned wolf points to the lynx who'd first inquired about you."
    "接着，鬃狼又指向了最早向他打听你的那只猞猁。"

# game/script.rpy:5639
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8e872b4b:

    # s "And that's Konrad. Got that, too, thank you very much."
    s "至于这位呢，是Konrad。看，这位的名字我也记住了，多谢大家伙捧场。"

# game/script.rpy:5644
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_495857bc:

    # "Having been introduced, the lynx leans over to face Samuel, apparently not inclined to give him any credit for that achievement."
    "被介绍完后，猞猁探身看向Samuel，显然一点都不打算因为他能记住名字就给他半点好脸色。"

# game/script.rpy:5648
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fb865b82:

    # k "Not pretty, though, eh? I thought we were friends, Sam."
    k "不过我可算不上什么俏哥儿，嗯？我还以为咱俩是好兄弟呢，Sam。"

# game/script.rpy:5652
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ee306d0c:

    # "He smirks, the flickering candlelight giving his eyes a particularly keen glint."
    "他似笑非笑地勾起嘴角，昏暗摇曳的烛光让他的双眼泛起一抹格外锐利的精光。"

# game/script.rpy:5656
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3782b1f8:

    # s "I haven't seen ya in women's clothing yet, have I? Maybe my opinion will change, then. That's a compliment you have to work for."
    s "我这不是还没见识过你穿娘们裙子的俏模样嘛，是不是？等哪天见着了，没准我的看法就变了。想挣到这份夸奖，你总得拿出点真本事来才行。"

# game/script.rpy:5660
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_923f5fc4:

    # k "I'll pass on it, then."
    k "那我可就敬谢不敏、消受不起了。"

# game/script.rpy:5666
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0696b7eb:

    # "The maned wolf shrugs, and there are few good-natured chuckles from around the table again."
    "鬃狼耸了耸肩，桌子周围再次响起了一阵善意的轻笑声。"

# game/script.rpy:5672
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_793d25a4:

    # "He rolls his eyes and stands up, leaning over the table to offer you a firm handshake."
    "他翻了个白眼站起身来，隔着狭窄的桌子俯身向前，朝你伸出一只宽厚有力的大手。"

# game/script.rpy:5677
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_938a405f:

    # "Your hands meet with an audible clap, and he makes no effort to hide his strength when he grips you."
    "你们两手相握，发出啪的一声清脆拍击，他握住你的时候丝毫没有掩饰自己掌心的骇人力道。"

# game/script.rpy:5679
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_333eb679:

    # k "Welcome aboard, lad."
    k "欢迎上船，小伙子。"

# game/script.rpy:5687
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_75c1699e:

    # "His grip is just a little too firm. You're grateful when he releases you a second or two later, and even more grateful that you managed to avoid wincing."
    "他的手劲实在大得有些吓人。一两秒后他终于松开了手，让你不由暗暗松了口气；更让你庆幸的是，自己在刚才那把铁钳般的握手下居然硬是忍住了没叫出声或龇牙咧嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:5701
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0818550f:

    # "The falcon next to Julian leans forward for a moment, so that you can see him more clearly, and welcomes you as well with a nod of his head."
    "坐在Julian身边的游隼微微倾身向前，好让你能更真切地看清他的面容，随即轻轻朝你点头致意，权当是欢迎。"

# game/script.rpy:5711
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c577049f:

    # "The falcon next to Julian stays where he is, but nods in greeting to you."
    "坐在Julian身旁的游隼并未挪动身形，只是隔着桌子朝你点头致意。"

# game/script.rpy:5713
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8c043364:

    # j "So, anyway..."
    j "总之啊……"

# game/script.rpy:5715
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_83c73761:

    # "You realize that you must've interrupted some conversation. You perk one ear to listen as you regard your salmon, preparing to dig in."
    "你意识到自己刚才多半打断了他们的谈话。你竖起一只耳朵听着，同时端详着眼前的鲑鱼，准备开动。"

# game/script.rpy:5727
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_922c001e:

    # k "Hold on. I want to watch this."
    k "等等。我倒想好好瞧瞧这一出。"

# game/script.rpy:5729
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a4594e4a:

    # "Samuel is focused on his own plate. The others, though, are all focused on you. You glance around at them."
    "Samuel正一门心思埋头对付自己的餐盘。不过其余人却全把视线齐刷刷投向了你。你有些纳闷地环顾了一圈。"

# game/script.rpy:5731
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:5735
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d21d535f:

    # k "How were you planning on eating that?"
    k "你小子打算怎么对付盘里那玩意儿？"

# game/script.rpy:5739
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0925b50c:

    # "You were so caught up talking to Bandile that you never bothered to think about that. Looking around, you see that the others all have utensils already."
    "你刚才光顾着跟Bandile闲扯，压根儿没把餐具这茬放在心上。环顾四周，你才发现别人手里早就各自攥着趁手的刀叉了。"

# game/script.rpy:5741
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ad35ea75:

    # p "Oh, um."
    p "呃，这个嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:5743
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a3ab7a6b:

    # "Was that something you were supposed to ask Bandile for?"
    "难道吃饭的家伙还得特意找Bandile张口要吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5748
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_cc0d0892:

    # "The maned wolf looks up from his food, and grins at you."
    "高瘦的鬃狼从饭菜里抬起头来，冲你咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:5750
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_772d78d8:

    # s "Hey, that's a good question."
    s "嘿，这问题问得可真妙啊。"

# game/script.rpy:5757
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9854541a:

    # "You figure that the sailors seem like pretty rough types. You play it off as a bit of a joke."
    "你寻思着这帮水手横竖都是些粗野糙汉，干脆打个哈哈开个玩笑蒙混过去算了。"

# game/script.rpy:5759
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c35b6d35:

    # p "I was just going to use my hands. I mean, I've got sharp enough claws, right?"
    p "我就打算直接用手抓着吃。再说了，我这双爪子生得够锋利，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:5761
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_63b48b42:

    # "Not intent on leaving them wanting for a demonstration you allow your claws of your right paw to slide out for a moment."
    "为了不让他们空等一场演示，你稍微亮出右爪的利刃，轻轻弹出了一小节指爪。"

# game/script.rpy:5771
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9866f63f:

    # "The others laugh, although you can't tell whether it's with you, or at you."
    "同桌的人哄堂大笑起来，不过你一时也分不清他们究竟是跟着你乐，还是纯粹在拿你当猴耍。"

# game/script.rpy:5777
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e0035d1c:

    # "The maned wolf leans forward from his perch on the barrel, lifting up his fork"
    "鬃狼从高高立着的木桶上探过身子，手里高高扬起自己的叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:5779
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6b8cf19e:

    # s "Were ya born in a barn or something? You do know how to use one of these, right?"
    s "你小子是在牲口棚里长大的吗？这正经玩意儿你总该认得怎么用吧？"
    # 译注：born in a barn俚语，指没规矩、像牲口棚里出来的蛮胚。

# game/script.rpy:5781
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_08dba763:

    # "Admittedly, it does seem like a bit of a shame to treat Bandile's hard work that way..."
    "不得不承认，要是真拿指爪撕扯着吃，确实有点白瞎了Bandile费尽心思的精妙手艺……"

# game/script.rpy:5783
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_64d32b57:

    # p "Look, I was hungry..."
    p "喂，我这不是饿坏了嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:5785
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5649dfb5:

    # "He gestures with the fork towards Julian."
    "他手里的叉子顺势朝Julian的方向一指。"

# game/script.rpy:5791
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2419182f:

    # s "Spare us, please."
    s "行行好，高抬贵手饶了我们大家的眼睛吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5799
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fa0a83d0:

    # "His own plate is already cleaned. So, you notice, is the fork. He produces a rag from his pocket, just in case, and cleans it again."
    "他自己的餐盘早就被舔得溜光水滑。你留意到他的叉子也一样干干净净。以防万一，他还是从兜里摸出一块破布，把叉子又用力擦了一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:5811
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_556db457:

    # j "Here you go."
    j "拿去用吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5815
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_44d24b22:

    # "The maned wolf cranes his body to look at you peculiarly."
    "鬃狼特意扭过身子，拿一副格外古怪的眼神上下打量着你。"

# game/script.rpy:5817
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_69f10f82:

    # s "You know, I expect some manners out of my dinner companion. Even Konrad manages a knife and fork..."
    s "我说，我对我同桌吃饭的伙伴好歹还是讲究点体统的。就连Konrad这么个粗胚都知道用刀叉吃饭呢……"

# game/script.rpy:5824
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_09a29884:

    # "That brings a bit of laughter from Julian and Torres. Konrad rolls his eyes."
    "这句挤兑逗得Julian和Torres忍不住笑出了声。Konrad则没好气地翻了个白眼。"

# game/script.rpy:5826
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5a6a9717:

    # p "Look, I was just hungry, alright?"
    p "听着，我只是快饿扁了而已，行了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5838
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a285ab2d:

    # s "And you know where those hands have been. Julian, please, be useful here."
    s "而且鬼晓得你那双手之前都摸过些什么脏东西。Julian，拜托，这会儿好歹发挥点用处吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5840
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e78247e1:

    # "Julian has already finished his dinner; the plate is clean. So, you see, is the fork beside it."
    "Julian早就吃完了自己的晚餐，盘子干干净净。你看到放在一旁的叉子也同样一尘不染。"

# game/script.rpy:5846
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_15931576:

    # "He produces a rag from his pocket, scrubs the utensil again, and then hands it across the table to you."
    "他从口袋里掏出一块破布，把那柄餐具又用力擦了擦，随后隔着桌子朝你递了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:5848
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c3d2132e:

    # "You know where that's been, too...{w} But it's better than nothing, right?"
    "鬼晓得那块抹布之前都擦过些什么……{w}不过好歹总比空着手强，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5858
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4e70e40c:

    # "A little awkwardly, you push the plate away so that it's clear you would never do such a gauche thing as eat salmon with your fingers."
    "你带着几分尴尬，故作优雅地把盘子往前稍微推了推，仿佛要向全桌人表明自己绝不可能做出直接拿手抓鲑鱼吃这种上不得台面的粗俗事。"

# game/script.rpy:5860
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_76bb2fea:

    # p "That's a good question. I, um... I didn't see any forks or knives when Bandile was handing out the food."
    p "问得好。我，呃……Bandile刚才分饭的时候，我压根儿就没瞧见哪儿有摆着刀叉啊。"

# game/script.rpy:5874
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_80311555:

    # t "And you didn't bring your own?"
    t "你就没想着自己带一把？"

# game/script.rpy:5876
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9b76cad3:

    # p "It's not like they gave us an orientation. I didn't think to ask."
    p "又没人给我们做过什么规矩交代。我哪能想到还要特意问这个啊。"

# game/script.rpy:5878
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_836dec59:

    # j "I guess it isn't the kind of thing you'd think to ask about, really, is it? Here, you can use mine."
    j "我琢磨着一般人确实也想不到提前打听这个，对吧？给，你先拿我的使吧。"

# game/script.rpy:5880
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_80cfeabb:

    # p "Yours?"
    p "你的？"

# game/script.rpy:5882
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_709d563c:

    # "His plate is already clean. So is the fork he was using, you notice. Still, he produces a rag from his pocket, wiping it down carefully before handing it to you."
    "他的盘子早就吃空了。你注意到他刚才用的叉子也一尘不染。不过他还是从兜里抽出一块擦布，仔细擦拭了一遍才递向你。"

# game/script.rpy:5884
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_bd8dac5c:

    # j "Sure. There you go."
    j "拿着吧，客气什么。"

# game/script.rpy:5898
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e7f05c25:

    # t "And you didn't think to bring your own? You knew they fed us, right?"
    t "你自己就没想着带上一套？你总知道船上是管伙食的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:5900
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8f1ea08a:

    # p "I hoped! They didn't give us an orientation or anything. I didn't think to ask."
    p "我当然盼着管饭！可压根儿没人跟我们交代过规矩啊，我哪知道还得自备家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:5906
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_683e2bf3:

    # s "We were all fresh meat once, I guess. Julian?"
    s "谁还不是从生瓜蛋子新兵蛋熬过来的呢，我琢磨着。Julian？"
    # 译注：fresh meat水手行话生瓜蛋子/新兵肉。

# game/script.rpy:5908
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_69043152:

    # "His plate is already clean. So is the fork he was using, you notice."
    "他的餐盘早就空空如也，你注意到，他手头用的那柄叉子也是干干净净。"

# game/script.rpy:5914
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_15931576_1:

    # "He produces a rag from his pocket, scrubs the utensil again, and then hands it across the table to you."
    "他从口袋里掏出一块破布，把那柄餐具又用力擦了擦，随后隔着桌子朝你递了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:5916
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b11f9a33:

    # j "Here you go. I need it back, though."
    j "给，拿去使吧。不过吃完了可得还我。"

# game/script.rpy:5922
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_01c73577:

    # "You take the fork with a nod."
    "你点头致谢，伸手接过了叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:5924
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_372b2194:

    # p "Thank you. Who do I ask about getting one? Where did this come from?"
    p "多谢了。之后我该找谁领一套餐具？这把又是打哪儿来的？"

# game/script.rpy:5926
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2c846705:

    # s "Finishing school."
    s "淑女礼仪学校呗。"

# game/script.rpy:5930
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0f0ae4ef:

    # "Julian rolls his eyes."
    "Julian冲他翻了个白眼。"

# game/script.rpy:5932
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1dd4185e:

    # j "No."
    j "少扯淡。"

# game/script.rpy:5934
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5b9c0ba6:

    # s "Silver, isn't it?"
    s "纯银的，对不对？"

# game/script.rpy:5938
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f51e1fd0:

    # j "No. Silver-plated brass."
    j "才不是。不过是黄铜镀了层银皮而已。"

# game/script.rpy:5940
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a3ae52d2:

    # s "It's still got silver {i}in{/i} it."
    s "那好歹骨子里也{i}带了银子{/i}不是。"

# game/script.rpy:5942
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_942bb9eb:

    # j "God, you're impossible sometimes. I bought my mess kit before I reported aboard. I was warned about that in advance, at least."
    j "天呐，你这家伙有时候真让人受不了。我这是在登船报到前自己掏钱买的餐具包。至少在这事上，我提前得到过别人的提醒。"

# game/script.rpy:5944
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_072b4849:

    # "It does seem rather elegant. And by this point, you're too hungry to care about whose fork you're using."
    "这柄叉子瞧着确实相当体面雅致。不过到了这步田地，你早就饿得前胸贴后背，哪里还顾得上使的是谁的叉子了。"

# game/script.rpy:5948
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7d2a4245:

    # "Bandile has prepared the salmon as excellently as you might've guessed. It falls neatly apart at the touch of your fork."
    "正如你料想的那样，Bandile这道鲑鱼的手艺当真绝妙非凡。叉尖轻轻一挑，鱼肉便整整齐齐地散开。"

# game/script.rpy:5950
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e4b31011:

    # "The smooth taste of the fish spreads across your tongue—he was right, the sauce is an absolutely perfect accompaniment."
    "细腻鲜嫩的鱼肉在你的舌尖化开——大厨说得一点没错，这酱汁搭配得简直绝了。"

# game/script.rpy:5962
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_208e145e:

    # k "That good?"
    k "真有那么好吃？"

# game/script.rpy:5964
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_bb87db98:

    # "You realize you'd sat up straight, reflexively, your ears perked up as if all your senses could focus on the meal itself."
    "你这才惊觉自己不知不觉挺直了腰板，两耳精神抖擞地竖起，浑身所有的感官仿佛都彻底沦陷在这盘美食里了。"

# game/script.rpy:5966
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9aa5d4be:

    # p "It's absolutely fantastic..."
    p "简直绝了，太好吃了……"

# game/script.rpy:5971
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f60e7561:

    # "The maned wolf, who has gotten busily back to work on his own second helping, pauses and snickers."
    "鬃狼正忙着扫荡自己的第二份加餐，听到这里停下嘴，噗嗤窃笑了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:5973
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e408b423:

    # s "It's the fork that does it. But anyway... where were we?"
    s "这可全亏了那柄好叉子的功劳。不过话说回来……咱们刚才聊到哪儿来着？"

# game/script.rpy:5975
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_22b21b5c:

    # k "Right. You were saying, Jules?"
    k "对。你刚才讲到哪儿了，Jules？"

# game/script.rpy:5977
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2a7d682b:

    # "Caught up in your mission of delivering Samuel's food, and the affair of the fork, you had scarcely realized that Julian was in the middle of a story."
    "你刚才一门心思忙着给Samuel送晚饭，又被找叉子的事儿吸引了全副心神，几乎没留神到Julian刚才其实正讲故事讲到一半。"

# game/script.rpy:5989
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_df941e6f:

    # j "Right! So, they'd locked the door to the storage, as they do every night. My goddamned heart was beating like crazy!"
    j "对！话说到他们像往常每天晚上那样，把库房的大门给锁上了。我那颗该死的心脏当时扑通扑通狂跳得跟打鼓一样！"

# game/script.rpy:5991
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_dc42e5d1:

    # "At once, he jumps back to where he must've been when you joined. The narrative quickly falls back into place."
    "他立刻纵身跳回了你刚加入时他讲到的段落，原本的故事飞快重新接续上了。"

# game/script.rpy:5995
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_24291b31:

    # j "I was sure he'd be able to hear it across the room! One friend had such an idiotic hiding place—right behind the door, if you can believe that?"
    j "我当时敢说他隔着半个屋子都能听见！我有个朋友藏身的地儿蠢透了——你能信吗，他就直挺挺躲在门后头！"

# game/script.rpy:5997
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_90a40d7e:

    # j "I could see his stupid eyes all wide-open, bright as the moon."
    j "我都能瞧见他那双蠢笨的眼睛瞪得老大，亮得跟天上的明月似的。"

# game/script.rpy:6001
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_162ebf49:

    # "He uses his hands to open his eyes as wide as he can by way of demonstration."
    "为了给大家演示，他特意用两只手把自己的眼皮尽可能撑得老大。"

# game/script.rpy:6003
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7eb1dc98:

    # "Next to him, Torres chuckles."
    "坐在他身旁的Torres忍不住低声失笑。"

# game/script.rpy:6007
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a66adca5:

    # j "I mean, the guard was right next to him."
    j "我是说，那个守卫当时可就近在咫尺，几乎贴着他站着啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6013
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_82064498:

    # j "But it worked! Somehow!"
    j "可它居然就这么蒙混过关了！真见鬼，天晓得怎么混过去的！"

# game/script.rpy:6015
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0d7440b1:

    # t "\"The luck of fools,\" isn't that what they say?"
    t "“傻人有傻福”，人们不是向来都这么说的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6019
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b8c37409:

    # j "Better than none at all."
    j "总比一点运气都没有强得多。"

# game/script.rpy:6021
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7a0dbfd5:

    # "The lizard retorts, and then continues with his story while his fork, in your hands, provides its own accompaniment."
    "小蜥蜴反唇相讥了一句，随即继续讲他的故事，而握在你手里的那柄属于他的叉子，则成了最相得益彰的佐餐伴奏。"

# game/script.rpy:6023
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_40fffc1e:

    # j "Anyway, there we were. Nobody but the three of us, all the supplies in the fort, and the whole night left..."
    j "总之，那会儿情形就是这样。除了我们三个半大小子，要塞里的满屋子补给，还有整整漫漫长夜由着我们折腾……"

# game/script.rpy:6025
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c4042a39:

    # p "You should've made it into the treasure room or something. They have those, right?"
    p "你们当时该设法摸进金库宝库之类的地方才对。要塞里总该有那种地方吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6029
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_78d7bf1e:

    # j "Look, we were dumb kids, but even then we would've known not to cross the paymaster."
    j "听着，我们那会儿确实是群蠢小子，但就算再没脑子，我们也知道绝不能去触司饷官的霉头。"

# game/script.rpy:6031
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7c597658:

    # k "Aye. Don't be stupid—{w}stealing coins, that's even easier to get caught at."
    k "可不是。别犯傻了——{w}偷银钱硬币，那更容易当场被逮个正着。"

# game/script.rpy:6035
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_cdf135fe:

    # j "Yeah, easier to get hanged for, too. And, I mean, I couldn't exactly go back to my dad and say I found a year's wages under the bed."
    j "没错，被抓住了也更容易被送上绞刑架吊死。再说了，我总不能跑回家跟我老爹说，我在床底下捡到了一整年份的军饷工资吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6049
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1fd51e3c:

    # "As he continues his story, you turn to the maned wolf next to you, whispering quietly."
    "趁着他继续讲故事的当口，你转头凑近身旁的鬃狼，压低嗓音悄声咬耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:6051
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2a788c94:

    # p "Sam. This is really good."
    p "Sam，这鱼当真太好吃了。"

# game/script.rpy:6055
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a5916b3e:

    # s "Told ya."
    s "我就跟你说吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6057
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_42d36955:

    # "Julian is too wrapped up in the story to notice your aside."
    "Julian讲故事讲得正投入，完全没留意到你们俩在边上咬耳朵。"

# game/script.rpy:6069
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_82064498_1:

    # j "But it worked! Somehow!"
    j "可它居然就这么蒙混过关了！真见鬼，天晓得怎么混过去的！"

# game/script.rpy:6071
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0d7440b1_1:

    # t "\"The luck of fools,\" isn't that what they say?"
    t "“傻人有傻福”，人们不是向来都这么说的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6075
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b8c37409_1:

    # j "Better than none at all."
    j "总比一点运气都没有强得多。"

# game/script.rpy:6079
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7a0dbfd5_1:

    # "The lizard retorts, and then continues with his story while his fork, in your hands, provides its own accompaniment."
    "小蜥蜴反唇相讥了一句，随即继续讲他的故事，而握在你手里的那柄属于他的叉子，则成了最相得益彰的佐餐伴奏。"

# game/script.rpy:6081
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_40fffc1e_1:

    # j "Anyway, there we were. Nobody but the three of us, all the supplies in the fort, and the whole night left..."
    j "总之，那会儿情形就是这样。除了我们三个半大小子，要塞里的满屋子补给，还有整整漫漫长夜由着我们折腾……"

# game/script.rpy:6083
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0f259db9:

    # t "Dear lord, Julian, but you must've been bored as a kid."
    t "老天爷啊，Julian，你小时候究竟得无聊成什么样啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6088
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f2d91f33:

    # "As the lizard turns around to Torres, an animated gesture emphasizes his words."
    "只见小蜥蜴转过身面朝Torres，手舞足蹈地比划着，竭力强调自己的话。"

# game/script.rpy:6090
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f9936b7c:

    # j "You have no idea! It was dreadful whenever our family was stationed there."
    j "你根本无法想象！每回我们全家随军驻扎到那鬼地方，日子都简直生不如死！"

# game/script.rpy:6092
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_33180e2d:

    # t "Uh huh."
    t "是嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:6094
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3e62aab9:

    # "The falcon seems patently unconvinced."
    "游隼脸上写满了不以为然的怀疑神色。"

# game/script.rpy:6096
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_86883116:

    # j "You'd think it would be every boy's dream to play soldier in a real fort, right?"
    j "一般人都觉得，能在正儿八经的军功要塞里过把当兵打仗的瘾，是每个男孩子的梦想，对不对？"

# game/script.rpy:6100
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c609297c:

    # "He shakes his head dramatically."
    "他夸张地用力摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:6102
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3224273c:

    # j "Worst fucking place for it!"
    j "实际上那鬼地方简直他妈糟透了！"

# game/script.rpy:6106
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e75ebd95:

    # j "Everyone gets their knickers in a knot. Discipline here, order there..."
    j "每个人都整天神经紧绷、歇斯底里。这儿要讲纪律，那儿要严规矩……"
    # 译注：get knickers in a knot英国俚语，指过度紧张神经质、小题大做。

# game/script.rpy:6108
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_766d6a3b:

    # t "I bet."
    t "我猜也是。"

# game/script.rpy:6110
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_549f6656:

    # j "I swear you'd think us children were supposed to be drilling, too, just like our brave, spit-and-polish fathers."
    j "我敢发誓，你准会以为我们这帮小崽子也该跟着一起出操操练，就跟我们那帮威风凛凛、制服鞋袜擦得锃亮的老爹们一个样。"

# game/script.rpy:6112
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b5cc8b92:

    # t "Speaking of which. Did yours ever find out?"
    t "说到这个。你老爹后来到底察觉到了没有？"

# game/script.rpy:6116
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6caac237:

    # "While you wait for Julian's answer, you turn to the asparagus. Slicing the long piece in half with your fork, you drop half into your mouth."
    "在等候Julian回答的当口，你把叉子伸向了盘里的芦笋。用叉刃把长长的一截切成两段，随后把半截送入口中。"

# game/script.rpy:6118
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_54e110b0:

    # "It's not as striking as the salmon, perhaps, but the fact remains that Bandile does marvelous work."
    "虽然不如鲑鱼那般惊艳味蕾，但不可否认的是，Bandile的手艺确实妙不可言。"

# game/script.rpy:6122
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7c62e28a:

    # j "I'll get to that."
    j "我马上就讲到那儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:6124
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f66ef5c8:

    # k "Can't wait 'til you get to the part where you get your ass kicked for it, Jules..."
    k "我可快等不及想听听你小子因此被揍得屁股开花的下场了，Jules……"

# game/script.rpy:6128
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_abf383a7:

    # "Something in the lynx's blunt tone has you chuckling before you can help yourself."
    "猞猁这番直截了当的粗犷语调，让你忍不住当场噗嗤笑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:6130
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_83c05e9f:

    # j "Hey! I gave you my fork! You're supposed to be on my side!"
    j "喂！我的叉子可借给你使着呢！你小子理应站在我这边才对吧！"

# game/script.rpy:6132
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_cc51d7c3:

    # "Despite his protests, he's grinning. After a moment, and a rueful shake of his head, he bursts out laughing, too."
    "尽管嘴上气恼抗议，他脸上却咧嘴笑着。过了一会儿，他自嘲般无可奈何地摇了摇头，自己也跟着哈哈大笑起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6136
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_205f2320:

    # j "Everybody on this ship has it out for me, I swear to God."
    j "我向上帝起誓，这条船上的每一个人全都在变着法子找我麻烦。"

# game/script.rpy:6138
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5d0b7cdb:

    # j "It hasn't even been one day! He punched me already, Wolf wants to throw me overboard—now you two as well?"
    j "这才连一天都不到呢！他已经揍过我一拳了，Wolf也嚷嚷着要把我扔下海——现在连你们俩也合伙针对我？"

# game/script.rpy:6142
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_56d86762:

    # t "Three."
    t "是三个。"

# game/script.rpy:6144
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5aa7be6c:

    # p "Perhaps it's the scales? They're very smackable."
    p "也许是你身上这身细密鳞片惹的祸？让人看着就忍不住想顺手抽上一巴掌。"

# game/script.rpy:6151
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4b23449a:

    # "You tease him, scooting your plate—and his fork—theatrically out of reach, just in case."
    "你故意逗他，特意把自己的餐盘——还有他的叉子——夸张地往旁边挪开，省得被他顺走。"

# game/script.rpy:6153
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9f975748:

    # j "What's that supposed to mean?"
    j "你这话到底算什么意思啊？"

# game/script.rpy:6156
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0757b403:

    # j "{cps=1000}What's that supposed to mean?{/cps}" nointeract
    j "{cps=1000}这是什么意思？{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script.rpy:6162
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f64d0aff:

    # "You decide your best course of action is to demonstrate."
    "你觉得眼下最有说服力的办法，莫过于当场给他示范一下了。"

# game/script.rpy:6167
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_533a767f:

    # "With a firm blow, your first lands on his shoulder!" with hpunch
    "看招！这第一拳就结结实实地打在你肩膀上！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6171
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_4fd6f2d0:

    # "The lizard immediately turns around to give you one back." with hpunch
    "蜥蜴立马转过身，想赏你一拳。" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6175
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_47f8ad9b:

    # j "Ow! Will you stop that?"
    j "哎哟！你小子能不能消停会儿！"

# game/script.rpy:6177
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5d1999bc:

    # "In his eagerness to retaliate, Julian's tail has smacked loudly against the pillar Torres is leaning against."
    "Julian急着想抽冷子报复回来，那条长尾巴啪的一声脆响，重重甩在了Torres倚靠着的那根船梁立柱上。"

# game/script.rpy:6181
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9833f338:

    # k "You see, Mr. [family_name]—this is the kind of dexterity that only a master thief can boast of."
    k "瞧见了吧，[family_name]先生——这手绝活，可只有神偷大师才敢拿出来显摆啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6185
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d9fcaab1:

    # "You don't want to risk your salmon. You do, though, raise your other hand, then make a show of thinking better of it."
    "你可不想让自己那块香喷喷的鲑鱼冒半点风险。不过你还是象征性地扬起了另一只空手，随后又装模作样地作罢放下。"

# game/script.rpy:6187
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d47a8dd4:

    # j "Yeah, that's right! That's what I thought!"
    j "哈，这就对了！算你识相！"

# game/script.rpy:6189
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_716b39b9:

    # "He snickers, playing the part of exasperation."
    "他哧哧笑了起来，装出一副被惹毛了的气急败坏模样。"

# game/script.rpy:6194
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c9706ddc:

    # j "You all better watch your fur, or I'll shave it off. You better believe that mess kit has a razor in it! Hmph."
    j "你们这帮家伙最好都看好身上的皮毛，小心我趁你们睡着全剃光！别不信，我的餐具包里可真揣着把剃刀呢！哼。"

# game/script.rpy:6196
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fbc086b0:

    # "Judging by the reactions of the other three, this threat doesn't land. He doubles down with a scowl."
    "从同桌另外三人的反应来看，这番恐吓显然毫无威慑力。他不甘心地板起脸，恶狠狠地瞪着眼。"

# game/script.rpy:6198
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1091b53d:

    # j "We'll see who's more smackable then. Goes double for you, new boy. Stealing my fork and everything."
    j "到时候看看到底是谁的身上更欠抽。特别是你，新来的小子。顺了我的叉子居然还敢跟着起哄。"

# game/script.rpy:6205
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fdbe6506:

    # "A laugh goes through the group."
    "众人爆发出一阵开怀的哄笑。"

# game/script.rpy:6220
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5d87f0ac:

    # "The maned wolf lowers his voice while Julian keeps talking."
    "趁着Julian还在那儿大声嚷嚷，身旁的鬃狼悄悄压低了嗓音。"

# game/script.rpy:6222
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_dcdecf83:

    # s "Could I..."
    s "我说，我能不能……"

# game/script.rpy:6224
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_653435eb:

    # "He points to the other stalks of asparagus on your plate, which have remained untouched."
    "他指了指你餐盘里剩下那几根完好无损、还没动过的嫩芦笋。"

# game/script.rpy:6226
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ee8feb32:

    # s "...have one of them, by any chance?"
    s "……借光分给我一根尝尝，不知行不行？"

# game/script.rpy:6238
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d66b18cf:

    # s "Oh! Really?"
    s "哦！当真？！"

# game/script.rpy:6240
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_af101f2e:

    # "He seems unexpectedly delighted, as though he wasn't expecting that answer."
    "他显得喜出望外，仿佛完全没料到你会答应得这般爽快。"

# game/script.rpy:6242
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_339ddab0:

    # p "I've never been the biggest fan."
    p "我向来算不上多喜欢吃这玩意儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6244
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5cc322fb:

    # s "Your loss!"
    s "那你可亏大发喽！"

# game/script.rpy:6246
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9364e3e5:

    # "The maned wolf says it happily, though, picking both of the remaining stalks from your plate and ferrying them deftly to his own."
    "鬃狼乐不可支地嚷着，伸手把你盘里剩下的两根嫩芦笋麻利地全抄走，手法娴熟地拨进了自己盘中。"

# game/script.rpy:6250
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_a49ae413:

    # s "I absolutely love asparagus. Especially the way Bandile does 'em. Call me weak for pining for vegetables, if you must."
    s "我可是打心眼里深爱芦笋。特别是Bandile做这道菜的手法。要是你们非要笑话我嘴馋青菜没出息，那你们就尽管笑话去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6252
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_dcaedfb4:

    # p "Not planning on holding it against you, one way or the other."
    p "放心吧，横竖我也绝不会因为这点小事拿你取笑的。"

# game/script.rpy:6254
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_6ae549e7:

    # "You promise, with a smile on your muzzle, watching Samuel go after the asparagus with unabashed relish."
    "你嘴角带笑地向他保证，看着Samuel毫无顾忌、大快朵颐地美美享用着那几根芦笋。"

# game/script.rpy:6264
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_76e161ca:

    # "You're surprised he has any left, but the maned wolf nods willingly."
    "你挺惊讶他盘里居然还剩着鱼肉，但高瘦的鬃狼却格外爽快地连连点头。"

# game/script.rpy:6266
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e5d3d653:

    # s "Some salmon? Deal. Here, take some."
    s "想分点鲑鱼？成交！来，分你一块。"

# game/script.rpy:6268
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c7affec5:

    # "He holds the plate closer to yours, so that you can take a bit of fish in exchange."
    "他把盘子往你跟前挪近了些，好让你用叉子挑走一块鱼肉作为交换。"

# game/script.rpy:6270
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_63b1a75c:

    # "During the exchange you, of course, manage to drip some of the sauce on your clothes..."
    "在这番倒换餐点的过程中，你的衣服上免不了还是不小心滴上了几滴酱汁……"

# game/script.rpy:6274
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e57c0ba6:

    # "Nothing that a quick wipe with your thumb couldn't fix, however! And Samuel is more distracted by the vegetables."
    "不过，用大拇指顺手一抹也就搞定了！况且Samuel满副心神都被那几根鲜嫩蔬菜勾走了，根本没留意到你的狼狈。"

# game/script.rpy:6276
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_91fdbc24:

    # s "Thank you, [name]. I've always loved Bandile's asparagus."
    s "多谢你啦，[name]。我向来最喜欢Bandile做的这道芦笋了。"

# game/script.rpy:6278
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ed8f095c:

    # "He says it almost like he's confiding a secret in you."
    "他说这话时的郑重神态，简直就像是在跟你悄悄分享什么了不得的惊天秘密一样。"

# game/script.rpy:6280
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ac9e3bae:

    # p "It is quite lovely. But I'm more partial to the fish. We didn't get so much of that, growing up..."
    p "味道确实相当美味。不过我还是更偏爱吃鱼。打小在乡下老家长大，我们可没怎么吃过这么鲜亮的鱼肉……"

# game/script.rpy:6284
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9c709d19:

    # s "Oh, right. That makes sense. He's very good with the salmon, too, of course. But fresh vegetables..."
    s "哦，倒也是。这么说就全说得通了。当然了，他做这道鲑鱼的手艺也称得上一绝。不过说到这新鲜蔬菜嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:6286
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ff38530d:

    # "He sighs happily, and gets back to work on them."
    "他心满意足地美美叹了口气，再次转头埋头对付起盘里的芦笋来。"

# game/script.rpy:6295
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_df4aca27:

    # "And, you don't mention, that is already Samuel's second plate of food..."
    "而且你压根儿没好意思当面提醒他：这可已经是他今晚吃下的整整第二大盘饭菜了……"

# game/script.rpy:6297
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_93fc703b:

    # "The maned wolf looks more dejected than you might've expected. His ears splay with your answer."
    "高挑的鬃狼看起来比你预想的要沮丧得多。一听到你的拒绝，那双原本高高竖起的大耳朵瞬间耷拉了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:6299
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9773e5fb:

    # s "Oh. Alright, I understand..."
    s "哦。行吧，我懂了……"

# game/script.rpy:6307
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1d9a02e5:

    # "Your attention is captured once more as the other conversation breaks into laughter."
    "餐桌另一头的交谈声突然再次爆发出哄堂大笑，把你的思绪重新吸引了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:6309
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ba2219fc:

    # j "I'm serious! You don't think I've got a razor in my mess kit?"
    j "我是认真的！你们难道真以为我的餐具包里没揣着剃刀吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6311
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_036b8d47:

    # p "What..."
    p "这又是闹哪出……"

# game/script.rpy:6313
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_07289e26:

    # "You mutter the question softly to Samuel, who shakes his head."
    "你偏过头小声向身旁的Samuel求证，后者无奈地摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:6317
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_8c847990:

    # s "It's Julian. I'm sure he's talking about shaving everyone again."
    s "是Julian。我敢打包票，他肯定又在嚷嚷着要给全船的人剃光毛发了。"

# game/script.rpy:6319
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_7ca1249c:

    # "He does, indeed, seem to be doing just that."
    "果不其然，他瞧着还真像是在手舞足蹈地宣扬着这套伟业。"

# game/script.rpy:6330
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d28c2cb4:

    # j "Don't think shaving you is just some idle threat!"
    j "可别以为扬言要剃光你们只是随口吓唬人的空话！"

# game/script.rpy:6338
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f7c27a1f:

    # "He playfully punches the air in front of him."
    "他装模作样地冲着身前的空气挥舞起拳头。"

# game/script.rpy:6340
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_96a5f974:

    # j "Why, how often have I been surrounded by one of your like! Menacing me with their pelts and their... their fleas!"
    j "想当年，有多少像你们这号粗胚仗着一身厚皮毛和……和身上的跳蚤，成天在我跟前张牙舞爪恐吓我！"

# game/script.rpy:6344
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ab0ee584:

    # j "But like that!{w} One!{w} Two!{w} Like a ferocious, cornered beast I strike!!"
    j "可我就这么刷刷几下！{w}一下！{w}两下！{w}犹如一头被逼入绝境的凶悍恶兽般猛烈反扑！！"

# game/script.rpy:6359
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f85fe08f:

    # "He pantomimes the act of shearing, albeit with more enthusiasm than skill."
    "他在半空中装模作样地模仿起剪羊毛的动作，只不过这架势看着热情有余，技巧却实在不敢恭维。"

# game/script.rpy:6361
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_ab91f4f1:

    # j "Leaving nothing behind but shorn and whimpering men!"
    j "杀得身后只留下一帮被剃得光溜溜、抱头呜咽惨叫的丧家之犬！"

# game/script.rpy:6365
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_f44b0dc5:

    # k "Shorn?"
    k "剪羊毛？"

# game/script.rpy:6369
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fe0fdd3d:

    # t "He means shaved, idiot."
    t "他那是想说刮胡子剃毛，蠢货。"

# game/script.rpy:6373
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_91410258:

    # j "You lot of uncultured boors. Well, as I said, if the sharpness of my tongue doesn't get you, the sharpness of my razor will."
    j "你们这帮目不识丁的粗鄙蛮胚。哼，反正我还是那句话：要是我的三寸不烂之舌治不了你们，我的锋利剃刀自会让你们知道厉害。"

# game/script.rpy:6378
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_3b3ac33b:

    # "Looking around, he finds nothing but shaking heads."
    "他环顾四周，迎上的却只有全桌人整齐划一的摇头叹气。"

# game/script.rpy:6382
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_43252309:

    # j "You still don't believe me?"
    j "你们居然还是不信？"

# game/script.rpy:6386
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_19cb5975:

    # k "No, it's just that it might be the stupidest fucking thing I've ever heard in my life."
    k "不是不信，主要是这听起来八成是我这辈子听过的最他妈蠢透顶的鬼话了。"

# game/script.rpy:6392
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0783c959:

    # k "Astonishing, Jules."
    k "当真让人叹为观止啊，Jules。"

# game/script.rpy:6399
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_95157177:

    # k "Not to mention—don't you know how stupid it is to reveal your plans?"
    k "更别提——你难道不知道提前把自己的鬼主意嚷嚷出来有多蠢吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6401
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_08a174cb:

    # k "Guess who's going straight overboard now if this beard goes missing..."
    k "不妨猜猜看，要是老子这把美髯胡须哪天冷不丁缺了半截，谁会被第一个捆起来直接扔进海里喂鱼……"

# game/script.rpy:6405
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_651394e7:

    # j "I'll blame it on [name]."
    j "到时候我就一口咬定全是[name]干的。"

# game/script.rpy:6407
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_91426e8b:

    # p "What?!" with hpunch
    p "哈？！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6409
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9f33a26b:

    # "Julian grins broadly, his scales shimmering in the warm lamplight."
    "Julian放肆地咧嘴坏笑，温暖摇曳的马灯光芒照在他周身的细密鳞片上，泛起波光粼粼的微光。"

# game/script.rpy:6411
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_e13478ee:

    # j "See? Look at him! Too confused in the moment to even think of a defense!"
    j "瞧见了吧？瞅瞅他那副傻样！这会儿直接被吓蒙了，连一句辩解的话都编不出来！"

# game/script.rpy:6415
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c3dcaf2e:

    # k "He didn't even have a fork. Where would he get shears or a razor or anything?"
    k "他连吃晚饭的叉子都拿不出来，上哪儿去给你弄大铁剪和剃刀这种凶器去？"

# game/script.rpy:6417
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d4933d2c:

    # "This alibi doesn't delay the lizard for more than a second before he beams wider."
    "这记铁证如山的不在场证明连一秒钟都没能难住这只小蜥蜴，只见他嘴角的笑意反而咧得更宽了。"

# game/script.rpy:6421
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_975a07bb:

    # j "Aha! From my mess kit! Which he'd already learned to raid, seeking my cutlery! It's a perfect plan."
    j "啊哈！当然是从我的餐具包里顺手牵羊摸走的啊！他刚才早就摸清了门道、偷溜过来打我餐具的主意了！这计划简直天衣无缝。"

# game/script.rpy:6425
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_2782f793:

    # s "There are witnesses, y'know. I've been watching all of this. Somehow [name] doesn't seem the type."
    s "这儿可满桌都是人证，你少来这套。我方才可从头到尾全看在眼里。[name]横看竖看也绝不像是会干那种鬼鬼祟祟勾当的人。"

# game/script.rpy:6433
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_1495d623:

    # s "You know there are witnesses, right? We were having a perfectly civilized discussion 'bout vegetables when you started going off about your razors."
    s "你自个儿也晓得周围有证人吧？刚才你满嘴跑火车瞎吹剃刀大业的时候，我们可正斯斯文文、正经八百地商讨着蔬菜呢。"

# game/script.rpy:6435
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fb3d78cc:

    # s "So who do ya think anyone will believe, hmm? You or me."
    s "所以你说说看，真闹到大副跟前，谁会信你的鬼话，嗯？大伙会信你，还是信我？"

# game/script.rpy:6441
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_c13740b1:

    # s "There are witnesses, y'know. He's been sitting right here this whole time you were going on 'bout your razors and he's just as confused as anyone else."
    s "这儿可满是人证，你清楚得很。你刚才在那儿胡吹大气满嘴剃刀的时候，他就一直老老实实坐在这儿，跟我们大伙一样听得云里雾里一头雾水。"

# game/script.rpy:6448
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_06f6ceb0:

    # j "Alright, maybe it's not a perfect plan. But it's pretty good. AND."
    j "行吧，就算这主意算不上十全十美，但好歹也算个不错的话头了。而且——"

# game/script.rpy:6450
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_fc7dd331:

    # "He dismisses the whole side topic with a wave of his hand."
    "他满不在乎地把手一挥，索性将整段跑偏了的题外话一笔勾销抛到脑后。"

# game/script.rpy:6452
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b414f4d3:

    # j "That's not what we were talking about."
    j "咱们刚才扯的原本就不是这桩事！"

# game/script.rpy:6454
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_25e8dff6:

    # k "Right, we were talking about you getting your \"smackable\" little arse kicked for thievery."
    k "没错，咱们刚才聊的，原本是你小子这副“欠抽”的小屁股因为手脚不干净被揍得开花的事儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6456
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_52209c5b:

    # j "No, we weren't talking about that, either. Where was I?"
    j "少来，咱们刚才说的也不是这茬。我刚才到底说到哪截了？"

# game/script.rpy:6458
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_b28eb035:

    # j "Right! A whole night of stuffing ourselves with Pontefract cakes, the dried meat they'd stored... some pastries they'd already baked for the next day..."
    j "对！话说我们整整折腾了漫漫大半夜，拼命往肚里塞庞蒂弗拉克特甘草饼，还有他们存库的风干腌肉……还有他们提前为第二天出操备好的甜油糕点……"

# game/script.rpy:6460
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_0fda0b38:

    # j "It looked as if some rats had ransacked the place."
    j "那现场被我们祸害得，活像刚被成群结队的硕大耗子彻底洗劫过一样。"

# game/script.rpy:6476
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_88913aeb:

    # "Having finished his plate, Samuel lifts his hand up to interrupt again."
    "已经彻底解决完盘中餐的Samuel再次举起一只手，打断了话头。"

# game/script.rpy:6480
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_5144062b:

    # s "On the topic of foolish thing done at night. Sorry for butting in again, but I think I'll call it for today."
    s "既然聊到了大半夜犯傻干蠢事的由头……很抱歉又打断了你的兴致，不过我看今天就聊到这儿为止吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6484
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_187bb2df:

    # s "Morning watch tomorrow. And you two..."
    s "明儿一早轮到我值早更。还有你们俩小子……"

# game/script.rpy:6486
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_d87384b5:

    # "He looks at Julian and you, his muzzle turning to indicate his targets."
    "他转过头看向Julian和你，长长的吻部顺势一偏，指了指你们俩。"

# game/script.rpy:6488
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_9cc9d543:

    # s "...should do the same. I'd rather not have to pick up ya slack just because you barely slept two hours."
    s "……也最好赶紧回舱躺下。我可不想到了明天甲板干重活的时候，还得帮才睡了两个钟头的生瓜蛋子擦屁股替班。"

# game/script.rpy:6502
translate Chinese firstdinner_samuelandjulian_af64d1cb:

    # j "Oh. Yes, I guess it is a bit late. Goodnight, Sam."
    j "啊，也对。我看时辰确实也不早了。晚安啦，Sam。"

# game/script.rpy:6527
translate Chinese day1story_7facd73e:

    # "You watch as Samuel slips off the barrel he's sitting on. His shirt briefly catches, but nothing he can't fix with a quick tug and a pull to get everything back in place."
    "你看着 Samuel 从桶上溜下来。衬衫稍稍挂了一下，但他扯了扯就弄好了。"

# game/script.rpy:6546
translate Chinese day1story_d59b4f94:

    # "You shift your legs to the side so he can get off the barrel and squeeze past you. He's remarkably graceful about it."
    "你挪了挪腿，好让他从桶上下来，从你身边挤过去。身手还挺利索。"

# game/script.rpy:6548
translate Chinese day1story_dd5b535e:

    # "But the quarters are too close for you to avoid getting a face full of maned wolf tail fur tickling your nose."
    "地方太小，你还是免不了被鬃狼尾巴毛扫了一脸。"

# game/script.rpy:6564
translate Chinese day1story_020e2418:

    # "You shift your legs to the side so the maned wolf can get off the barrel and squeeze past you."
    "你挪了挪腿，好让那只鬃狼从桶上下来，从你身边挤过去。"

# game/script.rpy:6566
translate Chinese day1story_6b3a001d:

    # "Your reward for this is a face full of tail fur."
    "作为回报，你收获了一脸的尾巴毛。"

# game/script.rpy:6568
translate Chinese day1story_b526d63a:

    # j "What about you? You're staying?"
    j "你呢？你留下？"

# game/script.rpy:6570
translate Chinese day1story_bf6d15dc:

    # p "Sure. I mean, I wouldn't want to miss out on you getting your ass kicked."
    p "那当然。我可不想错过你挨揍。"

# game/script.rpy:6574
translate Chinese day1story_34fca133:

    # j "You don't even know if the story's headed in that direction, you know."
    j "你都不知道故事会不会往那方向发展，好吗。"

# game/script.rpy:6576
translate Chinese day1story_8a3592e1:

    # k "Sure, but you've built up the expectation now. Anything else would be... disappointing."
    k "话是这么说，但你已经把人胃口吊起来了。不然多没意思。"

# game/script.rpy:6580
translate Chinese day1story_9342a452:

    # j "You just want to hear about my suffering."
    j "你就想看我倒霉是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6582
translate Chinese day1story_a5ddbc5a:

    # "He grins—affably? It's hard for you to tell."
    "他咧嘴笑了笑——算得上和蔼吗？你一时还真有点吃不准。"

# game/script.rpy:6584
translate Chinese day1story_4762898c:

    # k "Maybe. G'night, though, Sam. Have a good one."
    k "也许吧。晚安啦，Sam。玩得开心。"

# game/script.rpy:6602
translate Chinese day1story_0cb2fb1e:

    # "With one last wave, the maned wolf turns away and disappears into the darker parts of the deck. You find yourself watching every moment."
    "那只鬃狼最后挥了挥手，转身消失在甲板的阴影里。你的视线却始终追随着他。"

# game/script.rpy:6607
translate Chinese day1story_91426e53:

    # "Perhaps that means following him for just a bit too long as he picks his way between the barrels and crates..."
    "或许...你盯着他穿梭于那些木桶和货箱之间，时间确实有点太久了。"

# game/script.rpy:6609
translate Chinese day1story_51303337:

    # "Maybe one day you'll learn to move that skillfully below decks?"
    "也许有一天，你也能像他一样，在甲板下行动得如此身手矫健？"

# game/script.rpy:6611
translate Chinese day1story_b5bb0975:

    # "That's surely as good an excuse as any for staring, you decide. And if the maned wolf does look rather... fetching... well, that's just a side benefit."
    "你暗想，这当然是个光明正大盯着他的理由！而且，如果这只鬃狼确实...挺迷人的...那就算是个额外的福利吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6625
translate Chinese day1story_5833d253:

    # "The others don't seem to have noticed, anyway."
    "反正其他人好像都没注意到。"

# game/script.rpy:6632
translate Chinese day1story_8c7674e9:

    # "With one last wave, the maned wolf turns away and disappears into the darker parts of the deck."
    "目送着那“鬃狼”挥了挥手，转身消失在甲板深处的光线昏暗处。"

# game/script.rpy:6638
translate Chinese day1story_85f60077:

    # j "Well. Anyway, you know, we didn't know the good stuff they had. I probably knew that officers ate better than everyone else, but..."
    j "哎，总之，你知道的，那时候我们哪知道他们藏了这么多好东西。我大概就知道当官的比我们吃得好，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:6640
translate Chinese day1story_d1fdb215:

    # "He shrugs, gesturing to the empty plates on the table before him."
    "他耸耸肩，指了指面前桌上空空如也的盘子。"

# game/script.rpy:6642
translate Chinese day1story_afbb25ca:

    # j "I would've just assumed like this. What kid thinks to go for wine? Or caviar? Anything like that."
    j "我当时就想着，肯定就是这样的。哪个小屁孩会想到去偷酒喝？偷鱼子酱吃？谁会想这些啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6646
translate Chinese day1story_b1135a6d:

    # j "Of course, if we had, we'd probably just have found them disgusting."
    j "当然，就算真让我们偷着了，估计也只会觉得难吃。"

# game/script.rpy:6648
translate Chinese day1story_db50c72e:

    # p "Pastry, though. Everyone goes for that."
    p "还是糕点好啊。谁都喜欢吃。"

# game/script.rpy:6652
translate Chinese day1story_09ff47c4:

    # j "Exactly. And we just fooled around, you know? Played siege with the meat and all?{w} Let me tell you, when you get slapped right in the face by a slobbery piece of pork..."
    j "就是说嘛。我们当时就是瞎玩，你懂吧？拿肉块当炮弹，玩攻城游戏！{w} 我跟你说，被一块黏糊糊的肥猪肉砸在脸上，那感觉……"

# game/script.rpy:6654
translate Chinese day1story_ca34df8d:

    # j "It is somehow the best thing in the world and the worst simultaneously."
    j "简直是世界上最棒又最糟糕的体验。"

# game/script.rpy:6660
translate Chinese day1story_30ec37ec:

    # t "Boy, you do have a way with words, don't you? Slobbery piece of pork..."
    t "哎呦，你还挺会说话的嘛？黏糊糊的肥猪肉……"

# game/script.rpy:6662
translate Chinese day1story_12e42e81:

    # "He interjects with a rather pained look."
    "他一脸痛苦地打断你。"

# game/script.rpy:6664
translate Chinese day1story_8e8b3023:

    # t "And ruining everyone's perfectly good food, while you were at it."
    t "你们还糟蹋了大家的好吃的！"

# game/script.rpy:6668
translate Chinese day1story_31e0b821:

    # j "Look, I know! Alright? I know, I know. But you're telling me you never did stupid shit when you were a kid?"
    j "好啦，我知道错了还不行吗！我知道，我知道。你敢说你小时候没干过傻事？"

# game/script.rpy:6670
translate Chinese day1story_8a9ce5ae:

    # t "I'll have you know I was innocence personified."
    t "我跟你说，我小时候就是天真无邪的化身。"

# game/script.rpy:6675
translate Chinese day1story_4a0bf3ed:

    # j "Oh, shut up. Innocent enough when you were asleep, maybe."
    j "别瞎扯了。你睡着的时候可能还算老实。"

# game/script.rpy:6677
translate Chinese day1story_83358d35:

    # t "Next to you? When I was awake, they tried to have me canonized."
    t "在你旁边的时候？我醒着的时候，他们都想直接给我封圣了。"

# game/script.rpy:6683
translate Chinese day1story_d063ac41:

    # k "Would you even fit in a cannon?"
    k "你能塞进炮筒里吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6687
translate Chinese day1story_bf8b5322:

    # j "Anyway!"
    j "算了算了！"

# game/script.rpy:6693
translate Chinese day1story_09b43ff5:

    # "Valiantly, he tries to resume control of his story."
    "他试图力挽狂澜，把话题拉回正轨。"

# game/script.rpy:6697
translate Chinese day1story_275736e4:

    # j "I did win, of course. So it wasn't all for naught."
    j "反正我最后赢了，所以也不是完全白玩。"

# game/script.rpy:6699
translate Chinese day1story_2a38866b:

    # p "Win? Your floppy meat was enough to knock them out?"
    p "赢了？就凭你那几块臭肉就把他们干趴下了？"

# game/script.rpy:6703
translate Chinese day1story_1934aa90:

    # j "What?!"
    j "哈？！"

# game/script.rpy:6707
translate Chinese day1story_167e0f6e:

    # j "No! I mean... yes. Yes, but not like... eugh. You lot ARE completely uncivilized. Sam was right to take leave."
    j "不是！我的意思是...是，是没错，但不是你想的那样...呃。你们这些人真是野蛮。Sam走得对。"

# game/script.rpy:6709
translate Chinese day1story_7d201b6b:

    # "Not that he isn't still smiling a bit, of course."
    "当然，他嘴角还是带着一丝笑意。"

# game/script.rpy:6713
translate Chinese day1story_7a01abf5:

    # j "It's how it all came crashing down on us, too. That bloody idiot! So what if I was a bit... alright, I can admit that. I was a bit mean."
    j "我们倒霉也是因为这件事。那个白痴！就算我当时是有点...好吧，我承认，我当时是有点过分。"

# game/script.rpy:6715
translate Chinese day1story_2de87760:

    # j "Couldn't stop teasing him all night long about how he lost."
    j "整个晚上都在不停地嘲笑他输了。"

# game/script.rpy:6717
translate Chinese day1story_676a5b7a:

    # k "To your floppy-"
    k "给你那软趴趴的小玩意儿——"

# game/script.rpy:6721
translate Chinese day1story_413756b4:

    # j "BUT STILL!" with hpunch
    j "不过话说回来！" with hpunch

# game/script.rpy:6725
translate Chinese day1story_62ac7c09:

    # "Raising his voice, he cuts the lynx off."
    "他提高了嗓门，打断了Lynx的话。"

# game/script.rpy:6727
translate Chinese day1story_705fe626:

    # j "We make it out, right? We're perfectly in the clear! And that idiot—oh, he just couldn't leave it alone, could he?"
    j "我们都逃出来了，对吧？本来早就彻底脱险、没事儿了！可那个蠢货——哎，他就是非要手欠惹是生非，你们说是不是？"

# game/script.rpy:6729
translate Chinese day1story_0068c95d:

    # p "He wanted a rematch and you tried breaking in again?"
    p "他是想找你再比一次，所以你又偷偷摸摸地溜进去了？"

# game/script.rpy:6733
translate Chinese day1story_890234b8:

    # j "No! Worse! He goes to his damned parents! THIS idiot, he thinks if he tells on me and Martin he'd get one over on us!"
    j "才不是！更糟糕！他居然跑去告他那该死的爹妈！这白痴以为告发我和Martin，就能阴我们一把！"

# game/script.rpy:6742
translate Chinese day1story_691b3579:

    # "Caught up in his excited shouting, Julian smacks his fist on the table hard." with vpunch
    "Julian越说越激动，狠狠一拳砸在桌子上。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:6746
translate Chinese day1story_bbfd90f5:

    # "Hard enough, in fact, to send the piece of wood jumping into the air, before it slides down onto your laps."
    "好家伙，直接把那块木板都给震飞起来了，然后骨碌碌地滚到咱们腿上。"

# game/script.rpy:6748
translate Chinese day1story_1440f1de:

    # "Fortunately, you've finished your dinner. Even more fortunately, he doesn't flip any of the cutlery into his audience."
    "幸好咱们吃饱喝足了。更走运的是，他没把刀叉什么的也给掀过来。"

# game/script.rpy:6750
translate Chinese day1story_4a443ba0:

    # j "Sorry."
    j "“对不起。”"

# game/script.rpy:6755
translate Chinese day1story_1eaa9600:

    # "You nod in response, and to acknowledge the hand he's laid on your shoulder before he sets the board back into place."
    "你点点头，算是回应，也接受了他搭在你肩膀上的手，然后他把棋盘摆回了原位。"

# game/script.rpy:6757
translate Chinese day1story_f21fe002:

    # p "I can tell this was very intense for you."
    p "我看得出来，这事儿对你来说刺激不小啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6767
translate Chinese day1story_691b3579_1:

    # "Caught up in his excited shouting, Julian smacks his fist on the table hard." with vpunch
    "Julian越说越激动，狠狠一拳砸在桌子上。" with vpunch

# game/script.rpy:6771
translate Chinese day1story_3a06c0fa:

    # "Hard enough, in fact, to send the piece of wood jumping into the air, then sliding into his lap."
    "好家伙，直接把那块木板都给震飞起来了，然后骨碌碌地滚到他自己腿上。"

# game/script.rpy:6777
translate Chinese day1story_18b7e005:

    # "Carefully, he sets it back into place, along with the—clean, fortunately—plates that ended up in his lap."
    "他小心翼翼地把木板重新架好，顺带放稳了刚才滑落到自己大腿上的餐盘——谢天谢地，盘子已经被吃得精光了。"

# game/script.rpy:6781
translate Chinese day1story_e34a74ed:

    # j "...Oops. Got a bit carried away."
    j "哎哟……有点得意忘形了。"

# game/script.rpy:6785
translate Chinese day1story_04851484:

    # j "The thing of it is, he was missing all night, too! I mean, did he think his parents were stupid? Obviously, they were going to figure out he must've been there, too."
    j "关键是，他那天晚上也压根不在家啊！他是觉得他爹妈是傻子吗？肯定一下就猜到他也在场了啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6787
translate Chinese day1story_c097b847:

    # t "So is THIS the part where you get your ass beaten?"
    t "接下来是不是该轮到你屁股开花了？"

# game/script.rpy:6789
translate Chinese day1story_32d44bd4:

    # "He lifts his chin, looking as proud and stoic as possible."
    "他下巴一抬，摆出一副尽可能骄傲又坚忍的表情。"

# game/script.rpy:6791
translate Chinese day1story_b9833ad1:

    # "He even pushes his chest out to complete the picture, which mostly works."
    "他甚至还挺了挺胸膛，更像那么回事了。"

# game/script.rpy:6795
translate Chinese day1story_f5084f8a:

    # j "I will have YOU sorry lot know, as a matter of fact..."
    j "我要让你们这群没见识的家伙知道，实际上……"

# game/script.rpy:6797
translate Chinese day1story_b6a10273:

    # j "As a matter or fact, I—through my quick thinking and cunning, which you have all come to appreciate through your time knowing me..."
    j "事实上，在下——凭借着过人的机敏与狡黠智慧，想必各位在与我相识的这段时日里早已深有体会……"

# game/script.rpy:6799
translate Chinese day1story_0225a8e6:

    # k "Got your ass beat?"
    k "结果还不是被人揍了？"

# game/script.rpy:6803
translate Chinese day1story_aa35ce57:

    # "Julian just grins."
    "Julian只是咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:6807
translate Chinese day1story_0125fc27:

    # j "To a proper, shining red, of course."
    j "屁股蛋子被打得通红发亮！"

# game/script.rpy:6813
translate Chinese day1story_e265569f:

    # "Both Konrad and Torres begin to clap their appreciation. Less so about the story, you gather, than about finally hearing the details of the lizard's punishment."
    "Konrad和Torres开始鼓掌叫好。我看他们与其说是赞赏这个故事，倒不如说是终于听到了lizard倒霉的细节，乐开了花。"

# game/script.rpy:6815
translate Chinese day1story_34a3e331:

    # "After a moment, you join in, too. Julian takes it all in stride, providing further details."
    "过了一会儿，你也跟着鼓起掌来。Julian倒也处之泰然，还绘声绘色地补充了一些细节。"

# game/script.rpy:6817
translate Chinese day1story_e17bdd93:

    # j "I think he figured by the time I was old enough to enlist it would still be less comfortable sitting down than standing at attention."
    j "我估计他是觉得等我到了参军的年纪，坐着肯定比立正站着还难受。"

# game/script.rpy:6821
translate Chinese day1story_4bc3164a:

    # k "Ah, there we go. That's the part we've been waiting for."
    k "哎，这才对嘛。这才是咱们想听的。"

# game/script.rpy:6825
translate Chinese day1story_6c754cde:

    # t "I would've asked for my money back, otherwise."
    t "不然我可要退钱了啊。"

# game/script.rpy:6829
translate Chinese day1story_01eaa11b:

    # j "What money? I gave you my wit and witticism—dinner and a show! Not a single ha'penny did I ask of you, though it would've been my right! Not one!"
    j "什么钱？我给你们献上了我的满腹机智与连珠妙语——有吃有喝还附带精彩好戏！我可连半个便士都没找你们收过，尽管那是我的合法报酬！一个子儿都没要！"
    # 译注：ha'penny指半便士（英国传统硬币面额）。

# game/script.rpy:6831
translate Chinese day1story_fa0a45d3:

    # t "Time. I paid with time, which I will never get back."
    t "时间啊。我付出了时间，这可是再也回不来的。"

# game/script.rpy:6837
translate Chinese day1story_1c3d96f0:

    # j "Oh? You'd rather be off sleeping with Samuel? Well, we'll see if I deign to offer you these morsels next time, won't we."
    j "哦？你倒宁愿去和Samuel鬼混？行啊，咱们走着瞧，看我下次还赏不赏你点吃的！"

# game/script.rpy:6845
translate Chinese day1story_74ed9875:

    # j "Well, I think that's been quite enough from these ruffians. We shall be off, Mr. [family_name], shall we not?"
    j "我说，让这些无赖胡咧咧够久了。[family_name]先生，咱们该走了，您说呢？"

# game/script.rpy:6847
translate Chinese day1story_7c313ae2:

    # "He has affected an excruciatingly posh accent for the act. With a grin, you do your best to approximate one, too."
    "这家伙为了演戏，捏着嗓子装出一口要人命的贵族腔。你咧嘴一笑，也努力学着他的腔调。"

# game/script.rpy:6849
translate Chinese day1story_a1296315:

    # p "Very good, sir. Do you desire your utensil back?"
    p "说得好，先生。您还要您的餐具吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6851
translate Chinese day1story_eaf4ffc0:

    # "He takes it from you, replacing it crisply in his pocket."
    "他接过餐具，干脆利落地塞回了自己的口袋。"

# game/script.rpy:6855
translate Chinese day1story_27d6fa7a:

    # j "Quite right. And... be a dear, would you?"
    j "没错。而且... 帮个忙，成吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6868
translate Chinese day1story_381b83e0:

    # "You had already started to rise, and find Julian's arm extended towards you, a wry smile writ across his features."
    "你刚想起身，就看到Julian朝你伸出手臂，脸上挂着一丝意味难明的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:6870
translate Chinese day1story_c8a96e2f:

    # j "Help these old bones up?"
    j "扶我这把老骨头起来呗？"

# game/script.rpy:6872
translate Chinese day1story_8711b4b9:

    # p "Aren't you younger than I am?"
    p "你不是比我还年轻吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6878
translate Chinese day1story_205e72bd:

    # "Even still, you take his hand, pulling him up from the box."
    "嘴上这么说，你还是握住他的手，把他从箱子上拉了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:6880
translate Chinese day1story_c7002603:

    # j "Am I? I didn't even realize! It's all this time I have to spend among these tatterdemalions..."
    j "是吗？我都忘了！都怪我得和这些阿猫阿狗混在一起……"

# game/script.rpy:6882
translate Chinese day1story_89968fdf:

    # k "...I'm from Emden. I don't even know where that is."
    k "...我老家是Emden的。我压根儿不知道那地儿在哪儿。"

# game/script.rpy:6884
translate Chinese day1story_fde579fa:

    # j "Yes, yes. And you're both beautiful, if a challenging audience..."
    j "是是是。而且你们都很漂亮，就是观众有点难伺候……"

# game/script.rpy:6886
translate Chinese day1story_12859850:

    # t "You didn't get punched again, did you?"
    t "你没又挨揍了吧？"

# game/script.rpy:6890
translate Chinese day1story_4254ffdc:

    # "At least it seems fairly good natured."
    "看起来还算友善。"

# game/script.rpy:6894
translate Chinese day1story_66d9cced:

    # t "Have a nice rest, you two."
    t "祝你们俩好好休息。"

# game/script.rpy:6904
translate Chinese day1story_69e1ecd3:

    # k "Aye. And good luck with your real first day tomorrow."
    k "嗯。祝你明天第一天上工一切顺利。"

# game/script.rpy:6906
translate Chinese day1story_b09a102e:

    # p "Thank you, and thanks for the warm welcome. I'll see you around."
    p "谢谢，也谢谢你们的热情欢迎。回头见。"

# game/script.rpy:6916
translate Chinese day1story_df4c1c44:

    # p "You're ready, Julian?"
    p "Julian，你准备好了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:6918
translate Chinese day1story_cfbe3180:

    # j "Sure thing, fuzz-tail."
    j "没问题，毛尾巴。"

# game/script.rpy:6931
translate Chinese day1story_66c29df7:

    # "With that, he leads the two of you back in the direction Samuel had gone."
    "他说着，就领着你们俩朝Samuel离开的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:6933
translate Chinese day1story_16677c15:

    # j "They're not so bad, really. Anyhow! Remind me tomorrow and I'll take you to see the purser. Get you kitted out and all."
    j "他们其实人还行。对了！明天记得提醒我，我带你去见事务长，把你的行头都领了。"

# game/script.rpy:6939
translate Chinese day1story_eb598a8b:

    # p "Oh, I'd appreciate that a great deal."
    p "哦，那真是太感谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:6941
translate Chinese day1story_abb60285:

    # j "Ah, it would be my pleasure! Everyone's on a ship for the first time once, right? It's nice to feel like I'm not just a pretty face..."
    j "哎呀，我很乐意效劳！谁不是第一次上船啊，是吧？总感觉自己不只是个好看的摆设……"

# game/script.rpy:6947
translate Chinese day1story_c28a4a65:

    # j "For now, I suppose I should be off."
    j "时候不早了，我得走了。"

# game/script.rpy:6949
translate Chinese day1story_53f6a887:

    # "He looks to you, searching for your assent."
    "他看着你，似乎在等你的同意。"

# game/script.rpy:6951
translate Chinese day1story_287e9248:

    # p "That's probably for the best, yes."
    p "应该是这样，走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:6964
translate Chinese day1story_8cb5a6f6:

    # "You lift yourself up from the small box you've been sitting on, stretching your legs to work some feeling back into your limbs."
    "你从一直坐着的小箱子上撑起身子，伸展双腿，让血液活络活络。"

# game/script.rpy:6970
translate Chinese day1story_0f1aa64d:

    # "Julian stands up next, using Torres's knee to help him."
    "Julian也跟着站起来，还扶着Torres的膝盖借力。"

# game/script.rpy:6980
translate Chinese day1story_037e88ea:

    # t "You two have a nice night, then. It was a pleasure."
    t "那祝你们俩晚上愉快。很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:6982
translate Chinese day1story_61428b10:

    # k "Yeah. See you on watch tomorrow."
    k "好嘞。明天值班见。"

# game/script.rpy:6984
translate Chinese day1story_ce218bc8:

    # p "Thank you. And thanks for the warm welcome."
    p "谢谢。也感谢你们这么热情地欢迎我。"

# game/script.rpy:6994
translate Chinese day1story_f651293e:

    # "Julian takes his fork back from you before you both make your way in the direction Samuel had gone."
    "你们正要朝 Samuel 离开的方向走，Julian 先你一步拿回了他的叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:7007
translate Chinese day1story_e1ca1ae1:

    # j "Remind me tomorrow and I'll take you to see the purser. Get you kitted out and all."
    j "明天记得提醒我，我带你去找事务长，给你置办齐全了。"

# game/script.rpy:7009
translate Chinese day1story_eb598a8b_1:

    # p "Oh, I'd appreciate that a great deal."
    p "哦，那真是太感谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:7015
translate Chinese day1story_a3350551:

    # j "Ah, no worries. We were all new once, weren't we?"
    j "啊，没事儿。谁还不是从新来的过来的呢，是不是？"

# game/script.rpy:7021
translate Chinese day1story_bf26868f:

    # j "No sense wasting any more of our evening with these ruffians, wouldn't you agree? We shall be off."
    j "和这些地痞流氓浪费时间也没什么意思，你说对吧？我们走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7023
translate Chinese day1story_ad3a1e3f:

    # "He has affected an excruciatingly posh accent for the act, stiffening himself up haughtily. You try your best at your own."
    "他为了装样子，故意拿腔拿调地模仿着上流社会的口音，还傲慢地挺直了腰板。你也尽力学着他的样子。"

# game/script.rpy:7025
translate Chinese day1story_da2de855:

    # p "Very good, sir. Your utensils, sir."
    p "好的，先生。您的餐具，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:7038
translate Chinese day1story_481b64cd:

    # "He takes the fork, and crisply slips into his pockets it before getting to his feet. You rise with him."
    "他接过叉子，麻利地塞进口袋里，然后站起身。你也跟着站起来。"

# game/script.rpy:7042
translate Chinese day1story_561cd90f:

    # j "I bid you good day."
    j "祝你今天愉快。"

# game/script.rpy:7044
translate Chinese day1story_0972e645:

    # "Torres watches the whole process with a look somewhere between amusement and derision."
    "Torres 一直看着整个过程，脸上挂着一丝好笑又有点嘲讽的表情。"

# game/script.rpy:7055
translate Chinese day1story_5c39f2ff:

    # t "Uh huh. You and Lord Julian have a nice evening, [name]."
    t "嗯哼。你和 Julian 爵士晚上愉快，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:7057
translate Chinese day1story_93609948:

    # k "Yeah. It was a pleasure. Nice meeting you and all."
    k "是的。我也很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:7059
translate Chinese day1story_2a809109:

    # p "Likewise. I appreciate the warm welcome. I guess I'll be seeing you around?"
    p "彼此彼此。感谢你们这么热情地欢迎我。我想我之后应该经常能见到你们吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7061
translate Chinese day1story_23d54a67:

    # k "Not many places to go, now, are there?"
    k "也没几个地方能去，不是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7071
translate Chinese day1story_5f0e0411:

    # "Julian leads the two of you back in the direction Samuel had gone."
    "Julian 带着你们俩朝 Samuel 离开的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:7084
translate Chinese day1story_16677c15_1:

    # j "They're not so bad, really. Anyhow! Remind me tomorrow and I'll take you to see the purser. Get you kitted out and all."
    j "他们其实人还行。对了！明天记得提醒我，我带你去见事务长，把你的行头都领了。"

# game/script.rpy:7086
translate Chinese day1story_b15906bd:

    # p "Oh, I'd appreciate that great deal."
    p "哦，那真是太感谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:7092
translate Chinese day1story_de0ef7a0:

    # j "Ah, no worries. Everyone has to be new once. Even if I only have seniority by a few hours..."
    j "啊，没事儿。谁都有第一次嘛。就算我只比你们早来几个小时……"

# game/script.rpy:7100
translate Chinese day1story_80f0dda1:

    # j "Well, I think that's been quite enough from these ruffians. Shall we away, Mr. [family_name]?"
    j "好了，我想和这些家伙说得也够多了。我们走吧，[family_name] 先生？"

# game/script.rpy:7102
translate Chinese day1story_4560773e:

    # "How late has it gotten? You think about what Samuel said, and about the work that lies before you in the morning."
    "已经这么晚了吗？你想起 Samuel 跟你说的话，还有明天一早就要开始干的活。"

# game/script.rpy:7104
translate Chinese day1story_a0618804:

    # p "We shall definitely \"away,\" yes."
    p "必须得“走”了，是吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7106
translate Chinese day1story_e06c9b73:

    # j "Very well. My fork, squire."
    j "好的。我的叉子呢，侍从。"

# game/script.rpy:7108
translate Chinese day1story_57ee5282:

    # "Still in a playful mood, he's affected an excruciatingly posh accent for the act. But his mood is infectious; you do your best to repay the favor, as you hand him back the fork."
    "他兴致很高，为了逗乐还故意拿腔拿调地模仿着上流社会的口音。他的好心情也感染了你，你笑着把叉子递还给他。"

# game/script.rpy:7110
translate Chinese day1story_ecee2dc9:

    # p "Here you are, sir."
    p "给您，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:7123
translate Chinese day1story_d58eef6b:

    # "You slide off the barrel you were sitting on, and present him the implement ceremoniously."
    "你从坐着的桶上滑下来，像举行仪式一样，郑重其事地把叉子递给他。"

# game/script.rpy:7125
translate Chinese day1story_7a8d54fa:

    # "Torres does not seem particularly impressed, although his sigh doesn't suggest too much genuine frustration."
    "Torres 看起来并没有觉得多有趣，不过他的叹气听起来也不是真的有多无奈。"

# game/script.rpy:7135
translate Chinese day1story_c957dee1:

    # t "This is going to be a long trip. Well, take care of Lord Julian, [name]. It was a pleasure."
    t "这趟航行看来会很长。好吧，[name]，照顾好 Julian 爵士。很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:7137
translate Chinese day1story_2bb37642:

    # k "Yeah. And if he tries to steal anything, you know what to do."
    k "好嘞。要是他敢偷东西，你知道该怎么办。"

# game/script.rpy:7141
translate Chinese day1story_744e9cdf:

    # "You take that in good fun—at least you seem to be fitting in with the crew."
    "你对这番打趣一笑了之——至少眼下看来，你似乎挺合得来，正在逐渐融入这帮船员里头。"

# game/script.rpy:7143
translate Chinese day1story_69e08d62:

    # p "I'll do my best. Thank you for the warm welcome. I suppose I'll be seeing you around. You're ready, Julian?"
    p "我会尽力的，多谢你们的热情款待。我想之后总有机会再见的。你准备好了吗，Julian？"

# game/script.rpy:7145
translate Chinese day1story_2247b799:

    # "He, like you, has been stretching, trying to work some feeling back into his legs. But he nods."
    "他和你一样，一直在伸展身体，想让腿脚恢复知觉。然后他点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:7149
translate Chinese day1story_72a80d33:

    # j "Quite, fuzz-tail. Lead on."
    j "好嘞，毛绒尾巴，带路吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7162
translate Chinese day1story_66c29df7_1:

    # "With that, he leads the two of you back in the direction Samuel had gone."
    "他说着，就领着你们俩朝Samuel离开的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:7167
translate Chinese day1story_874ccfc3:

    # j "They're not so bad, really. Not Samuel, either, despite some of his quirks."
    j "其实他们人还不错，Samuel 也一样，虽然是有些怪脾气。"

# game/script.rpy:7169
translate Chinese day1story_cb24df21:

    # "Indeed, you do rather find you're coming to enjoy your time spent with the two."
    "说真的，你会发现你越来越喜欢和我们在一起的时光。"

# game/script.rpy:7171
translate Chinese day1story_5525c5e0:

    # p "It's true. You're good company."
    p "没错，你人挺好的。"

# game/script.rpy:7175
translate Chinese day1story_7b4672b9:

    # j "No need to go that far."
    j "没必要这么说。"

# game/script.rpy:7181
translate Chinese day1story_03adf298:

    # j "Anyhow! Remind me tomorrow and I'll take you to see the purser. Get you kitted out and all."
    j "总之，明儿个记得提醒我，我带你去见事务长，把你的行头都领了。"

# game/script.rpy:7183
translate Chinese day1story_eb598a8b_2:

    # p "Oh, I'd appreciate that a great deal."
    p "哦，那真是太感谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:7185
translate Chinese day1story_abb60285_1:

    # j "Ah, it would be my pleasure! Everyone's on a ship for the first time once, right? It's nice to feel like I'm not just a pretty face..."
    j "哎呀，我很乐意效劳！谁不是第一次上船啊，是吧？总感觉自己不只是个好看的摆设……"

# game/script.rpy:7191
translate Chinese day1story_2a48f6fc:

    # j "Well, as fun as all this has been, we shouldn't tarry too much longer. What do you say, [name]?"
    j "好了，虽然聊得很开心，不过我们也不该再耽搁下去了。[name]，你说呢？"

# game/script.rpy:7193
translate Chinese day1story_5c421bc0:

    # "You wonder what time it is, thinking about what Samuel said a little guiltily."
    "你有点内疚地想着Samuel说的话，想知道现在几点了。"

# game/script.rpy:7195
translate Chinese day1story_bffe0da5:

    # p "Ah... I guess we should be going, yes..."
    p "啊……我想我们是该走了……"

# game/script.rpy:7208
translate Chinese day1story_f00010a4:

    # "You slide off the barrel you were sitting on, and stretch your back after sitting there."
    "你从坐着的桶上下来，伸了个懒腰，刚才一直坐在那儿，有点腰酸背痛。"

# game/script.rpy:7210
translate Chinese day1story_63433a6c:

    # "You are becoming increasingly aware of how cramped the inside of a sailing ship truly is."
    "你越来越意识到，这帆船里面的空间是真的狭窄。"

# game/script.rpy:7220
translate Chinese day1story_303806a6:

    # t "Probably not a bad idea. You two have a nice rest, then. It was a pleasure."
    t "这主意不错。那你们俩就好好休息吧，很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:7222
translate Chinese day1story_f825e30f:

    # k "Yeah. Good meeting you, [name]. You too, I guess, Jules."
    k "是啊，很高兴认识你，[name]，还有你，Jules。"

# game/script.rpy:7226
translate Chinese day1story_4af0398c:

    # j "So generous."
    j "真是太慷慨了。"

# game/script.rpy:7228
translate Chinese day1story_cf27f55b:

    # "The lizard drawls, waiting for your to get some feeling back into your legs."
    "蜥蜴慢吞吞地说，等你腿脚缓过来了再说。"

# game/script.rpy:7230
translate Chinese day1story_5a81fcda:

    # p "I mean it, too. Thank you for the warm welcome. You're ready, Julian?"
    p "我说的也是真心话。多谢你们的热情款待。你准备好了吗，Julian？"

# game/script.rpy:7234
translate Chinese day1story_471f3410:

    # j "If you are, yes."
    j "如果你准备好了，那就走吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7247
translate Chinese day1story_bed78306:

    # "You hand his fork back to him, as the two of you make your way back in the direction Samuel headed."
    "你把叉子还给他，你们两个便朝着Samuel离开的方向走去。"

# game/script.rpy:7252
translate Chinese day1story_6e75c23d:

    # p "And thank you for this. That was generous, sincerely."
    p "也谢谢你。你真是太慷慨了，真心感谢。"

# game/script.rpy:7258
translate Chinese day1story_9b5275d9:

    # j "Don't mention it. Remind me tomorrow and I'll take you to see the purser. Get you kitted out and all."
    j "别客气。明儿个记得提醒我，我带你去见事务长，把你的行头都领了。"

# game/script.rpy:7260
translate Chinese day1story_29a5400b:

    # p "Oh, I'd appreciate that great deal"
    p "哦，那真是太感谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:7262
translate Chinese day1story_a3350551_1:

    # j "Ah, no worries. We were all new once, weren't we?"
    j "啊，没事儿。谁还不是从新来的过来的呢，是不是？"

# game/script.rpy:7270
translate Chinese day1story_7368f3f1:

    # "Your steps gradually take you past other little groups and to the side of the ship where your sleeping area is."
    "你们慢慢走过其他几堆人，来到了船舷边，那里是你们的休息区。"

# game/script.rpy:7272
translate Chinese day1story_20612297:

    # j "You know your way around yet?"
    j "你认得路了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7274
translate Chinese day1story_eb5fa8fc:

    # p "No, of course not. But it's... over by the third post, right? That's ours?"
    p "还没呢，不过……是在第三根柱子那边，对吧？是我们的位置吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7276
translate Chinese day1story_44d92441:

    # j "Exactly. 36 and 37."
    j "没错，36号和37号。"

# game/script.rpy:7278
translate Chinese day1story_fbacb161:

    # p "Can I ask you a question? How are you finding it so far?"
    p "我可以问你个问题吗？到目前为止，你感觉怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:7282
translate Chinese day1story_61bb6c3f:

    # j "What do you mean?"
    j "你这话什么意思？"

# game/script.rpy:7284
translate Chinese day1story_22629e07:

    # p "Well... everything. Today, I mean."
    p "嗯……所有的一切。我是说今天发生的事情。"

# game/script.rpy:7293
translate Chinese day1story_a988b551:

    # "He reaches behind one of the crates, fishing out some sturdy white linen hammocks."
    "他伸手到其中一个板条箱后面，摸出几张结实的白色亚麻吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:7295
translate Chinese day1story_916fafab:

    # j "\"Everything,\" that's very broad..."
    j "“一切”，这范围也太宽泛了吧……"

# game/script.rpy:7302
translate Chinese day1story_eb4e0e48:

    # "You watch as he sorts the hammock material. Setting one aside, he holds the other out to you, keeping his grasp on the near end."
    "你看着他摆弄着吊床的布料。把其中一张放到一边，他抓住另一张的一头，递给你。"

# game/script.rpy:7308
translate Chinese day1story_6191f24c:

    # "He begins to attach his side on one of the anchor points on the beams above. You try to think of a way to clarify your thoughts."
    "他开始把吊床的一侧固定到上方横梁的锚点上。你绞尽脑汁，想该怎么把想法说清楚。"

# game/script.rpy:7310
translate Chinese day1story_62c4d324:

    # p "This is my first time on a ship. My first time away from home, for that matter. You know?"
    p "这是我头一回上船。说起来，也是我头一回离家。你明白吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7316
translate Chinese day1story_b3021f44:

    # j "Oh! It's definitely going better than I expected. Thanks to you."
    j "哦！比我想象的顺利多了。多亏了你。"

# game/script.rpy:7318
translate Chinese day1story_dad20c63:

    # p "Me? How do you figure?"
    p "我？你从哪儿看出来的？"

# game/script.rpy:7322
translate Chinese day1story_0ed73176:

    # "He smiles at you. Anyone else might've missed it, in this dark corner of the Conway's decks, but your feline eyes are keen enough to catch the faint glint of his grin."
    "他朝你笑了笑。Conway号甲板的这个角落昏暗得很，换了别人可能根本注意不到，但你那双猫眼可是尖得很，一下就捕捉到了他嘴角那抹淡淡的笑意。"

# game/script.rpy:7324
translate Chinese day1story_bc0959c1:

    # j "That being around you is a pretty good time. I didn't know what to expect of this ship either, of course."
    j "和你在一起感觉挺好的。当然，我对这艘船也没什么期待。"

# game/script.rpy:7326
translate Chinese day1story_ded34170:

    # "You watch as he secures one end of the hammock to the pegs above, and follow suit as best you can."
    "你看着他把吊床的一头固定在上面的木钉上，也尽力模仿着他的动作。"

# game/script.rpy:7330
translate Chinese day1story_4d683537:

    # j "I've been on ships before, sure. I knew to bring a mess kit BEFORE I got to the mess."
    j "我以前当然上过船。还没到餐厅，我就知道要带上餐具。"

# game/script.rpy:7332
translate Chinese day1story_c84d069d:

    # "He snickers—quietly, mindful of the other sleeping sailors around."
    "他噗嗤低笑了一声——嗓音压得很低，显然是顾及到周围正在酣睡的其他水手。"

# game/script.rpy:7334
translate Chinese day1story_f00d8238:

    # j "But I've not tried to fit in with the crew before. It's nice to have a... partner, of sorts."
    j "而且我以前也没试着融入船员。有个……伙伴，感觉还真不错。"

# game/script.rpy:7336
translate Chinese day1story_5a3762d6:

    # p "Oh! I, uh—well, thank you."
    p "哦！我，呃——好吧，多谢你啦。"

# game/script.rpy:7340
translate Chinese day1story_dcc9cca1:

    # "Between the two of you, you're quickly able to fasten the second hammock to the other spot intended for one. It goes a bit easier this time."
    "你们俩一起动手，很快就把第二张吊床固定到了预定的位置上。这次顺手多了。"

# game/script.rpy:7342
translate Chinese day1story_f0cc7d06:

    # "Julian is certainly more skilled with his fingers than you are, even if he's never been a proper sailor. But you think you'll be able to learn."
    "即使Julian没当过一天正经水手，他的手也比你巧多了。不过你相信自己能学会的。"

# game/script.rpy:7350
translate Chinese day1story_4a595d8c:

    # "With the two hammocks set up, the two of you bid each other \"good night\" and get into them..."
    "搭好吊床后，你们互相道了声“晚安”，然后就钻了进去……"

# game/script.rpy:7352
translate Chinese day1story_bb8fbec0:

    # "Or, at least, that would be the plan."
    "至少，计划是这样的。"

# game/script.rpy:7354
translate Chinese day1story_4b2e8a0c:

    # "You've never actually used a hammock before. The constant rocking of the boat, which you could ignore at dinner, is making it even more difficult to maneuver yourself."
    "你其实从来没用过吊床。白天的晚饭时还没什么感觉，现在船不停地摇晃着，让你更难找到平衡。"

# game/script.rpy:7358
translate Chinese day1story_8a0b04ab:

    # j "Never used one of these, huh?"
    j "没用过这玩意儿，嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:7360
translate Chinese day1story_46c9dee8:

    # p "Surprised?"
    p "很惊讶？"

# game/script.rpy:7362
translate Chinese day1story_54086b90:

    # "You ask, after your third attempt to pull yourself into the hammock. It's too high and cramped for you to make progress, vaunted feline agility be damned."
    "试了三次都没能爬上吊床，你忍不住问道。这玩意儿又高又挤，就算你有再敏捷的身手也白搭，什么猫的敏捷，都见鬼去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7366
translate Chinese day1story_c88d7869:

    # j "Don't worry, it's really not too difficult at all. I can show you."
    j "别担心，其实一点都不难。我可以教你。"

# game/script.rpy:7372
translate Chinese day1story_cbd5dbdc:

    # "He makes his way past the wooden pillar, and gently nudges you towards the hammock."
    "他绕过木柱，轻轻地把你往吊床边上推。"

# game/script.rpy:7374
translate Chinese day1story_4cf8a334:

    # j "You just hold on here and here."
    j "你只要抓住这里，还有这里。"

# game/script.rpy:7376
translate Chinese day1story_38d46e52:

    # p "Where and..."
    p "哪……还有……"

# game/script.rpy:7382
translate Chinese day1story_3d838a86:

    # "The lizard guides you by the wrists to wrap your arms into the sides of the hammock."
    "那个蜥蜴抓住你的手腕，引导你把胳膊缠在吊床的边上。"

# game/script.rpy:7384
translate Chinese day1story_16ce57ba:

    # j "Got it? Now, just up with your legs. Put them in like that, and then you just rotate your body around."
    j "明白了吗？现在，抬起你的腿。像这样放进去，然后转动你的身体就行了。"

# game/script.rpy:7386
translate Chinese day1story_dc850e88:

    # p "You make this sound very easy..."
    p "你说得倒轻巧……"

# game/script.rpy:7390
translate Chinese day1story_f6f9cac8:

    # "You swear you can almost hear him giggle."
    "你敢肯定自己都快听到他偷偷笑出声了。"

# game/script.rpy:7394
translate Chinese day1story_f8f04a17:

    # j "Alright, then. I'll keep you steady. Just try for me?"
    j "行吧，我扶着你。就当帮我个忙，试试？"

# game/script.rpy:7398
translate Chinese day1story_23868474:

    # "You do as you're told, and roll with Julian's hand holding onto your linen-wrapped form."
    "你听他的，配合着 Julian，让他扶着你那裹着亚麻布的身子。"

# game/script.rpy:7400
translate Chinese day1story_d2627f10:

    # "Sure enough, once you cross the point of no return, the tension of the hammock does the rest. You flip over into it, if not particularly gracefully."
    "果不其然，一旦过了那道坎儿，吊床的弹性就帮你搞定了剩下的。你翻了个身，进了吊床，虽然姿势不怎么好看。"

# game/script.rpy:7404
translate Chinese day1story_6ef565d1:

    # j "See? Not so hard."
    j "看？没那么难吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7410
translate Chinese day1story_477beb67:

    # "He delivers a few pats to your back for a job well done, and makes his way back to his own sleeping space."
    "他拍拍你的背，夸你做得不错，然后就回自己的地儿睡觉去了。"

# game/script.rpy:7412
translate Chinese day1story_dc2faaa7:

    # p "Once you know, I guess.{w} You're more of an old salt than you let on."
    p "看来你上手挺快嘛。{w} 比你表现出来的像个老水手多了。"

# game/script.rpy:7414
translate Chinese day1story_8dfb48a7:

    # j "Flattery won't get you anywhere you haven't already gotten."
    j "拍马屁没用，你想要的好处都到手了。"

# game/script.rpy:7418
translate Chinese day1story_1f19dd0f:

    # j "You'll learn, though, same as me!"
    j "不过，你会学到的，和我一样！"

# game/script.rpy:7420
translate Chinese day1story_4cecdee6:

    # p "I know, I know. Thank you, Jules."
    p "我知道，我知道。谢谢你，Jules。"

# game/script.rpy:7422
translate Chinese day1story_641ae468:

    # j "No problem, [name]. Good night for real, now, alright? See you tomorrow..."
    j "没问题，[name]。现在真的晚安了，好吗？明天见……"

# game/script.rpy:7424
translate Chinese day1story_3a8252fe:

    # "You have no idea how late it is, but the work of the first day catches up to you swiftly. No sooner have you started trying to pay attention to the gentle swaying of the deck above you, than you're already asleep."
    "你也不知道现在几点了，第一天的活儿干下来，疲惫感一下子就涌上来了。你刚想感受一下头顶上甲板的轻微摇晃，就直接睡过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:7434
translate Chinese day1story_20519643:

    # j "Oh. Yes, I see. I would say that honestly, it's going better than I expected."
    j "哦，我明白了。说实话，比我想的要好多了。"

# game/script.rpy:7436
translate Chinese day1story_4a3119d0:

    # p "Better than expected?"
    p "比预期的好？"

# game/script.rpy:7438
translate Chinese day1story_a279d5a7:

    # "You're not sure what that means—the Conway has been at sea for less than a full day, after all."
    "你吃不准这话到底是什么意思——毕竟，Conway号出海航行统共也还不到一整天呢。"

# game/script.rpy:7440
translate Chinese day1story_4ad4433b:

    # j "It just wasn't as bad as I thought it would be."
    j "就是没我想的那么糟糕。"

# game/script.rpy:7444
translate Chinese day1story_0777b170:

    # j "But then again, all we did today was piss around, right? Anyone could do that."
    j "不过话说回来，咱们今天不就是瞎混了一天吗？谁都能干。"

# game/script.rpy:7446
translate Chinese day1story_5e0ff1e4:

    # "He helps you spread out the second hammock, fastening it to the other spot. Julian does his side, and you tie the knot on yours."
    "他帮你展开第二个吊床，把它固定在另一个地方。Julian 固定他那边，你系好你这边的结。"

# game/script.rpy:7448
translate Chinese day1story_05e9f3d2:

    # p "But that must help, too."
    p "不过，这应该也有点用吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7450
translate Chinese day1story_4fe5a2c0:

    # "When he doesn't answer, you keep going."
    "当他不回答时，你继续说。"

# game/script.rpy:7454
translate Chinese day1story_367d8089:

    # p "Growing up in a Navy family, and all that. You're going to do just fine with anything that isn't just \"pissing around.\""
    p "毕竟是在海军家庭长大的嘛。只要不是‘瞎混’，你肯定没问题。"

# game/script.rpy:7456
translate Chinese day1story_1c086c9c:

    # j "Maybe you're right."
    j "也许你是对的。"

# game/script.rpy:7458
translate Chinese day1story_909d0f0d:

    # p "I'm sure. I haven't even gotten my feet wet before. I'm just happy dinner's staying down."
    p "那是，我之前都没出过海。能不吐出来就谢天谢地了。"

# game/script.rpy:7462
translate Chinese day1story_3542829f:

    # "Julian shrugs without another word, climbing into his hammock to get ready for the night."
    "Julian 没有说一句话就耸耸肩，爬进他的吊床，准备睡觉。"

# game/script.rpy:7464
translate Chinese day1story_793013d1:

    # "He's mostly just a black shape, moving in the darkness."
    "他基本上只是一个黑色的形状，在黑暗中移动。"

# game/script.rpy:7466
translate Chinese day1story_37d5b30a:

    # "The feeble light from the commons area is barely enough for that. You're happy that your feline eyes give you a little bit of an edge."
    "从公共区域射出的光线太微弱了。幸好我眼神好，多少有点优势。"

# game/script.rpy:7468
translate Chinese day1story_c2964c73:

    # p "Let's get some sleep. Goodnight, Julian."
    p "让我们睡吧。晚安，Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:7470
translate Chinese day1story_f38eb41e:

    # j "Goodnight."
    j "晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:7472
translate Chinese day1story_e6f5c4e4:

    # "It's going to take you some time to enter the hammock as gracefully as he did—you can tell that straightaway."
    "想要像他那样潇洒自如地钻进吊床，你自知恐怕得狠狠花上一番苦功夫练练——你当场就能看出来这一点。"

# game/script.rpy:7474
translate Chinese day1story_054fe43c:

    # "For now, though, you're just happy that you've made it, and you can settle down for the night."
    "不过，现在我总算是上来了，能好好睡一觉了。"

# game/script.rpy:7476
translate Chinese day1story_173aab8f:

    # "The excitement of the first day is tempered rapidly by exhaustion of that day catching up with you."
    "第一天的兴奋劲儿，很快就被涌上来的疲惫感给冲淡了。"

# game/script.rpy:7478
translate Chinese day1story_541db2f8:

    # "As the deck above you rocks gently from side to side, sleep takes you before your mind can dwell on anything else."
    "甲板在你上方轻柔地摇晃着，你还没来得及多想，就沉沉睡去。"

# game/script.rpy:7492
translate Chinese headtobed_dc650e3b:

    # "If nothing else, you begin to feel how heavily the day is catching up to you."
    "至少，你现在开始觉得一天的疲惫都涌上来了。"

# game/script.rpy:7494
translate Chinese headtobed_1f3a4c6d:

    # "Maybe bed would be a good idea, after all."
    "看来，还是睡觉比较靠谱。"

# game/script.rpy:7496
translate Chinese headtobed_10f8a26d:

    # p "Now that you mention it, Samuel..."
    p "说起来，Samuel……"

# game/script.rpy:7500
translate Chinese headtobed_add9182d:

    # j "Really? You don't want to hear the end of my story?"
    j "真的？你不想听我把故事讲完？"

# game/script.rpy:7502
translate Chinese headtobed_365c1365:

    # p "You get your ass kicked, right?"
    p "你还不是被人揍得屁滚尿流？"

# game/script.rpy:7506
translate Chinese headtobed_fd264f4f:

    # "He grins a bit sheepishly. At last, he shrugs."
    "他有些不好意思地挠了挠头，最后耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:7511
translate Chinese headtobed_fc9d81c9:

    # j "Well... yeah."
    j "嗯... 是的。"

# game/script.rpy:7513
translate Chinese headtobed_31e00c2d:

    # "You hear a couple of knowing chuckles from the others."
    "你听到其他人发出了几声心照不宣的偷笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7520
translate Chinese headtobed_470dd14b:

    # j "I suppose it wouldn't be that bad of an idea to get some sleep before tomorrow."
    j "我想着，明天之前睡一觉，这主意真不赖。"

# game/script.rpy:7522
translate Chinese headtobed_bb0d770b:

    # "He seems to be wavering, though."
    "不过，他好像还是有点犹豫。"

# game/script.rpy:7524
translate Chinese headtobed_89ba47da:

    # p "It is just the first day. Tomorrow, Arthur's going to start really working us."
    p "这才第一天。明天，Arthur可就要真真正正地操练咱们了。"

# game/script.rpy:7526
translate Chinese headtobed_b479e8cf:

    # j "True. Alright, then. Look how responsible we're being, Samuel."
    j "说得是。好吧，就这样吧。瞧瞧咱们多负责任，Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:7528
translate Chinese headtobed_6e0f0438:

    # "The maned wolf regards him drily."
    "鬃狼面无表情地看着他。"

# game/script.rpy:7530
translate Chinese headtobed_89380ac5:

    # s "This isn't the Royal Navy, Julian. They don't award medals for gallantry like that on the Conway."
    s "这又不是皇家海军，Julian。在Conway号上，他们可不会随随便便因为你逞匹夫之勇就给你颁奖章。"

# game/script.rpy:7532
translate Chinese headtobed_874311b0:

    # j "I'm not doing it for glory. I'm doing it for my... my fellow crew."
    j "我又不是为了什么荣耀。我是为了我的... 我的弟兄们。"

# game/script.rpy:7539
translate Chinese headtobed_bd0d3040:

    # "He puts his hand on your leg, using it to push himself upright carefully."
    "他把手撑在你的腿上，小心地借力站了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:7541
translate Chinese headtobed_b8c249c1:

    # j "Alright, you all. It was nice being able to share a meal with you. I'll finish the story next time."
    j "好了，各位。很高兴能和你们一起吃顿饭。下次我再把故事讲完。"

# game/script.rpy:7543
translate Chinese headtobed_66a789e4:

    # k "You get-"
    k "你准是-"

# game/script.rpy:7545
translate Chinese headtobed_e942a33c:

    # "He interrupts the lynx, waving his hand dismissively."
    "他不耐烦地一挥手，打断了猞猁的话。"

# game/script.rpy:7547
translate Chinese headtobed_73eeed45:

    # j "But there will be drama! And romance. For now, though, there will be sleep."
    j "之后肯定少不了跌宕起伏的剧情！还有浪漫爱情故事。不过现在嘛，睡觉要紧。"

# game/script.rpy:7562
translate Chinese headtobed_cacae480:

    # p "Goodnight, you two. It was nice meeting you. And I appreciate the warm welcome."
    p "晚安，两位。很高兴认识你们，也谢谢你们的热情欢迎。"

# game/script.rpy:7564
translate Chinese headtobed_74f6a98e:

    # p "And the fork, Julian."
    p "还有叉子，Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:7566
translate Chinese headtobed_f89a77f2:

    # "You hand it back to him as you get up. It's after he fetches out his cloth rag that you realize you didn't wipe it down."
    "你起身的时候把叉子还给了他。等他拿出抹布，你才想起来你还没擦呢。"

# game/script.rpy:7568
translate Chinese headtobed_e9bbd03e:

    # "For that matter, you didn't have anything to wipe it down with."
    "话说回来，你也没什么东西可以擦啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7570
translate Chinese headtobed_1a93a46c:

    # j "Oh, don't worry about it. I don't mind."
    j "没事儿，我不讲究。"

# game/script.rpy:7576
translate Chinese headtobed_9c88f2f2:

    # "As the maned wolf heads towards the berths, he clears his throat."
    "鬃狼朝着床铺的方向走去，一边清了清嗓子。"

# game/script.rpy:7578
translate Chinese headtobed_c81134cd:

    # s "Probably should get that sorted, though."
    s "不过，那事儿可能还是得先搞定。"

# game/script.rpy:7580
translate Chinese headtobed_1c45b90f:

    # j "Yes! Remind me tomorrow, [name]. We'll go talk to the purser and get you a mess kit."
    j "没错！明天提醒我，[name]。咱们去找事务长，给你领一套餐具来。"

# game/script.rpy:7582
translate Chinese headtobed_e6051daa:

    # s "Good luck with it."
    s "祝你好运。"

# game/script.rpy:7586
translate Chinese headtobed_0c7a5255:

    # "The maned wolf moves swiftly, with the practiced grace of someone who's spent more time on ships than either of you."
    "Maned wolf行动迅速，身手老练，一看就是在船上待久了的人，你和他都比不上。"

# game/script.rpy:7599
translate Chinese headtobed_cacb97b4:

    # "Soon, it's just you and Julian, making your way through the shadows."
    "很快，就只剩下你和Julian了，在阴影里摸索着前进。"

# game/script.rpy:7607
translate Chinese headtobed_9895a8a8:

    # j "It really wasn't that great of a story, you know? Thinking about it now."
    j "你知道吗？其实那故事真没什么意思，现在想想。"

# game/script.rpy:7609
translate Chinese headtobed_382b0ab2:

    # p "Oh?"
    p "哦？"

# game/script.rpy:7611
translate Chinese headtobed_aa3efd98:

    # j "One of our confederates betrayed us. It's funny, I... I did get my scales properly tarred over that, believe you me."
    j "咱们的一个同伙背叛了咱们。说起来可笑，我...为了那事儿可没少吃苦头，信我。"

# game/script.rpy:7615
translate Chinese headtobed_27d467e8:

    # "He gives a quiet laugh."
    "他轻声笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7619
translate Chinese headtobed_239a60d4:

    # j "I've been holding it against him for years, now. But it doesn't matter, really, does it? We're here now."
    j "这些年来，我一直都挺在意那事儿的。不过现在想想，也没什么大不了的，不是吗？反正咱们已经在这儿了。"

# game/script.rpy:7621
translate Chinese headtobed_67bea173:

    # p "That's true."
    p "是啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7623
translate Chinese headtobed_b6d8969e:

    # p "And plenty of people put to sea to escape their past, don't they?"
    p "再说，出海的人里，不也有不少是为了逃避过去嘛？"

# game/script.rpy:7625
translate Chinese headtobed_f6b7f2c6:

    # p "Was your first day all that you thought it was?"
    p "你第一天感觉怎么样，跟你想的一样吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7627
translate Chinese headtobed_48615bfe:

    # j "I think so? I'm still trying to decide, honestly. You know where we're going, right?"
    j "感觉还行吧？说实话，我还在琢磨呢。你知道咱们要去哪儿，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7629
translate Chinese headtobed_c19cbac1:

    # p "Over there at the third post, right?"
    p "是在那边第三根柱子那儿吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7631
translate Chinese headtobed_112619f8:

    # j "That's what I thought, too. 36 and 37. Right here. Anyway..."
    j "我也觉得是。36号和37号，就是这儿了。对了……"

# game/script.rpy:7639
translate Chinese headtobed_95a26dc6:

    # "As he talks, he reaches behind the crates and fishes out some sturdy white linen hammocks, passing the end of one to you."
    "他一边说着，一边从货箱后面摸出几张结实的白亚麻吊床，把一头递给你。"

# game/script.rpy:7641
translate Chinese headtobed_3ef21a08:

    # j "We haven't done all that much, yet. Are you..."
    j "咱们也没做多少事啊。你是不是……"

# game/script.rpy:7643
translate Chinese headtobed_93f1cdd7:

    # "Even in the dark, your blank expression must've been fairly obvious."
    "就算在黑地里，你那副茫然的表情也肯定藏不住。"

# game/script.rpy:7645
translate Chinese headtobed_3c98b570:

    # p "Sorry, I was just... I was going to watch you and see what you did."
    p "抱歉，我就是...想看看你先怎么弄。"

# game/script.rpy:7651
translate Chinese headtobed_ef9560b7:

    # "Julian secures his end of the hammock to one of the anchor points. He does it slowly, you notice, so that you can follow along."
    "Julian把吊床的一头固定在一个锚点上。你注意到他弄得很慢，这样你就能学着做。"

# game/script.rpy:7653
translate Chinese headtobed_57d16498:

    # j "I've been on a few ships before, here and there. Never as crew. But I guess you do learn a few things."
    j "我以前也零零星星地上过几次船，但从来不是船员。不过多少也能学到点东西。"

# game/script.rpy:7655
translate Chinese headtobed_b8109009:

    # "You follow his lead, and then help him to begin setting up the second hammock."
    "你跟着他学，然后帮他一起搭第二张吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:7657
translate Chinese headtobed_05121e30:

    # p "You do, I'm sure. I promise I'll learn to do this myself soon enough."
    p "肯定能学会的。我保证，我很快就能自己弄了。"

# game/script.rpy:7661
translate Chinese headtobed_994b12eb:

    # "He smiles."
    "他笑了笑。"

# game/script.rpy:7665
translate Chinese headtobed_ee31d97a:

    # j "Oh, it's always better with help, anyway. Today definitely wasn't as bad as I thought it might be."
    j "嗨，反正有人帮忙总是好点。今天肯定没我想的那么糟。"

# game/script.rpy:7667
translate Chinese headtobed_75cbe617:

    # "He starts to pull himself into his hammock, then turns and looks at you."
    "他正要往吊床上爬，又转过头来看你。"

# game/script.rpy:7669
translate Chinese headtobed_d7385a2f:

    # j "Are you going to be alright with this?"
    j "你能行吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7671
translate Chinese headtobed_9ed3001f:

    # p "First time for everything, isn't there?"
    p "任何事不都有第一次嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:7675
translate Chinese headtobed_2ff01711:

    # "The lizard nods, and clambers into the hammock. You try to watch his movements carefully."
    "那蜥蜴点点头，然后爬上了吊床。你努力仔细地观察他的动作。"

# game/script.rpy:7677
translate Chinese headtobed_d2a783dd:

    # j "First time for everything, that's right. You'll get the hang of it."
    j "第一次嘛，没错。你很快就能找到诀窍的。"

# game/script.rpy:7679
translate Chinese headtobed_28c8408e:

    # "Even before making the attempt you realize it's going to take you quite some time before you can manage it as easily as he."
    "还没试你就知道，你肯定得练上一阵子才能像他那么轻松。"

# game/script.rpy:7683
translate Chinese headtobed_1322c593:

    # "Still, you get yourself into the hammock without making too much of a fool of yourself..."
    "就算这样，你还是设法爬进了吊床，也没怎么出丑...……"

# game/script.rpy:7685
translate Chinese headtobed_91986aaa:

    # "You hope."
    "但愿如此吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7687
translate Chinese headtobed_84697564:

    # p "It was nice to meet you, Jules. Goodnight."
    p "很高兴认识你，Jules。晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:7689
translate Chinese headtobed_f38eb41e:

    # j "Goodnight."
    j "晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:7691
translate Chinese headtobed_8177ff5a:

    # "You listen to the sounds around you—the quiet breathing of the other sleeping crew, and the creak of the ship's timbers."
    "你静静聆听着周围的声响——身旁熟睡的同伴们轻微平缓的呼吸声，以及整艘船身木料大梁在波涛起伏中的沉闷吱呀声。"

# game/script.rpy:7693
translate Chinese headtobed_b4934a3b:

    # "It's all been so new, and unexpected."
    "一切都太新鲜，也太出乎意料了。"

# game/script.rpy:7695
translate Chinese headtobed_7da4b3e7:

    # "And yet, despite the excitement, you can hardly keep your eyes open. Before you know it, sleep has completely taken you."
    "尽管心里很激动，你还是困得睁不开眼，不知不觉就睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:7706
translate Chinese headtobed_85c0976d:

    # "Perhaps bed would be a good idea, after all. You don't know what tomorrow is going to bring, but it'll be an early start, and you know they'll have you hard at work."
    "看来还是睡觉比较靠谱。你也不知道明天会发生什么，但肯定要早起，而且他们肯定会让你卖力干活。"

# game/script.rpy:7708
translate Chinese headtobed_467cfed6:

    # "Besides, it isn't as though you expect the story to be especially fascinating."
    "再说，你也不觉得他的故事能有多精彩。"

# game/script.rpy:7710
translate Chinese headtobed_e7c217e3:

    # p "Samuel's probably right, isn't he?"
    p "Samuel说得对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7714
translate Chinese headtobed_f7e71e07:

    # j "Really? You're leaving?"
    j "真的？你要走了？"

# game/script.rpy:7716
translate Chinese headtobed_732de205:

    # p "Yeah. If we're on the morning watch..."
    p "是啊，如果咱们是早班的话……"

# game/script.rpy:7720
translate Chinese headtobed_150d8189:

    # "Julian frowns, apparently unconvinced."
    "Julian皱着眉头，显然不太相信。"

# game/script.rpy:7724
translate Chinese headtobed_6a8dac85:

    # p "I just don't want to be a wreck on just the second day."
    p "我可不想第二天就累趴下。"

# game/script.rpy:7736
translate Chinese headtobed_d70c38a4:

    # k "Not a bad plan. Different word."
    k "这主意不错，换个说法而已。"

# game/script.rpy:7738
translate Chinese headtobed_1b640dae:

    # p "What?"
    p "啊？"

# game/script.rpy:7740
translate Chinese headtobed_d3d28394:

    # k "Don't want to be useless. Don't want to make mistakes. Don't want to piss Arthur off 'til he throws me overboard."
    k "我可不想没用，不想犯错，更不想惹毛Arthur，让他把我丢下海喂鱼。"

# game/script.rpy:7742
translate Chinese headtobed_c7731b77:

    # p "But I shouldn't say-"
    p "我不该说这些的……"

# game/script.rpy:7744
translate Chinese headtobed_ef337ba6:

    # k "No point tempting fate, that's all. Sam's right, though. And the new guy. Morning watch can be a real bitch."
    k "别乌鸦嘴，就这样吧。不过Sam说得对，还有你，新来的。早班简直要人命。"

# game/script.rpy:7746
translate Chinese headtobed_32002a50:

    # t "First day, especially. Still thinking like you're back on land, not run by the bells..."
    t "特别是第一天，脑子里还想着陆地上的那一套，还没适应这按钟声作息的规矩……"

# game/script.rpy:7748
translate Chinese headtobed_2ee21f5a:

    # j "I suppose you're all right... probably."
    j "我想你们说得都对...也许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7752
translate Chinese headtobed_4f9dc97c:

    # "The lizard is still pouting, though. Samuel, for his part, has already left—purely professional."
    "不过小蜥蜴还在气鼓鼓地撇着嘴赌气。至于Samuel嘛，早就已经打道回舱了——办事极有分寸、一丝不苟。"

# game/script.rpy:7765
translate Chinese headtobed_248a4666:

    # "You start to get up, to make it easier for him, too. As you do, you catch sight of your plate, and pick his fork back up."
    "你也赶紧起身，这样他也好走。起身的时候，你看到自己的盘子，顺手捡起他的叉子。"

# game/script.rpy:7767
translate Chinese headtobed_7fcdc636:

    # p "Thank you for letting me borrow this. For now."
    p "谢谢你借我叉子，先用用。"

# game/script.rpy:7769
translate Chinese headtobed_89c61572:

    # j "Just for now."
    j "就用一下。"

# game/script.rpy:7771
translate Chinese headtobed_8f7e393b:

    # "He looks at it with a slight frown, then pulls out his cloth and wipes it clean."
    "他微微皱眉看了看叉子，然后拿出布仔细擦拭干净。"

# game/script.rpy:7773
translate Chinese headtobed_3a9c20bf:

    # k "What, did he shed on it already? Should get that sorted, though."
    k "怎么，他弄脏了吗？是该好好收拾一下了。"

# game/script.rpy:7775
translate Chinese headtobed_2471c2bf:

    # j "Yeah. Yeah, [name], I'll point you to the purser tomorrow. They should have some kind of mess kit for you."
    j "行，[name]，明天我带你去找事务长，他会给你安排一套餐具的。"

# game/script.rpy:7781
translate Chinese headtobed_8516e4b9:

    # "He stands, reluctantly."
    "他不情愿地站起身。"

# game/script.rpy:7783
translate Chinese headtobed_80593538:

    # j "You all, I'll be seeing later. To finish my story."
    j "各位，回头见，我继续讲我的故事。"

# game/script.rpy:7785
translate Chinese headtobed_4017c60b:

    # k "You can jump straight to the part where you get your ass tarred for stealing."
    k "你可以直接跳到你因为偷东西要被涂沥青那段。"
    # 译注：tarring（涂沥青），帆船时代水手之间惩戒小偷盗贼的私刑，将其全身涂满滚热黑沥青。

# game/script.rpy:7789
translate Chinese headtobed_3b22c9f0:

    # j "You're all such good company..."
    j "和你们在一起真是太好了...……"

# game/script.rpy:7791
translate Chinese headtobed_46ba4e66:

    # p "Uh. It was nice meeting you."
    p "呃，很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:7795
translate Chinese headtobed_0eeaff9f:

    # "You add your own parting words somewhat more sincerely than Julian seems to mean them."
    "你的告别比Julian听起来真诚多了。"

# game/script.rpy:7805
translate Chinese headtobed_ddc65faf:

    # p "I appreciated the warm welcome. I'll see you around."
    p "谢谢你这么热情地欢迎我。回头见！"

# game/script.rpy:7807
translate Chinese headtobed_9fb1149d:

    # k "Not many places to hide around here, no, are there? Nice meeting you, [name]."
    k "这儿好像也没什么地方能躲着，是吧？很高兴认识你，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:7809
translate Chinese headtobed_f4260521:

    # t "Yeah. Get some rest while you can."
    t "是啊，能睡就赶紧睡会儿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7819
translate Chinese headtobed_442f8a8f:

    # "You follow him back in the direction Samuel went, to where you're supposed to be berthed."
    "你跟着他朝Samuel走的方向走去，也就是你该去的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:7823
translate Chinese headtobed_d0802161:

    # j "Was it really that boring of a story?"
    j "我讲的故事就那么无聊吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7825
translate Chinese headtobed_d187a30e:

    # p "I think it was just that late. I'm trying to make a good first impression..."
    p "我想只是太晚了。我这不是想给大家留个好印象嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:7827
translate Chinese headtobed_4b526cc1:

    # j "Am I not?"
    j "难道我没有吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7829
translate Chinese headtobed_9742fa31:

    # p "That's not what I meant!"
    p "我不是那个意思！"

# game/script.rpy:7831
translate Chinese headtobed_f496ebb4:

    # "Julian stays quiet as you pick your way through the crates and barrels towards where you're sleeping."
    "你小心地穿过那些装着板条箱和木桶的区域，朝你的铺位走去，Julian一直没说话。"

# game/script.rpy:7835
translate Chinese headtobed_0d293c74:

    # p "We're over there at the third post, right? Did I remember correctly?"
    p "咱们是不是在第三根柱子那边？编号是没错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:7837
translate Chinese headtobed_0ea88405:

    # j "Yeah. 36 and 37. You know how to do this?"
    j "没错，36号和37号。你会弄这个吗？"

# game/script.rpy:7846
translate Chinese headtobed_859b0117:

    # "He leans over, reaching behind one of the crates and fishing out some sturdy white linen hammocks. He holds the end of one out to you."
    "他探身从一个板条箱后面摸出几张结实的白色亚麻吊床，拿起其中一张的一头递给你。"

# game/script.rpy:7848
translate Chinese headtobed_7fd2d5b4:

    # p "Not... exactly."
    p "不... 算不上会。"

# game/script.rpy:7853
translate Chinese headtobed_f8365d7d:

    # "Julian attaches his side to one of the anchor points, and you do the same, although it takes you a little longer."
    "Julian把他那头固定在一个锚点上，你也跟着做，不过慢了半拍。"

# game/script.rpy:7855
translate Chinese headtobed_670dbd08:

    # "Even in the relative quiet, surrounded by your sleeping fellow crew, the silence is a little awkward."
    "就算周围很安静，大家都睡着了，这气氛还是有点尴尬。"

# game/script.rpy:7857
translate Chinese headtobed_27934e5c:

    # p "How... how are you finding it so far?"
    p "你... 你目前感觉怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:7859
translate Chinese headtobed_6bb3afce:

    # j "The hammock? It's just a hammock."
    j "吊床？不就是个吊床嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:7861
translate Chinese headtobed_446e1379:

    # p "No, the ship. Everything. Today, I mean."
    p "不是，我说的是船上的事。所有的一切。就说今天吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7863
translate Chinese headtobed_5763e70a:

    # j "Oh. Fine. Better than expected I guess."
    j "哦，还行。比我想象的要好。"

# game/script.rpy:7865
translate Chinese headtobed_43662090:

    # "He spreads out the second hammock, and begins fixing it to the other anchor point on the post."
    "他展开另一张吊床，开始把它固定在柱子上的另一个锚点上。"

# game/script.rpy:7867
translate Chinese headtobed_5e7cbb6f:

    # j "But it's just the first day."
    j "可这才是第一天啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7869
translate Chinese headtobed_caf4b96f:

    # "Your reflexive, quizzical expression is lost in the darkness."
    "在黑暗中，你也看不清他脸上那副下意识的疑惑表情。"

# game/script.rpy:7871
translate Chinese headtobed_a88bea3d:

    # "All day long he's seemed to be in his element—like this was another childhood adventure of his."
    "一整天下来，他都显得格外如鱼得水——就仿佛这趟漫长的远航，不过是他童年冒险旅程的又一次欢快重演罢了。"

# game/script.rpy:7873
translate Chinese headtobed_cb592cfb:

    # "Now he couldn't care less?"
    "现在就一点也不在意了？"

# game/script.rpy:7875
translate Chinese headtobed_3a16a954:

    # p "\"Better than expected\"? What were you expecting?"
    p "“比我想象的要好”？你还以为会怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:7877
translate Chinese headtobed_71a3e593:

    # j "I don't know. It wasn't as bad as I thought it would be—what do you want?"
    j "我哪儿知道。反正没有我想象的那么糟——你到底想怎样嘛？"

# game/script.rpy:7881
translate Chinese headtobed_52de1f37:

    # j "Anyway, all we did was piss around. Anyone can do that."
    j "哎，反正咱们今天就是瞎混。谁还不会啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7883
translate Chinese headtobed_6d310313:

    # "He finishes securing the hammock with a bit more forcefulness than was really required."
    "他把吊床固定好，用的力气比实际需要的要大一些。"

# game/script.rpy:7887
translate Chinese headtobed_5e6ce782:

    # j "I could do that."
    j "这我也会。"

# game/script.rpy:7891
translate Chinese headtobed_5c228996:

    # p "I guess we'll find out tomorrow, but..."
    p "看来明天就知道了，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:7893
translate Chinese headtobed_a475dd4c:

    # j "What?"
    j "啊？"

# game/script.rpy:7895
translate Chinese headtobed_96baf25e:

    # p "You grew up in a Navy family, right? You already know the ropes plenty well, seems to me."
    p "你从小在海军家庭长大，对吧？我看你对这些事儿门儿清。"

# game/script.rpy:7897
translate Chinese headtobed_92713d00:

    # j "Maybe."
    j "也许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7899
translate Chinese headtobed_05d3d61b:

    # p "I'm sure you'll do just fine with anything that isn't just \"pissing around.\""
    p "我相信你干什么都行，只要不是混日子。"

# game/script.rpy:7901
translate Chinese headtobed_fcceffc0:

    # j "Yeah."
    j "可不是嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:7903
translate Chinese headtobed_6cbf8080:

    # "His voice is flat, but you suspect you're not going to get much more out of him."
    "他语气平淡，但你知道再问也问不出什么了。"

# game/script.rpy:7907
translate Chinese headtobed_4d14791d:

    # "Sure enough, without another word, he pulls himself into his hammock to prepare for the night."
    "果然，他二话不说就爬进吊床，准备睡觉。"

# game/script.rpy:7909
translate Chinese headtobed_f67a65b0:

    # "You follow suit, as gracefully as you can. It's going to take quite some time before you can manage it like Julian."
    "你也尽量优雅地学着做。看来我得练上一阵子，才能像Julian那样熟练。"

# game/script.rpy:7911
translate Chinese headtobed_2b7201ca:

    # p "Let's get some sleep. Goodnight, man."
    p "睡吧。晚安，伙计。"

# game/script.rpy:7913
translate Chinese headtobed_0b89d946:

    # j "Night."
    j "晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:7917
translate Chinese headtobed_f8093b78:

    # "The lamps from the commons area are barely enough to reveal him as a still shadow, staring at the deck above him, motionless."
    "公共区域的灯光昏暗，他像个影子般静止不动，抬头盯着甲板。"

# game/script.rpy:7919
translate Chinese headtobed_975ad2ad:

    # "You do the same. Your feline eyes just about allow you to see the contours of the ship's timbers, but you're grateful to be able to see that, at least."
    "你也一样。多亏了我的夜视能力，我勉强能看清船舱的轮廓，能看到这些就不错了。"

# game/script.rpy:7921
translate Chinese headtobed_32c640cd:

    # "It does feel like a grand adventure, whether Julian has soured on it or not. Despite the excitement of the day, sleep takes you before you even realize it."
    "不管Julian怎么想，这都像是一场精彩的冒险。虽然今天有点兴奋，但还是不知不觉地睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:7932
translate Chinese headtobed_1e94081d:

    # "You decide it would be best to listen to his advice, even if it means costing Julian an audience."
    "还是听他的吧，就算这样Julian会少个听众。"

# game/script.rpy:7934
translate Chinese headtobed_87e60e07:

    # p "If he's heading off, I suppose I will, too. Seems wise."
    p "他要走，那我也走了。明智之举。"

# game/script.rpy:7938
translate Chinese headtobed_8e819f5a:

    # j "Aw. Wait, really? You don't want to hear the end of my story?"
    j "啊？等等，真的？你不想听我讲完？"

# game/script.rpy:7940
translate Chinese headtobed_2bb269e3:

    # p "I'm pretty sure I got the gist of it. Anyway..."
    p "我都猜到个大概了。算了……"

# game/script.rpy:7955
translate Chinese headtobed_87f9126f:

    # "Samuel is starting to get up, and once there's room to move, you do the same."
    "Samuel开始起身了，等地方宽敞了点，我也起来。"

# game/script.rpy:7968
translate Chinese headtobed_cb7ac061:

    # p "You can tell me all the best bits tomorrow."
    p "你明天再跟我说那些精彩的部分吧。"

# game/script.rpy:7972
translate Chinese headtobed_5519db13:

    # j "I guess we will want a way to pass the time swabbing those decks. Right, Samuel?"
    j "我想我们总得找点乐子，不然擦甲板多无聊啊。你说对吧，Samuel？"

# game/script.rpy:7976
translate Chinese headtobed_2da2da44:

    # "The prospect of another story does not seem to thrill the maned wolf."
    "听起来鬃狼对故事并不感兴趣。"

# game/script.rpy:7978
translate Chinese headtobed_0430b507:

    # s "Oh. I'm looking forward to it more than anything."
    s "哦。我可太期待了。"

# game/script.rpy:7983
translate Chinese headtobed_ec835efa:

    # "You hand Julian his fork back. At the last moment, you realize you don't have anything to clean it with, either."
    "你把叉子还给Julian。但转念一想，自己也没东西擦啊。"

# game/script.rpy:7987
translate Chinese headtobed_1607f8b6:

    # p "Thank you..."
    p "谢谢您……"

# game/script.rpy:7992
translate Chinese headtobed_3fd2357b:

    # "You say, weakly, as he pulls out a cloth and wipes it clean."
    "他拿出块布擦干净，你小声说。"

# game/script.rpy:7994
translate Chinese headtobed_d10b2107:

    # j "Don't mention it. I guess I'll be following you two soon enough. G'night."
    j "别客气。看来我也要跟你们一起睡了。晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:7996
translate Chinese headtobed_6fcfb811:

    # p "Night. Goodnight, Konrad; Torres. It was nice meeting you. Thanks for the warm welcome."
    p "晚安。晚安，Konrad，Torres。很高兴认识你们，谢谢你们的热情欢迎。"

# game/script.rpy:8011
translate Chinese headtobed_ab53ac4b:

    # "The two nod, and as Samuel heads off you follow closely behind the maned wolf, watching as he picks his skillful way through the ship."
    "他们点点头，Samuel走了，你紧跟着鬃狼，看他熟练地在船上穿行。"

# game/script.rpy:8018
translate Chinese headtobed_072258d6:

    # "You decide it would be best to listen to his advice. Besides which, it's not like you're really expecting much from Julian's story."
    "还是听他的吧。而且说实话，我对Julian的故事也没什么期待。"

# game/script.rpy:8020
translate Chinese headtobed_43be2e73:

    # p "If he's heading off, I'm going to, too."
    p "他要走，那我也走了。"

# game/script.rpy:8024
translate Chinese headtobed_9ef30650:

    # j "Wait, really? I was just getting to the good part."
    j "等等，真的？我才刚说到精彩的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:8026
translate Chinese headtobed_7ad10222:

    # p "You can tell me tomorrow. Or I'm sure Konrad will savor the best bits."
    p "你明天再告诉我吧。或者Konrad会很乐意听那些精彩的部分。"

# game/script.rpy:8032
translate Chinese headtobed_a31dd389:

    # k "Oh, yeah."
    k "哦，是吗。"

# game/script.rpy:8034
translate Chinese headtobed_c248be8d:

    # "The lizard looks disappointed, but nods."
    "蜥蜴看起来有点失望，但还是点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:8038
translate Chinese headtobed_d301d8b7:

    # j "I suppose it is late. I'll probably be coming along soon. Can I have..."
    j "我想我也差不多该走了。我能要……"

# game/script.rpy:8043
translate Chinese headtobed_13e8b6a6:

    # "He gestures to the fork he'd given you. As you hand it back over, you feel a little guilty about not being able to clean it."
    "他示意了一下递给你的叉子。因为没能把叉子洗干净就还给他，你有点过意不去。"

# game/script.rpy:8048
translate Chinese headtobed_c9d5fd55:

    # "And for skipping out on the rest of his story, overly excitable as the young man might be."
    "而且我还打断了他的故事，虽然那小伙子的确有点太激动了。"

# game/script.rpy:8050
translate Chinese headtobed_a9ba31af:

    # p "Thank you. I'll figure something out."
    p "谢谢你，我会想办法的。"

# game/script.rpy:8052
translate Chinese headtobed_d895a9fe:

    # "He wipes it down with his own cloth, giving a mild shrug."
    "他用自己的布擦了擦叉子，无所谓地耸了耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:8056
translate Chinese headtobed_e33c6c78:

    # j "It's fine. I'll see you tomorrow, if you're asleep by the time I get there."
    j "没事。如果我来的时候你已经睡了，那就明天见。"

# game/script.rpy:8058
translate Chinese headtobed_a1b85f72:

    # p "Right. It was nice to meet you two, Konrad and Torres. I appreciate the warm welcome."
    p "好吧。很高兴认识你们，Konrad和Torres。感谢你们的热情欢迎。"

# game/script.rpy:8060
translate Chinese headtobed_4b73549c:

    # t "Yeah. Welcome aboard. We'll be seeing more of each other, I'm sure."
    t "是的。欢迎登船。我相信我们以后会经常见面的。"

# game/script.rpy:8062
translate Chinese headtobed_ae8a7a0f:

    # k "Listen to Sam. Sleep while you can, [name]. Trust me."
    k "听Sam的，有空就赶紧睡吧，[name]。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:8077
translate Chinese headtobed_618c3b0c:

    # "You nod, and follow Samuel as the maned wolf skillfully picks his way through the ship."
    "你点点头，跟着Samuel，看他像一只鬃狼一样熟练地在船上穿行。"

# game/script.rpy:8088
translate Chinese headtobed_da643987:

    # s "He's alright, that kid. Probably. Just... well, I was gonna say inexperienced."
    s "那孩子人还行，大概吧。就是...嗯，我本来想说他没什么经验。"

# game/script.rpy:8090
translate Chinese headtobed_dc6d9871:

    # "He gives a quiet laugh, and gestures towards you."
    "他轻轻一笑，指了指你。"

# game/script.rpy:8094
translate Chinese headtobed_9552f6c9:

    # s "But you are, too. You should talk to the purser tomorrow, though. They'll be able to set ya up with a mess kit, or something like it."
    s "不过你也一样。你明天应该和事务长说说，他们会给你弄一套餐具，或者类似的玩意儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8096
translate Chinese headtobed_d30083d5:

    # p "Oh. Thanks."
    p "哦，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:8098
translate Chinese headtobed_e373be09:

    # s "Hey, and just think: you'll be well on your way to becoming a proper sailor."
    s "嘿，你就等着成为一名真正的水手吧！"

# game/script.rpy:8102
translate Chinese headtobed_e85900a7:

    # "He pauses, and points with his muzzle towards where Bandile is beginning to tidy up after the crew's dinner."
    "他顿了顿，用嘴朝Bandile开始收拾船员晚餐的地方努了努。"

# game/script.rpy:8104
translate Chinese headtobed_756d494d:

    # s "Would ya mind waiting here a moment? I want to thank Bandile."
    s "你介意在这里等我一会儿吗？我想去谢谢Bandile。"

# game/script.rpy:8106
translate Chinese headtobed_d8a3ffd9:

    # p "Of course."
    p "当然。"

# game/script.rpy:8112
translate Chinese headtobed_0d1f8f05:

    # "He makes his way past some of the other tables, and you notice how skillfully he's able to move amongst the crates and other obstacles."
    "他绕过其他的桌子，你注意到他是如何巧妙地在板条箱和其他障碍物之间穿行的。"

# game/script.rpy:8114
translate Chinese headtobed_aeef8953:

    # "You'd like to be able to manage with such skill. Aren't felines supposed to be agile? The maned wolf's tail sways after him, following with the same kind of sinuous grace."
    "真希望我也有这种本事。说起来，猫科动物不是应该很敏捷吗？鬃狼的尾巴在他身后摇摆，同样的优雅流畅。"

# game/script.rpy:8124
translate Chinese headtobed_90199722:

    # "Bandile has taken a seat, briefly, inspecting one of the plates. He looks up at Samuel's approach, and smiles at the maned wolf."
    "Bandile已经坐下了，正简单地检查着一个盘子。他抬头看到Samuel走过来，笑着向他打招呼。"

# game/script.rpy:8126
translate Chinese headtobed_e7bffa88:

    # "You can't tell what they're talking about. But, as promised, it's a short conversation, and a few seconds later, Samuel is back at your side."
    "你听不清他们在说什么。但正如他所说，他们很快就聊完了，没过多久，Samuel就回到了你身边。"

# game/script.rpy:8134
translate Chinese headtobed_da80fd2b:

    # s "Just wanted to thank him again for the extra helping. He didn't have to do that. You didn't have to, either."
    s "我就是想再谢谢他给我多盛了一份。他没必要这么照顾我，你也没必要。"

# game/script.rpy:8136
translate Chinese headtobed_6914a927:

    # "He licks his muzzle with the recollection."
    "他回味了一下，舔了舔鼻子。"

# game/script.rpy:8138
translate Chinese headtobed_3fd6cc0f:

    # s "Ah, that asparagus. Best part o' being ashore is the supplies. Anyway, now, your number 36, right? Do I remember that correctly?"
    s "啊，那芦笋。靠岸了才能有这些好吃的。对了，你是36号，对吧？我没记错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8140
translate Chinese headtobed_6cd0054a:

    # p "That's right. The third post, I was told. I'm trying to remember everything I can."
    p "没错。他们说我是第三个岗位的，我正努力把该记住的都记住。"

# game/script.rpy:8142
translate Chinese headtobed_230f9c1a:

    # s "It'll all be second-nature soon enough. Especially things like that."
    s "用不了多久，一切就都成习惯了。尤其是这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:8144
translate Chinese headtobed_12298b80:

    # "He smiles, as if offering you the advice in confidence."
    "他笑了笑，像是悄悄地给你提建议。"

# game/script.rpy:8146
translate Chinese headtobed_18c95425:

    # s "The first thing you want to remember, definitely, is where ya can get some sleep."
    s "你最该记住的，绝对是去哪儿睡觉。"

# game/script.rpy:8148
translate Chinese headtobed_897fb25e:

    # "The first day hasn't been especially trying, but even still, you can feel hints of the kind of exhaustion hard-working sailors must feel so keenly."
    "第一天倒也没什么特别累的，但你也能体会到那些辛勤工作的海员们有多疲惫了。"

# game/script.rpy:8156
translate Chinese headtobed_dafc1e0b:

    # "When you reach the post, it's clear enough where a hammock is supposed to go. Beyond that..."
    "到了柱子边上，吊床该怎么挂，在哪儿挂，一下子就清楚了。除此之外……"

# game/script.rpy:8158
translate Chinese headtobed_ff2874b6:

    # p "I suppose I'll also remember where the hammocks are?"
    p "我应该也能记住吊床的位置吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8160
translate Chinese headtobed_2fbd5057:

    # s "Yeah, they clear 'em away to keep things tidy, 'course. These crates here..."
    s "是啊，他们当然会把东西收起来，这样才整洁。这些板条箱……"

# game/script.rpy:8162
translate Chinese headtobed_b67f4bad:

    # "He nudges one with his foot, and you find two white linen hammocks within. For you and Julian, you imagine."
    "他用脚尖碰了碰一个箱子，你发现里面装着两张白色的亚麻吊床。 应该是给你和Julian准备的吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8166
translate Chinese headtobed_add6f326:

    # "Samuel looks at your blank expression, and grins."
    "Samuel看你一脸茫然，咧嘴一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:8168
translate Chinese headtobed_a7459543:

    # s "Alright, I'll help. Just this once, as a favor."
    s "好吧，我来帮你。就这一次，算我帮个忙。"

# game/script.rpy:8170
translate Chinese headtobed_92dc9593:

    # p "Thanks."
    p "谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:8176
translate Chinese headtobed_670bf02a:

    # "He attaches one of the hammocks to its anchor points, letting you see how he's doing it."
    "他把一个吊床挂到固定点上，好让你看清楚他是怎么弄的。"

# game/script.rpy:8178
translate Chinese headtobed_3b6d6336:

    # s "That's Julian's, I suppose. The way he talked, he probably knows how to set a hammock up, at least. Now you try."
    s "那张应该是Julian的吧。听他那口气，至少知道怎么搭吊床。现在你来试试。"

# game/script.rpy:8180
translate Chinese headtobed_f77a83f6:

    # "With the maned wolf's example to work from, it's not terribly difficult. It doesn't look like the coziest place to sleep..."
    "有了这只“鬃狼”做示范，倒也不是很难。就是看起来睡着不太舒服……"

# game/script.rpy:8182
translate Chinese headtobed_0158ffcc:

    # "Nor the safest, for that matter, swinging languidly from the ship's beams. But it'll do."
    "说实话，也不太安全，晃晃悠悠地挂在船梁上。不过，凑合着也能睡。"

# game/script.rpy:8186
translate Chinese headtobed_8244e481:

    # "Clearly, because there are already other sailors asleep around you. Trying not to make too much noise, you pull yourself into the hammock."
    "看看周围，已经有不少水手睡着了。你尽量放轻动作，把自己塞进吊床里。"

# game/script.rpy:8188
translate Chinese headtobed_8c7c208c:

    # "It's not your best work, and you can tell by Samuel's expression that he's trying to suppress a grin."
    "这次弄得不怎么样，看Samuel那表情，就知道他憋着笑呢。"

# game/script.rpy:8190
translate Chinese headtobed_86bf4372:

    # p "I'll get used to it, right?"
    p "我会习惯的，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8192
translate Chinese headtobed_99abe719:

    # "Your whisper, in an attempt not to wake anyone up, makes the question sound like it came from a timid schoolchild. Samuel does grin, now."
    "你压低声音，生怕吵醒别人，结果问得像个胆怯的小学生。这下Samuel可真笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:8194
translate Chinese headtobed_b09cf4e8:

    # s "You will."
    s "你会的。"

# game/script.rpy:8196
translate Chinese headtobed_100fe2d5:

    # "With his arms holding the beams above him, the maned wolf's lanky body is on full display. He pauses, as if considering whether to say what's on his mind."
    "“鬃狼”用胳膊撑着头顶的横梁，那双大长腿暴露无遗。他顿了顿，好像在考虑要不要说出心里话。"

# game/script.rpy:8200
translate Chinese headtobed_8587564a:

    # s "For what it's worth, Mr. [family_name]? You did well today. I thought ya should know."
    s "那个，[family_name]先生？不管怎么说，你今天干得不错。我觉得应该让你知道。"

# game/script.rpy:8202
translate Chinese headtobed_cfac6ca8:

    # p "The asparagus?"
    p "芦笋？"

# game/script.rpy:8206
translate Chinese headtobed_251afa82:

    # s "Not just that.{w} Well, that you did {i}really{/i} well, too, and I'll kiss ya fucking ass if you somehow manage to make supplying me with asparagus a daily habit. But it's not {i}just{/i} that."
    s "可不光是芦笋的事儿。{w} 当然，芦笋你也弄{i}得特别{/i}好，你要是真能让我每天都吃上芦笋，我就给你跪了。但主要不是{i}这个{/i}。"

# game/script.rpy:8210
translate Chinese headtobed_711c0c46:

    # s "I'm sure it was overwhelming, but..."
    s "肯定有点懵吧，不过……"

# game/script.rpy:8212
translate Chinese headtobed_fc9d655b:

    # p "We didn't actually do much today. If anything, I really have to tell you that you did a good job getting us settled in."
    p "其实今天也没干啥。真要说的话，我觉得你把我们安顿得挺好。"

# game/script.rpy:8214
translate Chinese headtobed_a977e44e:

    # p "And introducing us to Konrad and Torres. The old hands, I don't know... I want to make a good impression..."
    p "还把Konrad和Torres介绍给我们。那些老水手，我也不知道...就是想给他们留个好印象……"

# game/script.rpy:8216
translate Chinese headtobed_6c86635c:

    # p "I was kind of worried it'd be our officer doing it. A lot of loud barking..."
    p "我还挺担心是长官来安排这些。那家伙嗓门那么大……"

# game/script.rpy:8220
translate Chinese headtobed_cc386dbb:

    # "Even in the darkness, you can see the knowing smile that crosses Samuel's muzzle."
    "即使在黑暗中，你也能看到Samuel嘴角露出了心照不宣的笑容。"

# game/script.rpy:8222
translate Chinese headtobed_4718b75c:

    # s "He's not so bad, y'know."
    s "他也没那么糟糕，我说真的。"

# game/script.rpy:8224
translate Chinese headtobed_94fee16d:

    # p "I know, I know. But, still. You're the nicer option."
    p "知道知道。但还是你更好。"

# game/script.rpy:8226
translate Chinese headtobed_bf0f2115:

    # "Samuel rubs the back of his head with his hand."
    "Samuel抬手挠了挠后脑勺。"

# game/script.rpy:8228
translate Chinese headtobed_93f8ec4b:

    # s "Well..."
    s "那个……"

# game/script.rpy:8230
translate Chinese headtobed_acecad7a:

    # p "Also, you know, I didn't exactly make the best showing of myself, when I reported aboard. I got the barking very early."
    p "还有，我跟你说，我刚来报到那会儿，表现得也不咋地。早早就挨了顿训。"

# game/script.rpy:8232
translate Chinese headtobed_84b611a3:

    # s "Don't mind it. Discipline is important on a ship like this. We got a long way to go, after all."
    s "别往心里去。在这种船上，纪律很重要。毕竟，咱们还有很长的路要走。"

# game/script.rpy:8236
translate Chinese headtobed_f017db4e:

    # s "Besides, how else do you keep someone like Julian in line?"
    s "除了这样，你还能怎么让Julian这种人老实点？"

# game/script.rpy:8238
translate Chinese headtobed_4bfece97:

    # s "Can't give 'em an inch. I'm just a sailor, myself, and I know that much."
    s "可不能给他们一点好脸色。我也是个水手，这点我懂。"

# game/script.rpy:8240
translate Chinese headtobed_221324a6:

    # s "I'll tell you something, though: show him you can do the job, and you can bet he'll step in for you if someone else is making trouble."
    s "不过跟你说，你要是让他瞧见你有两把刷子，那要是有人找你茬，他肯定罩着你。"

# game/script.rpy:8242
translate Chinese headtobed_cc49b97e:

    # "If he was about to continue, he doesn't get the chance."
    "他想继续说，但没机会了。"

# game/script.rpy:8244
translate Chinese headtobed_c46b202b:

    # "A wave catches the ship, hard enough that Samuel has to adjust his stance until it settles again, putting both hands back on the beams above him."
    "一个大浪拍在船上，颠得Samuel赶紧调整身子，等船稳下来，又把两只手抓回了头顶的梁上。"

# game/script.rpy:8246
translate Chinese headtobed_f1a000e1:

    # s "It's a lot of..."
    s "这可关系到……"

# game/script.rpy:8248
translate Chinese headtobed_eef7e5e4:

    # "He trails off, while the two of you listen to the sound of the wave breaking, all the way back to the stern of the ship."
    "他声音越来越小，我们俩就听着海浪哗啦啦地拍打着船尾。"

# game/script.rpy:8250
translate Chinese headtobed_18e070b3:

    # "You're already learning that, sturdy as she is, the Conway will sometimes feel very small, indeed, in a vast ocean."
    "你现在该明白了，Conway号再结实，在这茫茫大海里，有时候也显得忒渺小。"

# game/script.rpy:8252
translate Chinese headtobed_d4fa4288:

    # "Finally, Samuel keeps going."
    "Samuel接着说。"

# game/script.rpy:8254
translate Chinese headtobed_74ec2895:

    # s "It's a lot of giving young sailors the chance to become old sailors. Learn how to ride out a wave like that."
    s "这关系着能不能让年轻水手变成老水手。得学会怎么扛过刚才那样的浪。"

# game/script.rpy:8256
translate Chinese headtobed_c9570ddf:

    # p "Yeah... I can imagine..."
    p "嗯... 我明白……"

# game/script.rpy:8258
translate Chinese headtobed_ac42de42:

    # s "And the only way that happens is keepin' 'em from doing anything too dumb, like getting a crane full of cargo dropped on their head. But ya learn. Like I said: show you can do the work."
    s "要做到这个，就得让他们别犯傻，比如别让起重机吊着一堆货砸脑袋上。不过人嘛，都是学出来的。我跟你说，拿出真本事来。"

# game/script.rpy:8260
translate Chinese headtobed_4873c011:

    # p "I guess the morning watch will be as good a time as any for that, right?"
    p "要证明自己，看来明早的值班是个好机会，你说呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8262
translate Chinese headtobed_67f92ca6:

    # s "Exactly."
    s "就是这个意思。"

# game/script.rpy:8267
translate Chinese headtobed_e708afcd:

    # "He gives you a pat on the shoulder before starting to head towards his own hammock."
    "他拍拍你的肩膀，就往自己的吊床那儿去了。"

# game/script.rpy:8269
translate Chinese headtobed_e0bdf754:

    # s "Have a good night, [name]."
    s "晚安，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:8271
translate Chinese headtobed_d452a98c:

    # s "I'll make sure to wake you up if I see you still sleeping."
    s "要是看你还睡着，我肯定叫醒你。"

# game/script.rpy:8273
translate Chinese headtobed_45f1fd7b:

    # p "Thank you. You too, Sam. Goodnight."
    p "谢谢。你也一样，Sam。晚安。"

# game/script.rpy:8277
translate Chinese headtobed_eb52651a:

    # "You watch as he walks over to his spot, dropping his vest and sizing up his hammock."
    "你看着他走到自己的地方，放下背心，开始摆弄他的吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:8279
translate Chinese headtobed_55cea206:

    # "With one graceful movement, he's jumped up and into it, settling comfortably down and into place."
    "只见他身手利落地一跃，就钻进了吊床，舒舒服服地躺好了。"

# game/script.rpy:8281
translate Chinese headtobed_c6b7d167:

    # "You're quite fortunate to have met such a skilled mentor already, you think. Handsome, too."
    "你心想，真幸运，这么快就遇上这么个有本事的前辈。还挺帅的。"

# game/script.rpy:8283
translate Chinese headtobed_4a32fd7f:

    # "...Handsome..."
    "...帅啊……"

# game/script.rpy:8285
translate Chinese headtobed_2f9aa0c4:

    # "For a few more seconds, your eyes linger on the hammock, even after he's completely disappeared into the white linen."
    "你的目光又在吊床上停留了几秒，就算他已经完全没入那白色的帆布里了。"

# game/script.rpy:8287
translate Chinese headtobed_b90ca56d:

    # "At last you manage to tear your eyes away, and settle down for your own attempt at rest."
    "你终于还是恋恋不舍地移开了目光，也准备睡觉了。"

# game/script.rpy:8289
translate Chinese headtobed_fe73e943:

    # "The movements of the ship are deceptively lulling, considering the force of the wave earlier. But you can already feel exhaustion building."
    "别看刚才风浪那么大，现在船摇摇晃晃的，还挺催眠的。不过你也觉得累了。"

# game/script.rpy:8291
translate Chinese headtobed_546bd13a:

    # "Before you have any further chance to dwell, sleep has taken you completely."
    "还没等你多想，困意就彻底把你吞没了。"

# game/script.rpy:8303
translate Chinese headtobed_fe7d00b1:

    # s "He's not so bad. Just... well, I was gonna say inexperienced."
    s "他倒是不坏。就是...嗯，我本来想说，没什么经验。"

# game/script.rpy:8305
translate Chinese headtobed_dc6d9871_1:

    # "He gives a quiet laugh, and gestures towards you."
    "他轻轻一笑，指了指你。"

# game/script.rpy:8307
translate Chinese headtobed_223b48f8:

    # s "But you are, too. You should talk to the purser tomorrow. They'll be able to cobble together a mess kit for you."
    s "不过你也一样。你明天该去找事务长说说，他们应该能给你凑出一套伙食家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:8309
translate Chinese headtobed_d30083d5_1:

    # p "Oh. Thanks."
    p "哦，谢谢。"

# game/script.rpy:8313
translate Chinese headtobed_9477f79b:

    # s "You'll be a proper sailor soon enough. Anyway... you can go ahead and sleep, if you want."
    s "你很快就能成为一个像样的水手了。得了...想睡就睡吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8315
translate Chinese headtobed_d3f23b44:

    # s "I want to thank Bandile for that extra plate real quick. I appreciate you putting in a good word, too."
    s "我得赶紧谢谢Bandile多给了我那份吃的。也谢谢你帮我说话了。"

# game/script.rpy:8317
translate Chinese headtobed_99cc9c4d:

    # p "Well, you were right about the food."
    p "得，你说的没错，这伙食确实不错。"

# game/script.rpy:8319
translate Chinese headtobed_882ec33d:

    # s "Glad it made an impression. Your sleeping spot is... number 36, I think. Right?"
    s "看来我对你印象挺深的。你的铺位是...36号，没错吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8321
translate Chinese headtobed_a0b54a9f:

    # p "That's right. 36. Over by the third pillar, if I remember right."
    p "没错，36号。如果我没记错，就在第三根桅杆那边。"

# game/script.rpy:8325
translate Chinese headtobed_13d7e037:

    # s "Hey. Not bad."
    s "嘿，记性不错嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:8327
translate Chinese headtobed_136386b6:

    # "He nods, grinning, although he gives a self-deprecating gesture towards himself, too."
    "他笑着点点头，又有些不好意思地挠了挠头，显得很谦逊。"

# game/script.rpy:8329
translate Chinese headtobed_9c9aca4e:

    # s "This old noggin is able to retain some stuff. Bumps and everythin'."
    s "我这老脑瓜子，还能记住点东西，不容易啊。"

# game/script.rpy:8331
translate Chinese headtobed_ab665097:

    # p "You're not showing your, ah... advanced years, don't worry."
    p "你一点都不显老，别担心。"

# game/script.rpy:8333
translate Chinese headtobed_63857cc7:

    # "He grins at the teasing, and then nods with his muzzle towards Bandile, who is currently beginning to tidy up."
    "他笑着接受了我的调侃，然后努努嘴，示意了一下正在收拾东西的Bandile。"

# game/script.rpy:8337
translate Chinese headtobed_4422aebe:

    # s "Well, I'll take what I can get. Ya have a good night, [name]. I'll make sure and wake you up in the morning if I catch you sleeping in."
    s "行吧，能占点便宜就占点。[name]，晚安。明儿要是你偷懒睡过头了，我保证叫你起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8339
translate Chinese headtobed_149799cc:

    # p "Thanks, Sam. You sleep well, too."
    p "谢了，Sam。你也好好睡。"

# game/script.rpy:8346
translate Chinese headtobed_d3418332:

    # "You watch for a moment as he goes to talk to the cook, although it's not as though you'd be able to make out details of their conversation."
    "你看着他走去和厨师说话，不过你也听不清他们具体在聊些什么。"

# game/script.rpy:8352
translate Chinese headtobed_8ae41205:

    # "After a moment, you make your way to the third post. There are some linen hammocks in one of the crates. Two, one for Julian and one for yourself."
    "过了一会儿，你走到第三根桅杆旁。其中一个箱子里装着几张亚麻吊床，一张是给Julian的，一张是你的。"

# game/script.rpy:8354
translate Chinese headtobed_2c07ad12:

    # "You do have the sense that it might be easier to accomplish this task with more than one person. But, with some effort, you're able to get the hammock in place."
    "你觉得这活儿要是能有个人搭把手肯定更轻松。不过，费了点劲，你总算是把吊床给挂好了。"

# game/script.rpy:8356
translate Chinese headtobed_4e12338b:

    # "With even more effort, you're able to pull yourself up and into it, despite the cramped quarters. It's not exactly the coziest place you've ever slept..."
    "又费了九牛二虎之力，你才爬了上去，躺进了吊床，虽然空间有点挤。这可不是你睡过的最舒服的地方……"

# game/script.rpy:8358
translate Chinese headtobed_45fd5da0:

    # "But it's not the worst, either. And, as you stare at the ship above you, feeling its gentle motion and listening to the creak of ropes and timbers..."
    "但也还凑合。你抬头看着头顶的船，感受着它轻轻的摇晃，听着绳索和船板发出的嘎吱声……"

# game/script.rpy:8360
translate Chinese headtobed_85e97c7b:

    # "You're briefly aware of how exhausted you are. Then, sleep takes you, and you're not aware of anything at all."
    "你这才意识到自己有多累。然后，困意瞬间将你吞没，你什么都不知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:8375
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c6af313b:

    # "You decide your dinner plans don't include the crew, at least for now. Whether it's a lack of hunger or will to face a crowd, it's not the evening you had in mind."
    "你决定晚饭不和船员们一起吃了，至少现在不想。也许是没什么胃口，也许是不想面对人群，总之这和你原本想的晚上不太一样。"

# game/script.rpy:8396
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5d31c8aa:

    # "Instead, you turn towards the highest officer you had the pleasure to meet."
    "你转过身，走向了之前有幸见到的职位最高的大副——Arthur。"

# game/script.rpy:8398
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c3ab3980:

    # "Arthur, the first mate, isn't hard to spot. The horse towers over the rest of the crew, his size almost reflecting the importance of his role in the ship's hierarchy, standing stalwart next to the wall of the common area."
    "Arthur很好认，他身材高大，比其他船员高出一头，他的体型几乎象征着他在船上举足轻重的地位。他笔直地站在公共区域的墙边。"

# game/script.rpy:8405
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ca91ad64:

    # "Wall? Panel? Planks? It's wood, that's for sure, but you don't know if there's a nautical term for it. Wall will do for now, though you make a note not to use it in front of another sailor unless you hear it from them first."
    "墙？镶板？还是木板？反正就是木头做的，但你不知道有没有专门的航海术语来称呼它。现在先叫墙吧，不过你可得记住，除非你听到其他水手也这么说，不然别在他们面前用“墙”这个词。"

# game/script.rpy:8407
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1e0bf057:

    # "You also take notice of how he's bending downward to fit inside the cramped space surrounding you. This man, you think, was born to give orders on the deck."
    "你还注意到，他为了适应这狭小的空间，不得不弯着腰。你心想，这家伙就是天生要在甲板上发号施令的。"

# game/script.rpy:8416
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8b101172:

    # "You walk up to him."
    "你向他走去。"

# game/script.rpy:8418
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_77d8cb2c:

    # "As you get closer, you realize the first mate's forward slump is also letting him engage in a conversation with a smaller member of the crew."
    "走近了你才发现，大副微微弯着腰，也是为了和一个个头稍矮的船员说话。"

# game/script.rpy:8420
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2883e558:

    # "Well, smaller compared to him. The cheetah is still quite a bit taller than you are, her voice authoritative but soft, her eyes a piercing blue, her body slender."
    "嗯，是和他相比矮一些。那只猎豹其实还是比你高不少，她的声音沉稳而柔和，蓝色的眼睛锐利有神，身材也很苗条。"

# game/script.rpy:8422
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_af078e23:

    # "She's leaning against the wood, propping herself up to steady her balance against the movements of the ship."
    "她靠在木板上，借此保持平衡，以抵御船的摇晃。"

# game/script.rpy:8424
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cc2b97d3:

    # a "A week?"
    a "一个星期？"

# game/script.rpy:8426
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_261302ef:

    # ch "Most likely. With some luck, a couple days earlier. But I wouldn't push things too far—the fact he's able to keep his arm at all is a hair's width shy of a miracle."
    ch "多半如此。要是运气好，还能再提前个一两天。不过我劝你别太操之过急——他这条胳膊能保住没被锯掉，本身就只差毫厘便算得上是奇迹了。"
    # 译注：在18世纪航海医疗条件下，骨折极易致残或导致截肢。

# game/script.rpy:8428
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_aaeaa41f:

    # ch "Or maybe the miracle was delaying the infection until we made port. Either way, here's my professional advice: I'd rather not bet on being lucky all the time."
    ch "没准奇迹在于，感染被拖延到了我们进港。总之，我作为医生的建议是：最好别指望每次都这么走运。"

# game/script.rpy:8430
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0d9ecde7:

    # "The cheetah's voice is soft-spoken and deliberate. A slight accent to her tone betrays that she must be from somewhere you've not familiar with."
    "猎豹的声音轻柔而平缓，略带异域口音，听起来不像是来自你熟悉的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:8432
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9d13a6e5:

    # "The officer frowns, deep furrows developing around his eyes."
    "大副皱起了眉头，眼角的皱纹也更深了。"

# game/script.rpy:8434
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3385dc67:

    # a "I told them that we were in no hurry."
    a "我跟他们说了，我们不赶时间。"

# game/script.rpy:8436
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_25c78086:

    # ch "Accidents happen, Officer."
    ch "谁也不想出意外，长官。"

# game/script.rpy:8440
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6e60dc5d:

    # a "I know. It's not my first week."
    a "我又不是新来的。"

# game/script.rpy:8444
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0e29dd84:

    # a "But ideally, you'd want to avoid them."
    a "但最好还是避免的好。"

# game/script.rpy:8446
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6e5865f5:

    # "The officer stops, clearly mulling a decision over in his head. But as he takes his eyes off his conversation partner, he finally notices you standing there, waiting, listening in."
    "长官顿了顿，显然在琢磨着什么。他把目光从对方身上移开，这才注意到你站在一旁，像是在等什么，又像是在偷听。"

# game/script.rpy:8450
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c47f8994:

    # "His eyes narrow."
    "他眯起了眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:8452
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_81025793:

    # a "Something the matter, recruit?"
    a "有何贵干，新丁？"

# game/script.rpy:8454
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4ce109d2:

    # "His tone and attitude make you second guess yourself. What's the plan here? What were you thinking, exactly?"
    "他的语气让你开始怀疑自己是不是做错了。我到底想干什么？我到底在想些什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8456
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5eb8ec8a:

    # "You waltzed up to a superior you've barely spoken a few sentences to since you came on board. You better have a good reason for it."
    "你居然敢走到一个自从上船就没说过几句话的长官面前，最好有个像样的理由。"

# game/script.rpy:8459
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9ca59b0f:

    # p "I just..." nointeract
    p "我只是……"

# game/script.rpy:8479
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_88bb6056:

    # p "I guess I just wanted to talk."
    p "我...我就是想说说话。"

# game/script.rpy:8483
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_03986771:

    # "The officer turns to face you, his attention now fully captured. For better or worse."
    "长官转过身，注意力全在你身上了。这下可好，不知道是福是祸。"

# game/script.rpy:8485
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f6909c0d:

    # a "Talk? And what could you possibly-"
    a "聊聊？你又能有什么可——"

# game/script.rpy:8489
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_40b48602:

    # "Before he's able to finish his question, the woman he was speaking to cuts in."
    "他还没说完，和他说话的女人就插了进来。"

# game/script.rpy:8491
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4e2b557f:

    # ch "My apologies for the interruption, but—could I borrow him, Officer?"
    ch "打扰长官谈话实在冒昧，不过——我能借用他一下吗，长官？"

# game/script.rpy:8495
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3af4e2e8:

    # "Arthur's ear flicks in her direction. A hint of confusion—and curiosity, perhaps—cracks the stone-like facade of his face."
    "Arthur的耳朵朝她的方向微微抖动了一下。一丝困惑——或许还夹杂着些许好奇——在他那宛如石雕般冷峻的面容上裂开了一条缝隙。"

# game/script.rpy:8497
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e5ce1d0e:

    # a "Borrow?"
    a "借用？"

# game/script.rpy:8499
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_86791484:

    # ch "I'm afraid I need someone to help with Mr. Blackborow."
    ch "我恐怕需要人帮忙处理Blackborow先生的事情。"

# game/script.rpy:8503
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6146b07d:

    # "Something about the woman draws you in. You can't quite put your finger on it—there's more to it than simple curiosity. But it's a complicated feeling, and the more you try to grasp at it, the farther it escapes."
    "这位女士身上有某种特质深深吸引着你。你一时说不大上来——绝不仅仅是单纯的好奇心那么简单。但这是一种极为复杂的情绪，你越是试图去琢磨看透，它就越是飘忽不定、悄然溜走。"

# game/script.rpy:8505
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6b53eea3:

    # "You can't quite explain it but it compels your to let the next sentence cross your lips."
    "你无法解释它，但它迫使你说出下一句话。"

# game/script.rpy:8507
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d76ea944:

    # p "I wanted to speak to her."
    p "我想和她谈谈。"

# game/script.rpy:8512
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_890b2386:

    # "You hide your thoughts behind a confident tone, hoping this will make up for the fact you've never seen her before now."
    "你强装镇定，希望这样能掩盖你根本不认识她的事实。"

# game/script.rpy:8514
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b8657a97:

    # "Her ears twitch as she looks back at you in wide-eyed surprise. The long tail flicks against one of the barrels behind her."
    "她吃惊地回头看着你，耳朵动了一下。长长的尾巴扫到了她身后的一只桶。"

# game/script.rpy:8516
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6097e3ea:

    # ch "Excuse me?"
    ch "你说什么？"

# game/script.rpy:8520
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45eb6dd4:

    # "The first officer raises an eyebrow, not quite able to put things together either."
    "大副扬起眉毛，也有些摸不着头脑。"

# game/script.rpy:8522
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7c1a25c9:

    # a "Doctor, do you happen to know this recruit?"
    a "医生，你认识这位新兵吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8524
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7fad49de:

    # "Her silence is deliberate, as if she's digging through memories to make sure. Or maybe for a different reason."
    "她的沉默是故意的，好像在翻找记忆以确认。或者可能是出于其他原因。"

# game/script.rpy:8526
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_785c342e:

    # ch "...{w} I do not."
    ch "……{w}我不认识。"

# game/script.rpy:8531
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_07f0313b:

    # ch "But if he does want some of my time, I would happily exchange it for some help with Mr. Blackborow."
    ch "不过，如果他真想和我聊聊，我倒是可以让他帮我照看一下Blackborow先生。"

# game/script.rpy:8535
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3211b73b:

    # "The first officer snorts."
    "大副轻蔑地哼了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:8537
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ff78e4a8:

    # a "You have an entire ship's worth of more experienced sailors at your disposal."
    a "船上多的是比他有经验的水手。"

# game/script.rpy:8539
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_59aa036d:

    # "The woman shrugs her shoulders dismissively in response."
    "那女人耸耸肩，不屑地回应道。"

# game/script.rpy:8544
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_03583c7b:

    # ch "I just need another pair of hands. He's right here. He wants to be around even longer."
    ch "我只是缺个人手。他就在这儿，而且他还想多待会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8546
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fd09a9f0:

    # ch "Might as well take advantage of a lucky coincidence, no?"
    ch "有这等巧事，不用白不用，你说呢？"

# game/script.rpy:8550
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9146cff0:

    # "Arthur crosses his arms. His displeasure is evident, but so is his respect for the woman."
    "Arthur抱起胳膊，脸上写满了不悦，但看得出来，他对这位女士还是有几分敬意的。"

# game/script.rpy:8552
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_20173476:

    # a "Are you sure about this, Doctor?"
    a "你确定要这么做吗，医生？"

# game/script.rpy:8554
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_707bc7bb:

    # a "I can have any other sailor ready for the task in less than five minutes."
    a "我五分钟之内就能给你找个别的水手来。"

# game/script.rpy:8556
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6b768eb0:

    # "There's a palpable sense of awkwardness in your current predicament that neither of them seem to share. They may be used to this type of situation, but you're feeling slightly uncomfortable."
    "你们之间这气氛，尴尬得呦，就好像你们自己没感觉似的。他们可能早就习惯了，只有你觉得浑身不自在。"

# game/script.rpy:8558
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6b4d673d:

    # "You're not used to other people discussing your worth right in front of you, as if you weren't there."
    "被人当面评价你的价值，好像你根本不存在一样，你还没习惯这种事儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8564
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_99fdeb37:

    # ch "Officer, I need a pair of hands. Their provenance is irrelevant."
    ch "长官，我需要的是人手，其他的我不在乎。"

# game/script.rpy:8566
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a0211ea0:

    # ch "He's qualified, as long as he can follow instructions and stand still."
    ch "只要他听指挥，站得稳，那就够格。"

# game/script.rpy:8571
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6717bebf:

    # a "I can vouch for the latter, that's for sure."
    a "站得稳我倒是可以担保。"

# game/script.rpy:8573
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cd274b82:

    # ch "Then I might be able to vouch for the former once we're done."
    ch "那等事成之后，没准我还能担保他听指挥。"

# game/script.rpy:8579
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_36f18e9e:

    # "He looks at you intently for a few seconds, his face impenetrable—but not particularly friendly."
    "他目不转睛地审视了你几秒钟，神色高深莫测——但显然算不上有多友善。"

# game/script.rpy:8583
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0439f6d6:

    # "At last, he nods."
    "最终，他点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:8585
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f92d1dbd:

    # a "Very well. I trust your judgment, Doctor."
    a "好吧，我相信你的判断，医生。"

# game/script.rpy:8589
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a8aeace7:

    # a "You heard her. Let's go. We can talk when we're there."
    a "听见了吧？走吧，有什么事到了地方再说。"

# game/script.rpy:8595
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_eb422483:

    # "You follow them until you're out of the common area, stairs leading you deeper inside the bowels of the ship."
    "你跟着他们离开了公共区域，沿着楼梯向船舱深处走去。"

# game/script.rpy:8606
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_34a13ab9:

    # ch "Officer, had I known you were planning to tag along I wouldn't have asked for help."
    ch "长官，早知道你要跟来，我就不找人帮忙了。"

# game/script.rpy:8608
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7bd9d339:

    # a "I'm not going to stay. I have other duties to take care of this evening."
    a "我不留下，今晚还有别的事情要处理。"

# game/script.rpy:8610
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9e5e73f7:

    # a "I'm making time to assess Mr. Blackborow's health. An official confirmation that the treatment is working."
    a "我只是抽空看看布莱克伯勒先生的身体状况，确认一下治疗有没有效果。"

# game/script.rpy:8614
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b455bc36:

    # a "Rajeeyah... How confident are you about it, really?"
    a "Rajeeyah，你到底有多大把握？"

# game/script.rpy:8620
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3c156547:

    # r "He should be fine.{w} It's an infection. We have options to treat it, but there's always a level of randomness to account for. So far we've been lucky, but that's not something I want to rely on."
    r "他应该没事的。{w} 就是个感染，我们有办法治，但总有些意外情况。目前为止我们还算走运，但我不想把希望全放在运气上。"

# game/script.rpy:8625
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4162c3dd:

    # "The two of them walk ahead of you, continuing their conversation as if you weren't there. That's part of being crew, you think."
    "他们俩走在你前面，旁若无人地聊着。你心想，这就是当船员的命吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8627
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_40c2ef43:

    # "You exist when an officer needs you to exist, otherwise you're the equivalent of a plank of wood—a piece of the ship, necessary in numbers but insignificant in identity."
    "只有在长官需要你的时候，你的存在才有意义；除此以外，你不过就等同于甲板上的一块垫脚木板——只是整艘船的一个小小部件，在编制人数上不可或缺，可在个人身份上却微不足道。"

# game/script.rpy:8629
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ad88e87e:

    # "And yet, it's all that wood that makes things float. There's something oddly comforting about the thought."
    "不过话说回来，让船能漂起来，靠的可不就是这些木头吗？这么一想，心里竟然觉得踏实了不少。"

# game/script.rpy:8631
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5d281550:

    # "Your train of thoughts is interrupted by Arthur having to slow down and duck under the low ceiling."
    "Arthur不得不弯腰低头，这才打断了你的思绪。"

# game/script.rpy:8633
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c807eb61:

    # "The woman may be tall, but Arthur has her beat by a whole order of magnitude in the height department."
    "那女人可能算高的，但Arthur比她高了一个量级都不止。"

# game/script.rpy:8635
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9fa48c0e:

    # a "Is he conscious?"
    a "他醒着吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8637
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_462d49df:

    # r "He was when I left him, but I recommended he try to sleep. He needs rest. {w}Although waking him up shouldn't be an issue."
    r "我走的时候他还醒着，不过我让他尽量多睡会儿，他需要休息。{w} 叫醒他应该不难。"

# game/script.rpy:8644
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_56ea230b:

    # p "Excuse me, but... what happened?"
    p "打扰一下，请问……发生什么事了？"

# game/script.rpy:8646
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e0a92706:

    # "Arthur looks back at you over his shoulder."
    "Arthur回头看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:8648
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8336ff19:

    # a "Mr. Blackborow's arm got caught between chain links. The force tore the flesh straight off."
    a "老布莱克波罗先生的手臂被链环夹住了，硬生生把肉都给扯了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8650
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cf01356a:

    # p "You mean his... {w}arm... {w}is..."
    p "你是说他的... {w}胳膊... {w}没了...?"

# game/script.rpy:8652
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0c3d44b5:

    # r "Still where it should, and not missing as much as I feared. It could have been very, very much worse."
    r "还在原位，而且没我想的那么严重。本来可能更惨的。"

# game/script.rpy:8654
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cac56a5d:

    # a "I'm thankful it wasn't.{w} Mr. Blackborow is a good sailor... but he needs to learn that speed must be secondary to the safety of the crew."
    a "谢天谢地，没出大事儿。{w}布莱克波罗先生是个好水手...但他得明白，速度再快也比不上船员的安全重要。"

# game/script.rpy:8658
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_539a8608:

    # "Arthur takes the lead down the stairs to the lower deck, wood creaking under every step."
    "Arthur带头走下通往下层甲板的楼梯，每一步都发出木头的吱嘎声。"

# game/script.rpy:8663
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_539a8608_1:

    # "Arthur takes the lead down the stairs to the lower deck, wood creaking under every step."
    "Arthur带头走下通往下层甲板的楼梯，每一步都发出木头的吱嘎声。"

# game/script.rpy:8670
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_07fc6f7d:

    # "The environment down here is darker still and entirely devoid of noise. No lamps, and what little natural light comes in from the upper deck isn't enough to force back the overwhelming darkness."
    "下面更黑了，而且一点声音都没有。没有灯，上面甲板漏下来的那点光，根本不足以驱散这伸手不见五指的黑暗。"

# game/script.rpy:8672
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6d3704b6:

    # "The ambiance of a crew happily getting ready for dinner is muffled by the boards above."
    "头顶的木板隔绝了船员们兴高采烈准备晚餐的喧闹。"

# game/script.rpy:8676
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_893133fb:

    # "Rajeeyah grabs one of the lamps. She clearly has no intention of dealing with another accident."
    "Rajeeyah拿起一盏灯。显然她可不想再碰上什么意外了。"

# game/script.rpy:8678
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0379e77e:

    # p "Oh.. Officer?"
    p "哦...长官？"

# game/script.rpy:8682
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6f83c361:

    # a "Yes?"
    a "是？"

# game/script.rpy:8684
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7f1b9112:

    # p "I wanted to...{w}apologize for earlier today."
    p "我想...{w}为今天早上的事儿道个歉。"

# game/script.rpy:8686
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6c1d3670:

    # p "When I got in the way during loading, I mean. I should have paid more attention to my surroundings."
    p "就是装货的时候，我不小心挡了道。我应该多注意周围的。"

# game/script.rpy:8690
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7485f44e:

    # "Arthur stops."
    "Arthur停了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:8692
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5c729b3c:

    # "Rajeeyah does the same once she hears the footsteps halt behind her."
    "一听到身后的脚步声停了下来，Rajeeyah也随即止住了脚步。"

# game/script.rpy:8696
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_faf62d16:

    # a "Your apology is accepted."
    a "你的道歉我接受了。"

# game/script.rpy:8700
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6fb009cd:

    # a "But you'd do well to remember that at sea, there are things apologies can't fix. Consider, as an example, the guy we're about to see. There's always a cost to carelessness."
    a "但你最好记住，在海上，有些事儿光靠道歉是没用的。就拿咱们要见的那个倒霉蛋来说吧，粗心大意总是要付出代价的。"

# game/script.rpy:8702
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8a521bc6:

    # a "The difference being, Mr. Blackborow was rushing when there was no need for it. You were dawdling. {w}Loitering. {w}Lollygagging."
    a "不一样的是，Blackborow先生那是没必要赶的时候瞎着急。你呢，在那儿磨磨蹭蹭。{w}闲荡。{w}虚度光阴。"

# game/script.rpy:8704
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8fdd0e22:

    # a "That is why I think you're a {i}runt{/i}, recruit."
    a "这就是为什么我认为你是个{i}矮冬瓜{/i}，新丁。"

# game/script.rpy:8706
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d1b1e314:

    # "You gulp."
    "你咽了口唾沫。"

# game/script.rpy:8708
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_46466daf:

    # a "And I did not think I needed to explain this, but apparently I was wrong."
    a "而且我还以为这种事儿不用我多说呢，看来是我自作多情了。"

# game/script.rpy:8710
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6a83dcee:

    # a "I do, however, welcome honesty. In fact, I require it."
    a "不过，我喜欢诚实。 实际上，我需要的就是这个。"

# game/script.rpy:8712
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8c21ebbe:

    # a "Knowing when to swallow your pride is a prerequisite for a sailor. I'm glad that, at a minimum, you can check that virtue off the list."
    a "知道什么时候该认怂，是当水手的基本要求。 至少，你能做到这一点，勉强算你合格。"

# game/script.rpy:8714
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f290c2b4:

    # a "But to my eyes, you're a runt. And you'll keep being a runt until I'm given solid proof to the contrary."
    a "可在我眼里，你就是一个矮冬瓜。而且在拿出确凿证据向我证明你有真本事之前，你永远都只是个矮冬瓜。"

# game/script.rpy:8716
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d27f3463:

    # a "Are we clear on that?"
    a "听明白了没有？"

# game/script.rpy:8718
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0eee25b5:

    # p "Yes... Sir."
    p "明白了...长官。"

# game/script.rpy:8720
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ef85c08c:

    # a "Good."
    a "知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:8722
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a61dc4a5:

    # "The officer turns around and continues walking and ignoring you."
    "军官转过身，继续往前走，根本不搭理你。"

# game/script.rpy:8724
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_196b8869:

    # "The two of you catch up with Rajeeyah and soon after make it to the door you must be after."
    "你们俩赶紧追上Rajeeyah，没一会儿就到了那扇门前。"

# game/script.rpy:8726
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6ca55a5a:

    # r "Before we get to it, may I ask for your name?"
    r "在进去之前，能问一下你的名字吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8728
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a0cf73b1:

    # p "Ah... I'm [name]. [name] [family_name]."
    p "啊...我叫[name]。 [name] [family_name]。"

# game/script.rpy:8732
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5d1c289b:

    # r "A pleasure. I'm Rajeeyah al-Maghribi."
    r "很高兴认识你。我是Rajeeyah·马格里比。"

# game/script.rpy:8736
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9a6d4564:

    # "The cheetah then looks toward Arthur and he nods."
    "猎豹随后看向Arthur，Arthur点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:8740
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d18525c9:

    # "The doctor pushes down on the handle. The wooden door creaks open, light from her lamp slowly seeping into the room."
    "医生按下门把手。木门吱呀一声打开，灯光慢慢地从房间里流泻出来。"

# game/script.rpy:8742
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_78b66063:

    # a "You know, you should thank the Doctor. Breaking rank to ask for a chat with your superiors is..."
    a "你知道吗，你应该好好谢谢医生。擅自越级请求和上司谈话，这可是……"

# game/script.rpy:8747
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3db37c4e:

    # a "... It's not the kind of boldness that's rewarded with a long and fruitful career."
    a "...可不是什么能让你平步青云、飞黄腾达的举动。"

# game/script.rpy:8751
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_39bcda51:

    # a "Wouldn't have happened on a Navy vessel."
    a "这种事绝不可能发生在海军的船上。"

# game/script.rpy:8756
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_397a2519:

    # r "This ship isn't part of the Navy, Officer."
    r "长官，这艘船可不是海军的编制。"

# game/script.rpy:8758
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5b835d86:

    # a "And that's why he's not on deck getting ten."
    a "所以他才没在甲板上吃鞭子。"

# game/script.rpy:8762
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7d4856bc:

    # "Arthur lowers his head to pass through a door much too small for an officer of his size. The cheetah chuckles and follows suit."
    "Arthur俯下身子，穿过那扇对他这身板来说实在太小的门。猎豹轻笑着，也跟着走了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:8764
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_089858b0:

    # "After a second, you enter the room as well."
    "你也紧随其后，走进房间。"

# game/script.rpy:8777
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a42fe992:

    # "Rajeeyah's lamp floods the room with a nice warm light, enough to navigate it easily."
    "Rajeeyah的灯光温暖明亮，照亮了整个房间，让人能轻易看清里面的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:8779
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_98dcabab:

    # "The room is fairly furnished, for a ship. You can make out cabinets, a table, a couple chairs. There's a pen and paper on the table, and you spot an open letter too, though you can't make out any words."
    "这房间的陈设对于一艘船来说已经算相当不错了。你能看到几个柜子、一张桌子和几把椅子。桌上有纸和笔，还有一封打开的信，可惜你看不清上面的内容。"

# game/script.rpy:8781
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d82e1cd9:

    # "You notice bottles of medicines as well—at least what you assume to be—and some sparse books strewn around the place."
    "你还留意到了几瓶药水——至少你觉得那是药品——以及四处零散摊放着的几本书籍。"

# game/script.rpy:8783
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7be251fb:

    # "As you get closer to the table, you recognize the label on one of the bottles. Whiskey, half empty."
    "走近桌子，你认出了其中一个瓶子上的标签：威士忌，已经喝掉一半了。"

# game/script.rpy:8785
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d79aa39e:

    # "You make your way to the opposite side of the room, where the two are huddled around a bed. In it rests a bundle of sheets and shapes that take a few seconds for your eyes to recognize."
    "你走到房间的另一边，看到他们正围在一张床边。床上隆起一团，裹在被子里，你定睛看了几秒才认出那是什么。"

# game/script.rpy:8787
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_63a4260b:

    # "It's a jackal, buried under a blanket."
    "是一只胡狼，正埋在毯子下面。"

# game/script.rpy:8789
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_28773208:

    # p "That's... Mr. Blackborow, I presume?"
    p "这位是...布莱克波罗先生，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:8791
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9c4c62ac:

    # "Rajeeyah nods, her eyes darting back and forth over the figure below."
    "Rajeeyah点点头，目光在床上的人影身上来回游移。"

# game/script.rpy:8793
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4497e089:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow?"
    r "布莱克波罗先生？"

# game/script.rpy:8795
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_77d65967:

    # "No response."
    "没有回应。"

# game/script.rpy:8797
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_50068cf9:

    # r "Perce? Are you awake? {w}I need to take a look at the wound."
    r "珀西？醒醒？{w} 我得看看你的伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:8799
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9850f53c:

    # "Nothing."
    "没啥。"

# game/script.rpy:8801
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9c9cac8f:

    # p "Is he..."
    p "他这是……"

# game/script.rpy:8803
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6261e28d:

    # r "Out cold."
    r "睡死了。"

# game/script.rpy:8805
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_634f2534:

    # a "Is it bad?"
    a "情况很糟糕吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8807
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_533db5f6:

    # r "No, no. He's just sleeping.{w} He emptied a good chunk of the bottle."
    r "不，没事。他只是睡着了。{w} 他喝掉了瓶子里的大半威士忌。"

# game/script.rpy:8814
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1c200f8e:

    # "Rajeeyah weaves past you and steps over to one of the cabinets. She opens its doors, taking out a few items and laying them on what free space remains on the table."
    "Rajeeyah绕过你，走到一个柜子旁。她打开柜门，取出几样东西，放在桌面上仅剩的空地上。"

# game/script.rpy:8818
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1db74d34:

    # "More clanging fills the room as she organizes the table, clearing away the paper and books to make room for whatever item she actually needs."
    "她开始整理桌面，挪开纸笔和书籍，为她真正需要的物品腾出空间，房间里又响起一阵叮当声。"

# game/script.rpy:8823
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0e805d80:

    # "The sound of stirring coming from the bed makes you jump, but you welcome it excitedly nonetheless."
    "床上突然传来一阵动静，你吓了一跳，但随即又兴奋起来。"

# game/script.rpy:8828
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_47f56ef7:

    # a "Mr. Blackborow? Are you awake?"
    a "布莱克波罗先生？你醒了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8830
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1955af7e:

    # "The man groans in response. He struggles to pull his right arm out from under the sheets, bringing his hand to his head."
    "那人呻吟了一声作为回应。他费力地从被子里抽出右手，抬手扶住额头。"

# game/script.rpy:8836
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_50372e7d:

    # pb "Aah, the... I... Yes...?"
    pb "啊...这...我...是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8840
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a08f8622:

    # r "Perce. Sorry to have to wake you up, but I would need to have a look at the wound."
    r "珀西。抱歉吵醒了您，但我得检查一下您的伤势。"

# game/script.rpy:8842
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_70e42fce:

    # a "Mr. Blackborow, welcome back to the land of the living. How are you feeling?"
    a "布莱克伯勒先生，欢迎回到人间。感觉怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:8844
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fa969eec:

    # pb "Like dogshit."
    pb "感觉糟透了。"

# game/script.rpy:8846
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d16e32a3:

    # pb "Might be the injury."
    pb "可能是伤势的原因吧。"

# game/script.rpy:8848
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_72fa06fb:

    # pb "Might be the whiskey."
    pb "也可能是威士忌的缘故。"

# game/script.rpy:8850
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ee253bd6:

    # pb "I 'unno.{w} Might be the fact it's wearing off."
    pb "我也不知道。{w} 也许是药劲儿快过了。"

# game/script.rpy:8855
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e5d39cdb:

    # r "Both, I'd argue."
    r "我觉得两者都有可能。"

# game/script.rpy:8857
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cacdeaac:

    # "The man doesn't reply. He nods slowly, still lying in bed."
    "那人没吭声，依旧躺在床上，只是缓缓点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:8864
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_edab0d7f:

    # "Rajeeyah rests her palm on his head for a moment."
    "Rajeeyah把手放在他额头上探了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:8866
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d277c549:

    # r "Fever still present."
    r "还在发烧。"

# game/script.rpy:8868
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4d0300fa:

    # "She then carefully peels away the blanket from his torso, a soft {i}hmm{/i} escaping through her closed lips."
    "接着，她小心翼翼地揭开盖在他身上的毯子，轻轻地“嗯”了一声。"

# game/script.rpy:8870
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_21045591:

    # pb "Sir... What's the time?"
    pb "长官...现在什么时辰了？"

# game/script.rpy:8872
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3b786f92:

    # a "Almost nightfall."
    a "差不多要入夜了。"

# game/script.rpy:8876
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d59ebd9c:

    # pb "Fuck... did I miss-"
    pb "糟糕... 我是不是耽误事儿了-"

# game/script.rpy:8878
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4c878c18:

    # r "Easy, Mr. Blackborow. I'll make sure you are going to be fed when we are done here."
    r "别急，布莱克伯勒先生。完事之后，我保证饿不着您。"

# game/script.rpy:8882
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4a99772f:

    # pb "Thank you. Could eat a horse... {w}No offense, sir."
    pb "多谢啦。我现在饿得能吞下一整匹马……{w}无意冒犯，长官。"
    # 译注：pb为水手Perce Blackborow。eat a horse为饥饿俚语，Arthur是马，所以急忙道歉"No offense"。

# game/script.rpy:8886
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_577f25f4:

    # a "None taken."
    a "不会。"

# game/script.rpy:8890
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b3b7d03a:

    # "Rajeeyah rolls up the blanket, revealing the extent of the man's injuries. You can't make out much beneath the tight layers of white bandages, which cover the lower half of his left arm."
    "Rajeeyah卷起毯子，露出了他受伤的部位。只见他左臂下半部分缠着厚厚的白色绷带，看不清里面的具体情况。"

# game/script.rpy:8892
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8c51acdd:

    # r "Perce, this is Mr. [family_name]. He will be assisting me today."
    r "珀西，这位是[family_name]先生。今天他会来帮我。"

# game/script.rpy:8903
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_52be9929:

    # "You step out from behind the other two. You wave your hand awkwardly, feeling like an uninvited guest at a family reunion."
    "你从他们身后走出来，尴尬地挥挥手，感觉自己像个不速之客，闯入了人家的家宴。"

# game/script.rpy:8907
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d6a7ab13:

    # pb "Who's that?"
    pb "你老爹是谁？"

# game/script.rpy:8909
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8f85a944:

    # a "New recruit. We've had some open spots to replenish before departure."
    a "新来的。起航前，我们得把空缺补上。"

# game/script.rpy:8911
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6091ff4d:

    # pb "Barely on board and already a surgeon's assistant? Oh, he's... He's good."
    pb "刚上船就成了外科医生的助手？哦，看来... 有两下子啊。"

# game/script.rpy:8915
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fc52f286:

    # "Arthur snorts loudly and deliberately."
    "Arthur重重地哼了一声，带着明显的嘲讽意味。"

# game/script.rpy:8917
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b2edeaef:

    # r "No, I just needed someone to stand there and look pretty. His role in this is sheer coincidence."
    r "不，我只是需要一个站在那儿充场面的。他能帮上忙，纯属巧合。"

# game/script.rpy:8919
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ebf1f332:

    # pb "Fair enough. Hard to mess that up."
    pb "说得也是。这事儿嘛，的确不容易搞砸。"

# game/script.rpy:8921
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45c82c0c:

    # "You fold your ears down, unsure what you're even here for. The jackal cackles."
    "你耷拉着耳朵，也不知道自己来干什么的。那只老狐狸在那儿偷笑。"

# game/script.rpy:8925
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9aacf782:

    # a "Doctor, are you certain the whiskey has worn off?"
    a "医生，您确定他身上的酒劲儿已经散了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:8927
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_451420cf:

    # r "If it hasn't, it's going to very soon."
    r "就算没散，也快了。"

# game/script.rpy:8931
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_796a7eb4:

    # "As Rajeeyah unwraps the bandages, you notice that the deeper she goes, the more the cloth takes on a shade of pink."
    "Rajeeyah解开绷带，你注意到越往深处，布料的颜色就越发泛红。"

# game/script.rpy:8933
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9192dcf0:

    # r "Last call. If you can't stomach seeing blood, this is your chance to look away."
    r "最后一眼了。要是你受不了见血，现在就赶紧转过头去。"

# game/script.rpy:8937
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b11b8ae9:

    # "You shake your head, keeping your eyes on the wound."
    "你摇摇头，眼睛还是盯着伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:8939
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3c980cd3:

    # "You watch as she carefully peels off the last layer. The wound isn't as large as you feared, but you could easily fit a finger inside the gash."
    "你眼瞧着她小心翼翼地揭开最后一层。伤口没你以为的那么大，但塞进去一根手指头那是绰绰有余。"

# game/script.rpy:8941
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d15b5184:

    # "Two, you think as the doctor slowly reveals more of the naked flesh. Maybe three, even."
    "“两个”，你心里估摸着，随着大夫慢慢地露出更多的皮肉。“也许三个，搞不好呢。”"

# game/script.rpy:8943
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b5dbfbcc:

    # r "It's looking better, at least. You can take your mind off that."
    r "起码现在看起来好多了。你可以稍微放松一下，别老盯着那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8945
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3bb7eb1a:

    # "You'll have to take Rajeeyah's word for it. It doesn't take a surgeon to notice colors and liquids in that gap that should be nowhere near a healthy person's insides. But she sounds genuine."
    "你只能听Rajeeyah的。要说这伤口，那可不用外科大夫也能看出来，那道口子里面的颜色和液体，压根儿就不该出现在正常人身上。不过她听起来倒是挺有把握。"

# game/script.rpy:8958
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b1469ced:

    # "Suddenly, these bottles you can't quite recognize are the most interesting thing in the world. And that whiskey, is it aged? Strong stuff? You examine the label in the dim light with great interest."
    "突然间，那些你叫不上名字的瓶瓶罐罐成了这世上最有意思的东西。还有那瓶威士忌，陈酿了多久？够不够劲儿？你在昏暗的灯光下饶有兴致地研究着标签。"

# game/script.rpy:8960
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f7db41e0:

    # "It looks expensive. Sick bay might not be so bad after all."
    "瞧着挺贵的。这么看来，待在医务室好像也没那么糟糕。"

# game/script.rpy:8962
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9e66107f:

    # r "The wound is looking better, at least. You can take your mind off that."
    r "起码现在看起来好多了。你可以稍微放松一下，别老盯着那儿。"

# game/script.rpy:8964
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4ffebe88:

    # "As you mull over the opportunity of getting black out drunk to escape the noises and moans coming from the patient, a call snaps you back to reality."
    "你寻思着要不要把自己灌个烂醉，好逃避病人发出的鬼哭狼嚎，一声呼唤把你拽回了现实。"

# game/script.rpy:8975
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_94b0d3ba:

    # r "The water under the table, please."
    r "“把桌子底下的水递给我。”"

# game/script.rpy:8977
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_30561f63:

    # "You spring into action and bend down, searching for a glass bottle and finding it stashed away next to one of the chairs."
    "你立马行动，弯腰去摸，在一个椅子边上摸到了藏着的玻璃瓶。"

# game/script.rpy:8983
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cdc6847a:

    # "You open it and place it down right next to her."
    "你打开瓶子，放到她手边。"

# game/script.rpy:8987
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a95b3b0a:

    # "You open it and carry it back to Rajeeyah, making sure to keep the woman's silhouette between you and the man on the bed."
    "你打开瓶子，拿着水回到Rajeeyah身边，留心用那个女人挡住你和病床上那家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:8989
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c265bda4:

    # r "Thank you."
    r "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:8991
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e974b7c7:

    # a "What's your official assessment, Doctor? Is it healing well?"
    a "医生，您怎么看？伤口恢复得怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:8993
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e23f14ff:

    # "Rajeeyah's answer comes with her eyes locked on the wound."
    "Rajeeyah回答时，眼睛一直没离开伤口。"

# game/script.rpy:8995
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ae2edea3:

    # r "\"Well\" might be a bit of a strong word, sir."
    r "“好得很”未免有点言过其实了，长官。"

# game/script.rpy:8997
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_407ff885:

    # r "But it is starting to look better than before."
    r "不过，看起来确实比之前好多了。"

# game/script.rpy:8999
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b0cf6a41:

    # a "You're going to have to be more formal than that, Doctor."
    a "医生，请您更严谨一点。"

# game/script.rpy:9004
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_feee5ec7:

    # r "We're keeping our fingers crossed and hoping it keeps progressing this way."
    r "我们只能祈祷，希望情况继续好转。"

# game/script.rpy:9006
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6f44e7ee:

    # r "If it does, he's going to be fine."
    r "如果顺利的话，他就没事了。"

# game/script.rpy:9008
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ffbf0c0d:

    # "You didn't realize you were holding your breath until you noticed yourself suddenly exhaling at her conclusion."
    "你听到她说完，才意识到自己刚才一直屏着呼吸，一下子放松了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:9010
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_24aecb07:

    # r "We should have started treatment way sooner, but no use crying over spilt milk. What's done is done."
    r "我们本该早点开始治疗的，唉，现在说这些也于事无补。都过去了。"

# game/script.rpy:9014
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_598f6b92:

    # pb "That's good news. {w}It's good news, right?"
    pb "这是个好消息。 {w}是好消息，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9016
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_66ad4f2a:

    # a "It is."
    a "的确晚了。"

# game/script.rpy:9022
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e28672d3:

    # "It's clear that Mr. Blackborow isn't enjoying the procedure."
    "很明显，Blackborow先生不太享受这个过程。"

# game/script.rpy:9024
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9d26a628:

    # "No matter how hard he attempts to keep a stone-faced expression, his lips can't stop the occasional hiss or grunt of pain from escaping."
    "尽管他极力想面无表情，但还是会忍不住发出嘶嘶声或痛苦的呻吟。"

# game/script.rpy:9026
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_119e1dd6:

    # "The cheetah works diligently, punctuating his reactions with splashes of water. She makes clean-up look easy, but you're certain all of her movements are carefully and expertly planned."
    "这只猎豹干活很卖力，时不时地用水花来缓解他的不适。她清理起来似乎毫不费力，但你确信她的每一个动作都经过精心设计。"

# game/script.rpy:9028
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4edced7b:

    # "Suddenly, Arthur breaks the silence."
    "突然，Arthur打破了沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:9030
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c584bc60:

    # a "That's enough for me. As I have other matters to attend to, I'll leave the rest of this situation in your hands."
    a "行了，就这样吧。我还有别的事，剩下的事就由你们善后了。"

# game/script.rpy:9032
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ea545718:

    # a "Mr. Blackborow. {w}Doctor. {w}Runt."
    a "Blackborow先生。{w}医生。{w}矮冬瓜。"

# game/script.rpy:9034
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5c778bc7:

    # "He accompanies each name and epithet with a nod. Rajeeyah nods back, while Perce gives a subtle salute in response. You mirror it."
    "他每说一个名字或称谓，就点一下头。Rajeeyah点头回应，而Perce则回敬了一个微妙的敬礼。你模仿了它。"

# game/script.rpy:9041
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d4b7d385:

    # "Arthur bends down and leaves through the cabin's door. It closes behind him with a loud clack, leaving the three of you to the task at hand."
    "Arthur弯下腰，从船舱的门走了出去。门在他身后砰的一声关上，把这事儿留给你们三个了。"

# game/script.rpy:9049
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_24901623:

    # pb "Runt?"
    pb "矮冬瓜？"

# game/script.rpy:9054
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2ea92f02:

    # "Rajeeyah shakes her head."
    "Rajeeyah摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:9056
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_24717f73:

    # r "Can't say I was there when he earned that title."
    r "我可不知道他啥时候落下的这名声。"

# game/script.rpy:9060
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_dc567af7:

    # p "I—I may not have made the best first impression earlier today."
    p "我——今天早些时候我给他留下的第一印象恐怕不太妙。"

# game/script.rpy:9065
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5183aab8:

    # "Your voice is quiet, not wanting to draw further attention to your failures."
    "你的声音很小，不想让更多人注意到你出的糗。"

# game/script.rpy:9067
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4fe94b26:

    # p "Might have stood in the way of the crane when I stumbled around the harbor looking for this ship. {w}Like a fool."
    p "我找船的时候，傻了吧唧地差点撞上起重机。{w}像个傻瓜。"

# game/script.rpy:9069
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_27386beb:

    # pb "Oh yeah. That'll get ol' Arthur riled up..."
    pb "哦，是吗。那老Arthur肯定要炸毛了……"

# game/script.rpy:9074
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_83f2e514:

    # p "I hope it won't hang over my head for too long. It's not exactly the start I'd imagined."
    p "我希望这事儿别记我太久。这可不是我想要的开局。"

# game/script.rpy:9078
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1cc6f367:

    # pb "Don't worry. Some of the best—Ah!... Careful, Doctor..."
    pb "别放在心上。有些最棒的水手——啊！……轻点，医生……"

# game/script.rpy:9082
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b3f5f6ed:

    # r "I'm being as careful as I can be."
    r "我已经尽可能小心了。"

# game/script.rpy:9086
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3d6a95be:

    # pb "I know. Sorry."
    pb "我知道。对不起。"

# game/script.rpy:9090
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09a44aea:

    # pb "But yes, some of the best crew have started with mishaps. With him you're as good as your last day and if you do well, he will leave you alone."
    pb "跟你说，不少优秀的船员一开始都出过岔子。在他眼里，你怎么样全看最后表现，要是你干得好，他自然会放你一马。"

# game/script.rpy:9092
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_331b6ded:

    # pb "Just make him think you fixed whatever problem you had. That's the trick."
    pb "只要让他觉得你把问题解决了就行。这就是诀窍。"

# game/script.rpy:9094
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3c864e72:

    # p "That's my main worry. I haven't exactly got a lot of experience in..."
    p "这正是我担心的。我在这方面没什么经验...……"

# game/script.rpy:9096
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d904a574:

    # pb "Then you better get around to gaining it, no? And fast."
    pb "那你最好赶紧积累点经验，不是吗？还得抓紧。"

# game/script.rpy:9098
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1d7de193:

    # r "Sorry to interrupt. Mr. [family_name], I need the little green bottle."
    r "抱歉打断一下。[family_name]先生，我需要那个绿色的小瓶子。"

# game/script.rpy:9107
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3de7bc63:

    # "You turn back towards the table, examining the glassware. It's hard to tell in the dim light, but you spot a little green bottle on the left side."
    "你转过身，看向桌子，检查着玻璃器皿。在昏暗的光线下很难分辨，但你发现左侧有一个绿色的小瓶子。"

# game/script.rpy:9109
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cbb5e115:

    # "And one in the middle. {w}And a third behind the first."
    "中间也有一个。{w}第一个后面还有第三个。"

# game/script.rpy:9113
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b7e596e3:

    # "You lift the rightmost one from the table to show her."
    "你从桌子上拿起最右边的那个给她看。"

# game/script.rpy:9115
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4f49108a:

    # p "This one?"
    p "这个？"

# game/script.rpy:9117
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1f50ff48:

    # r "No, no. That one there.{w} On the left."
    r "不，不。是那个。{w}在左边。"

# game/script.rpy:9128
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7835c0e6:

    # "Another attempt. This time she nods approvingly, so you take the bottle over to the bed."
    "又试了一次。这次她满意地点点头，你便把瓶子拿到了床边。"

# game/script.rpy:9130
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_287796b4:

    # p "What's in it?"
    p "里面是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9132
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_974bc2de:

    # r "The liquid? A mixture of water and silver."
    r "液体？是水和银的混合物。"

# game/script.rpy:9134
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_013720d8:

    # p "Oh, that makes sense. {w}... Wait, silver? {w}Shiny? {w}Extremely expensive?"
    p "哦，这倒说得通。{w}...等等，银？{w}闪闪发光的银？{w}贼贵的那种？"

# game/script.rpy:9136
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_bec3b4af:

    # r "Yes."
    r "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:9140
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4ce42bd5:

    # pb "Only the best for a dedicated and conscientious member of the crew! Oh, I'm touched, Doctor."
    pb "当然要把最好的给最敬业的船员！哎哟，医生，这可真让我感动。"

# game/script.rpy:9142
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4f7ccc2e:

    # "Rajeeyah holds the bottle in front of the lamp, checking its content against the light. It's small enough for her to hold it in one hand."
    "Rajeeyah举着瓶子在灯光下照看，检查里面的液体。瓶子不大，她一只手就能握住。"

# game/script.rpy:9144
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a3c723ee:

    # r "It is {i}very{/i} diluted."
    r "里面的东西{i}非常{/i}稀。"

# game/script.rpy:9148
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0a767c26:

    # pb "Well there goes my romantic portrait of life on the ship. Could have left me in the dark."
    pb "唉，我对船上生活的浪漫幻想就这么破灭了，还不如让我蒙在鼓里呢。"

# game/script.rpy:9153
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8d2d9b1f:

    # r "We got what helps. Is that not enough?"
    r "我们有能帮上忙的药，这还不够吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9157
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_60f26681:

    # pb "More than enough, I'd say."
    pb "足够了，绝对足够了。"

# game/script.rpy:9164
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8f2031bb:

    # "She applies the mixture to his wound with the same care as before. Mr. Blackborow reacts with the same forcefully suppressed grunts."
    "她像之前一样小心地把药涂在他的伤口上。布莱克波罗先生还是老样子，极力压着嗓子，哼哼唧唧的。"

# game/script.rpy:9168
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_66bdc35d:

    # "While you keep your distance, she applies some of the mixture to the wound."
    "你站在一边，她小心地把药涂在伤口上。"

# game/script.rpy:9170
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4c9cd22f:

    # "The rest is just re-dressing, which Rajeeyah does with consummate experience and... mostly clean bandages."
    "剩下的就是重新包扎，Rajeeyah凭着熟练的手法，用还算干净的绷带完成了包扎。"

# game/script.rpy:9174
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b310753b:

    # "Once the doctor seems to have completed her operation, she stashes the dirty pieces of cloth in a corner of the cabin, before gesturing to Mr. Blackborow he's free to get back under his blanket."
    "医生似乎是弄完了，就把那些脏布头塞到小屋的角落里，然后朝布莱克波罗先生示意，让他躺回被窝里。"

# game/script.rpy:9176
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f4256a26:

    # r "And we are done. As usual, keep the arm as still as possible and avoid any unnecessary movement in general."
    r "好了，完事。老规矩，尽量别动胳膊，总的来说也别乱动。"

# game/script.rpy:9178
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1936a4ab:

    # r "Mr. [family_name], thank you for your assistance."
    r "[family_name]先生，多谢帮忙。"

# game/script.rpy:9180
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7a7c7994:

    # p "I'm glad I could help."
    p "乐意之至。"

# game/script.rpy:9182
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fc3bd53d:

    # "You suppress a smile. Mr. [family_name] sure sounds better than \"runt.\" "
    "你强忍着笑意。[family_name]先生听起来可比“矮冬瓜”体面顺耳多了。"

# game/script.rpy:9184
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ba9db420:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow, we'll be meeting again tomorrow for another check. I'll see that someone brings dinner down here as soon as I'm able to."
    r "布莱克波罗先生，明天咱们还得再看看。我尽快让人把晚饭给你送下来。"

# game/script.rpy:9186
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8a8428fd:

    # pb "Thank you, Doctor. Wouldn't want to escape maiming just to end up starving in a bed right below the galley."
    pb "谢谢您，医生。我可不想躲过了截肢，结果饿死在厨房下面的床铺上。"

# game/script.rpy:9188
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_07140bbb:

    # pb "I mean... Thank you. I appreciate it."
    pb "我是说...谢谢。我感激不尽。"

# game/script.rpy:9190
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e75b96b7:

    # "With the job done and things tidied up, the two of you leave Perce to his rest."
    "活儿干完，东西也收拾好了，你们俩就让Perce好好休息。"

# game/script.rpy:9200
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8d6d4261:

    # r "Good job."
    r "干得不错。"

# game/script.rpy:9204
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_842c7d9e:

    # p "Thanks, but... Why did you want me to help you, anyway? Don't you have a surgeon's mate?"
    p "谢谢，不过...你干嘛非得让我帮忙啊？你不是有外科助手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9208
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d78d5d79:

    # r "I'd have preferred to know ahead of time that blood troubles you, though."
    r "不过，你要是晕血，你早说啊。"

# game/script.rpy:9210
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c9c8863b:

    # p "I didn't exactly know what to expect. You just{cps=2}...{/cps} borrowed me, I guess."
    p "我也不知道会发生什么。你直接就{cps=2}...{/cps}把我抓过来了，大概是这样吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9215
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5ce2b935:

    # "She laughs. As eloquent and professional as she comes across, her laughter is soft and gentle."
    "她笑了。平时说话那么头头是道，那么专业，笑起来却轻声细语的。"

# game/script.rpy:9217
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_193d4296:

    # p "Don't you have a surgeon's mate, anyway?"
    p "话说回来，你不是有外科助手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9222
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_47cc2e74:

    # r "I do. But he'd already disappeared for dinner, and you..."
    r "是有。可他跑去吃晚饭了，你嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:9224
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d9fb9ba3:

    # r "Well, you were right there. That's all."
    r "刚好就在那儿呗，就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:9226
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_87b6b1dc:

    # "The two of you walk back to the stairs. It's a slower and more careful trek, as the doctor's lamp was left in the room with Mr. Blackborow. Intentionally, you assume."
    "你们俩慢慢地往楼梯走回去。这次比来时更慢更小心，因为医生的灯还留在布莱克波罗先生的房间里。估计她是故意的。"

# game/script.rpy:9228
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3284d93c:

    # "She doesn't seem to have any trouble navigating the dark corridors. You hold a hand out to the wall, as caution, following behind at a short distance. Soon, you reach the stairs."
    "她在黑黢黢的走廊里走得挺溜。你也扶着墙，小心翼翼地跟在后面。很快，你们就走到楼梯口了。"

# game/script.rpy:9234
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1596a2c3:

    # r "I should get cleaned up."
    r "我得去洗洗了。"

# game/script.rpy:9236
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_920d0769:

    # r "And you should hurry back to the common area before Bandile packs away his pots. They won't wait for you."
    r "你最好赶紧回餐厅，不然 Bandile 可就要收摊了。他们不会等你开饭的。"

# game/script.rpy:9242
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b90eebd2:

    # "As soon as you hear that, you grab the banister and swing yourself upwards with gusto, stumbling over the steps, but quickly catching up with her. Rajeeyah chuckles in response."
    "你一听，立马抓住楼梯扶手，起劲地往上荡，虽然跌跌撞撞，但很快就赶上了她。Rajeeyah 笑着回应。"

# game/script.rpy:9244
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_23c374c3:

    # p "Sorry, just... Really hungry."
    p "抱歉，只是...太饿了。"

# game/script.rpy:9246
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2627bf9e:

    # "You both exit the stairs, being led back out again into the common area.{w}The sounds of other people chatting and playing cards, along with the sparse few still eating dinner, fill the space again."
    "你们走下楼梯，又回到了餐厅。{w}人们聊天、玩牌，还有零星几位还在吃饭的声音再次充满了整个空间。"

# game/script.rpy:9250
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_157b72b8:

    # "The two of you cross the open space, past the makeshift common area and past all the tables and crates populated by the crew."
    "你们穿过空地，经过临时搭建的公共区域，走过船员们占据的桌子和货箱。"

# game/script.rpy:9252
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d420f900:

    # "The atmosphere is jovial, but you can tell by the tone of people conversing that the evening is starting to wind down."
    "气氛很欢快，但从人们的语气中能听出来，夜幕已经开始降临。"

# game/script.rpy:9254
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_83170567:

    # "Worried about the status of your dinner, you hasten your step, eyes fixed on the cook's location..."
    "担心自己的晚餐，你加快脚步，眼睛紧盯着厨师的位置……"

# game/script.rpy:9256
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_56d92e8f:

    # "... only to get stopped in your tracks by an arm popping out of some sailors huddled around a table."
    "……结果一只胳膊突然从一群挤在桌子旁的水手中伸出来，拦住了你的去路。"

# game/script.rpy:9258
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_396a4ef4:

    # "You turn to your side and find yourself staring down at a certain lizard."
    "你转过身，发现自己正盯着一只蜥蜴。"

# game/script.rpy:9260
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e1aee598:

    # j "Hey, [name]! Where have you been?"
    j "嘿，[name]！你跑哪儿去了？"

# game/script.rpy:9262
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09730b6c:

    # "You point at Rajeeyah, who is already several steps ahead of you."
    "你指了指 Rajeeyah，她已经走到你前面好几步远了。"

# game/script.rpy:9264
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d13e44f7:

    # p "I was asked to help, I...{w} I'll be right back, I just—just wanted to...{w} I'm just going to go grab dinner."
    p "别人叫我去搭把手，我……{w}我马上就回来，我只是——只是想……{w}我这就去领晚饭。"

# game/script.rpy:9266
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c51ecaca:

    # "You don't leave Julian enough time to formulate a reply, or an objection. You shove his arm aside and march your way to the cook, just as Rajeeyah disappears off somewhere with two plates."
    "你没给 Julian 留出反应或反驳的时间，一把推开他的胳膊，径直走向厨师，这时 Rajeeyah 正好端着两个盘子消失在某个地方。"

# game/script.rpy:9268
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f77e73c9:

    # "You don't particularly care about what's in it, only that it's particularly full. You thank the cook—Bandile—and make your way back, already nibbling on some of the bread."
    "你并不怎么在乎盘子里盛的是啥，只要塞得满满当当就行。你向大厨——Bandile——真诚道了谢，便端着餐盘折返回去，嘴里早已嚼起了几口硬面包。"

# game/script.rpy:9283
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_00e2f0ec:

    # "As you return to Julian's table, you realize he—and Samuel by his side—have been watching you over their shoulders all this time."
    "当你回到Julian那一桌时，你才发觉他和身旁的Samuel这一路上都扭着脖子直勾勾地盯着你呢。"

# game/script.rpy:9298
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3553c78d:

    # "There are two other sailors with them—a lynx and a peregrine falcon."
    "跟他们坐在一块儿的还有另外两名水手——一只猞猁和一只游隼。"

# game/script.rpy:9312
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1a06707d:

    # s "And our happy little family is complete at last!"
    s "我们这快乐的小家庭总算团聚了！"

# game/script.rpy:9314
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_34d0fbea:

    # s "So tell me, oh Prodigal Son, what exactly made Rajeeyah pick {i}you{/i} out of the litter, like? Curiosity's devourin' me."
    s "所以说快跟我招了吧，我们的大浪子，到底是因为啥让Rajeeyah偏偏从这一窝新兵里挑中{i}你{/i}了？我这好奇心抓心挠肝的都快把我吃了。"

# game/script.rpy:9318
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45a8096b:

    # j "Rajeeyah?"
    j "“Rajeeyah？”"

# game/script.rpy:9320
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c9efa249:

    # s "She's the ship's surgeon. So, do ya know anything 'bout medicine, [name]?"
    s "她是船上的外科医生。[name]，你懂医术吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9337
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_624a5963:

    # "You shrug and sit down with the group."
    "你耸耸肩，在人群中坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:9339
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_34477ca6:

    # p "No, not really. She just needed someone to fetch her a few things."
    p "不，不太懂。她只是需要人帮她跑腿。"

# game/script.rpy:9341
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4168bece:

    # p "I was around. That's all."
    p "我正好在附近，就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:9346
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9bbc8f94:

    # s "...{w} Well, sounds like a good enough reason to me."
    s "……{w}好吧，听起来理由很充分。"

# game/script.rpy:9348
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ed61e0e8:

    # "You finally dig into the food. The salmon is great—juicy, flavorful, garnished with... Things your brain doesn't fully register."
    "你终于迫不及待地大快朵颐起来。这鲑鱼滋味极棒——多汁、鲜美，还点缀着……一些你脑子一时根本辨认不出来的香料。"

# game/script.rpy:9350
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8b8f7be8:

    # "Hunger makes it taste incredible, but it also makes it harder to stop and appreciate the details."
    "饥饿感让食物变得无比美味，但也让你难以停下来细细品味。"

# game/script.rpy:9352
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_801940ac:

    # "You look up from your plate to notice the two other sailors staring at you, an amused look on their faces."
    "你从盘子里抬起头，注意到另外两个水手正盯着你，脸上带着戏谑的表情。"

# game/script.rpy:9354
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_13bf6394:

    # p "Uh, sorry... That was rude of me. I'm [name], it's a pleasure."
    p "呃，抱歉……我太失礼了。[name]，很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:9361
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f3878271:

    # "Samuel stretches his long legs under the table with a pleased smirk. It's time for introductions."
    "Samuel咧嘴一笑，在桌子底下伸了个懒腰，两条大长腿也跟着伸展开来。看来该轮到我们自我介绍了。"

# game/script.rpy:9363
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_291e5925:

    # s "That's Konrad over here and Torres on our... er, my left, your right. And, to your most shocked surprise, they're also members of the crew."
    s "这位是 Konrad，那边那位是 Torres，在我们的……呃，我的左边，你的右边。更让你惊讶的是，他们也是船员。"

# game/script.rpy:9365
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09b1e83d:

    # p "Ah, nice to meet you two."
    p "啊，很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:9369
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d5ac5d38:

    # "You reach across the table to shake hands with them. Torres goes for it first."
    "你越过桌子，准备和他们握手。Torres抢先伸出了手。"

# game/script.rpy:9371
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_11feb4de:

    # t "So, another part of the new blood, ay? Torres, the pleasure is mine."
    t "哟，又来个新来的？Torres，很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:9373
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cb6a7ef6:

    # "Torres is polite and affable. Warm, smiling, well groomed—perhaps exceedingly so? The bright blue feathers in his hat feel a tad too much for a sailor."
    "Torres待人既客气又和蔼。热情、笑脸迎人、衣着光鲜得体——甚至可以说得体过了头？他帽子上那几根亮蓝色的羽毛，瞧着未免比普通水手招摇扎眼了些。"

# game/script.rpy:9375
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_07649060:

    # "It's the lynx's turn to offer you his hand. Unlike Torres, his grip is firm and strong, almost to the point of discomfort."
    "现在轮到lynx向你伸出手了。和Torres不同，他的手劲很大，几乎要捏疼你了。"

# game/script.rpy:9377
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_94c0c66e:

    # "It's the grip of a sailor who's more familiar with ropes and wooden planks than people, and you are thankful once he decides to release your hand."
    "这是一个水手的握力，他对绳索和木板比对人更熟悉，你很庆幸他决定松开你的手。"

# game/script.rpy:9379
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45f305e5:

    # k "Name's Konrad, boy, and that's a pleasure for me as well. Samuel told us about ya earlier."
    k "我叫Konrad，小子，很高兴认识你。Samuel之前跟我们提起过你。"

# game/script.rpy:9381
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_defecb35:

    # "You're not surprised when he introduces himself as the shipwright. He brushes along his beard, playing expertly with the three braids he's split it in."
    "当他自我介绍说是船匠时，你并不感到惊讶。他捋了捋胡子，熟练地摆弄着他把胡子分成的三股辫子。"

# game/script.rpy:9383
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_05a5a8fe:

    # "He's roughly in his forties, but his manners seem to project a mindset far beyond his age. And in the eyes of the others at the table, a high level of respect."
    "他大概四十多岁，但他的举止似乎表现出一种远超他年龄的心态。在桌边其他人的眼中，他备受尊敬。"

# game/script.rpy:9385
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ddb96072:

    # "For now, he seems happy to have you on board."
    "目前，他似乎很高兴你能上船。"

# game/script.rpy:9387
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d9c3b557:

    # p "Good stuff, I hope?"
    p "希望没说我什么坏话吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9391
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e7263544:

    # "The lynx nods."
    "山猫点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:9393
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_eedd2637:

    # k "Naturally."
    k "这是自然。"

# game/script.rpy:9398
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6d37e9d4:

    # k "Not a single word about asking questions ya should already know the answer to."
    k "“没有一句关于问那些你应该已经知道答案的问题。”"

# game/script.rpy:9400
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ef8a19b1:

    # k "Nothing about hitting your head because ya weren't paying attention either."
    k "“也没有一句关于因为你没注意而撞到头的事情。”"

# game/script.rpy:9402
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_db201dca:

    # k "And not a whisper about how yer big heart won't let a passenger go uncomforted, even in the middle of your first day."
    k "“更没有一句关于你那颗热心肠，即使在你第一天，也不让乘客感到不舒服的事情。”"

# game/script.rpy:9404
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_32c0a8c8:

    # p "So... {w}He lied, is what I'm hearing?"
    p "所以……{w}我听到的意思是，他撒谎了？"

# game/script.rpy:9408
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_16a38e84:

    # "The tufts on the tips of his ears wobble as he laughs heartily. His voice is deep but not cavernous, though you can't recall ever thinking of a laugh as 'reverberating' before now."
    "他耳尖上的绒毛在他开怀大笑时颤动着。他的声音低沉但不空洞，虽然你以前从未觉得笑声可以“回荡”。"

# game/script.rpy:9413
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1d92ebaf:

    # k "Hah! All slander, of course."
    k "哈！当然，全是诽谤。"

# game/script.rpy:9417
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c8b80401:

    # s "Well, isn't this a happy crew! Glad to see we're all getting along, and apologies for having to ruin the atmosphere."
    s "好吧，这真是一个快乐的船员团队！很高兴看到我们相处融洽，很抱歉不得不破坏这种气氛。"

# game/script.rpy:9419
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_88dbfb38:

    # s "I must let ya know it's the morning watch for us tomorrow. Which means it's a good idea to cut this party a little shorter than you might be used to."
    s "我必须告诉你们，明天轮到我们值早班了。这意味着最好把这场聚会的时间缩短一点，别像你们平时那样。"

# game/script.rpy:9421
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_90dac208:

    # s "I'd prefer not to pick up your slack because you haven't had any rest."
    s "我可不想因为你没休息好，还得替你收拾烂摊子。"

# game/script.rpy:9423
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4f25eed9:

    # s "Granted, I can't order you to bed, but I also don't want ya sailing career to start off with an official reprimand."
    s "虽然我不能命令你睡觉，但也不希望你的航海生涯以受罚开始。"

# game/script.rpy:9425
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_db743b5b:

    # p "Message received. I'll finish up my plate quickly first, if you don't mind."
    p "收到。如果你不介意，我先快速吃完我的盘子。"

# game/script.rpy:9427
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8a4333bd:

    # p "I'm feeling rather tired anyway."
    p "反正我感觉很累了。"

# game/script.rpy:9433
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e96b0720:

    # "You follow his advice and finish your meal before retiring to your hammock."
    "你听从了他的建议，吃完饭才回到吊床上休息。"

# game/script.rpy:9435
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_05478c65:

    # "The hammock does a good job catching the gentle rolling of the ship, as the vessel forges its way through the night.{w} You lay there, taking in the calming sight of the dark wooden deck above you."
    "船只在夜里乘风破浪，吊床也随着船身轻轻摇晃。{w} 你躺在吊床上，望着上方幽暗的木制甲板，心情渐渐平静了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:9437
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f11b50d8:

    # "As abrasive as Arthur was, you still feel you made some progress today. {w}Well, one step back and one step forward, at least. Back to the starting line."
    "尽管Arthur态度粗鲁，你仍然觉得今天取得了一些进展。{w} 好吧，至少是后退了一步，又前进一步，回到了起跑线。"

# game/script.rpy:9439
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2eefe611:

    # "You try to figure out if that's better or worse than not having moved at all."
    "你琢磨着，这样到底比原地踏步要好，还是更糟。"

# game/script.rpy:9441
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3c5797e8:

    # "And as you're immersed in those thoughts, the shroud of sleep falls on your face as well."
    "在你沉浸在思绪中时，睡意也渐渐袭来。"

# game/script.rpy:9443
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3ac80e20:

    # "Not the worst first day in this new chapter of your life."
    "在新的人生篇章里，第一天过得还不错。"

# game/script.rpy:9450
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ca791159:

    # a "Well. You heard her."
    a "好吧，你听到了她的话。"

# game/script.rpy:9452
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f2d1f71a:

    # p "Understood, sir."
    p "明白了，长官。"

# game/script.rpy:9454
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0503b399:

    # "You lower your head and bring a hand to your forehead, in a gesture you've seen a few crew members do and you hope will resemble some kind of salute as you try to mirror it."
    "你低下头，学着之前看到的船员那样，抬手放在额头前，希望这能算是一种敬礼。"

# game/script.rpy:9456
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0e225738:

    # "Arthur nods in return."
    "Arthur点头回应。"

# game/script.rpy:9458
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7ad9f077:

    # "The officer then walks through the door you three are standing in front of."
    "接着，这位长官走进了你们三人面前的门。"

# game/script.rpy:9465
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_73cda617:

    # "The wooden door squeaks briefly, before sliding back to its closed state with a loud clacking sound. You hear Arthur's muffled steps disappear into the distance.."
    "木门吱呀一声，然后“咔哒”一声关上了。你听着Arthur沉闷的脚步声渐渐远去。"

# game/script.rpy:9467
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3934c13e:

    # p "So... {w}Where are we going?"
    p "那么... {w} 我们这是要去哪儿？"

# game/script.rpy:9469
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7a0bc14f:

    # "She points to the stairs that lead further down, into the bowels of the ship."
    "她指了指通往船舱下层的楼梯。"

# game/script.rpy:9471
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_361506a6:

    # ch "Down one deck, it's a fairly short walk. Come, I'll lead."
    ch "下一层甲板不远，跟我来吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9480
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_964ca7c9:

    # "As the two of you walk to your destination, you find yourself staring at her back and thinking. There's something peculiar about her."
    "你们两人走向目的地，你忍不住盯着她的背影，心里琢磨着：她身上总有种说不出的特别。"

# game/script.rpy:9482
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_29624150:

    # "You've seen cheetahs before, even had the pleasure to talk to some at one point in your life. But she doesn't quite look like the ones you've seen before."
    "你以前见过猎豹，平生甚至还有幸跟他们中的几位攀谈过。但她瞧上去跟你以往见过的那些猎豹大不相同。"

# game/script.rpy:9487
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_188baab3:

    # "Her spots are much darker, bolder—in fact, most of the fur on her neck is a solid shade of black. The contrast makes the turquoise of her jewelry almost shine in the darker interiors of the ship."
    "她身上的斑纹颜色深沉得多，也更为粗犷醒目——事实上，她颈间的大部分皮毛都呈现出纯粹的墨黑色。这种强烈的反差衬得她佩戴的绿松石饰品在昏暗的船舱里几乎在熠熠生辉。"

# game/script.rpy:9489
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5a0b28e6:

    # "Curious."
    "真有意思。"

# game/script.rpy:9493
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e26a5327:

    # "You reach the stairs to the lower decks. Rajeeyah turns towards a nearby crate, grabbing one of the lamps resting above it and lighting it."
    "你们来到了通往下层甲板的楼梯口。Rajeeyah转向旁边的一个板条箱，拿起放在上面的油灯点燃。"

# game/script.rpy:9498
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ac075d56:

    # "She lifts it, placing her other hand firmly on the wooden railing leading downwards. Then she looks back from above her shoulder."
    "她举起油灯，另一只手扶住向下的木制栏杆，然后回头看了你一眼。"

# game/script.rpy:9504
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_40ec2bd0:

    # ch "What is your name, by the way?."
    ch "话说回来，你叫什么名字？"

# game/script.rpy:9506
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fa10e4a1:

    # ch "I'd rather not shout \"recruit!\" whenever I require your attention."
    ch "我总不能每次想找你都喊“新兵”吧！"

# game/script.rpy:9508
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e9d0209e:

    # "You follow her down the stairs into the darker parts of the ship."
    "你跟着她走下楼梯，进入船上光线昏暗的区域。"

# game/script.rpy:9514
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2a2cb5d5:

    # p "I'm [name] [family_name]. What do you need me for, exactly? I'm not sure I followed your conversation."
    p "我是[name] [family_name]。你找我有什么事？我没太听明白你们在说什么。"

# game/script.rpy:9519
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b19792ce:

    # r "Mr. [family_name]? I'm Rajeeyah al-Maghribi. Doctor of the ship."
    r "[family_name]先生？我是Rajeeyah al-Maghribi，船医。"

# game/script.rpy:9521
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_774085a6:

    # r "We're going to be dressing Mr. Blackborow's wound. Rather, I'm going to be dressing it. You'll provide help."
    r "我们要处理Blackborow先生的伤口。确切地说，是我来处理，你帮下手。"

# game/script.rpy:9523
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1144650e:

    # r "There are no particular prerequisites for your role. Just do as I say when I say it, and you'll be fine."
    r "你没什么特别要求，照我说的做就行。"

# game/script.rpy:9525
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a7ad7de1:

    # "{i}Medical procedures on a wounded sailor. Sure, I can do that,{/i} you think, trying to persuade yourself you're right."
    "{i}给受伤的水手做手术？没问题，{/i} 你心里想着，努力说服自己。"

# game/script.rpy:9527
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b1929bf8:

    # "You swallow nervousness and thick, damp air. The lower inside the ship you get, the heavier the atmosphere—in a literal sense. Humid, heavy, with Rajeeyah's lamp the only source of light."
    "你咽下了心头的紧张与喉咙里潮湿闷浊的空气。越往船舱下层走，那种压抑感就越沉重——从字面意义上来说也是如此。空气湿热窒息，而Rajeeyah手中的油灯是这里唯一的光源。"

# game/script.rpy:9529
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5674d74e:

    # "The smell of fresh fish mixes with damp wood, a staleness that includes tinges of pungent odors you can't recognize from the ship's cargo. The result is rather unpleasant."
    "新鲜的鱼腥味混杂着木头的潮味，还有一股陈腐的气息，以及一些你无法从船上货物中分辨出的刺鼻气味。总而言之，味道不太好闻。"

# game/script.rpy:9531
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2efb172e:

    # "The doctor's light doesn't help much, but it's enough to keep you from stumbling."
    "医生的灯光光线不太好，但勉强能看清路。"

# game/script.rpy:9533
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_056dc35e:

    # "As you reach the bottom of the stairs and continue your walk, the doctor speaks."
    "当你走到楼梯底部，继续往前走时，医生开了口。"

# game/script.rpy:9535
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a56012e7:

    # r "So, you mentioned wanting to talk to me?"
    r "所以，你刚才说想和我聊聊？"

# game/script.rpy:9537
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_85b8395e:

    # p "I—I just-"
    p "我——我只是——"

# game/script.rpy:9539
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_47cc4686:

    # p "Well, you know."
    p "嗯，你知道的。"

# game/script.rpy:9541
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3262c3bd:

    # p "It's my first day. I'm getting to know the crew. Just making sure things are smooth."
    p "我第一天来，想熟悉一下船上的伙计们，看看有没有什么能帮上忙的。"

# game/script.rpy:9546
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_05a5c9ac:

    # "Rajeeyah stops all of a sudden. You come a finger's width from crashing into her."
    "Rajeeyah突然停了下来，你差点撞到她。"

# game/script.rpy:9548
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c34469fd:

    # r "Correct me if I'm mistaken. You decided that walking up to your superior and... {w}Stumbling your way through an awkward conversation was the best way to achieve that goal?"
    r "如果我说的不对，请纠正我。你觉得走到上级面前……{w}磕磕巴巴地硬聊一场，就是达成目的的最好方式？"

# game/script.rpy:9550
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e13275eb:

    # r "That's bold, if you allow me a euphemism."
    r "如果你想让委婉点说那就是：你可真是胆大。"

# game/script.rpy:9552
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_70063dfc:

    # "You don't know that word, but you get the message. {i}Stupid.{/i}"
    "你不知道那个词，但你明白她的意思了。{i}蠢货。{/i}"

# game/script.rpy:9554
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cdb50a74:

    # p "Sure, bold is one way to put it."
    p "大胆，倒也是一种说法。"

# game/script.rpy:9560
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fd8b0eb3:

    # "Rajeeyah smiles, then pushes down on the handle of the door behind where she stopped. It opens into a completely dark room."
    "Rajeeyah笑了笑，然后按下了她身后的门把手。门打开了，里面一片漆黑。"

# game/script.rpy:9562
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_32f8529d:

    # "As she enters it, shadows begin to flicker across the furniture and the array of objects strewn around it with no apparent order or method. You follow."
    "她走进去，阴影开始在家具和随意散落的物品上跳动。你也跟着走了进去。"

# game/script.rpy:9564
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_92ef5ffa:

    # p "But I am here talking to you, so I guess the boldest plans do work out, occasionally."
    p "不过，我现在能在这儿跟你说话，看来再大胆的计划，偶尔也能成功。"

# game/script.rpy:9569
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cea97c83:

    # "Your witty response makes her crack up. Her laughter is soft—naturally, but also intentionally so, you realize. She's trying to keep her voice as quiet as possible."
    "你这番机智的应答逗得她噗嗤一声笑了出来。她的笑声很轻柔——天性如此，但你也察觉到她是刻意压低的。她显然是在尽力避免发出声响。"

# game/script.rpy:9571
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d9ed6da0:

    # r "I can't argue with that. Sometimes luck is on your side."
    r "我同意。有时候，运气就是会站在你这边。"

# game/script.rpy:9582
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_00d248f5:

    # "You follow and enter as well. It's a small cabin, sporting a bed, a desk, and a few cabinets solidly fastened to the wall."
    "你也跟着走了进去。这是一个小舱室，里面有一张床、一张桌子和几个牢牢固定在墙上的柜子。"

# game/script.rpy:9584
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_13477ace:

    # "There is a pen and some paper on the table, and an open letter as well, along with a few books and what appear to be bottles of medicine."
    "桌子上放着一支笔、一些纸，还有一封打开的信，以及一些书和几瓶像是药品的瓶子。"

# game/script.rpy:9586
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e4aa2745:

    # "You squint at one of the bottles. No, that's not medicine. You recognize that style of label."
    "你眯起眼睛，仔细看着其中一个瓶子。不对，那不是药，你认得这种标签。"

# game/script.rpy:9588
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_11cd4be5:

    # "It's a bottle of whiskey. Half empty."
    "这是一瓶威士忌，喝了一半了。"

# game/script.rpy:9595
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9c1bb99a:

    # "She puts the lamp down on the table and steps over to the bed, where a man rests with blankets loosely wrapped around him."
    "她把灯放在桌子上，走到床边。床上躺着一个男人，身上随意地盖着毯子。"

# game/script.rpy:9597
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e2f2c22a:

    # p "Mr. Blackborow, I presume?"
    p "这位就是Blackborow先生吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9599
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09528cfe:

    # "She nods and looks him over briefly, before calling to him with a soft tone."
    "她点点头，上下打量了他一眼，然后轻声唤道："

# game/script.rpy:9601
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4497e089_1:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow?"
    r "布莱克波罗先生？"

# game/script.rpy:9603
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_77d65967_1:

    # "No response."
    "没有回应。"

# game/script.rpy:9605
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7dfdaad5:

    # r "Perce? Are you awake? I need to take a look at the wound."
    r "“Perce？醒了吗？我得看看你的伤。”"

# game/script.rpy:9607
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9850f53c_1:

    # "Nothing."
    "没啥。"

# game/script.rpy:9609
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9c9cac8f_1:

    # p "Is he..."
    p "他这是……"

# game/script.rpy:9611
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6261e28d_1:

    # r "Out cold."
    r "睡死了。"

# game/script.rpy:9613
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7b550c65:

    # "You peek past her to try and get a look at him. A jackal, by the looks of it. Hard to make out more details in the dark."
    "你从她身后探出头，想看清那人。瞧着像是个豺狼。不过光线太暗，看不真切。"

# game/script.rpy:9619
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_30c17961:

    # p "What happened to him?"
    p "“他这是怎么了？”"

# game/script.rpy:9623
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_eb14102a:

    # "Rajeeyah has completely stopped paying attention to you. She's selecting items from a cabinet, thinking and considering before putting each bottle and object she settles on on the table."
    "Rajeeyah完全没理会你。她从柜子里挑挑拣拣，拿起一个瓶子、一件东西，都要仔细思量一番才放到桌上。"

# game/script.rpy:9625
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6ed15f93:

    # "She's in her element. Professional, focused, carefully arranging what she needs before performing... Whatever it is she's going to be doing here."
    "她进入状态了。神情专注而专业，一丝不苟地整理着一会儿要用到的东西……不管她要做什么。"

# game/script.rpy:9630
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4b915707:

    # "She doesn't seem to have completely forgotten about you, though."
    "不过，她倒也没把你完全忘了。"

# game/script.rpy:9632
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d7204890:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow's forearm got caught in a chain during operations. No amputation needed, but it left a pretty deep wound."
    r "“Blackborow先生的前臂在工作中被链条绞住了。幸好不用截肢，但伤口很深。”"

# game/script.rpy:9634
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cb4259b6:

    # "You suck in air through your teeth, silently praying to never experience the same."
    "你倒吸一口凉气，暗暗祈祷自己别遇上这种事。"

# game/script.rpy:9638
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c8820585:

    # "More noises fill the room as she organizes the table, clearing away the paper and books to make room for the items she's going to need."
    "她整理桌子时，屋里的声响也多了起来。她把纸张和书本清到一边，好腾出地方放她要用的东西。"

# game/script.rpy:9640
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e53db748:

    # r "At the time of the accident, the ship was lacking medical supplies. We were only able to acquire what I needed once we made shore, which gave the wound ample time to develop an infection."
    r "“出事那会儿，船上缺医少药。我们靠岸后才弄到我需要的，结果伤口感染了很久。”"

# game/script.rpy:9642
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c130b459:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow was very lucky—it was lighter than I feared. But I'm not going to let him out until I'm confident it's all been dealt with."
    r "Blackborow先生运气相当不错——伤势比我先前担心的要轻得多。但在彻底确认隐患排除之前，我是绝不会放他离开病榻回甲板干活的。"

# game/script.rpy:9646
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_108520c6:

    # "A stirring comes from the bed, perhaps a reaction to the mention of his name."
    "床上的人动了动，好像是对提到自己名字的反应。"

# game/script.rpy:9651
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b34b06a9:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow? Are you awake?"
    r "布莱克波罗先生？你醒了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9653
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_039de5bc:

    # "No reply. Rajeeyah kneels down next to the bed, before repeating her call softly—this time with an equally soft touch to the injured man's shoulder."
    "没有回应。Rajeeyah在床铺旁单膝跪下，随后压低嗓音又轻唤了一声——这一回，她的手也同样轻柔地搭上了伤员的肩膀。"

# game/script.rpy:9655
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_76c14c94:

    # r "Perce?"
    r "Perce？"

# game/script.rpy:9661
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1955af7e_1:

    # "The man groans in response. He struggles to pull his right arm out from under the sheets, bringing his hand to his head."
    "那人呻吟了一声作为回应。他费力地从被子里抽出右手，抬手扶住额头。"

# game/script.rpy:9663
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_50372e7d_1:

    # pb "Aah, the... I... Yes...?"
    pb "啊...这...我...是吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9668
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7fcecaf3:

    # r "Perce. I need to take another look at the injury."
    r "“Perce，我得再看看你的伤。”"

# game/script.rpy:9670
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9c4fd8b5:

    # "She gestures towards you, introducing your presence to the jackal."
    "她朝你那边示意了一下，向豺狼介绍你："

# game/script.rpy:9672
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1ffdb944:

    # r "This is Mr. [family_name]. He is going to be assisting me tonight."
    r "“这位是[family_name]先生，今晚他会来帮我。”"

# game/script.rpy:9676
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_416cd8df:

    # "The jackal doesn't reply. He just nods slowly, relaxing back in the bed, as if acknowledging your presence took away all of his energy."
    "豺狼没有回答，只是缓缓点了点头，又放松地躺回床上，好像仅仅是承认你的存在就耗尽了他全部的力气。"

# game/script.rpy:9680
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_87d8d19b:

    # "Rajeeyah places her palm on his head, just for a moment, before carefully starting to peel the blanket away from his torso."
    "Rajeeyah把手掌放在他的头上，只停留了片刻，然后小心地开始解开裹在他躯干上的毯子。"

# game/script.rpy:9682
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d277c549_1:

    # r "Fever still present."
    r "还在发烧。"

# game/script.rpy:9684
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9aeaad2a:

    # "She rolls the blanket up, revealing his left arm—and the piece of cloth tightly wrapped around the lower half."
    "她掀开了毯子，露出了他的左臂——以及前臂下半段紧紧缠绕着的那截绷带粗布。"

# game/script.rpy:9686
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_aeeadc72:

    # p "Just... Let me know if you need anything."
    p "“那个……有什么需要帮忙的，尽管说。”"

# game/script.rpy:9688
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e6d176f3:

    # "You're feeling a little useless, standing there not doing anything. But you also don't want to risk hindering the doctor's work."
    "你站在那儿，什么也做不了，觉得自己有点多余。但你也不想冒险碍手碍脚。"

# game/script.rpy:9692
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ce824a95:

    # r "The chain missed most of the sinews. Just tore through skin and flesh. Didn't hit any veins or arteries either."
    r "“链条避开了大部分肌腱，只是撕裂了皮肉，也没伤到静脉或动脉。”"

# game/script.rpy:9696
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_38bc1e0e:

    # r "Fortunately, the chain missed anything irreplaceable."
    r "“幸运的是，链条没碰到什么要紧的东西。”"

# game/script.rpy:9698
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_dae9d48d:

    # "Rajeeyah starts slowly peeling off the bandages, one by one. They're clean—mostly—up until a layer that starts taking on a light tinge of pink."
    "Rajeeyah开始一层层小心翼翼地揭开绷带。大部分都很干净——直到其中一层逐渐渗出了一丝淡淡的粉红色血水。"

# game/script.rpy:9700
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_44236d39:

    # r "If you can't stomach seeing blood, Mr. [family_name], this is a good time to look away."
    r "“[family_name]先生，如果你受不了见血，现在可以转过头去。”"

# game/script.rpy:9704
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9a6a5bbd:

    # "You keep your eyes peeled as she does her work. The pink gets brighter and brighter, then turns to red. Then the wound is in full view."
    "你睁大眼睛，看着她处理伤口。粉红色越来越深，变成了红色。然后，伤口完全暴露在眼前。"

# game/script.rpy:9706
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b6e4f15f:

    # "It looks... Well, it looks like a wound. Bloody and not healed yet, sporting splashes of colors that shouldn't be present around flesh. But you're no doctor, and this is as far as your diagnosis goes."
    "看起来……嗯，看起来就像个伤口。血淋淋的，还没长好，带着些不该出现在血肉上的颜色。但你又不是医生，这已经是你所能做出的全部诊断了。"

# game/script.rpy:9708
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9004c9f5:

    # "It's not massive, but it's deep enough to comfortably fit a few fingers inside it. You try not to think too hard about the implication of the colors and liquids you're noticing."
    "伤口不算大，但足够深，能轻松塞进几根手指。你尽量不去深究那些颜色和液体意味着什么。"

# game/script.rpy:9710
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_533fc8f4:

    # "You look at Rajeeyah, but she doesn't seem to share your worry."
    "你看着Rajeeyah，但她似乎并不像你一样担忧。"

# game/script.rpy:9715
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e992ad0a:

    # r "The situation seems to be improving. Good."
    r "情况好像正在好转。很好。"

# game/script.rpy:9726
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d1b3324d:

    # "Suddenly, these bottles you can't quite recognize are the most interesting thing in the world. And that whiskey, is it aged? Strong stuff? You examine the label in the crepuscular light with great interest."
    "突然，那些你叫不上名字的瓶瓶罐罐成了世界上最有趣的东西。还有那威士忌，是陈年佳酿吗？够烈吗？你饶有兴致地在昏暗的光线下研究着标签。"

# game/script.rpy:9728
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f7db41e0_1:

    # "It looks expensive. Sick bay might not be so bad after all."
    "瞧着挺贵的。这么看来，待在医务室好像也没那么糟糕。"

# game/script.rpy:9730
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3854392a:

    # "As you mull over the opportunity of getting black out drunk to escape the noises and grunts coming from the patient, a call snaps you back to reality."
    "你正琢磨着要不要一醉方休，好逃避病人哼哼唧唧的呻吟，一声呼唤却把你拉回了现实。"

# game/script.rpy:9739
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e992ad0a_1:

    # r "The situation seems to be improving. Good."
    r "情况好像正在好转。很好。"

# game/script.rpy:9742
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_41359e22:

    # r "Mr. [family_name], the water under the table, please."
    r "[family_name]先生，麻烦把桌子下面的水递给我。"

# game/script.rpy:9747
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_30561f63_1:

    # "You spring into action and bend down, searching for a glass bottle and finding it stashed away next to one of the chairs."
    "你立马行动，弯腰去摸，在一个椅子边上摸到了藏着的玻璃瓶。"

# game/script.rpy:9753
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cdc6847a_1:

    # "You open it and place it down right next to her."
    "你打开瓶子，放到她手边。"

# game/script.rpy:9757
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a95b3b0a_1:

    # "You open it and carry it back to Rajeeyah, making sure to keep the woman's silhouette between you and the man on the bed."
    "你打开瓶子，拿着水回到Rajeeyah身边，留心用那个女人挡住你和病床上那家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:9759
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c265bda4_1:

    # r "Thank you."
    r "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:9761
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4a453f28:

    # p "How long have you been doing this?"
    p "你当这行多久了？"

# game/script.rpy:9766
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ec3b55e5:

    # r "Being a surgeon? Long enough to have a few people be very grateful to me."
    r "当外科医生？足够久了，久到有人对我感激涕零。"

# game/script.rpy:9768
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4643f97a:

    # "The cheetah works diligently, deftly splashing water on the wound. She makes clean-up look easy, and if your questions are distracting her, she's not letting it show."
    "只见她像只猎豹一样利索地工作着，熟练地往伤口上泼水。清理工作在她手里好像变得轻而易举，就算我的问题让她分了神，她也没表现出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9770
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e893d5e5:

    # p "I was just thinking you seem... Young, for the position. Maybe."
    p "我只是觉得，就这职位来说，你是不是太...年轻了？或许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9772
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_04c0d6de:

    # p "I mean, you're definitely experienced! It's just, I always pictured ship surgeons to be the kind of people whose fur has started turning gray."
    p "我是说，你肯定经验丰富！只不过，我一直以为船医都该是那种头发都开始发白的老头。"

# game/script.rpy:9774
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_984ea41e:

    # r "Looks can be deceiving. But in this case you're right—I am in fact on the younger side of the profession."
    r "外表往往具有欺骗性。不过这回你倒是没猜错——在这行医界里头，我的年纪确实算偏年轻的。"

# game/script.rpy:9776
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ea06e0b1:

    # r "All I can say is, a while ago I decided on a sudden career change. But I already had experience in the medical field."
    r "我只能说，前段时间我突然决定转行。不过我之前就有医疗方面的经验。"

# game/script.rpy:9778
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_70fe9f95:

    # r "No need to be nervous, it's an understandable curiosity. I hope I managed to sate it, at least in part."
    r "别紧张，你的好奇心可以理解。希望我至少稍微满足了你的求知欲。"

# game/script.rpy:9784
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_058e7202:

    # "Mr. Blackborow chimes in with an addition to the conversation, that addition being a loud grunt of pain."
    "布莱克波罗先生插话了，不过与其说是插话，不如说是一声痛苦的呻吟。"

# game/script.rpy:9786
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7fd54d88:

    # "No matter how hard he tries, his lips can't hide the fact that the procedure must be extremely painful."
    "他再怎么努力，也无法掩饰手术带来的剧痛。"

# game/script.rpy:9788
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_80007814:

    # "He's trying to put on a brave face, to pretend that his pain tolerance is far higher than his gritted teeth suggest. {w}He's not selling it, but he's still trying. You wonder why."
    "他想强装镇定，假装自己能忍受远超紧咬牙关所表现出来的痛苦。{w}不过他演得并不像，但他还在努力。你很想知道他为什么要这样。"

# game/script.rpy:9790
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b0314b18:

    # r "I need the little green bottle."
    r "我需要那个绿色的小瓶子。"

# game/script.rpy:9799
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3de7bc63_1:

    # "You turn back towards the table, examining the glassware. It's hard to tell in the dim light, but you spot a little green bottle on the left side."
    "你转过身，看向桌子，检查着玻璃器皿。在昏暗的光线下很难分辨，但你发现左侧有一个绿色的小瓶子。"

# game/script.rpy:9801
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cbb5e115_1:

    # "And one in the middle. {w}And a third behind the first."
    "中间也有一个。{w}第一个后面还有第三个。"

# game/script.rpy:9805
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b7e596e3_1:

    # "You lift the rightmost one from the table to show her."
    "你从桌子上拿起最右边的那个给她看。"

# game/script.rpy:9807
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4f49108a_1:

    # p "This one?"
    p "这个？"

# game/script.rpy:9809
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1f50ff48_1:

    # r "No, no. That one there.{w} On the left."
    r "不，不。是那个。{w}在左边。"

# game/script.rpy:9819
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_7835c0e6_1:

    # "Another attempt. This time she nods approvingly, so you take the bottle over to the bed."
    "又试了一次。这次她满意地点点头，你便把瓶子拿到了床边。"

# game/script.rpy:9821
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_287796b4_1:

    # p "What's in it?"
    p "里面是什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9823
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_974bc2de_1:

    # r "The liquid? A mixture of water and silver."
    r "液体？是水和银的混合物。"

# game/script.rpy:9825
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_013720d8_1:

    # p "Oh, that makes sense. {w}... Wait, silver? {w}Shiny? {w}Extremely expensive?"
    p "哦，这倒说得通。{w}...等等，银？{w}闪闪发光的银？{w}贼贵的那种？"

# game/script.rpy:9827
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_bec3b4af_1:

    # r "Yes."
    r "是的。"

# game/script.rpy:9831
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1f3a684e:

    # "Mr. Blackborow finally breaks the silence, trying to turn his gritted teeth and suppressed grunts into the appearance of a stoic attitude."
    "布莱克波罗先生终于打破了沉默，试图把紧咬的牙关和强忍的呻吟伪装成一种坚忍不拔的态度。"

# game/script.rpy:9833
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3f79587a:

    # pb "Hnngh—You spared no expense for me. I'm touched."
    pb "哼嗯——你可真舍得为我下血本。我感动得眼泪都要掉下来了。"

# game/script.rpy:9835
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4f7ccc2e_1:

    # "Rajeeyah holds the bottle in front of the lamp, checking its content against the light. It's small enough for her to hold it in one hand."
    "Rajeeyah举着瓶子在灯光下照看，检查里面的液体。瓶子不大，她一只手就能握住。"

# game/script.rpy:9837
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a3c723ee_1:

    # r "It is {i}very{/i} diluted."
    r "里面的东西{i}非常{/i}稀。"

# game/script.rpy:9839
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b2bcabec:

    # "Mr. Blackborow's stoic attitude melts like snow in the sun."
    "布莱克波罗先生的坚忍瞬间瓦解，像阳光下的雪一样融化。"

# game/script.rpy:9841
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_71ad185d:

    # pb "You know, you didn't have to tell me that. Took all the magic right out of it."
    pb "你知道吗，这话你没必要说出来的。一下子就没意思了。"

# game/script.rpy:9846
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8d2d9b1f_1:

    # r "We got what helps. Is that not enough?"
    r "我们有能帮上忙的药，这还不够吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9848
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_60f26681_1:

    # pb "More than enough, I'd say."
    pb "足够了，绝对足够了。"

# game/script.rpy:9855
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_24605b51:

    # "She applies the mixture to his wound with the same care as before. Mr. Blackborow reacts with the same grunts, this time withholding the theatrics."
    "她像之前一样小心地将药膏涂在他的伤口上。布莱克波罗先生也同样发出了呻吟，但这次没有再像之前那样夸张。"

# game/script.rpy:9859
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_66bdc35d_1:

    # "While you keep your distance, she applies some of the mixture to the wound."
    "你站在一边，她小心地把药涂在伤口上。"

# game/script.rpy:9861
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4c9cd22f_1:

    # "The rest is just re-dressing, which Rajeeyah does with consummate experience and... mostly clean bandages."
    "剩下的就是重新包扎，Rajeeyah凭着熟练的手法，用还算干净的绷带完成了包扎。"

# game/script.rpy:9863
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_be5e595a:

    # p "What pushed you to do it?"
    p "是什么促使你选择这条路？"

# game/script.rpy:9868
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a4e29c01:

    # r "Turning to seafaring, you mean?"
    r "你是说当水手？"

# game/script.rpy:9870
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f626b68d:

    # p "Mhm."
    p "嗯哼。"

# game/script.rpy:9872
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ef4b7222:

    # r "Ah. {w}A partner of mine."
    r "啊...{w}因为我的一个同伴。"

# game/script.rpy:9874
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_fc9db1ce:

    # "A partner is the reason she's here? That's quite the unexpected confession."
    "她来这儿是因为一个同伴？这可真是出人意料。"

# game/script.rpy:9876
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c06f3317:

    # "You give her the opportunity to add more to her answer, but her silence tells you it's not something she's willing to discuss in detail. The doctor's eyes are fixed on Mr. Blackborow."
    "你给她机会补充，但她的沉默表明她并不想细说。医生的眼睛一直盯着布莱克波罗先生。"

# game/script.rpy:9878
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0f54dd5b:

    # "She has a right to her privacy, after all. She doesn't seem angry or offended, but it's probably better not to discuss the matter further. {w}For now, at least."
    "毕竟，每个人都有权保守秘密。她看起来没有生气，也没有不悦，但最好还是别再深究了。{w}至少现在是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:9880
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4e324414:

    # "She keeps on doing her work, quietly."
    "她继续一声不吭地忙着手里的活。"

# game/script.rpy:9884
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_723e00bc:

    # "Once her operation is complete, she stashes the dirty pieces of cloth in a corner of the cabin, before gesturing to Mr. Blackborow he's free to get back under his blanket."
    "手术完成之后，她把那些脏布头塞进船舱角落，然后示意Blackborow先生可以回去睡觉了。"

# game/script.rpy:9889
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ad9dac03:

    # r "All done for today."
    r "今天就到这儿吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9891
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ba9db420_1:

    # r "Mr. Blackborow, we'll be meeting again tomorrow for another check. I'll see that someone brings dinner down here as soon as I'm able to."
    r "布莱克波罗先生，明天咱们还得再看看。我尽快让人把晚饭给你送下来。"

# game/script.rpy:9893
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_94a19f4f:

    # pb "Thank you, Doctor. I'm starving."
    pb "谢谢你，医生。我快饿死了。"

# game/script.rpy:9898
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_685724ed:

    # "You nod to the jackal, who nods back. {w}Rajeeyah starts putting all the bottles back where they belonged. No need for your help, now that her hands are free."
    "你朝那只豺狼点了点头，他也对你点了点头。{w}Rajeeyah开始把瓶瓶罐罐放回原位。现在她腾出手了，不需要你帮忙了。"

# game/script.rpy:9900
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_65df1336:

    # "She motions towards the door, and you follow her into the dark corridors of the ship. The lamp is left back for Mr. Blackborow's use."
    "她朝门口示意，你跟着她走进船舱里黑漆漆的走廊。那盏灯就留给Blackborow先生用了。"

# game/script.rpy:9910
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6e7ec0cf:

    # "Rajeeyah closes the door behind the two of you. Then she leans against the wall, staring at you."
    "Rajeeyah走到你身后把门关上。然后她靠在墙上，盯着你。"

# game/script.rpy:9912
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8d6d4261_1:

    # r "Good job."
    r "干得不错。"

# game/script.rpy:9915
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_842c7d9e_1:

    # p "Thanks, but... Why did you want me to help you, anyway? Don't you have a surgeon's mate?"
    p "谢谢，不过...你干嘛非得让我帮忙啊？你不是有外科助手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9919
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d78d5d79_1:

    # r "I'd have preferred to know ahead of time that blood troubles you, though."
    r "不过，你要是晕血，你早说啊。"

# game/script.rpy:9921
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c9c8863b_1:

    # p "I didn't exactly know what to expect. You just{cps=2}...{/cps} borrowed me, I guess."
    p "我也不知道会发生什么。你直接就{cps=2}...{/cps}把我抓过来了，大概是这样吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9926
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5ce2b935_1:

    # "She laughs. As eloquent and professional as she comes across, her laughter is soft and gentle."
    "她笑了。平时说话那么头头是道，那么专业，笑起来却轻声细语的。"

# game/script.rpy:9928
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_193d4296_1:

    # p "Don't you have a surgeon's mate, anyway?"
    p "话说回来，你不是有外科助手吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9933
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_47cc2e74_1:

    # r "I do. But he'd already disappeared for dinner, and you..."
    r "是有。可他跑去吃晚饭了，你嘛……"

# game/script.rpy:9935
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_49b8286c:

    # r "Well, you were right there, weren't you?"
    r "好吧，你当时就在那儿，对吧？"

# game/script.rpy:9937
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3abc66fd:

    # "That's another question answered, you think as the two of you make your way back to the stairs."
    "又解开一个谜团，你心想，然后你们俩转身往楼梯走去。"

# game/script.rpy:9939
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_050f6376:

    # "Still one mystery left, and no matter what they say about curiosity and felines, you cannot help but voice the thought you've been ruminating on."
    "还有一个谜没解开呢。人们都说好奇心害死猫，但我还是忍不住想问问你。"

# game/script.rpy:9941
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_77b54c99:

    # p "Was this your partner's idea?"
    p "这是你搭档的主意？"

# game/script.rpy:9943
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_5b8c784a:

    # r "Come again?"
    r "你说什么？"

# game/script.rpy:9945
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_04189bff:

    # p "I mean, you mentioned your partner. Did they suggest you become a ship surgeon?"
    p "我是说，你之前提到过你的搭档。是你搭档建议你当船医的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:9947
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b6f54c33:

    # "Rajeeyah goes quiet for a moment or two."
    "Rajeeyah沉默了片刻。"

# game/script.rpy:9952
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_eecbf4bc:

    # r "Something like that."
    r "差不多吧。"

# game/script.rpy:9954
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4dccccbf:

    # p "I think I understand. I won't pry, then."
    p "我好像明白了。那我就不刨根问底了。"

# game/script.rpy:9956
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_364e2077:

    # "Silence hangs between the two of you, until Rajeeyah puts an end to it."
    "你们俩沉默了一会儿，Rajeeyah打破了沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:9961
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_961b3945:

    # r "I appreciate it, just as I appreciate the help in there."
    r "我很感激，就像感激你刚才的帮忙一样。"

# game/script.rpy:9963
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_dd5bdf78:

    # p "Thank you."
    p "谢谢你。"

# game/script.rpy:9965
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4b45c616:

    # r "You're welcome. And I'll report to Arthur that you also performed excellently at your role—you're welcome for that as well."
    r "不客气。待会儿向Arthur长官复命时，我也会如实禀告你今晚的表现可圈可点——这事儿你也用不着谢我。"

# game/script.rpy:9967
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d1383443:

    # r "Granted, all I needed was someone who could stand still and follow orders."
    r "其实我只是需要一个能站着不动、听我指挥的人。"

# game/script.rpy:9969
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9893651e:

    # r "I figured you wouldn't disappoint. It wasn't what I'd call a risky bet anyway."
    r "我就觉得你不会让我失望。反正这也不算冒险。"

# game/script.rpy:9971
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_13a55e93:

    # "You cross your arms over your chest with a smirk."
    "你双手抱在胸前，假笑着说。"

# game/script.rpy:9973
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9e219a0d:

    # p "Well, thank you for having such a glowing first impression of me."
    p "承蒙你看得起啊。"

# game/script.rpy:9978
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_aa98f82b:

    # r "Definitely. A sailor who waltzes up to his superior for a casual chat, on his first day, does leave {i}an{/i} impression."
    r "确实。一个水手第一天就跑来和上级套近乎，{i}那{/i}印象可太深刻了。"

# game/script.rpy:9980
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ba78e62a:

    # p "Hey, and here we are talking casually, aren't we?"
    p "哎，这不就在和你套近乎么？"

# game/script.rpy:9982
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cedc9a8c:

    # p "It couldn't have been {i}that{/i} stupid if it worked."
    p "要是这招管用，那肯定也{i}不{/i}蠢。"

# game/script.rpy:9987
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_de99f0fe:

    # "The cheetah chuckles under her breath."
    "母猎豹低声笑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9989
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_304c4877:

    # r "In any case, I have to go and get cleaned up. Thank you again, [name]."
    r "好了，我得去洗洗干净了。再次感谢你，[name]。"

# game/script.rpy:9993
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_106efddb:

    # r "And you should hurry back too, before Bandile packs up. They're not going to be waiting for you."
    r "你也赶紧回去吧，不然Bandile他们走了可不等你。"

# game/script.rpy:9995
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f6665637:

    # "As soon as you hear that, you grab the banister and swing yourself upwards with gusto, stumbling over the steps, but quickly catching up with her. Rajeeyah laughs in response."
    "一听到这话，你立马抓住扶手，兴冲冲地往上跑，差点儿绊倒，赶紧加快脚步追上她。Rajeeyah看着你笑了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:9997
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0ee0282e:

    # "She lets you pass, happy to acknowledge your sudden realization regarding food and the lack thereof. {w}But, before leaving her behind, you turn for one last question."
    "她让你先走，看来她也知道你惦记着吃的了。{w}不过，在你离开之前，你还是转过身，问了最后一个问题。"

# game/script.rpy:9999
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9345dc46:

    # p "Oh, Rajeeyah... Would you perhaps want to sit down for dinner?"
    p "哦，Rajeeyah…要不要一起吃个晚饭？"

# game/script.rpy:10004
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1ce8e187:

    # r "Do you really want bloodstained fingerprints on your bowl that badly?"
    r "你真想在你的碗上留下血手印不成？"

# game/script.rpy:10006
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4faaec37:

    # p "After you've cleaned up, of course..."
    p "当然，等你收拾干净了之后再说…"

# game/script.rpy:10010
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d0d10a39:

    # r "I'm sorry.{w} Arthur will want to hear back from me, so I'll be eating dinner with the officers."
    r "抱歉。{w} Arthur还等着我的消息，我得和军官们一起吃饭。"

# game/script.rpy:10012
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0b14afb4:

    # "You nod. Right."
    "你点点头，表示明白。"

# game/script.rpy:10014
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f5eba436:

    # "A few more steps, and you are again led back out onto the common area.{w}The sounds of other people talking, playing cards, and eating fill the space again."
    "又走了几步，你回到了公共区域。{w} 周围又充满了人们的说话声、玩牌声和吃饭声。"

# game/script.rpy:10016
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_78bfad8b:

    # "It's only then that you realize you've been keeping your ears folded in disappointment."
    "这时你才意识到，自己一直因为失望而竖着耳朵听着。"

# game/script.rpy:10021
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_52d4446c:

    # r "Cheer up. We can definitely share a meal another time."
    r "别灰心，我们以后肯定有机会一起吃饭的。"

# game/script.rpy:10023
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_294ebe08:

    # p "I'd love to."
    p "我很期待。"

# game/script.rpy:10029
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_2e0e9548:

    # "Rajeeyah leaves, and you follow a moment later. The two of you cross the open space, past the makeshift common area and past all the tables and crates populated by the crew."
    "Rajeeyah离开了，你稍晚也跟了上去。你们两人穿过空地，经过临时搭建的公共区域，以及船员们占据的桌子和板条箱。"

# game/script.rpy:10031
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d420f900_1:

    # "The atmosphere is jovial, but you can tell by the tone of people conversing that the evening is starting to wind down."
    "气氛很欢快，但从人们的语气中能听出来，夜幕已经开始降临。"

# game/script.rpy:10033
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_0bea2c97:

    # "And yet, you're not feeling that hungry. You hasten your step, intent on catching up with the cheetah..."
    "可是，你却没什么胃口。你加快脚步，只想追上那只“猎豹”…"

# game/script.rpy:10035
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_56d92e8f_1:

    # "... only to get stopped in your tracks by an arm popping out of some sailors huddled around a table."
    "……结果一只胳膊突然从一群挤在桌子旁的水手中伸出来，拦住了你的去路。"

# game/script.rpy:10037
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_396a4ef4_1:

    # "You turn to your side and find yourself staring down at a certain lizard."
    "你转过身，发现自己正盯着一只蜥蜴。"

# game/script.rpy:10039
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e1aee598_1:

    # j "Hey, [name]! Where have you been?"
    j "嘿，[name]！你跑哪儿去了？"

# game/script.rpy:10041
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09730b6c_1:

    # "You point at Rajeeyah, who is already several steps ahead of you."
    "你指了指 Rajeeyah，她已经走到你前面好几步远了。"

# game/script.rpy:10043
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_679f516e:

    # p "I was asked to help, I...{w} I'll be right back, I just—just wanted to...{w} I'm just going to take care of a thing."
    p "别人叫我去帮个忙，我……{w}我马上就回来，我刚只是——只是想……{w}我这就去把事情办妥。"

# game/script.rpy:10045
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_769669db:

    # "You don't leave Julian enough time to formulate a reply, or an objection. You shove his arm aside and march your way towards the doctor."
    "你没给Julian留下任何反驳的机会，一把推开他的胳膊，朝着医生走去。"

# game/script.rpy:10053
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ae7ea96f:

    # "Just as Rajeeyah reaches the cabins, you finally manage to catch up with her."
    "就在Rajeeyah快走到船舱的时候，你总算赶上了她。"

# game/script.rpy:10055
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8bef637b:

    # p "Yes, hey! So... {w}Dinner another day, then?"
    p "嘿！那个…{w} 晚饭改天再吃，怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:10060
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_06f2b2ef:

    # "Rajeeyah's hand freezes on the door handle. As she turns and realizes who's asked that question, her surprise fades—though not entirely."
    "Rajeeyah搭在门把手上的手蓦地一僵。当她回过身认清是谁问出这句话时，脸上的惊诧之色稍稍褪去——不过并未彻底消散。"

# game/script.rpy:10065
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_b0b1f23a:

    # r "Mr. [family_name], are you inviting me to a date?..."
    r "[family_name]先生，您这是在邀请我约会吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10067
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_3f535361:

    # p "No, nothing of the sort! I just... I just wanted to make sure I got what you meant, I guess."
    p "不，当然不是！我只是…我只是想确认一下你的意思。"

# game/script.rpy:10073
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e8888ad1:

    # "Her features soften as she pushes down on the handle. She crosses the threshold with a smile."
    "她的表情变得柔和，笑着按下了门把手。"

# game/script.rpy:10075
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_9d4bad66:

    # r "Then yes. Dinner another day."
    r "那就改天吧，晚饭。"

# game/script.rpy:10083
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_a6f7dcc9:

    # "Then the door falls into its lock behind her."
    "说完，门在她身后落锁。"

# game/script.rpy:10085
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_18de06ac:

    # "It takes a few seconds before you can peel yourself away from the door."
    "你愣了几秒，才回过神来，离开了门口。"

# game/script.rpy:10087
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d392c356:

    # "Having time to properly sit down with her sounds nice. Especially with no grievous bodily harm involved."
    "能和她好好地坐下来吃顿饭，感觉应该不错。特别是不用担心会受伤的情况下。"

# game/script.rpy:10089
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45596433:

    # "You manage to catch the cook—Bandile—just as he's about to pack up. He scrapes some salmon leftovers together for a last-minute meal, and you thank him heartily before heading back."
    "你总算在伙夫Bandile收摊打烊的前一刻赶上了他。他把案板上剩下的最后一点鲑鱼边角料凑在了一起为你弄了顿热乎饭，你满心感激地道了谢，这才端着餐盘折返回去。"

# game/script.rpy:10106
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_17631fe9:

    # "As you return to Julian's table, you realize him—and Samuel by his side—have been staring at you over their shoulders all this time."
    "当你走回Julian那张桌子时，你注意到他和身旁的Samuel这一路上都在扭着头直勾勾地盯着你。"

# game/script.rpy:10120
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_81618695:

    # "There are two more sailors with them—a lynx and a peregrine falcon."
    "跟他们待在一块儿的还有另外两名水手——一只猞猁和一只游隼。"

# game/script.rpy:10134
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1a06707d_1:

    # s "And our happy little family is complete at last!"
    s "我们这快乐的小家庭总算团聚了！"

# game/script.rpy:10136
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ae58d42c:

    # s "So tell me, oh Prodigal Son, what exactly made Rajeeyah pick {i}you{/i} out o' the litter? Curiosity's devourin' me."
    s "哎哟，这不是浪子回头了吗？快说说，Rajeeyah到底看上你哪点了？我这好奇心都快爆炸了。"

# game/script.rpy:10140
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45a8096b_1:

    # j "Rajeeyah?"
    j "“Rajeeyah？”"

# game/script.rpy:10142
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_08d4914f:

    # s "The ship's surgeon. So, do you know anything 'bout medicine, [name]?"
    s "船上的医生啊。[name]，你懂医术吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10157
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_624a5963_1:

    # "You shrug and sit down with the group."
    "你耸耸肩，在人群中坐下。"

# game/script.rpy:10159
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_75a46662:

    # p "No, not really. She just needed someone to fetch her some things."
    p "不太懂，她只是让我帮她跑跑腿。"

# game/script.rpy:10161
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_4168bece_1:

    # p "I was around. That's all."
    p "我正好在附近，就这么简单。"

# game/script.rpy:10166
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_68da36b7:

    # s ". . .{w} Well, sounds like a good enough reason to me."
    s "…{w} 听起来理由充分。"

# game/script.rpy:10168
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e6271844:

    # "You finally dig into the food. The salmon is cold, but great—juicy, flavorful, garnished with... Things your brain doesn't fully register. Would have been fantastic when it was hot, you think."
    "你终于开始享用自己的晚饭了。鲑鱼虽然已经凉了，但味道依旧棒极了——肉质鲜嫩多汁，浸透了滋味，上面还点缀着……一些你脑子里一时辨认不出的香料调味。你心想，这要是在刚出锅热气腾腾时吃，肯定更是一绝。"

# game/script.rpy:10170
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_801940ac_1:

    # "You look up from your plate to notice the two other sailors staring at you, an amused look on their faces."
    "你从盘子里抬起头，注意到另外两个水手正盯着你，脸上带着戏谑的表情。"

# game/script.rpy:10172
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_13bf6394_1:

    # p "Uh, sorry... That was rude of me. I'm [name], it's a pleasure."
    p "呃，抱歉……我太失礼了。[name]，很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:10179
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_f3878271_1:

    # "Samuel stretches his long legs under the table with a pleased smirk. It's time for introductions."
    "Samuel咧嘴一笑，在桌子底下伸了个懒腰，两条大长腿也跟着伸展开来。看来该轮到我们自我介绍了。"

# game/script.rpy:10181
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_44074e51:

    # s "That's Konrad to ya left and Torres on the right. And, to your most shocked surprise, they're also members of the crew."
    s "这位是你左边的Konrad，右边是Torres。更让你大跌眼镜的是，他们竟然也是船上的水手。"

# game/script.rpy:10183
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_09b1e83d_1:

    # p "Ah, nice to meet you two."
    p "啊，很高兴认识你们。"

# game/script.rpy:10187
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d5ac5d38_1:

    # "You reach across the table to shake hands with them. Torres goes for it first."
    "你越过桌子，准备和他们握手。Torres抢先伸出了手。"

# game/script.rpy:10189
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_11feb4de_1:

    # t "So, another part of the new blood, ay? Torres, the pleasure is mine."
    t "哟，又来个新来的？Torres，很高兴认识你。"

# game/script.rpy:10191
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cb6a7ef6_1:

    # "Torres is polite and affable. Warm, smiling, well groomed—perhaps exceedingly so? The bright blue feathers in his hat feel a tad too much for a sailor."
    "Torres待人既客气又和蔼。热情、笑脸迎人、衣着光鲜得体——甚至可以说得体过了头？他帽子上那几根亮蓝色的羽毛，瞧着未免比普通水手招摇扎眼了些。"

# game/script.rpy:10193
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_07649060_1:

    # "It's the lynx's turn to offer you his hand. Unlike Torres, his grip is firm and strong, almost to the point of discomfort."
    "现在轮到lynx向你伸出手了。和Torres不同，他的手劲很大，几乎要捏疼你了。"

# game/script.rpy:10195
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_94c0c66e_1:

    # "It's the grip of a sailor who's more familiar with ropes and wooden planks than people, and you are thankful once he decides to release your hand."
    "这是一个水手的握力，他对绳索和木板比对人更熟悉，你很庆幸他决定松开你的手。"

# game/script.rpy:10199
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_45f305e5_1:

    # k "Name's Konrad, boy, and that's a pleasure for me as well. Samuel told us about ya earlier."
    k "我叫Konrad，小子，很高兴认识你。Samuel之前跟我们提起过你。"

# game/script.rpy:10201
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_defecb35_1:

    # "You're not surprised when he introduces himself as the shipwright. He brushes along his beard, playing expertly with the three braids he's split it in."
    "当他自我介绍说是船匠时，你并不感到惊讶。他捋了捋胡子，熟练地摆弄着他把胡子分成的三股辫子。"

# game/script.rpy:10203
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_05a5a8fe_1:

    # "He's roughly in his forties, but his manners seem to project a mindset far beyond his age. And in the eyes of the others at the table, a high level of respect."
    "他大概四十多岁，但他的举止似乎表现出一种远超他年龄的心态。在桌边其他人的眼中，他备受尊敬。"

# game/script.rpy:10205
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ddb96072_1:

    # "For now, he seems happy to have you on board."
    "目前，他似乎很高兴你能上船。"

# game/script.rpy:10207
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_d9c3b557_1:

    # p "Good stuff, I hope?"
    p "希望没说我什么坏话吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10211
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e7263544_1:

    # "The lynx nods."
    "山猫点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:10213
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_eedd2637_1:

    # k "Naturally."
    k "这是自然。"

# game/script.rpy:10218
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_6d37e9d4_1:

    # k "Not a single word about asking questions ya should already know the answer to."
    k "“没有一句关于问那些你应该已经知道答案的问题。”"

# game/script.rpy:10220
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_ef8a19b1_1:

    # k "Nothing about hitting your head because ya weren't paying attention either."
    k "“也没有一句关于因为你没注意而撞到头的事情。”"

# game/script.rpy:10222
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_db201dca_1:

    # k "And not a whisper about how yer big heart won't let a passenger go uncomforted, even in the middle of your first day."
    k "“更没有一句关于你那颗热心肠，即使在你第一天，也不让乘客感到不舒服的事情。”"

# game/script.rpy:10224
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_32c0a8c8_1:

    # p "So... {w}He lied, is what I'm hearing?"
    p "所以……{w}我听到的意思是，他撒谎了？"

# game/script.rpy:10228
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_16a38e84_1:

    # "The tufts on the tips of his ears wobble as he laughs heartily. His voice is deep but not cavernous, though you can't recall ever thinking of a laugh as 'reverberating' before now."
    "他耳尖上的绒毛在他开怀大笑时颤动着。他的声音低沉但不空洞，虽然你以前从未觉得笑声可以“回荡”。"

# game/script.rpy:10233
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_1d92ebaf_1:

    # k "Hah! All slander, of course."
    k "哈！当然，全是诽谤。"

# game/script.rpy:10235
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_071c6e4d:

    # k "Seems ya got to know Rajeeyah already. Good surgeon, that gal. Great judge of people. {w}And wounds."
    k "看来你已经认识Rajeeyah了。那姑娘可是个好外科医生，看人准得很，{w}对处理伤口也很有心得。"

# game/script.rpy:10239
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_c8b80401_1:

    # s "Well, isn't this a happy crew! Glad to see we're all getting along, and apologies for having to ruin the atmosphere."
    s "好吧，这真是一个快乐的船员团队！很高兴看到我们相处融洽，很抱歉不得不破坏这种气氛。"

# game/script.rpy:10241
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_40aa8ddb:

    # s "I must let you know it's the morning watch for us tomorrow. Which means it's a good idea to cut this party a little shorter than ya might be used to."
    s "我得跟你说一声，明早该咱们值早班了。所以，这聚会最好别搞得太晚，悠着点儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10243
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_90dac208_1:

    # s "I'd prefer not to pick up your slack because you haven't had any rest."
    s "我可不想因为你没休息好，还得替你收拾烂摊子。"

# game/script.rpy:10245
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_13b079c5:

    # s "Granted, I can't order ya to bed, but I also don't want your sailing career to start off with an official reprimand."
    s "当然，我不能命令你睡觉，但我也可不想你刚开始航海生涯就吃个处分。"

# game/script.rpy:10247
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_db743b5b_1:

    # p "Message received. I'll finish up my plate quickly first, if you don't mind."
    p "收到。如果你不介意，我先快速吃完我的盘子。"

# game/script.rpy:10249
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_8a4333bd_1:

    # p "I'm feeling rather tired anyway."
    p "反正我感觉很累了。"

# game/script.rpy:10255
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_e96b0720_1:

    # "You follow his advice and finish your meal before retiring to your hammock."
    "你听从了他的建议，吃完饭才回到吊床上休息。"

# game/script.rpy:10257
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_05478c65_1:

    # "The hammock does a good job catching the gentle rolling of the ship, as the vessel forges its way through the night.{w} You lay there, taking in the calming sight of the dark wooden deck above you."
    "船只在夜里乘风破浪，吊床也随着船身轻轻摇晃。{w} 你躺在吊床上，望着上方幽暗的木制甲板，心情渐渐平静了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:10259
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_06afa914:

    # "You think about the doctor. What little information she revealed about her past only created a dozen more questions."
    "你脑海里浮现出那位医生的身影。她透露的那么一点点关于过去的信息，反而勾起了你更多的好奇。"

# game/script.rpy:10261
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_53790a11:

    # "You don't want to pry, but it's impossible to deny that you're looking forward to your next dinner. You start planning immediately how to word your questions so as to not offend."
    "你不想打探别人的隐私，但不得不承认，你开始期待下一次的晚餐了。你立马开始琢磨该怎么措辞，才能问得不冒犯。"

# game/script.rpy:10263
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_cbdef028:

    # "But eventually, the shroud of sleep falls on your face as well."
    "最终，你还是抵挡不住睡意，沉沉睡去。"

# game/script.rpy:10265
translate Chinese firstdinner_Arthur_be5e991e:

    # "Certainly not the worst first day in this new chapter of your life."
    "怎么说呢，这新生活的第一天，还算不错。"

# game/script.rpy:10274
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_e8a93b4e:

    # p "I guess, what with dinner going on, I just wanted to ask if I could... sit down for it alongside you?"
    p "我寻思着，大家都在吃晚饭，我就想问问，能不能...跟你们一起凑合一顿？"

# game/script.rpy:10278
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_83227fd8:

    # "The furrows on Arthur's face disappear."
    "Arthur脸上的皱纹舒展开了。"

# game/script.rpy:10283
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_7bfb11bf:

    # "His head slowly tilts, the stern expression dissolving into a subtle hint of surprise."
    "他缓缓地歪了歪头，严肃的表情逐渐消融，取而代之的是一丝不易察觉的惊讶。"

# game/script.rpy:10285
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_b80c6e38:

    # a "Sit down... for dinner?"
    a "坐下来...吃饭？"

# game/script.rpy:10287
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_1059d874:

    # "You nod sheepishly."
    "你有些难为情地点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:10295
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_d59ef0ea:

    # "Arthur steps forward, turning to face you fully."
    "Arthur向前迈了一步，转过身，正面朝向你。"

# game/script.rpy:10299
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a505d333:

    # a "Sit down.{w} For dinner."
    a "坐下来。{w} 吃饭？"

# game/script.rpy:10301
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_8c5efc8c:

    # "The officer rolls each word over his tongue, as if tasting an expensive wine. His expression is hard to decipher—somewhere between confused, angry, and delighted."
    "这位长官在舌尖上反复咂摸咀嚼着每一个字眼，仿佛在品鉴某种昂贵的陈年佳酿。他的神情让人难以琢磨——介于困惑、愠怒与莫名的愉悦之间。"

# game/script.rpy:10303
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_77716736:

    # "The ambiguity doesn't last long."
    "这种模棱两可的状态并没有持续多久。"

# game/script.rpy:10307
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_dbfe6673:

    # a "Sit down for dinner."
    a "坐下来吃饭？"

# game/script.rpy:10309
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_dfc6d8d5:

    # a "Sit down for dinner with me."
    a "跟我一起坐下来吃饭？"

# game/script.rpy:10311
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_420d52c0:

    # p "Uh... Yes..."
    p "额... 是...是的。"

# game/script.rpy:10316
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_bb993e25:

    # "The woman next to him raises a hand to shield her eyes, trying to look anywhere but at the two of you."
    "他旁边的女士抬起手遮住眼睛，竭力不去看你们俩。"

# game/script.rpy:10318
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_b08723c9:

    # a "Well then. Why not invite the captain while we're at it?"
    a "好家伙。要不咱们顺便把船长也请来得了？"

# game/script.rpy:10320
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_4d095b87:

    # p "I'm... sorry?"
    p "我... 对不起？"

# game/script.rpy:10322
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_bcf763fd:

    # a "I bet you'd be excited to make his acquaintance. Oh, I just can't wait to hear the stories you'll share!"
    a "我敢跟你打赌，你肯定很想认识他。哦，我已经迫不及待地想听你们分享故事了！"

# game/script.rpy:10326
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a6d6925c:

    # a "Maybe you'd like your own cabin? How about that? Hmm?"
    a "也许你想要一间自己的船舱？怎么样？嗯？"

# game/script.rpy:10328
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_8aee77f4:

    # "Wood creaks under his weight, each mocking line accompanied by a step forward."
    "木板在他沉重的身躯下发出不堪重负的吱嘎声，每说一句嘲讽的话，他就向前逼近一步。"

# game/script.rpy:10330
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_75c978aa:

    # a "How about holding a proper ceremony? Finding you an officer's uniform?"
    a "要不要给你办个像样的仪式？再给你找一套军官的制服？"

# game/script.rpy:10332
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a7e4ac96:

    # a "Should I inform the rest of the crew they're now taking orders {i}from you{/i}?"
    a "我是不是应该通知全体水手，他们现在要听{i}你的{/i}号令了？"

# game/script.rpy:10334
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_92cf1808:

    # "The confined spaces of the ship make him feel even bigger than his already noticeable height implies. You shake your head, fast."
    "船舱狭窄的空间衬托得他更加高大，压迫感十足。你赶紧摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:10336
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_d9a22cb0:

    # p "N-No, sir."
    p "不...不了，先生。"

# game/script.rpy:10338
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_33498b6f:

    # "Arthur stays silent, staring daggers your way."
    "Arthur一言不发，眼神像刀子一样剜着你。"

# game/script.rpy:10340
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_5d1c64e1:

    # "You can tell he's expecting something more, but you have no idea what. Your brain races with potential additions, but you're too scared to commit to any of them."
    "你能感觉到他在期待着什么，但你摸不着头脑。你脑子里飞速闪过无数种可能，却又胆怯得不敢确定。"

# game/script.rpy:10342
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_522f2712:

    # "The first officer takes a slow, deep breath. His behavior might suggest an attempt at calming down, but his eyes imply a fantasy involving his rather large hands and your neck."
    "大副缓缓地深吸一口气，似乎想要冷静下来，但眼神却暴露了他内心的真实想法——他的大手正幻想着掐住你的脖子。"

# game/script.rpy:10344
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_c6abb0d9:

    # a "For the love of... One day. It hasn't even been one day yet."
    a "我的老天...这才第一天啊，还不到一天呢。"

# game/script.rpy:10346
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a3d2d2ca:

    # a "Count yourself lucky that this is not a military vessel, runt, or {i}your apology{/i} would be written in blood on your back. {w}And I'd be disappointed I wouldn't be holding the whip."
    a "算你命大这艘船不是战舰军船，矮冬瓜，否则{i}你的道歉{/i}早就用鲜血刻在你背上了。{w}而且我还巴不得亲手拿着九尾鞭来抽你呢。"

# game/script.rpy:10348
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a55b81f6:

    # p "Sorry, sir. I apologize, sir. It won't happen again, sir. Understood."
    p "对不起，先生！属下知错，先生！绝不会再犯，先生！属下明白！"

# game/script.rpy:10350
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a4d7c4eb:

    # a "Do not make this a recurring problem.{w} Now leave."
    a "别再有下次！{w} 滚吧！"

# game/script.rpy:10352
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_70bac8eb:

    # "He finally takes his eyes off you. You remember how to breathe."
    "他终于把目光从你身上挪开，你这才想起该怎么呼吸。"

# game/script.rpy:10357
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_80dedec9:

    # "You turn your tail and walk away as fast as your legs allow, but not so fast as to make people think you're running."
    "你赶紧转身离开，步子飞快，又不能显得像是在逃跑。"

# game/script.rpy:10359
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_e4affcc3:

    # "In the corner of your eye, you spot Arthur saying something to the woman and leaving through a door."
    "眼角余光里，你瞥见Arthur对那女人说了几句什么，然后便穿过一道门走了。"

# game/script.rpy:10361
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_a9127e0c:

    # "The cheetah then follows after him, closing the door behind her."
    "那只猎豹也跟了上去，随手关上了门。"

# game/script.rpy:10365
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_aa656504:

    # "Free from the terrifying gaze of your superior, you stop and look towards where your conversation took place."
    "摆脱了上司那可怕的目光，你这才停下脚步，回头望向刚才对话的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:10367
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_21389cf0:

    # "The spot is empty, but the feeling lingers."
    "那里空无一人，但那种令人窒息的感觉仍然挥之不去。"

# game/script.rpy:10369
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_92c681b5:

    # "Your heart is still beating wildly in your chest. You blink slowly, taking deep, controlled breaths. The wild rhythm slows to a more manageable waltz as you recenter yourself."
    "你的心脏依旧在胸腔里狂跳，你缓缓眨眼，深呼吸，努力平复着心情。狂乱的心跳也渐渐平复，如同华尔兹般舒缓，你重新找回了平静。"

# game/script.rpy:10371
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_b4adf308:

    # "It's no big deal, you think. Everyone makes mistakes on their first day. You just need to be more careful in the future. {w}It's all right."
    "没什么大不了的，你安慰自己。谁第一天上班还不犯点错呢？以后小心点就是了。{w} 没事的，一切都会好起来的。"

# game/script.rpy:10373
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_16665061:

    # "But you can't stop yourself from staring at the closed door."
    "但你还是忍不住盯着那扇紧闭的门。"

# game/script.rpy:10375
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_dd1b447a:

    # "The atmosphere around you is lively. You spot Julian sitting at a table with people you don't know, but you can't summon any lingering interest in socializing."
    "周围气氛热闹非凡，你看到Julian正和几个你不认识的人坐在一起谈笑风生，但你现在根本没心情去社交。"

# game/script.rpy:10377
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_f5de471f:

    # "Nor do you feel any hunger whatsoever. You just want the day to end as fast as possible."
    "你也感觉不到任何饥饿，只想让这糟糕的一天赶紧结束。"

# game/script.rpy:10379
translate Chinese day1_arthur_dinner_rejection_77e1160b:

    # "You leave the common area to go and figure out where you're supposed to sleep."
    "你离开了公共区域，打算去找找自己该睡在哪儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10415
translate Chinese day_2_start_49ced15a:

    # "A voice enters your surroundings from a realm beyond, resonating through space itself."
    "一个声音从虚空中传来，在你的脑海中回响，仿佛穿透了空间。"

# game/script.rpy:10417
translate Chinese day_2_start_a970915d:

    # "You're talking to someone. Someone you know, however their exact likeness is difficult to place. Their face is strangely blurry whenever you look."
    "你在和某人说话，一个你认识的人，但他的样子却有些模糊，怎么也无法看清。"

# game/script.rpy:10419
translate Chinese day_2_start_27e28444:

    # q "Hey"
    q "嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:10421
translate Chinese day_2_start_2ab6c3e9:

    # "It becomes harder and harder to focus on the person. Your feet start to feel unsteady with the movement of the earth underneath."
    "你越来越难以集中精神，脚下的地面也开始摇晃，让你站立不稳。"

# game/script.rpy:10423
translate Chinese day_2_start_65b54ab1:

    # q "Heeey"
    q "嘿嘿嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:10425
translate Chinese day_2_start_8967c909:

    # "Suddenly the familiarity of the voice returns to your mind, and it gets sucked into the here and now."
    "突然，你猛然想起这熟悉的声音是谁，一下子回到了现实。"

# game/script.rpy:10427
translate Chinese day_2_start_8d27c9c2:

    # "It's not unsteady ground you're standing on but your hammock."
    "原来，你不是站在不稳的地面上，而是躺在吊床上。"

# game/script.rpy:10429
translate Chinese day_2_start_0a2bcb9c:

    # "Samuel."
    "Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:10431
translate Chinese day_2_start_b4174afa:

    # "Right, you remember. That wonderful maned wolf."
    "对了，你想起来了，是那只可爱的maned wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:10434
translate Chinese day_2_start_c4a69588:

    # "The ship's interior emerges around you as you turn in your hammock, finding Samuel just waiting for you to wake up."
    "你翻了个身，船舱的景象映入眼帘，Samuel正笑吟吟地看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:10445
translate Chinese day_2_start_bd75ea24:

    # "WHA-?!"
    "哇-？！"

# game/script.rpy:10449
translate Chinese day_2_start_bd75ea24_1:

    # "WHA-?!"
    "哇-？！"

# game/script.rpy:10456
translate Chinese day_2_start_20d622a5:

    # "Samuel?!"
    "Samuel？！"

# game/script.rpy:10458
translate Chinese day_2_start_3883ddc5:

    # s "Heeeey!"
    s "嘿！"

# game/script.rpy:10460
translate Chinese day_2_start_83e29e3c:

    # p "I'm awake, I'm awake, but..."
    p "我醒了，醒了还不行吗……"

# game/script.rpy:10462
translate Chinese day_2_start_a6e25ac5:

    # "You can hardly believe your eyes, nor can you stop them from wandering."
    "你简直不敢相信自己的眼睛，忍不住到处乱看。"

# game/script.rpy:10464
translate Chinese day_2_start_cd63ca6e:

    # "Down his shoulders, the curve of his back... tail..."
    "顺着他的肩膀，他背部的曲线... 还有那尾巴……"

# game/script.rpy:10466
translate Chinese day_2_start_4d663e9a:

    # "...rear..."
    "... 屁股……"

# game/script.rpy:10468
translate Chinese day_2_start_176270f2:

    # "\"I wanted to wake you up before the others\" he suggests. \"Spend some extra time with you.\""
    "“我想赶在其他人之前叫醒你，”他说着，带着点期待，“这样就能和你多待一会儿了。”"

# game/script.rpy:10470
translate Chinese day_2_start_83982995:

    # s "I said hey. Wake up."
    s "嘿，我说醒醒啦。"

# game/script.rpy:10472
translate Chinese day_2_start_bfe1a147:

    # "Light enters this world from the edge of your vision. In that instant, the barrier between the two worlds in your mind is broken."
    "一丝光亮从眼角溜进这个世界。就在那一瞬间，你脑海中两个世界的壁垒轰然倒塌。"

# game/script.rpy:10478
translate Chinese day_2_start_3234f97c:

    # "The desired world of your dream vanishes, replaced and filled with nothing but the sight of a crudely woven hammock."
    "梦中的美好世界瞬间消失，取而代之的是一张粗糙的吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:10480
translate Chinese day_2_start_86c83a87:

    # "You close your eyelids forcefully, not in an effort to fall asleep again but to combat the yawn that is sure to follow."
    "你用力闭上眼睛，想阻止即将到来的哈欠，而不是想睡回笼觉。"

# game/script.rpy:10482
translate Chinese day_2_start_c2c8c82b:

    # "...Despite your best efforts, you yawn anyway."
    "... 结果还是没忍住，打了个哈欠。"

# game/script.rpy:10484
translate Chinese day_2_start_3bbdb401:

    # s "Good morning."
    s "早上好。"

# game/script.rpy:10489
translate Chinese day_2_start_0d04436e:

    # s "Rise and shine."
    s "起来嗨！"

# game/script.rpy:10491
translate Chinese day_2_start_8dd1ed4c:

    # "You bring your hands to your face, rubbing your eyes firmly."
    "你抬手揉了揉眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:10493
translate Chinese day_2_start_c33769b8:

    # "You weren't new to waking up early from your life back at home, but it always takes a couple moments, and the hammock feels so tantalizingly comfy."
    "在家的时候你也没少早起，但总得缓一会儿才能适应，而且这吊床也太舒服了。"

# game/script.rpy:10495
translate Chinese day_2_start_50f7bf43:

    # "Maybe just five more minutes?"
    "让我再睡五分钟，就五分钟？"

# game/script.rpy:10497
translate Chinese day_2_start_a393abaa:

    # "Samuel is having none of it and, noticing your hands starting to relax over your eyes, reaches into your hammock and pulls them away from your face."
    "Samuel可不吃这套。他看你又要睡过去，直接伸手把你扒拉了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:10502
translate Chinese day_2_start_21479045:

    # s "Don't ya dare fall asleep again."
    s "你要是敢再睡，看我不揍你。"

# game/script.rpy:10504
translate Chinese day_2_start_602033fc:

    # "You sigh, knowing that he's right."
    "你叹了口气，知道他说得对。"

# game/script.rpy:10506
translate Chinese day_2_start_5a9b8e45:

    # "Unfortunately."
    "可不是么。"

# game/script.rpy:10511
translate Chinese day_2_start_678ab202:

    # p "But muuuuum!"
    p "哎哟，人家还想睡嘛！"

# game/script.rpy:10514
translate Chinese day_2_start_54f42a8d:

    # "Samuel is caught off guard briefly from your playful retort, and gives your snout a light back-handed swat."
    "Samuel没想到你会来这句，一时没反应过来，抬手轻轻拍了下你的鼻子。"

# game/script.rpy:10516
translate Chinese day_2_start_8f9e3571:

    # p "Fine. I'm awake. I'm awake...{w} Kind of."
    p "好啦。我醒了，我醒了……{w}大概算是醒了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10518
translate Chinese day_2_start_ffcf533c:

    # p "How late is it anyway?"
    p "现在几点了？"

# game/script.rpy:10524
translate Chinese day_2_start_e1b6077e:

    # "You shift in your hammock, using your elbows to prop yourself up as much as possible without knocking your head on the wooden beam above."
    "你在吊床上挣扎着坐起来，用胳膊肘撑着，生怕磕到头顶上的木头。"

# game/script.rpy:10526
translate Chinese day_2_start_e92505a4:

    # "Julian is still fast asleep in his hammock next to yours, his tail dangling out over the edge of it."
    "旁边的吊床上，Julian睡得正香，尾巴都耷拉下来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10528
translate Chinese day_2_start_788a0596:

    # s "Hm? Oh it's 3 o'clock. Just rang six bells."
    s "嗯？哦，现在是凌晨三点。刚敲过六响钟呢。"
    # 译注：航海计钟制：半小时一响钟，六响钟（six bells）在夜更对应凌晨3点。

# game/script.rpy:10530
translate Chinese day_2_start_b4742ff2:

    # s "Morning watch starts at 4."
    s "早上四点开始值班。"

# game/script.rpy:10532
translate Chinese day_2_start_a723b84e:

    # p "You woke me up an hour earlier?!"
    p "你居然提前一个小时叫我起来？！"

# game/script.rpy:10544
translate Chinese day_2_start_45800267:

    # p "Could have slept a little more..."
    p "真想再睡会儿…"

# game/script.rpy:10546
translate Chinese day_2_start_95f79232:

    # "You grumble annoyedly as you fight the urge to fall asleep again."
    "你咕哝着，强忍着再次睡去的冲动，心里一阵烦躁。"

# game/script.rpy:10548
translate Chinese day_2_start_c73f3198:

    # s "Stop being so pissy. I wanted to show ya something before the morning watch starts."
    s "别这么臭着脸。早上开始值班前，我想给你看个好东西。"

# game/script.rpy:10550
translate Chinese day_2_start_b6b26f6f:

    # s "Besides, you worked on a farm, didn't you? You must be used to gettin' up early."
    s "再说，你以前不是在农场干活吗？肯定习惯早起了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10552
translate Chinese day_2_start_f3701de9:

    # p "It was my father's farm... he went easy on me, and yesterday left me pretty tired."
    p "那是我爸的农场……他没怎么使唤我，而且昨天确实累着了。"

# game/script.rpy:10557
translate Chinese day_2_start_bc1522ad:

    # s "You'll survive."
    s "你死不了。"

# game/script.rpy:10560
translate Chinese day_2_start_736b68e8:

    # "Slowly you shift your weight to the side to slide out the hammock while Samuel holds onto it to help you keep it steady."
    "你慢慢地把重心移到一边，想从吊床上滑下来，Samuel在一旁扶着，帮你稳住。"

# game/script.rpy:10562
translate Chinese day_2_start_6de73310:

    # "The two of you do a good job balancing your still hazy self. With your combined efforts your paws land on the deck with a soft thud."
    "你们俩配合得还不错，总算没摔着。在你们的努力下，你的脚掌轻轻地落在了甲板上。"

# game/script.rpy:10564
translate Chinese day_2_start_dad28967:

    # s "There we go. {w}Wasn't so hard, was it?"
    s "这就对了。{w}没那么难吧？"

# game/script.rpy:10566
translate Chinese day_2_start_04e9ee3d:

    # "Samuel chuckles as he looks at your face, which must appear to answer his question without a single word necessary."
    "Samuel看着你的表情，忍不住笑了出来， 看来你的脸已经代替你回答了他的问题。"

# game/script.rpy:10571
translate Chinese day_2_start_a458e38f:

    # p "Aside from me barely being able to keep my eyes open and probably stumbling over something and breaking my neck within the next 5 minutes..."
    p "要不是我困得眼睛都睁不开，而且接下来五分钟内可能被什么东西绊倒摔断脖子的话……"

# game/script.rpy:10573
translate Chinese day_2_start_a99f5a04:

    # p "But yes, aside from that it wasn't very hard, Sam."
    p "但抛开这些不说，确实不难，Sam。"

# game/script.rpy:10578
translate Chinese day_2_start_d1aec262:

    # "Once more your hands find their way to rub some of the gunk from your eyes."
    "你又抬手揉了揉惺忪的睡眼。"

# game/script.rpy:10580
translate Chinese day_2_start_02f61064:

    # s "That's the spirit."
    s "这就对了。"

# game/script.rpy:10586
translate Chinese day_2_start_36843863:

    # "He reaches up to your shoulder to straighten out your shirt. Helping you look slightly less as if you just rolled out of the barrel you hid in as a stowaway."
    "他抬手帮你拉了拉肩膀上的衣服，让你看起来不那么像个躲在桶里偷渡的家伙。"

# game/script.rpy:10588
translate Chinese day_2_start_b43aeee1:

    # p "What did you want to show me anyway?"
    p "你到底想给我看什么啊？"

# game/script.rpy:10593
translate Chinese day_2_start_1f185b35:

    # "Samuel smiles subtly in return."
    "Samuel也微微一笑。"

# game/script.rpy:10595
translate Chinese day_2_start_b06aef63:

    # s "Ya first sunrise at sea. You did say you never set foot on a ship, right?"
    s "你第一次在海上看日出。你不是说你没上过船吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10597
translate Chinese day_2_start_611cae39:

    # s "I like watching them."
    s "我喜欢看日出。"

# game/script.rpy:10599
translate Chinese day_2_start_f41e9fae:

    # p "But... 3 in the morning?"
    p "可是……凌晨三点？"

# game/script.rpy:10604
translate Chinese day_2_start_9427292f:

    # s "This is all on you. {w}If you wanted more convenient times, you shouldn't have joined during summer."
    s "这可都是你自找的。{w}你要是想晚点儿，就不该夏天上船。"

# game/script.rpy:10606
translate Chinese day_2_start_11bd6b3c:

    # p "What about him?"
    p "他怎么了？"

# game/script.rpy:10608
translate Chinese day_2_start_6844cac1:

    # "You nod over to the bed Julian is sleeping in."
    "你朝Julian睡觉的床努了努嘴。"

# game/script.rpy:10610
translate Chinese day_2_start_0d4eb506:

    # s "Let him sleep.{w} He'd just ruin the moment somehow."
    s "让他睡吧。{w}他醒了肯定会破坏气氛。"

# game/script.rpy:10612
translate Chinese day_2_start_59642aba:

    # p "He isn't that bad."
    p "他没那么差劲。"

# game/script.rpy:10614
translate Chinese day_2_start_2893adff:

    # s "He isn't. But I prefer a quiet sunrise today."
    s "他倒是不差。但我今天只想安安静静地看个日出。"

# game/script.rpy:10617
translate Chinese day_2_start_0b201e94:

    # "A moment of quiet is shared between you before you start making your way to the stairs, weaving past other sleeping crew and all the bits and bobs strewn around the deck."
    "你们享受了一会儿安静的时光，然后便开始走向楼梯，绕过正在睡觉的船员和散落在甲板上的杂物。"

# game/script.rpy:10619
translate Chinese day_2_start_ae5e0085:

    # "The atmosphere on the ship is so starkly different from yesterday evening. It is quiet, with nothing but a few voices coming from the main deck."
    "船上的气氛和昨晚完全不同，静悄悄的，只有主甲板上传来几声低语。"

# game/script.rpy:10621
translate Chinese day_2_start_19ae17f0:

    # "The warm light of the lamps is still present, yet for the most part, what was a room bustling with activity now is still, aside from the sway of hammocks and one of the watchmen sitting at his post."
    "灯光依旧温暖，但曾经热闹的船舱现在却安静了下来，只有吊床在轻轻摇晃，还有一名守望者坚守岗位。"

# game/script.rpy:10623
translate Chinese day_2_start_10c2adf7:

    # "Most of the seating has been cleared aside to leave the space less claustrophobic, and even the occasional bird outside can be heard as they still trail the ship."
    "为了让空间不那么压抑，大部分座位都被搬到了一边，甚至能听到偶尔有海鸟在船后飞过的声音。"

# game/script.rpy:10625
translate Chinese day_2_start_732d5b60:

    # "Samuel doesn't appear to struggle with being up so early with the maned wolf confidently leading the way across the deck."
    "Samuel看起来毫不费力，这匹鬃狼自信地领着你走过甲板。"

# game/script.rpy:10627
translate Chinese day_2_start_642942b0:

    # "Past one of the wooden pillars and up the wide stairway leading to the main deck."
    "绕过一根木柱，走上通往主甲板的宽阔楼梯。"

# game/script.rpy:10634
translate Chinese day_2_start_31bce545:

    # s "You'll thank me. Trust me."
    s "你会感谢我的。相信我。"

# game/script.rpy:10636
translate Chinese day_2_start_f5a8b55f:

    # p "I do, Sam. It's my body that doesn't want to play along just yet."
    p "我信你，Sam。就是身体它还没缓过来。"

# game/script.rpy:10638
translate Chinese day_2_start_eb16ec7d:

    # p "How long have you been up already? You are way too spry."
    p "你都起来多久了？你倒是挺精神。"

# game/script.rpy:10640
translate Chinese day_2_start_7c3de2cb:

    # "He turns around as he reaches the top of the stairs."
    "他走到楼梯顶端时转过身。"

# game/script.rpy:10642
translate Chinese day_2_start_6052bcc6:

    # s "Oh, just a few minutes. I rarely have trouble getting outta bed."
    s "哦，就一会儿。我很少赖床。"

# game/script.rpy:10647
translate Chinese day_2_start_663f6f70:

    # s "I don't know. It's just like that, and I'm up and ready."
    s "说不上来，反正一下子就精神了。"

# game/script.rpy:10650
translate Chinese day_2_start_2f522a8f:

    # "He snaps his fingers to underline his point."
    "他打了个响指来强调他的观点。"

# game/script.rpy:10663
translate Chinese day_2_start_2790e4c2:

    # "By now no lamps were needed outside, as the twilight provides just enough of a soft illumination to allow you to confidently pick your steps."
    "现在外面都不用点灯了，借着这黄昏的光，也能看清路。"

# game/script.rpy:10665
translate Chinese day_2_start_bb6a6c20:

    # "The morning air is fresh, with a firm breeze that immediately begins to tug on your fur as you step outside."
    "迎面吹来一阵清劲的微风，立刻就吹拂着你的毛发。"

# game/script.rpy:10667
translate Chinese day_2_start_4677b055:

    # "It is a little more active out here, but even then, the middle watch is just calmly counting down the hours."
    "是比刚才热闹了些，不过值夜班的也只是在安静地数着时间。"

# game/script.rpy:10669
translate Chinese day_2_start_f94924fd:

    # "Samuel walks down the deck until he finds a somewhat secluded spot at the front of the ship, behind a couple of barrels affixed in place."
    "Samuel沿着甲板走，在船头找了个相对安静的角落，在几只固定住的木桶后面。"

# game/script.rpy:10671
translate Chinese day_2_start_735fe21c:

    # "The maned wolf crosses his arms over the railing, ensuring there is enough space next to him to have you join alongside."
    "这匹鬃狼将双臂搭在栏杆上，特意给你留了地方。"

# game/script.rpy:10673
translate Chinese day_2_start_b6bc555a:

    # "The two of you are nestled between barrels and winding lines, the waves breaking on the bow right beneath you as the ship slides through them."
    "你们俩就挤在木桶和绳索之间，海浪拍打着船头，船劈波斩浪地前行。"

# game/script.rpy:10675
translate Chinese day_2_start_8931eb93:

    # "The sun was yet to creep over the horizon, but judging by the emerging glow along the distance, it couldn't be too far off."
    "太阳还没露头，不过看远处那逐渐显现的光芒样子，也快了。"

# game/script.rpy:10677
translate Chinese day_2_start_ebccfa29:

    # s "Did ya sleep well?"
    s "睡得好吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10679
translate Chinese day_2_start_9c7771f1:

    # p "Okay, I guess."
    p "还行吧，大概。"

# game/script.rpy:10681
translate Chinese day_2_start_812f0e2d:

    # p "Takes a bit of getting used to it. But I was rather tired and drifted off quickly enough."
    p "这吊床确实得花点时间适应。不过我当时实在太累了，倒头没多久就睡着了。"

# game/script.rpy:10683
translate Chinese day_2_start_905834fc:

    # s "Coulda' been worse then."
    s "那可就更遭罪了。"

# game/script.rpy:10685
translate Chinese day_2_start_7a823227:

    # p "I think getting woken up by you helped as well."
    p "被你叫醒了，感觉还不错。"

# game/script.rpy:10690
translate Chinese day_2_start_4ed2bf9e:

    # s "Oh, you charmer. {w}It's my special technique. Toss people out early, and they'll like me for it."
    s "你这张甜嘴。 {w}这可是我的独门秘诀，早点把人拽起来，他们就得喜欢我。"

# game/script.rpy:10692
translate Chinese day_2_start_abc8cdea:

    # s "It has never failed. Not even once."
    s "百试百灵，从没失手过。"

# game/script.rpy:10694
translate Chinese day_2_start_18666e1b:

    # p "That doesn't sound very believable. How often have you applied that technique so far?"
    p "这话你自己信吗？你这招用到现在几次了？"

# game/script.rpy:10696
translate Chinese day_2_start_2e12c053:

    # s "Oh, y'know. Once."
    s "嗨，这不是头一回嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:10698
translate Chinese day_2_start_74e6ffc8:

    # "He grins toothily."
    "他咧嘴一笑，露出牙齿。"

# game/script.rpy:10703
translate Chinese day_2_start_8b02421b:

    # p "Aren't you a bit early with your assessment? I've yet to decide if getting dragged out here by you was a good thing."
    p "你下结论是不是有点太早了？被你硬拉到这船上到底算不算好事，我可还没想明白呢。"

# game/script.rpy:10705
translate Chinese day_2_start_29e30b9b:

    # p "I might grumpily drag myself back to bed and dream about all the sleep I've missed out on."
    p "没准我一会就气哼哼地滚回床上，接着睡我的回笼觉去了。"

# game/script.rpy:10710
translate Chinese day_2_start_4ca8dc62:

    # s "Oh shut up."
    s "滚你的吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10713
translate Chinese day_2_start_f7960a91:

    # "He laughs and shoves your shoulder, sending you swaying into the wooden barrel next to you."
    "他笑着搡了你一下，把你搡得一个趔趄，撞到了旁边的木桶上。"

# game/script.rpy:10715
translate Chinese day_2_start_2211a99d:

    # "By now the deck of the ship is lit entirely. The deep darkness of the sky has vanished to be replaced with the pale blue of morning."
    "甲板上亮堂堂的。深邃的夜空褪去，换上了清晨的浅蓝。"

# game/script.rpy:10717
translate Chinese day_2_start_f398f07b:

    # "The few clouds in the sky catch the bright orange sunlight already, and within a few seconds, the first glimmers of the sun make their way over the horizon."
    "天空中稀疏的云朵，已经染上了明亮的橙色阳光，第一缕阳光刺破地平线。"

# game/script.rpy:10726
translate Chinese day_2_start_da59b4db:

    # "It dances between the distant clouds, setting them alight with a brilliant shine and bathing the two of you in the first rays of sunlight."
    "阳光在远方的云层间跳跃，以耀眼的光芒点亮云彩，也将你们笼罩在第一缕晨曦之中。"

# game/script.rpy:10728
translate Chinese day_2_start_e90bf494:

    # "A minute passes in contemplative silence as you look out onto the open sea, a few birds being the only thing that breaks the sense of time simply standing still."
    "你们静静地眺望着大海，时间仿佛凝固，只有几只海鸟的鸣叫打破了这份寂静。"

# game/script.rpy:10730
translate Chinese day_2_start_2e7158fe:

    # "A gust of wind sends one of his braids slapping against your cheek, yet even that can't break this moment for you."
    "一阵风拂过，他的一根辫子调皮地扫过你的脸颊，但这小小的触动也无法打破此刻的宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:10732
translate Chinese day_2_start_25f8e936:

    # "Maybe it is stupid. It is just a sunrise like every other you've experienced, but the company seems to make this one particularly special."
    "也许这很傻。这不过是你经历过的无数次日出之一，但这份陪伴，却让它显得格外珍贵。"

# game/script.rpy:10734
translate Chinese day_2_start_4ac55c53:

    # s "Is it failing?"
    s "会失败吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10736
translate Chinese day_2_start_f9af8145:

    # "Samuel asks, while continuing to look out onto the sea."
    "Samuel一边问，一边继续望着大海。"

# game/script.rpy:10738
translate Chinese day_2_start_4bac7d1d:

    # p "It never will if you make sure to combine it with a sunrise."
    p "只要你和日出一起欣赏，它就不会失败。"

# game/script.rpy:10740
translate Chinese day_2_start_7f8be56c:

    # s "Sharin' it with someone doesn't hurt either. Makes me feel a little less odd about it."
    s "有人一起分享，感觉也挺好。至少不会觉得我是个怪人。"

# game/script.rpy:10742
translate Chinese day_2_start_a9d40b01:

    # p "Feeling odd about it? Is that why you've tucked us into the corner here?"
    p "所以你才带我们躲到这儿？"

# game/script.rpy:10744
translate Chinese day_2_start_d196e75f:

    # "You peek over the barrel to check the surroundings. It is the only place on the ship that would hide you from the view of others further back."
    "你从桶边探出头，查看四周。这里是船上唯一能避开别人视线的地方。"

# game/script.rpy:10746
translate Chinese day_2_start_fa990bab:

    # s "No.{w} Not really I think."
    s "不是的。{w} 其实没有。"

# game/script.rpy:10748
translate Chinese day_2_start_a676197a:

    # s "Well... perhaps. It just feels to me like nobody else appreciates it."
    s "嗯……也许吧。只是觉得，好像没人能体会这种美好。"

# game/script.rpy:10750
translate Chinese day_2_start_83d831d1:

    # s "Or have you heard many veterans at the tavern boasting about all the days they spent calmly watching the sun climb over the horizon?"
    s "你听过哪个老兵在酒馆里，吹嘘自己平静地看太阳升起的日子？"

# game/script.rpy:10752
translate Chinese day_2_start_a88c621c:

    # "He tips his head to the side as if to shrug off the thought."
    "他歪了歪头，似乎想甩掉这个想法。"

# game/script.rpy:10754
translate Chinese day_2_start_60e70cfa:

    # s "It's how drunk they got, how many women they laid, how many men they beat up."
    s "他们只会吹嘘自己喝了多少酒，睡了多少女人，揍了多少人。"

# game/script.rpy:10768
translate Chinese day_2_start_dd48032e:

    # p "With all the men here nobody wants to be the weak one."
    p "在这种地方，谁也不想示弱。"

# game/script.rpy:10770
translate Chinese day_2_start_81be82ba:

    # p "It's just as with Arthur. To hold a position like that you just need to be strong. So the others show you the required respect."
    p "就像Arthur一样，想要坐到那个位置，就必须足够强大，才能赢得别人的尊重。"

# game/script.rpy:10774
translate Chinese day_2_start_028c742f:

    # s "Perhaps..."
    s "也许吧……"

# game/script.rpy:10776
translate Chinese day_2_start_83715b32:

    # "His gaze lowers to watch the waves pass by the ship."
    "他垂下眼眸，看着海浪从船边涌过。"

# game/script.rpy:10778
translate Chinese day_2_start_eecf0289:

    # s "Is that what you are after?{w} Taking a role like Officer as Arthur does?"
    s "你也想那样吗？{w} 像Arthur一样当个军官？"

# game/script.rpy:10780
translate Chinese day_2_start_938bf354:

    # p "It'd be pretty cool, wouldn't it?{w} Though I've just started my second day, it's probably a bit early to set my sights on that."
    p "听起来很酷，不是吗？{w} 不过我才刚来第二天，现在想这些是不是太早了？"

# game/script.rpy:10782
translate Chinese day_2_start_5f099c4b:

    # p "But it would have a good sound to it, don't you think? Officer [family_name]?"
    p "但[family_name]长官，听起来就很气派，你不觉得吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10784
translate Chinese day_2_start_ce97582c:

    # "You do start to daydream for a moment about your possible ascendancy up the ranks over the years. Early days but who knows?"
    "你开始憧憬着未来晋升的情景。虽然现在说这些还早，但谁知道呢？"

# game/script.rpy:10786
translate Chinese day_2_start_8ca35737:

    # "Better than the farm? At least at this point you think so."
    "总比待在农场好吧？至少现在我是这么想的。"

# game/script.rpy:10788
translate Chinese day_2_start_0a85a968:

    # s "I see.{w} It is a bit early for ya to know, I suppose."
    s "我明白了。{w} 确实，现在你知道这些还太早了。"

# game/script.rpy:10790
translate Chinese day_2_start_62786e8c:

    # p "Speaking of early...is there something for us to eat before the shift starts?"
    p "说到早……开工前有什么吃的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10803
translate Chinese day_2_start_b1127eeb:

    # "The maned wolf seems pulled out of his own thoughts as he lifts his head, nodding in response."
    "他似乎这才从思绪中回过神，抬起头，点点头。"

# game/script.rpy:10805
translate Chinese day_2_start_3eb51960:

    # s "Nothin' fancy if you're hoping for that.{w} Bandile isn't up this early. But you could grab some bread, and if you're lucky there are some leftovers still."
    s "想吃什么好东西就别指望了。{w} Bandile还没起呢。不过你可以去拿点面包，运气好的话，说不定还有剩菜。"

# game/script.rpy:10807
translate Chinese day_2_start_b798ebb0:

    # s "Don't count on it though."
    s "不过，别太指望了。"

# game/script.rpy:10809
translate Chinese day_2_start_4b603f0e:

    # p "That'll do for me. Just need something in me... you're not coming along?"
    p "我这样就垫垫肚子。你先去吃吧？你不一起来吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10811
translate Chinese day_2_start_027dedc0:

    # "He waves his hand to allow you to leave without him."
    "他摆摆手，让你不用管他，先走。"

# game/script.rpy:10813
translate Chinese day_2_start_f44e9f5f:

    # s "I'll get something later. Feel free to go ahead."
    s "我晚点再吃点什么。你请便。"

# game/script.rpy:10815
translate Chinese day_2_start_e52f619a:

    # "You pause for a moment, looking back at him before you step back up to the railing."
    "你停顿了一下，回头看了他一眼，然后才重新走到栏杆旁。"

# game/script.rpy:10817
translate Chinese day_2_start_4be3b63c:

    # p "I can wait."
    p "我可以等。"

# game/script.rpy:10819
translate Chinese day_2_start_20c93534:

    # s "It's alright. You really don't have to if you're hungry."
    s "没关系的。你饿了就先去吃吧，不用管我。"

# game/script.rpy:10821
translate Chinese day_2_start_daf40a7e:

    # p "But I will."
    p "但我愿意。"

# game/script.rpy:10823
translate Chinese day_2_start_f5a7013f:

    # "He nods, and the two of you quietly watch the horizon for a little while longer."
    "他点点头，然后你们俩便一同静静地凝望着地平线，任时光流逝。"

# game/script.rpy:10825
translate Chinese day_2_start_b38790fe:

    # "The sun dances in between the light clouds in the distance, beginning to warm up your face and banish any remaining chill that might have remained from last night."
    "远方的阳光在稀疏的云层间跳动，开始温暖你的脸庞，驱散昨晚残留的寒意。"

# game/script.rpy:10832
translate Chinese day_2_start_6598bbd3:

    # "Soon enough though, the quiet was interrupted by the ringing of the ship's bells."
    "没过多久，船钟的铃声便打破了这份宁静。"

# game/script.rpy:10836
translate Chinese day_2_start_665d959d:

    # p "They won't think less of you just because you don't spend every moment being the epitome of manliness."
    p "大伙儿不会因为你没有时时刻刻摆出一副男子气概的硬汉派头，就瞧不起你的。"

# game/script.rpy:10838
translate Chinese day_2_start_2b9ad617:

    # s "Perhaps."
    s "也许吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10840
translate Chinese day_2_start_7df5ec88:

    # p "I'm not thinking less of you now, am I?"
    p "我这会儿不就没看轻你吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10842
translate Chinese day_2_start_10064f4a:

    # s "That's not the same."
    s "这不一样。"

# game/script.rpy:10844
translate Chinese day_2_start_7a5961e3:

    # p "Why isn't it?"
    p "为什么不是呢？"

# game/script.rpy:10846
translate Chinese day_2_start_dc9b6b30:

    # s "It just...{w}it just doesn't feel the same."
    s "只是……{w}总觉得有些别扭。"

# game/script.rpy:10848
translate Chinese day_2_start_0f3ee067:

    # "A shrug of his shoulders accentuates his words."
    "他耸了耸肩，以此强调自己所说的话。"

# game/script.rpy:10850
translate Chinese day_2_start_a73ffcb0:

    # p "I understand what you mean though.{w} In an environment like this you don't want to be the odd one out. Especially given the goodwill you appear to have gained with many of the others."
    p "不过我明白你的意思。{w} 在这种环境下，谁也不想显得格格不入。更何况你已经赢得了大家的好感。"

# game/script.rpy:10852
translate Chinese day_2_start_5c239b29:

    # p "But I doubt something like this would undo any of that, Sam."
    p "我觉得不至于因为这点小事就抵消你之前建立的好感，Sam。"

# game/script.rpy:10854
translate Chinese day_2_start_e6b979d6:

    # s "You're probably right."
    s "也许你是对的。"

# game/script.rpy:10856
translate Chinese day_2_start_b57c5dbf:

    # s "It's just difficult to relax sometimes."
    s "只是有时候没法完全放松下来。"

# game/script.rpy:10858
translate Chinese day_2_start_22b6e513:

    # p "In any case though, I'll gladly hide back here with you for future sunrises if you need non-judgmental company."
    p "没关系，以后日出的时候，如果你需要一个不带偏见的伙伴，我很乐意陪你躲在这儿。-"

# game/script.rpy:10860
translate Chinese day_2_start_2da86107:

    # "The maned wolf breaks into a laugh, facing you with a smile."
    "鬃狼笑着看向你。"

# game/script.rpy:10862
translate Chinese day_2_start_f9a3de4a:

    # s "I appreciate it, man."
    s "多谢了，老兄。"

# game/script.rpy:10864
translate Chinese day_2_start_32911c26:

    # s "See?{w} Julian would have absolutely ruined that."
    s "瞧？{w} Julian 来肯定会把气氛搞砸。"

# game/script.rpy:10866
translate Chinese day_2_start_d800ac68:

    # "You join his laugh."
    "你也笑了。"

# game/script.rpy:10868
translate Chinese day_2_start_76ea8caf:

    # p "Oh, he would have."
    p "那是肯定的。"

# game/script.rpy:10870
translate Chinese day_2_start_f32fdd68:

    # p "But he could potentially have made himself useful by getting us something to eat."
    p "不过他要是在的话，说不定能给我们找点吃的，也能派上用场。"

# game/script.rpy:10872
translate Chinese day_2_start_288f4795:

    # s "Very true.{w} I'm' starting to get hungry as well. Morning watch isn't going to get anything proper though. Bandile's not up, so it's only bread for us."
    s "确实。{w} 我也开始饿了。不过，早班岗是搞不到什么像样的吃的。Bandile 还没起，咱们就只能啃面包了。"

# game/script.rpy:10874
translate Chinese day_2_start_25ab2966:

    # s "Maybe some leftovers from yesterday if we're lucky."
    s "要是走运，说不定有昨天的剩饭。"

# game/script.rpy:10876
translate Chinese day_2_start_859a86a7:

    # p "Some bread wouldn't go amiss either."
    p "要是有块面包也不赖。"

# game/script.rpy:10878
translate Chinese day_2_start_293e72c6:

    # p "But it's hard to peel myself away from this. Maybe a few more minutes?"
    p "但我实在放不下这事儿。要不，再待几分钟？"

# game/script.rpy:10880
translate Chinese day_2_start_ff386f78:

    # s "Sounds good to me."
    s "我没意见啊。"

# game/script.rpy:10884
translate Chinese day_2_start_8944aa0c:

    # "Samuel nods in agreement, resting his head in his palms."
    "Samuel赞同地点点头，把脑袋搁在手掌心里。"

# game/script.rpy:10886
translate Chinese day_2_start_35c0cdeb:

    # "You look down at him and for a moment the urge to flick his ear pops up in your mind..."
    "你低头看着他，突然想给他一个脑瓜崩儿……"

# game/script.rpy:10888
translate Chinese day_2_start_cb3643d3:

    # p "I really do mean it though. I'll gladly wake up early if you want to watch one of these again."
    p "我是说真的。如果你还想看，我非常乐意早起。"

# game/script.rpy:10890
translate Chinese day_2_start_c3719bbc:

    # s "Don't sound too eager for it or y'll never gonna get a full night's sleep again on this route."
    s "可别显得太积极主动了，不然这趟航线后头你就别指望能再睡上一个安稳整觉了。"

# game/script.rpy:10892
translate Chinese day_2_start_5ea7697d:

    # p "I'll survive."
    p "我还撑得住。"

# game/script.rpy:10894
translate Chinese day_2_start_dacba793:

    # p "Say, Sam.{w} How long have you been with this ship?"
    p "话说，Sam。{w} 你在这船上待多久了？"

# game/script.rpy:10896
translate Chinese day_2_start_f4d38e0c:

    # "His ear swivels in your direction as he recounts his memories."
    "他回忆了一下，耳朵也朝你转了过来。"

# game/script.rpy:10898
translate Chinese day_2_start_286474fb:

    # s "Just over 5 years by now."
    s "满打满算，五年出头了吧。"

# game/script.rpy:10900
translate Chinese day_2_start_5cea8d01:

    # p "5 years?{w} And you are honestly worried about losing your standing with the others now, over this?"
    p "五年？！{w} 你现在竟然还担心这个，怕影响了你在大家伙儿心里的地位？"

# game/script.rpy:10902
translate Chinese day_2_start_cf359659:

    # "Without taking his muzzle from his palms he shrugs, eyeing back up at you."
    "他也没把脸从手掌里抬起来，耸耸肩，抬头看着你。"

# game/script.rpy:10904
translate Chinese day_2_start_e7957a73:

    # s "Can you explain away all your worries?"
    s "你能把所有的顾虑都解释清楚吗？"

# game/script.rpy:10906
translate Chinese day_2_start_fa285fc3:

    # "You return a single shake of your head."
    "你摇了摇头。"

# game/script.rpy:10908
translate Chinese day_2_start_df9b9864:

    # s "I know that it's probably stupid...that they're friends by now.{w} Friends I worked and practically lived with for years in many cases."
    s "我知道可能挺蠢的……他们现在都成朋友了。{w} 多少都是我一起工作、几乎一起生活了好几年的老伙计。"

# game/script.rpy:10910
translate Chinese day_2_start_ae6f6cfd:

    # s "But...{w}food?"
    s "可是……{w}吃的啊？"

# game/script.rpy:10917
translate Chinese day_2_start_605c5dd9:

    # "Your answer takes a few seconds to leave your lips. And before you even can the first of seven rings of the bells fills the air."
    "你过了好几秒才回答。 话还没出口，第一声钟鸣就响彻天空，一共七响。"

# game/script.rpy:10919
translate Chinese day_2_start_413172d3:

    # p "Sure, we can go for some."
    p "行啊，咱去弄点吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:10921
translate Chinese day_2_start_95b4f026:

    # s "Perfect timing, too. Half an hour before we start."
    s "时间正好。离开始干活还有半个小时。"

# game/script.rpy:10934
translate Chinese day_2_start_ebe208bd:

    # "Samuel pushes himself away from the wooden railing, taking a step back and rolling his shoulders in an attempt to get rid of any remaining morning rustiness."
    "Samuel从木头栏杆上起身，往后退了一步，转动肩膀，想甩掉早上的僵劲儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10936
translate Chinese day_2_start_dd91d3b0:

    # "He scans the deck of the ship as he waits for you, once more pushing his shoulders back and twisting his body left and right."
    "他等你的时候扫视着甲板，又向后拉了拉肩膀，左右扭动身体。"

# game/script.rpy:10938
translate Chinese day_2_start_3c60cb7f:

    # "You follow suit and push yourself past the barrel, as the two of you make your way back into the bowels of the ship."
    "你也照做，推开旁边的木桶，你们俩一块儿往船舱深处走去。"

# game/script.rpy:10940
translate Chinese day_2_start_87adc5e1:

    # s "I'll have to wake up Julian and Wolf as well if they're not up yet.{w} So feel free to start. I'll be there in a moment."
    s "要是Julian和Wolf还没起，我还得去叫他们。{w} 那你先去吧。我一会儿就到。"

# game/script.rpy:10963
translate Chinese day_2_start_1955affe:

    # "A voice enters your surroundings from some realm beyond, resonating through space itself."
    "一个声音从不知名的空间传来，在周围回荡。"

# game/script.rpy:10965
translate Chinese day_2_start_f080732f:

    # "You are speaking to someone. Someone you know, but whose exact likeness is difficult to place, their face is strangely blurry whenever you look."
    "你在跟人说话。你认识这个人，但是他的脸很模糊，具体长什么样也说不太清。"

# game/script.rpy:10967
translate Chinese day_2_start_27e28444_1:

    # q "Hey"
    q "嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:10969
translate Chinese day_2_start_4abce0bd:

    # "It becomes harder and harder to focus on the person. Your feet begin to feel unsteady with the movement of the earth beneath you."
    "你越来越难集中注意力，脚下的大地仿佛在晃动，让你站都站不稳。"

# game/script.rpy:10971
translate Chinese day_2_start_07f7f1c6:

    # "Light enters this world from somewhere else, and in that instant, the barrier in your mind is broken. It leaves you to realize that you've simply been asleep."
    "光芒从某个地方照进这个世界，那一瞬间，你脑海里的那根弦断了。你意识到自己原来是在做梦。"

# game/script.rpy:10973
translate Chinese day_2_start_86c83a87_1:

    # "You close your eyelids forcefully, not in an effort to fall asleep again but to combat the yawn that is sure to follow."
    "你用力闭上眼睛，想阻止即将到来的哈欠，而不是想睡回笼觉。"

# game/script.rpy:10975
translate Chinese day_2_start_d4dbc446:

    # "It comes in spite of your best efforts."
    "就算你拼命抵抗，它还是来了。"

# game/script.rpy:10977
translate Chinese day_2_start_d52a7230:

    # q "Good morning."
    q "早上好。"

# game/script.rpy:10979
translate Chinese day_2_start_f402720e:

    # "The voice sounds familiar, but the haze of sleep makes it so that you can only place it when you open your eyes."
    "这声音听着挺熟，睡意朦胧的，得睁开眼才能认出是谁。"

# game/script.rpy:10986
translate Chinese day_2_start_40d3b428:

    # j "There you are, finally."
    j "你可算醒了。"

# game/script.rpy:10990
translate Chinese day_2_start_d550f666:

    # "You bring your hands up to your face, and rub your eyes firmly."
    "你抬手用力揉了揉眼睛。"

# game/script.rpy:10992
translate Chinese day_2_start_8391fcf7:

    # p "I'm not sure if I'd go that far..."
    p "我倒不觉得会这样……"

# game/script.rpy:10994
translate Chinese day_2_start_57762264:

    # "You aren't new to waking up early from your life back at home, but it always takes a couple moments, and the bed always feels so tantalizingly comfortable."
    "要说早起，打以前在家的时候就习惯了，但总得缓一会儿，而且这张床总是舒服得让人想再睡一会儿。"

# game/script.rpy:10996
translate Chinese day_2_start_50f7bf43_1:

    # "Maybe just five more minutes?"
    "让我再睡五分钟，就五分钟？"

# game/script.rpy:11000
translate Chinese day_2_start_3985c038:

    # j "Don't you go to sleep again. I told Sam that I'd make sure to wake you up."
    j "别睡了啊。我跟Sam说了我会叫醒你的。"

# game/script.rpy:11004
translate Chinese day_2_start_33902625:

    # "You groan and, with a monumental effort, lift your head over the edge of the hammock to look out onto the deck. You scan it for any sign of the maned wolf."
    "你哼了一声，费了老大劲儿才把头从吊床上抬起来，看向甲板，想看看那只鬃狼在哪儿。"

# game/script.rpy:11008
translate Chinese day_2_start_fe48cb24:

    # p "I'm awake. I'm awake."
    p "醒了醒了。"

# game/script.rpy:11010
translate Chinese day_2_start_87e315eb:

    # p "Where did Samuel go?"
    p "Samuel人呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11012
translate Chinese day_2_start_33f6e9a7:

    # "Julian follows your gaze, to try and figure out what you are looking for, then he snaps back to you as you ask him out loud."
    "Julian顺着你的视线看过去，想搞清楚你在找啥，你一出声问他，他才反应过来。"

# game/script.rpy:11014
translate Chinese day_2_start_81b0e2b5:

    # j "Getting us something to eat. It's only 25 minutes or so before our morning shift starts."
    j "弄吃的去了。再过个二十来分钟，咱们就该上早班了。"

# game/script.rpy:11016
translate Chinese day_2_start_a343aea1:

    # j "You don't look like you've had the best night."
    j "你看起来昨晚没睡好啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11021
translate Chinese day_2_start_ae17b8ca:

    # "You get up in your hammock and promptly bang your head on the overhead beam." with hpunch
    "你从吊床上爬起来，一头撞在了上面的横梁上。"

# game/script.rpy:11023
translate Chinese day_2_start_7e522bc8:

    # p "OW! Ffff-!"
    p "哎哟！我去-！"

# game/script.rpy:11025
translate Chinese day_2_start_f8a4883a:

    # j "Oh shit! You alright?!"
    j "我去！你没事吧？！"

# game/script.rpy:11027
translate Chinese day_2_start_e4208450:

    # "He looks at you with wide-open eyes, ready to catch you, as if he expects you to faint on the spot."
    "他瞪大了眼睛看着你，好像生怕你当场晕过去似的，准备随时接住你。"

# game/script.rpy:11029
translate Chinese day_2_start_512a4922:

    # "You rub the top of your head, in the hope to ease the dull pain that now emanates from it."
    "你揉着头顶，希望能减轻那阵阵袭来的钝痛。"

# game/script.rpy:11033
translate Chinese day_2_start_2db40f1b:

    # p "It wasn't that bad... ow{w}... I may have to change my mind, though."
    p "其实也没那么糟啦……哎哟{w}……不过，我恐怕得收回刚才的话了。"

# game/script.rpy:11035
translate Chinese day_2_start_8a04d953:

    # p "I'm fine though.{w} Gah, damn cramped space in here."
    p "我没事……啊，这鬼地方也太挤了。"

# game/script.rpy:11037
translate Chinese day_2_start_881e5b64:

    # j "You're not bleeding or anything?"
    j "没撞出血啥的吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11039
translate Chinese day_2_start_0e08c6e3:

    # "You check your hand and thankfully find no stains."
    "你看了看手，还好，没血。"

# game/script.rpy:11041
translate Chinese day_2_start_c6b42210:

    # p "It's all right, Julian. It was just a bump."
    p "没事，Julian，就磕了一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11045
translate Chinese day_2_start_14313446:

    # j "Phew. I wouldn't even know where to get you any help.{w} Luckily you have that fur to cushion everything."
    j "呼，吓我一跳。我都不知道该上哪儿找人来帮你。幸好你那一身毛能缓冲一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11047
translate Chinese day_2_start_1b026551:

    # p "The fur isn't some kind of pillow...{w} I'm just not THAT fragile and can survive bumping my head."
    p "毛又不是枕头……我还没那么弱不禁风，撞一下头还能活蹦乱跳的。"

# game/script.rpy:11049
translate Chinese day_2_start_9365446f:

    # j "It always feels very soft to me. Surely it must help you furred creatures when you knock against something?"
    j "我摸着老觉得挺软和的。你们这些长毛的，撞到东西的时候肯定能起点作用吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11051
translate Chinese day_2_start_3b29ad98:

    # p "I mean, I don't know what it would have felt like without it. But it still bloody hurt..."
    p "我是说，我也不知道没这身毛会咋样。但撞了还是疼啊……"

# game/script.rpy:11053
translate Chinese day_2_start_0470778c:

    # p "Besides, it was my head...it's pretty short there."
    p "再说了，撞的是脑袋……那儿的毛又短。"

# game/script.rpy:11055
translate Chinese day_2_start_16be9d0d:

    # p "Maybe other parts would hurt less.{w} Aren't your scales hardened or something?"
    p "也许撞别的地方就没那么疼了。你那鳞片不是挺硬的吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11059
translate Chinese day_2_start_b567a2ba:

    # j "Hardened? Do I look like a crocodile? Of course not. It hurts when I get hit!"
    j "硬的？我长得像鳄鱼吗？肯定不是啊。被打一样疼！"

# game/script.rpy:11064
translate Chinese day_2_start_a9d5b5a2:

    # "He demonstratively holds his arm out in front of you."
    "他做了个示范，把胳膊伸到你面前。"

# game/script.rpy:11070
translate Chinese day_2_start_57ae322d:

    # j "Here. Does it feel hard?"
    j "这儿。摸起来硬吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11075
translate Chinese day_2_start_94053ef1:

    # s "Hard? Who's hard?"
    s "硬？谁硬了？"

# game/script.rpy:11077
translate Chinese day_2_start_ef12527c:

    # "Samuel's red eyes land on you as he tries to make sense of the topic of conversation that he has just barged into."
    "Samuel红着眼看着你，想搞清楚他刚才打断了什么对话。"

# game/script.rpy:11084
translate Chinese day_2_start_37a6ee94:

    # s "You don't look so great."
    s "你脸色不太好啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11086
translate Chinese day_2_start_6b651ba2:

    # p "Oh, how come?"
    p "噢？怎么说？"

# game/script.rpy:11088
translate Chinese day_2_start_eb1d55f7:

    # "You respond with a little sarcasm soaking your words."
    "你带着一丝嘲讽回道。"

# game/script.rpy:11090
translate Chinese day_2_start_875c6cbb:

    # j "He's fine.{w} He's got fur. It cushioned the impact."
    j "他没事儿，他有毛，能缓冲一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11092
translate Chinese day_2_start_c221a685:

    # p "I alread-"
    p "我早就-"

# game/script.rpy:11094
translate Chinese day_2_start_26a4a487:

    # s "I'm sure he is. I'm just not sure if I can entrust him into your care again, Jules."
    s "我当然相信他没事。但我不太放心再让你照顾他了，Jules。"

# game/script.rpy:11098
translate Chinese day_2_start_51d24469:

    # s "I leave for 3 minutes and he looks like a wreck."
    s "我就离开三分钟，他就跟个破烂玩意儿似的了。"

# game/script.rpy:11100
translate Chinese day_2_start_45f222a6:

    # s "And how would his fur cushion it? It's much too short on his head."
    s "再说了，他那毛能缓冲个啥？头上就没几根毛。"

# game/script.rpy:11111
translate Chinese day_2_start_bd5be533:

    # "You slide out of your hammock, now feeling weirdly self-aware of your head, with it being the subject of discussion."
    "你从吊床上溜下来，突然意识到大家伙儿都在讨论你的脑袋，感觉怪怪的。"

# game/script.rpy:11113
translate Chinese day_2_start_075c3717:

    # p "That's what I've been saying."
    p "我一直在说这个。"

# game/script.rpy:11117
translate Chinese day_2_start_448b8856:

    # "Julian pulls back his arm, only for you to interrupt him and mention that you haven't gotten to touch it yet."
    "Julian 赶紧把胳膊缩回去，结果你冒出来一句，说你还没摸过呢。"

# game/script.rpy:11119
translate Chinese day_2_start_a2e20a5e:

    # "Reaching out, you slide your fingers over the scales of his forearm and, just as promised, they really are soft!"
    "你伸手摸了摸他胳膊上的鳞片，嘿，真像他说的，挺软乎！"

# game/script.rpy:11121
translate Chinese day_2_start_cdef5646:

    # "A subtle oily layer helps the tips of your fingers to glide over it, and he feels comparatively cold to your touch."
    "表面好像有一层油，指尖滑过的时候很顺畅，摸起来凉凉的。"

# game/script.rpy:11123
translate Chinese day_2_start_00e4b1fa:

    # j "See?"
    j "怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:11125
translate Chinese day_2_start_c58d3855:

    # p "It really is quite soft.{w} It feels nice."
    p "确实挺软的，手感不错。"

# game/script.rpy:11129
translate Chinese day_2_start_bb02e634:

    # "The lizard averts his gaze with an expression bordering on bashful."
    "这蜥蜴不好意思地躲开了视线，好像有点害羞。"

# game/script.rpy:11131
translate Chinese day_2_start_c6135e02:

    # s "What the-..."
    s "我靠…"

# game/script.rpy:11133
translate Chinese day_2_start_2392c089:

    # s "What have I just walked into?!"
    s "我这是撞见啥情况了？！"

# game/script.rpy:11137
translate Chinese day_2_start_2b71a692:

    # s "Do you... like, want me to leave ya two for a moment?"
    s "你们……那个，需要我先出去回避一下吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11139
translate Chinese day_2_start_3bc710d6:

    # j "What?! It's nothing sexual, you idiot. He just didn't know how my scales felt."
    j "啥玩意儿？！你想哪儿去了，我就是想让他摸摸我的鳞片！"

# game/script.rpy:11141
translate Chinese day_2_start_79f5f3bb:

    # p "It's quite fascinating! I thought it was like armor or something. Like a dragon in those old tales!"
    p "这可真有意思！我还以为这身鳞片跟铠甲一样硬呢。就像古老传说里的恶龙那样！"

# game/script.rpy:11143
translate Chinese day_2_start_0a948ce6:

    # p "Where even a sword would struggle to penetrate the scales.."
    p "甚至连利剑都很难刺穿那些鳞片……"

# game/script.rpy:11147
translate Chinese day_2_start_b949477c:

    # j "I'm not a dragon..."
    j "我不是龙……"

# game/script.rpy:11149
translate Chinese day_2_start_557b9c7c:

    # s ". . ."
    s "……"

# game/script.rpy:11156
translate Chinese day_2_start_5d1ec478:

    # "He places a piece of bread for each of you on a nearby storage box, along with a shared plate of cold leftovers from yesterday."
    "他在旁边的储物箱上给你们一人放了块面包，还有一盘昨天的剩菜。"

# game/script.rpy:11158
translate Chinese day_2_start_46d4771d:

    # s "Sure... while you two figured that out I been getting some leftovers for those of us on the morning shift. I hope you don't mind."
    s "没事儿... 趁你们俩在那研究鳞片的时候，我把早班的伙食给弄了弄，都是些剩菜，别介意啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11160
translate Chinese day_2_start_d1214dcd:

    # "After you finish touching Julian's arm, you reach for your share of the breakfast and Julian for his."
    "摸完了Julian的胳膊，你和Julian各自拿起了自己的那份早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11162
translate Chinese day_2_start_31c384cc:

    # "The bread is clearly from yesterday. The fresh crunch that it had was gone by now."
    "这面包明显是隔夜的，一点也不脆了。"

# game/script.rpy:11164
translate Chinese day_2_start_8732b626:

    # j "It'll do. Thank you."
    j "行吧，谢了。"

# game/script.rpy:11169
translate Chinese day_2_start_6c02010a:

    # s "So... Do I get to touch it, too?"
    s "那... 我也能摸摸不？"

# game/script.rpy:11173
translate Chinese day_2_start_75f76ad1:

    # j "Oh, so now you're interested as well?"
    j "哟，现在你也来劲了？"

# game/script.rpy:11175
translate Chinese day_2_start_4bf4773e:

    # s "There just aren't that many of your kind around..."
    s "主要是你们这种，平时真不多见……"

# game/script.rpy:11177
translate Chinese day_2_start_e2c79762:

    # s "I've never really had the opportunity."
    s "一直没啥机会。"

# game/script.rpy:11183
translate Chinese day_2_start_a9d963cd:

    # "Julian doesn't need much convincing and holds out his arm for Samuel, who follows your example and gently touches his arm."
    "Julian也没怎么推辞，直接伸出了胳膊，Samuel学着你的样子，轻轻碰了碰他的手臂。"

# game/script.rpy:11185
translate Chinese day_2_start_f9a3c241:

    # p "Weirdly soft, isn't it?"
    p "是不是怪软乎的？"

# game/script.rpy:11187
translate Chinese day_2_start_3f97d806:

    # s "And it's all like that?"
    s "全身都这样？"

# game/script.rpy:11189
translate Chinese day_2_start_381ce655:

    # "Julian nods."
    "Julian点了点头。"

# game/script.rpy:11193
translate Chinese day_2_start_097798dc:

    # j "Some parts are a bit rougher. Elbows or knees for example. They are tougher."
    j "有的地方糙点，像胳膊肘、膝盖啥的，比较硬。"

# game/script.rpy:11196
translate Chinese day_2_start_e7d9ec0f:

    # "Samuel tests it right away, pushing Julian's sleeve up beyond the elbow to feel the more worn scales around it."
    "Samuel立马就上手了，把Julian的袖子撸到胳膊肘以上，摸了摸那块磨损多点的鳞片。"

# game/script.rpy:11201
translate Chinese day_2_start_96eafc10:

    # s "Scales are fuckin' weird."
    s "这鳞片，真他娘的邪门。"

# game/script.rpy:11205
translate Chinese day_2_start_599b7ab6:

    # "Satisfied for now Samuel stops his exploration, and Julian is left to pull his sleeve down again."
    "Samuel暂时是满足了，停下了手，Julian也赶紧把袖子拉了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:11207
translate Chinese day_2_start_d6219ac8:

    # j "Hey...{w} at least I don't leave hairs all over the place."
    j "嘿... {w} 至少爷不掉毛，到处都是。"

# game/script.rpy:11212
translate Chinese day_2_start_f862cea9:

    # s "But ya also shed, I'm pretty sure."
    s "你也掉皮，我跟你说。"

# game/script.rpy:11214
translate Chinese day_2_start_e5314720:

    # j "But not ALWAYS. And EVERYWHERE."
    j "但也不是老掉啊。也不是哪儿都掉。"

# game/script.rpy:11216
translate Chinese day_2_start_bccf5f22:

    # s "But your shedding is all sorts of weird in different ways."
    s "你那掉皮才叫奇葩呢，哪哪儿都不对劲。"

# game/script.rpy:11220
translate Chinese day_2_start_cd85856e:

    # j "It's not. It's perfectly normal."
    j "屁咧，可正常了。"

# game/script.rpy:11222
translate Chinese day_2_start_44d55b63:

    # s "Maybe for you..."
    s "你自己觉得吧……"

# game/script.rpy:11224
translate Chinese day_2_start_bc25f440:

    # s "Anyway, we should eat and get ready.{w} I can't believe ya two dragged me into this..."
    s "算了算了，咱赶紧吃点东西，准备准备。{w} 真他妈服了，咋被你俩忽悠到这儿来了……"

# game/script.rpy:11228
translate Chinese day_2_start_e83d43c7:

    # j "What? Us? You asked yourself!"
    j "啥？我们？是你自己要来的好吧！"

# game/script.rpy:11230
translate Chinese day_2_start_2719a3ff:

    # s "Just because...{w} Ah, shut up..."
    s "就因为……{w}哎呀，你快闭嘴吧……"

# game/script.rpy:11257
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_91806246:

    # s "Really...? Alright..."
    s "真的假的...？好吧……"

# game/script.rpy:11279
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_73e08e54:

    # s "Hey"
    s "嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:11281
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_6096a22c:

    # s "Wake-up attempt number two..."
    s "唤醒尝试，二号方案启动……"

# game/script.rpy:11283
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_cc6bee9e:

    # s "Feelin' ready now?"
    s "感觉醒没醒透啊？"

# game/script.rpy:11286
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_49ced15a:

    # "A voice enters your surroundings from a realm beyond, resonating through space itself."
    "一个声音从虚空中传来，在你的脑海中回响，仿佛穿透了空间。"

# game/script.rpy:11288
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c1b3a15d:

    # "You're talking to someone. Someone you know, but not really, whose face is strangely blurry whenever you look."
    "你在跟人说话，一个你认识，但又说不上多熟的人。 奇怪的是，每次你想看清他的脸，都模模糊糊的。"

# game/script.rpy:11290
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_27e28444:

    # q "Hey"
    q "嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:11292
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_132b6a28:

    # "It gets harder and harder to focus on the person. Your feet start to feel unsteady with the movement of the earth beneath you."
    "你越来越没法集中精神，脚下也开始发飘，感觉地都在动。"

# game/script.rpy:11294
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_65b54ab1:

    # q "Heeey"
    q "嘿嘿嘿~"

# game/script.rpy:11296
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5dfe8dc3:

    # "Suddenly the familiarity of the voice returns to your mind, and it is sucked into the here and now."
    "突然，那熟悉的声音涌回了脑海，你一下子回到了现实。"

# game/script.rpy:11298
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c554d04f:

    # "It's not unstable ground you feel, but the sway of your hammock."
    "摇晃你的不是什么不稳的地，是你的吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:11300
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0a2bcb9c:

    # "Samuel."
    "Samuel。"

# game/script.rpy:11302
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_b4174afa:

    # "Right, you remember. That wonderful maned wolf."
    "对了，你想起来了，是那只可爱的鬃狼。"

# game/script.rpy:11305
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9ce003ba:

    # "The ship's interior emerges around you. You turn in your hammock and find Samuel waiting for you to wake up."
    "船舱出现在你的周围。 你在吊床上翻了个身，发现Samuel正等着你醒来。"

# game/script.rpy:11314
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_bd75ea24:

    # "WHA-?!"
    "哇-？！"

# game/script.rpy:11317
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_bd75ea24_1:

    # "WHA-?!"
    "哇-？！"

# game/script.rpy:11322
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_20d622a5:

    # "Samuel?!"
    "Samuel？！"

# game/script.rpy:11324
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3883ddc5:

    # s "Heeeey!"
    s "嘿！"

# game/script.rpy:11326
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_83e29e3c:

    # p "I'm awake, I'm awake, but..."
    p "我醒了，醒了还不行吗……"

# game/script.rpy:11328
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a6e25ac5:

    # "You can hardly believe your eyes, nor can you stop them from wandering."
    "你简直不敢相信自己的眼睛，忍不住到处乱看。"

# game/script.rpy:11330
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_cd63ca6e:

    # "Down his shoulders, the curve of his back... tail..."
    "顺着他的肩膀，他背部的曲线... 还有那尾巴……"

# game/script.rpy:11332
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e349e14e:

    # "... rear..."
    "... 屁股……"

# game/script.rpy:11334
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f6e05685:

    # "\"I wanted to wake you up before the others,\" he suggests. \"Spend a little more time with you.\""
    "“我想赶在别人之前叫醒你，”他说着，语气带着一丝期待，“这样就能和你多待一会儿。”"

# game/script.rpy:11336
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_83982995:

    # s "I said hey. Wake up."
    s "嘿，我说醒醒啦。"

# game/script.rpy:11338
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_bfe1a147:

    # "Light enters this world from the edge of your vision. In that instant, the barrier between the two worlds in your mind is broken."
    "一丝光亮从眼角溜进这个世界。就在那一瞬间，你脑海中两个世界的壁垒轰然倒塌。"

# game/script.rpy:11344
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9ec6cbd5:

    # "The desired world of your dream vanishes, replaced with yours, filled with nothing but the sight of a crudely woven hammock."
    "梦中美好的世界消失了，取而代之的是现实——一张简陋的吊床。"

# game/script.rpy:11346
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3b73e346:

    # "You close your eyelids forcefully, not to fall asleep again, but to fight the yawn that is sure to follow."
    "你用力闭上眼睛，试图抑制住即将涌出的呵欠。"

# game/script.rpy:11348
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c2c8c82b:

    # "...Despite your best efforts, you yawn anyway."
    "... 结果还是没忍住，打了个哈欠。"

# game/script.rpy:11353
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3bbdb401:

    # s "Good morning."
    s "早上好。"

# game/script.rpy:11356
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_62a268e5:

    # p "Ugh. Hey Samuel.{w} Is it time already?"
    p "唔... 嘿，Samuel。{w}  到点了？"

# game/script.rpy:11361
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f684bcd6:

    # "The maned wolf leans against a structural pillar and watches you come to your senses in the hammock."
    "鬃狼倚靠着一根立柱，饶有兴致地看着你从吊床上醒来。"

# game/script.rpy:11363
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_76de5790:

    # s "It sure is. The seventh bell just rang, so we got 'bout half an hour."
    s "可不是嘛。刚敲过七响钟，所以咱们满打满算也就剩半个钟头了。"
    # 译注：七响钟（seven bells）：清晨3点30分，早更水手还有30分钟准备交接。

# game/script.rpy:11365
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3eb60d1d:

    # s "I've also brought something to eat.{w} It's nothing fancy, mind you."
    s "我还带了点吃的。{w}  你别嫌弃啊，没什么好东西。"

# game/script.rpy:11367
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f088a4f8:

    # s "Bandile's not up this early. So, leftovers it is."
    s "Bandile那家伙起不来这么早，就只能吃点剩的了。"

# game/script.rpy:11370
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e602c506:

    # "Slowly you get up in the hammock, careful to not bang your head on the beams above."
    "你小心地从吊床上爬起来，免得磕到头。"

# game/script.rpy:11374
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_652cf278:

    # "Getting out of the hammock proves to be much easier than it was getting in, and you quickly find yourself with your paws firmly on the deck."
    "从吊床上下来倒是容易多了，你很快就双脚落地，稳稳地站在甲板上。"

# game/script.rpy:11379
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_652cf278_1:

    # "Getting out of the hammock proves to be much easier than it was getting in, and you quickly find yourself with your paws firmly on the deck."
    "从吊床上下来倒是容易多了，你很快就双脚落地，稳稳地站在甲板上。"

# game/script.rpy:11381
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_ed33f6eb:

    # s "You look tired. Didn't sleep well?"
    s "你看起来很疲惫，没睡好？"

# game/script.rpy:11385
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_15f716c9:

    # "You shake your head and take a piece of bread from the plate Samuel has brought."
    "你摇了摇头，从Samuel递过来的盘子里拿了一块面包。"

# game/script.rpy:11387
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f2fad2a7:

    # p "It's fine. You just pulled me out of an odd dream."
    p "没事，你就是把我从一个怪梦里拽了出来。"

# game/script.rpy:11389
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_888b91cb:

    # p "My thoughts are still a little scrambled."
    p "我脑子还有点懵。"

# game/script.rpy:11394
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5f1abc47:

    # s "Oh? An odd dream?"
    s "哦？做了个怪梦？"

# game/script.rpy:11396
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_7bfeccba:

    # "Well, great. Now you've done it. You can hardly tell him you were dreaming of his shapely rump..."
    "好家伙，这下可好。你总不能跟他说你梦见他那结实的屁股了吧...……"

# game/script.rpy:11398
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a0a6c967:

    # p "You know how dreams are. Just weird. You woke me up, and now you ACTUALLY woke me up."
    p "你也知道梦这东西，就是这么离奇古怪。你吵醒了我一次，现在是真醒了。"

# game/script.rpy:11400
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_8ca0266d:

    # p "I'm not awake enough for that kind of deja vu."
    p "我还不够清醒，无法产生那种似曾相识的感觉。。"

# game/script.rpy:11405
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9e366872:

    # "Samuel laughs and breaks off a piece of bread for himself."
    "Samuel笑着掰了块面包，自己吃了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11407
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_afee7379:

    # s "That'd mess with anyone."
    s "谁碰上这事儿都得懵。"

# game/script.rpy:11409
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_67e7c376:

    # s "Hope my dream self wasn't too much of an ass."
    s "希望我梦里没犯浑。"

# game/script.rpy:11411
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_34041cc7:

    # "! ! !"
    "! ! !"

# game/script.rpy:11413
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2b679321:

    # "Oh God, does he have to phrase it like that?!"
    "我去，他怎么非得这么说？！"

# game/script.rpy:11418
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4582b183:

    # p "No. You were just as nice."
    p "没有，你一直都挺好的。"

# game/script.rpy:11420
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5a8d37ea:

    # s "I'm glad that I'm nice both here and in the other realm."
    s "不管是在这儿还是在梦里那个世界，我待你都一样和善，这我挺欣慰的。"

# game/script.rpy:11426
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_15f716c9_1:

    # "You shake your head and take a piece of bread from the plate Samuel has brought."
    "你摇了摇头，从Samuel递过来的盘子里拿了一块面包。"

# game/script.rpy:11428
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1f1d3034:

    # p "All is fine.{w} It's nothing."
    p "没事没事。{w} 小事一桩。"

# game/script.rpy:11430
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_b5c2e580:

    # p "Just a slow start."
    p "只是还没缓过神来。"

# game/script.rpy:11432
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_d2ecd7e3:

    # "Samuel reaches down and breaks off a piece of the bread for himself."
    "Samuel伸手掰了块面包，自己吃了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11434
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_97394820:

    # s "I get ya."
    s "我懂。"

# game/script.rpy:11436
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_152df3b5:

    # s "I also haven't managed to wake up Wolf or Julian yet. Can ya help with one of them?"
    s "而且我还没腾出手去叫醒Wolf或者Julian呢。你能帮我去喊醒其中一个吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11439
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_da36296b:

    # s "{cps=5000}I also haven't managed to wake up Wolf or Julian yet. Can ya help with one of them?{/cps}" nointeract
    s "{cps=5000}而且我还没腾出手去叫醒Wolf或者Julian呢。你能帮我去喊醒其中一个吗？{/cps}"

# game/script.rpy:11456
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_30a75c29:

    # s "Are you sure? Didn't you say you two had a spat yesterday?"
    s "真的？你俩昨天不是还吵架了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11458
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_15639e13:

    # "You look away from Samuel."
    "你避开了 Samuel 的目光。"

# game/script.rpy:11460
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_01d351ab:

    # p "Yes...{w} it didn't go well."
    p "嗯...{w}  闹得不太愉快。"

# game/script.rpy:11462
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_08e69774:

    # p "That's why I want to go and mend things. Even if only a little."
    p "所以我想去缓和一下关系。哪怕稍微好一点也行。"

# game/script.rpy:11467
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1303b55d:

    # "The maned wolf shrugs and walks over to Julian's hammock, turns to you and walks the last few steps backwards."
    "那只鬃狼耸耸肩，走到 Julian 的吊床边，转过身来，一步一步地倒退着朝你走近。"

# game/script.rpy:11469
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0a27602f:

    # s "You do that."
    s "你去吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11471
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a9d14810:

    # p "Where is he sleeping anyway?"
    p "他睡哪儿呢？"

# game/script.rpy:11473
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f799cd08:

    # s "Right over there.{w} One o' those."
    s "就在那边。{w}  就那几个吊床里。"

# game/script.rpy:11475
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9af50552:

    # "Samuel points you to the hammocks on the other side of the deck. You do as he suggests, take up a piece of the bread, and make your way over to it."
    "Samuel 指了指甲板另一头的吊床。你听了他的，拿起块面包走了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:11481
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_376a61d7:

    # "In the end, it is no trouble to find him as you discover him to be in the process of getting up anyway."
    "结果发现他正要起来，你很轻易就找到了他。"

# game/script.rpy:11483
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_27435121:

    # "The deep black of his fur is one of a kind on this ship as far as you have seen."
    "就你所见，他的毛发黑得纯粹，在这船上独一份。"

# game/script.rpy:11490
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3665dbdb:

    # p "Oh, you're awake."
    p "呦，醒啦。"

# game/script.rpy:11492
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_856b8a1d:

    # "First his ears swivel to you, before his head follows."
    "他先是耳朵动了动，然后才转过头来。"

# game/script.rpy:11494
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4e85d288:

    # w "Yes. What is it?"
    w "嗯。什么事？"

# game/script.rpy:11496
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2bf96815:

    # p "Nothing. I was told to wake you up, but it seems that is not necessary."
    p "没事。我奉命来叫你起床，不过看来没这个必要了。"

# game/script.rpy:11501
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5fa1ce52:

    # w "I am a light sleeper."
    w "我睡觉很轻的。"

# game/script.rpy:11503
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_53a1aaff:

    # "You pause in front of the hammock, unsure of what to do with yourself, until you remember the breakfast you are holding in your hand."
    "你站在吊床前，一时不知所措，这才想起手里还拿着早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11505
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_82b2871e:

    # "You hold out the rather sad-looking ration to him."
    "你把那份看起来实在寒酸的口粮递给他。"

# game/script.rpy:11507
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2baa02e2:

    # p "I do have your breakfast too, and, well...{w} I wanted to apologize for yesterday."
    p "我也给你带了早餐，而且，那个...我想为昨天的事跟你道个歉。"

# game/script.rpy:11511
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_7d38cbf4:

    # "The canine unties one side of the hammock and brings it over to stow it away for the day."
    "那家伙解开吊床的一头，拉过来收好，准备白天存放起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11513
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_6e20ba5b:

    # w "No need."
    w "不用了。"

# game/script.rpy:11515
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_549ef577:

    # w "Forgotten it already? I'm not here to make friends."
    w "这么快就忘了？我可不是来交朋友的。"

# game/script.rpy:11517
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3a596ade:

    # "Patiently, you continue to hold his breakfast while he is busy cleaning up his space."
    "你耐心举着早餐，等他忙着收拾好地方。"

# game/script.rpy:11519
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5616dcb5:

    # "Perhaps you should have done the same."
    "或许你也该先整理一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11521
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_ec725350:

    # p "Maybe not friends,{w} but how about not making enemies of each other either?"
    p "做不成朋友，不如我们试着别当仇人，怎么样？"

# game/script.rpy:11523
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e41e8b51:

    # "He pauses for a few seconds before he finishes strapping the hammock to the ship's hull."
    "他停顿了几秒，才把吊床绑到船身上。"

# game/script.rpy:11530
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_bab01201:

    # "Slowly, he turns to face you and takes his breakfast from your paws."
    "他缓缓转过身，从你爪里接过早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11532
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_7ca77804:

    # w "That would be more agreeable."
    w "这样最好。"

# game/script.rpy:11534
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5aa84dac:

    # w "We will see.{w} When are we supposed to be ready?"
    w "走着瞧吧。{w} 我们什么时候该准备好？"

# game/script.rpy:11536
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_b037d800:

    # p "I'll do my best going forward, Wolf.{w} We're supposed to be ready for the next bell. Maybe another 15 minutes?"
    p "我会尽力的，Wolf。{w} 我们得为下一次打钟做好准备。大概还有15分钟吧？"

# game/script.rpy:11538
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_cd733bb6:

    # w "Got it. You can tell Samuel that I'll be ready for it."
    w "知道了。你跟Samuel说我准备好了。"

# game/script.rpy:11559
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c128c795:

    # s "Thanks. Take some food with ya for him."
    s "谢了。给他带点吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:11561
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_8866cc97:

    # p "Sure.{w} Er, where is he sleeping again?"
    p "好嘞。{w} 呃，他睡哪来着？"

# game/script.rpy:11563
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5017ff26:

    # s "Just over there. One o' them."
    s "就在那边那间。"

# game/script.rpy:11565
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9af50552_1:

    # "Samuel points you to the hammocks on the other side of the deck. You do as he suggests, take up a piece of the bread, and make your way over to it."
    "Samuel 指了指甲板另一头的吊床。你听了他的，拿起块面包走了过去。"

# game/script.rpy:11571
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_376a61d7_1:

    # "In the end, it is no trouble to find him as you discover him to be in the process of getting up anyway."
    "结果发现他正要起来，你很轻易就找到了他。"

# game/script.rpy:11573
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_27435121_1:

    # "The deep black of his fur is one of a kind on this ship as far as you have seen."
    "就你所见，他的毛发黑得纯粹，在这船上独一份。"

# game/script.rpy:11580
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3665dbdb_1:

    # p "Oh, you're awake."
    p "呦，醒啦。"

# game/script.rpy:11582
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_856b8a1d_1:

    # "First his ears swivel to you, before his head follows."
    "他先是耳朵动了动，然后才转过头来。"

# game/script.rpy:11584
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4e85d288_1:

    # w "Yes. What is it?"
    w "嗯。什么事？"

# game/script.rpy:11586
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2bf96815_1:

    # p "Nothing. I was told to wake you up, but it seems that is not necessary."
    p "没事。我奉命来叫你起床，不过看来没这个必要了。"

# game/script.rpy:11591
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5fa1ce52_1:

    # w "I am a light sleeper."
    w "我睡觉很轻的。"

# game/script.rpy:11593
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_53a1aaff_1:

    # "You pause in front of the hammock, unsure of what to do with yourself, until you remember the breakfast you are holding in your hand."
    "你站在吊床前，一时不知所措，这才想起手里还拿着早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11595
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_657d9ae2:

    # "You hold out the rather sad-looking ration for Wolf."
    "你把那份可怜巴巴的口粮递给Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:11597
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_dc28f4de:

    # p "I do have your breakfast too."
    p "我也给你留了早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11601
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_7d38cbf4_1:

    # "The canine unties one side of the hammock and brings it over to stow it away for the day."
    "那家伙解开吊床的一头，拉过来收好，准备白天存放起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11603
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5b176603:

    # w "I appreciate it. Give me a second here."
    w "多谢了。我先缓缓。"

# game/script.rpy:11605
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3a596ade_1:

    # "Patiently, you continue to hold his breakfast while he is busy cleaning up his space."
    "你耐心举着早餐，等他忙着收拾好地方。"

# game/script.rpy:11607
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5616dcb5_1:

    # "Perhaps you should have done the same."
    "或许你也该先整理一下。"

# game/script.rpy:11609
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e41e8b51_1:

    # "He pauses for a few seconds before he finishes strapping the hammock to the ship's hull."
    "他停顿了几秒，才把吊床绑到船身上。"

# game/script.rpy:11616
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_bab01201_1:

    # "Slowly, he turns to face you and takes his breakfast from your paws."
    "他缓缓转过身，从你爪里接过早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11618
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_d0fb0a96:

    # "He squeezes the piece of bread and watches the already hardening piece give way under the pressure."
    "他捏着面包，看着那块硬邦邦的面包在他手下变形。"

# game/script.rpy:11620
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a7253b86:

    # w "Stale bread. My favorite."
    w "馊面包，我的最爱。"

# game/script.rpy:11622
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e87bf261:

    # p "Don't shoot the messenger. I didn't get anything else."
    p "这可不赖我，我也没捞着啥好吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:11624
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a640c41d:

    # w "Don't worry. I've had worse."
    w "没事儿，我吃过更难吃的。"

# game/script.rpy:11626
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9feabff2:

    # p "Also, just letting you know, probably another 15 minutes or so before the morning shift starts."
    p "还有，跟你说一声，大概还有十五分钟就要开始早班了。"

# game/script.rpy:11628
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_712576bd:

    # p "When the next bell rings."
    p "等下次钟响。"

# game/script.rpy:11630
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9e0c634c:

    # w "Got it, thanks. You can tell Samuel that I'm up. I assume he sent you."
    w "知道了，谢啦。你跟Samuel说我起了。估计是他让你来的吧。"

# game/script.rpy:11632
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_042cfb80:

    # p "Alright, I guess I'll do that."
    p "好吧，我去叫他。"

# game/script.rpy:11634
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1dd40633:

    # p "See you in a bit, Wolf."
    p "待会儿见，Wolf。"

# game/script.rpy:11659
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_98e58abd:

    # s "Lazy ass. Making me walk over there."
    s "懒鬼，还让我跑这一趟。"

# game/script.rpy:11661
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1c4aed47:

    # s "All twenty feet."
    s "足足有二十英尺长呢。"

# game/script.rpy:11663
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a192f273:

    # p "You offered it!"
    p "还不是你自个儿提出来的！"

# game/script.rpy:11665
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_261c240c:

    # s "I know. I should have seen it coming!{w} See you in a moment."
    s "算我自找的！{w} 待会儿见。"

# game/script.rpy:11670
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0d1b422d:

    # "With Samuel gone to get Wolf, you are left alone with Julian in the hammock next to yours."
    "Samuel去找Wolf了，现在就剩你和Julian在你旁边的吊床上。"

# game/script.rpy:11672
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_90c34ba4:

    # "He's still fast asleep, wrapped tightly in the blanket, even though the ship's interior is quite warm this morning."
    "就算今天早上船舱里挺暖和，他还是裹紧了毯子，睡得死沉死沉的。"

# game/script.rpy:11674
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_ff705d43:

    # "Reptiles and their desire for every ounce of warmth."
    "这家伙，跟条爬行动物似的，恨不得榨干每一丝热量。"

# game/script.rpy:11678
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_d0b074ff:

    # "You wonder what dreams might float around in his head."
    "你想知道他会做些什么梦。"

# game/script.rpy:11680
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_779bfdc8:

    # "Probably nothing as dirty as yours..."
    "肯定没我的那么龌龊……"

# game/script.rpy:11682
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_90b8c676:

    # "But then again, this is Julian. You can imagine that he has a wild streak."
    "不过话又说回来，这可是Julian啊。说不定他骨子里也挺狂野的。"

# game/script.rpy:11684
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_265b0708:

    # "You hope his brain does justice to your body in his dreams."
    "真希望他的梦能好好地展现我的魅力。"

# game/script.rpy:11686
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3183fa23:

    # "Who are you kidding, if anything it's probably the other way around and his dreams overestimate you."
    "别开玩笑了，搞不好正相反，他的梦肯定高估我了。"

# game/script.rpy:11688
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0e850901:

    # "If you are the target in the first place... maybe he fancies Wolf? Teasing is a sign of affection after all."
    "要说我真是他的目标的话...说不定他喜欢的是Wolf？ 毕竟打是亲骂是爱嘛。"

# game/script.rpy:11690
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_6740534e:

    # p "Julian."
    p "Julian。"

# game/script.rpy:11692
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0d6bf83e:

    # p "Hey Julian.{w} Wake up."
    p "嘿，Julian。{w} 醒醒啦。"

# game/script.rpy:11694
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_efa0ab3e:

    # p "It's time to get up. I have breakfast here too."
    p "起床了。我也在这里吃早餐。"

# game/script.rpy:11696
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_553fc7fb:

    # "No reaction."
    "没反应。"

# game/script.rpy:11698
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f1bb783e:

    # "You try again, this time with a little more purpose!"
    "你又试了一次，这次更来劲了！"

# game/script.rpy:11701
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_6ab5bb97:

    # "And finally he stirs. The blanket shifts as he pulls his right arm from it."
    "他终于动了动。右胳膊从毯子里抽了出来，毯子也跟着挪动。"

# game/script.rpy:11703
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_32e29183:

    # "Tired eyes find you briefly before he closes them again and rolls on his back."
    "他疲惫地瞥了你一眼，又闭上眼，翻了个身。"

# game/script.rpy:11708
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_342047b8:

    # j "Mum?"
    j "妈妈？"

# game/script.rpy:11710
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_43d592e7:

    # p "Close...{w} Try again."
    p "差不多了...{w} 再叫一遍。"

# game/script.rpy:11712
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f8d31c03:

    # j "Ugh... it's you."
    j "呃...是你啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11714
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_6aecdb1e:

    # p "Yep. I appreciate the enthusiasm."
    p "是么，真是谢谢你的热情啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11716
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_36648a0d:

    # p "It's time to get up. We have less than half an hour to get ready."
    p "起床了！咱们得在半小时内搞定一切。"

# game/script.rpy:11718
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_d8e974a0:

    # j "Oh God. You are more like my dad."
    j "我去，你更像我爸了。"

# game/script.rpy:11720
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_764eda48:

    # p "Is that good or bad?"
    p "这是夸我还是损我？"

# game/script.rpy:11723
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f3e15fbd:

    # "He rubs his eyes and sits up in the hammock, the blanket sliding off his chest in the process."
    "他揉着眼睛从吊床上坐起来，毯子也从胸口滑落。"

# game/script.rpy:11725
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_34ac224f:

    # "You never get an answer to your question."
    "...当我没问。"

# game/script.rpy:11727
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0394b307:

    # j "Sleeping in is not an option?"
    j "就不能睡个懒觉吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11729
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f14bc38e:

    # p "Afraid not. Come on, you knew what to expect when you signed up."
    p "得了吧。你报名的时候就该知道会这样。"

# game/script.rpy:11731
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f2343ca4:

    # j "Ugh... yeah... When I signed up..."
    j "呃……是啊……当初我在合同上签字画押登船的时候……"

# game/script.rpy:11733
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_31deed10:

    # j "You really are more like my dad."
    j "你真越来越像我爸了。"

# game/script.rpy:11735
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2cc96a94:

    # p "I'm starting to get the feeling that's not a good thing."
    p "我怎么觉得这不是什么好话。"

# game/script.rpy:11737
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_f9c02415:

    # p "I'm sorry, I think."
    p "抱歉。"

# game/script.rpy:11744
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2b35aa21:

    # "He finally leaves his hammock, his feet land on the deck and his thick tail slides over the edge of the hammock to flop down like a wet noodle."
    "他终于下了吊床，脚踩在甲板上，粗壮的尾巴从吊床边滑落，像条湿面条似的耷拉着。"

# game/script.rpy:11746
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_fc536783:

    # "His scales squish and stretch as his fingers firmly rub against the sides of his head."
    "他用手指用力揉搓着太阳穴，鳞片也跟着挤压舒张。"

# game/script.rpy:11750
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c0751dde:

    # j "Goddamn..."
    j "该死的……"

# game/script.rpy:11752
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_7814b2dc:

    # p "You didn't sleep well?"
    p "你没睡好？"

# game/script.rpy:11754
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5f3268d8:

    # j "Does it look like it?"
    j "你看我像睡好了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11756
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_807cadfe:

    # p "Sorry for asking, I guess..."
    p "对不起，我没事找事……"

# game/script.rpy:11759
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_c7ad5f1a:

    # "An awkward silence settles between the two of you for a few moments as Julian begins to sort out his bedding."
    "尴尬的沉默在你们之间蔓延，Julian开始收拾床铺。"

# game/script.rpy:11761
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_02ec5048:

    # "He unhooks the hammock from one side and attaches it to the other to stow it away."
    "他解开吊床一头的挂钩，挂到另一头，把吊床收了起来。"

# game/script.rpy:11763
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3ac019bc:

    # "You watch in silence. Wondering if it would be better to leave him alone."
    "你默默地看着，琢磨着是不是该让他自己静静。"

# game/script.rpy:11765
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a67f02b1:

    # "After those few seconds giving him some space to think and settle, Julian breaks the silence."
    "过了几秒，Julian缓和了一下，打破了沉默。"

# game/script.rpy:11769
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_45240430:

    # j "I'm sorry. Yes, I didn't sleep very well."
    j "抱歉。是，我没怎么睡好。"

# game/script.rpy:11771
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_de91246d:

    # "This time you remain silent and don't say anything right away. Instead you just point to the breakfast plate left for him."
    "这次你没说话，只是指了指给他留的早餐盘。"

# game/script.rpy:11773
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_2029b9ed:

    # p "It's alright. There is the breakfast I mentioned."
    p "没事。我说的早餐在那儿呢。"

# game/script.rpy:11775
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4b0213eb:

    # p "Bad dreams?"
    p "做噩梦了？"

# game/script.rpy:11777
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_cb32e9de:

    # "Julian reaches for the bread and breaks a piece off of it."
    "Julian伸手拿了块面包，掰了下来。"

# game/script.rpy:11779
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_e48e904c:

    # j "I guess."
    j "知道了。"

# game/script.rpy:11781
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_3e60186b:

    # p "You guess? Doesn't sound like you're too convinced yourself."
    p "大概？听着你好像自己也不太确定啊。"

# game/script.rpy:11783
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_96d3c03d:

    # j "I'm just not made to get up so early, that's all."
    j "我就是不适合起这么早，就只是这样。"

# game/script.rpy:11785
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_a3de0f7b:

    # j "And I shouldn't have snapped at you for it."
    j "我不该因为这个朝你发火。"

# game/script.rpy:11787
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_46b4a285:

    # p "No. You shouldn't have."
    p "确实不该。"

# game/script.rpy:11789
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0b29135e:

    # "He takes a bite of the bread and washes it down with a sip of water."
    "他咬了一口面包，喝了口水咽了下去。"

# game/script.rpy:11793
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0cc10d27:

    # j "Maybe it'll get better with time."
    j "也许时间长了就好了。"

# game/script.rpy:11795
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4fdcd366:

    # j "Otherwise this job will be a real drag."
    j "不然这份工作可就太要命了。"

# game/script.rpy:11800
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_ebbde1bd:

    # "His eyes focus past you, and a moment later Samuel rejoins you."
    "他目光越过你，过了一会儿，Samuel回来了。"

# game/script.rpy:11805
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_85d9bc74:

    # s "Ya two ready?"
    s "你们俩弄完了没？"

# game/script.rpy:11807
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1f45f7b9:

    # j "Will you accept no for an answer?"
    j "你说了“不”我就不会再问了吗？"

# game/script.rpy:11812
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_4d2b57c1:

    # s "I might, but I'm not sure Mr. Hudson would appreciate it."
    s "也许吧，但我不确定Hudson先生会不会高兴。"

# game/script.rpy:11814
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_5b38cd72:

    # s "What's wrong? You sounded much more lively yesterday."
    s "你怎么了？你昨天听起来精神好多了。"

# game/script.rpy:11816
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_9fd64fbb:

    # j "Just not a morning lizard..."
    j "我真不是那种能起大早的蜥蜴……"

# game/script.rpy:11818
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_1ae230b9:

    # j "Give me a moment."
    j "等等我。"

# game/script.rpy:11820
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_d944f39f:

    # "Samuel looks to you in search of an answer, but you can only respond with an uncertain shrug."
    "Samuel向你投来寻求答案的目光，你只能无奈地耸耸肩。"

# game/script.rpy:11822
translate Chinese day_2_normalstart_0b74641c:

    # "A minute or two passes before Julian is ready and you make your way over to start the morning shift."
    "过了一两分钟，Julian准备完毕，你们一起去开始早班的工作。"

# game/script.rpy:11897
translate Chinese thank_you_e4295618:

    # n "Thank you very much for playing Conway!"
    n "非常感谢游玩Conway！"

# game/script.rpy:11899
translate Chinese thank_you_9efe98f7:

    # n "This game is still in active development, if you want to support us then you can do so on Patreon or Subscribestar. And of course big thank you to everyone who makes this possible. :)"
    n "本作目前仍在紧锣密鼓地开发中，如果您希望支持我们，欢迎前往 Patreon 或 Subscribestar 订阅赞助。当然，由衷感谢每一位让这一切成为可能的朋友！:)"

# game/script.rpy:11901
translate Chinese thank_you_f7d9abf5:

    # n "We also have a merch store. So if you're on the lookout for perhaps a new mug for your morning-coffee, some prints, apparel and more, then head over to {a=https://conwayship.store/}our Store{/a}."
    n "我们还开通了周边商店。如果您正想为晨间咖啡添置个新马克杯、选购几张原画版画或服饰周边，欢迎光临{a=https://conwayship.store/}我们的官方商店{/a}。"

# game/script.rpy:11903
translate Chinese thank_you_f9d154e8:

    # n "We really appreciate it, as every little bit helps to expand our means of what we can do with the VN, and helps getting people paid fairly for their work."
    n "我们对此深表感激，每一份微小的支持都将切实助益我们拓展这部视觉小说的创作边界，并让团队成员得到应得的合理报酬。"

# game/script.rpy:11905
translate Chinese thank_you_c08334a4:

    # n "A big big thank you to those of you who already do! This genuinely wouldn't be possible without the generous support of all of them."
    n "再次向所有已经支持过我们的朋友道一声大大的感谢！没有大家慷慨鼎力的相助，这部作品绝不可能走到今天。"

# game/script.rpy:11907
translate Chinese thank_you_a5c18d35:

    # n "They are the best!"
    n "你们是最棒的！"

