    new "否，禁用血腥和受伤效果"

    # game/script.rpy:1372
    old "{cps=5000}From his spot leaned up against the mast, the lizard lets his inquisitive gaze focus on you, a faint smirk tugging at his lips.{/cps}"
    new "{cps=5000}蜥蜴靠在桅杆上，他那充满好奇的目光落在了你身上，嘴角挂着一丝若有若无的微笑。{/cps}"

    # game/script.rpy:1375
    old "Greet them"
    new "打个招呼"

    # game/script.rpy:1379
    old "Silently join and wait"
    new "默默加入，静观其变"

    # game/script.rpy:2022
    old "Ask if any of you can be of assistance"
    new "问问有什么需要帮忙的"

    # game/script.rpy:2108
    old "Stay quiet"
    new "保持沉默"

    # game/script.rpy:2745
    old "{cps=5000}With that prompting, Julian looks to you for approval.{/cps}"
    new "{cps=5000}你这么一说，Julian便看向你，似乎在等你首肯。{/cps}"

    # game/script.rpy:2749
    old "Side with Samuel"
    new "我支持Samuel"

    # game/script.rpy:2753
    old "Side with Julian"
    new "我支持Julian"

    # game/script.rpy:3133
    old "What do you want to do?"
    new "你想怎么做？"

    # game/script.rpy:3137
    old "Offer some advice"
    new "给点建议"

    # game/script.rpy:3173
    old "Offer your condolences"
    new "节哀顺变"

    # game/script.rpy:3562
    old "Who do you want to seek out for dinner?"
    new "晚饭想和谁一起吃？"

    # game/script.rpy:3565
    old "Join Wolf in the corner"
    new "去和角落里的Wolf待会儿"

    # game/script.rpy:3572
    old "Join Samuel and Julian"
    new "和Samuel、Julian一起"

    # game/script.rpy:3580
    old "Go and talk to Arthur"
    new "找Arthur聊聊"

    # game/script.rpy:3830
    old "How do you respond?"
    new "你打算怎么回话？"

    # game/script.rpy:3834
    old "Apologize for holding up the line"
    new "不好意思，耽误大家了"

    # game/script.rpy:3867
    old "Question the sailor's attitude"
    new "质问那个水手"

    # game/script.rpy:3946
    old "\"I did. But I figured you looked lonely out here.\""
    new "“我看见你一个人怪孤单的。”"

    # game/script.rpy:3951
    old "\"I just prefer quiet company. Been a busy day and a little bit of silence won't hurt.\""
    new "“我喜欢清静。忙了一天，想安静一会儿。”"

    # game/script.rpy:5356
    old "Of course, first you have to find a place to sit."
    new "话说回来，先找个地方坐下吧。"

    # game/script.rpy:5360
    old "Ask if Julian can make some room for you to sit down"
    new "问问Julian能不能挤出个位置"

    # game/script.rpy:5365
    old "Go around to Samuel and sit down next to him"
    new "绕到Samuel旁边坐下"

    # game/script.rpy:5752
    old "That {i}is{/i} a good question."
    new "这{i}的{/i}确是个好问题。"

    # game/script.rpy:5756
    old "Say that you'll just eat with your fingers"
    new "我就用手随便吃点吧"

    # game/script.rpy:5855
    old "Ask where the others got their forks from"
    new "问问其他人叉子是哪儿搞来的。"

    # game/script.rpy:6159
    old "Give him a playful smack against the shoulder"
    new "轻轻拍他肩膀一下。"

    # game/script.rpy:6184
    old "Don't do it"
    new "不要这样做。"

    # game/script.rpy:6228
    old "Do you share with Samuel?"
    new "你跟Samuel分着吃吗？"

    # game/script.rpy:6232
    old "\"Sure. You can have both.\""
    new "“当然。你可以两个都吃。”"

    # game/script.rpy:6258
    old "\"Trade for some salmon?\""
    new "“拿鲑鱼跟你换怎么样？”"

    # game/script.rpy:6290
    old "\"Sorry. I'm really hungry.\""
    new "“抱歉。我真的很饿。”"

    # game/script.rpy:6504
    old "You take a moment to think about it before you decide to..."
    new "你考虑了一下，然后决定..."

    # game/script.rpy:6507
    old "...stay for a little longer."
    new "...再待一会儿。"

    # game/script.rpy:6510
    old "...head to bed as well."
    new "...也去睡觉。"

    # game/script.rpy:8461
    old "...was hoping to talk."
    new "...想找你聊聊。"

    # game/script.rpy:8466
    old "...wanted to sit along for dinner."
    new "...想跟你一块儿吃晚饭。"

    # game/script.rpy:8472
    old "...wanted to speak to her."
    new "...想跟你说说话。"

    # game/script.rpy:10534
    old "The urge to just go back to sleep is powerful...very powerful."
    new "想要回去睡觉的冲动很强烈……非常强烈。"

    # game/script.rpy:10537
    old "Tell him you really need a little extra rest"
    new "跟他说你实在需要再休息会儿。"

